export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffDesk","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Getting started with TakeoffDesk","summary":"What TakeoffDesk does, where it runs, and your first measured and priced item from a PDF plan set.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["start","first takeoff","quick start","introduction","estimate","quantity takeoff","plan set","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"where-it-runs","text":"Where it runs","level":2},{"id":"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps","text":"Your first takeoff in ten steps","level":2},{"id":"what-to-read-next","text":"What to read next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOpen a DWG or DXF drawing\u003C/a\u003E), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make \u003Cstrong\u003Eitems\u003C/strong\u003E (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in other programs, read \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EComing from other takeoff software\u003C/a\u003E next. Some things work differently here.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-it-runs\"\u003EWhere it runs\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYour PDFs stay on your computer.\u003C/strong\u003E They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers and computers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works with no internet connection once you choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar and it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps\"\u003EYour first takeoff in ten steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E group of the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind the sheet&#039;s printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group and pick that scale, for example \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says &quot;Scale 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, leave the type on \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E in the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item&#039;s color and its length appears next to the item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, type \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Your browser downloads a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menu in the toolbar and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E to download the estimate as a spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes any change.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-to-read-next\"\u003EWhat to read next\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EThe TakeoffDesk screen\u003C/a\u003E names every part of the window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E covers several PDFs and the sheets list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E explains types, units, waste and rates.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E lists every key.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see Open a DWG or DXF drawing), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make items (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in. If you have done takeoff in other programs, read Coming from other takeoff software next. Some things work differently here. Where it runs TakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install. Your PDFs stay on your computer. They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download. It works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See Browsers and computers. It works with no internet connection once you choose Save for offline in the app bar and it says Offline ready. See Working offline. Cloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer. Your first takeoff in ten steps This walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have. Choose Open plans in the File group of the toolbar (or press Ctrl+O), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle. Find the sheet's printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title. Open the Preset list in the Scale group and pick that scale, for example 1/4\" = 1'-0\". The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says \"Scale 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Choose Check (or press D) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see Set the scale. In the Items panel on the right, choose New item, type a name like Interior wall type A, leave the type on Linear (length), and choose Add. Choose Linear in the toolbar (or press L). Click the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press Enter or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item's color and its length appears next to the item. In the item editor under Items, type 9'-0\" in Height, 0.85 in Material $/LF and 1.20 in Labor $/LF. The Quantities table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the Job total. Choose Save takeoff (or press Ctrl+S). Your browser downloads a .takeoff.json file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs. Open the Export menu in the toolbar and choose XLSX to download the estimate as a spreadsheet. Press Esc to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the Select tool. Ctrl+Z undoes any change. What to read next The TakeoffDesk screen names every part of the window. Start a takeoff and open a plan set covers several PDFs and the sheets list. Create takeoff items explains types, units, waste and rates. Assemblies and formulas turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more. Keyboard and mouse lists every key.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"The TakeoffDesk screen","summary":"A tour of the window by on-screen name - the toolbar, the sheets list, the sheet, the Items panel, the Quantities table and the status bar.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["screen","layout","layouts","ribbon","project browser","toolbox","info box","toolbar","panels","sheets list","items panel","quantities","status bar","tour","interface"],"headings":[{"id":"the-toolbar","text":"The toolbar","level":2},{"id":"sheets-left","text":"Sheets (left)","level":2},{"id":"the-sheet-middle","text":"The sheet (middle)","level":2},{"id":"items-right","text":"Items (right)","level":2},{"id":"quantities-bottom","text":"Quantities (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"status-bar-bottom","text":"Status bar (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"other-layouts","text":"Other layouts","level":2},{"id":"full-screen-and-themes","text":"Full screen and themes","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhere\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it is for\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery top\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe app name, the version, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E theme switch.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnder the app bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery command, in groups: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiddle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe open page. You measure here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour takeoff items, the selected item&#039;s settings, and the selected mark.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStatus bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery bottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar\"\u003EThe toolbar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover over any button to see what it does and its key.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGroup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EButtons\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E (empty takeoff), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe tool you are using is shown pressed. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E buttons stay pressed while they are on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheets-left\"\u003ESheets (left)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESearch sheets\u003C/strong\u003E filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item&#039;s marks are on the sheet instead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick a sheet to open it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E move to the next and previous sheet in the list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like &quot;Plans, page 3&quot;. With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-sheet-middle\"\u003EThe sheet (middle)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or &quot;No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate&quot;. Its buttons: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (when that app can take the PDF; see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E (an older version of the sheet over this one: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003ECompare a revised sheet\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) to check&quot; (flagged marks, when there are any) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBefore any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhile you use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-right\"\u003EItems (right)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E opens a small form: a name, a type (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe list shows each item&#039;s color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder the list, \u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. With several marks selected it becomes \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected marks\u003C/strong\u003E: how many of each item, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe item editor ends with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"quantities-bottom\"\u003EQuantities (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E lists each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA warning starting with \u003Cstrong\u003EIncomplete:\u003C/strong\u003E appears when something is left out of the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E is at the right of the header.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003ERead quantities and the estimate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-bar-bottom\"\u003EStatus bar (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrom left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder &quot;Shift snaps to 45°&quot; (or &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot; when that is on in \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ESettings\u003C/a\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E button (snapping to the drawing&#039;s lines, on when highlighted; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the zoom percentage.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERead the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example &quot;This sheet has no scale yet&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"other-layouts\"\u003EOther layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEverything above is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E layout, the start. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E again puts every control back where it was.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayout\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E across the top (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing&#039;s Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E under the sheet. The left panel holds \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E (the selected item, note or mark) over the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff browser\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E (click one to open it in a tab), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConditions\u003C/span\u003E (click one to draw with it) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (each item&#039;s total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E and the zoom under the sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"full-screen-and-themes\"\u003EFull screen and themes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E is the light theme and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the dark one. In \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right: Part Where What it is for App bar Very top The app name, the version, About TakeoffDesk, Help (F1), Save for offline, Settings (Ctrl+,), the Full screen button and the Paper / Model theme switch. Toolbar Under the app bar Every command, in groups: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit, View. Sheets Left Every page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count. The sheet Middle The open page. You measure here. Items Right Your takeoff items, the selected item's settings, and the selected mark. Quantities Bottom Quantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total. Status bar Very bottom The live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom. The toolbar Hover over any button to see what it does and its key. Group Buttons File New (empty takeoff), Open PDFs (Ctrl+O), Open takeoff (a .takeoff.json project), Save takeoff (Ctrl+S) Export One menu: XLSX, CSV, Marked PDF Scale Calibrate (K), Check (D), and the Preset list Takeoff Select (V), Linear (L), Area (A), Circle (O), Arc (R, an on/off switch), Deduct (E, an on/off switch), Cut-out (X), Count (C), Auto count (S) Edit Undo (Ctrl+Z), Redo (Ctrl+Y), Copy (Ctrl+C), Paste (Ctrl+V), and More: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all, Select none View Fit page (F), Fit width (W) The tool you are using is shown pressed. The Arc and Deduct buttons stay pressed while they are on. Sheets (left) Search sheets filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label. Each sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or No scale. The right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item's marks are on the sheet instead. Click a sheet to open it. Page Down and Page Up move to the next and previous sheet in the list. When a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Sheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as A-101 becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like \"Plans, page 3\". With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name. The sheet (middle) The bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or \"No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate\". Its buttons: MarkupCraft (when that app can take the PDF; see Start a takeoff and open a plan set), Compare (an older version of the sheet over this one: Compare a revised sheet), \"(n) to check\" (flagged marks, when there are any) and 3D (the 3D check view). Before any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide. The wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See Keyboard and mouse. While you use Auto count, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet. Items (right) At the top, the Bid area list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (Bid areas). New item opens a small form: a name, a type (Linear (length), Area or Count) and Add. The list shows each item's color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting. Under the list, Item: (name) is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the Assembly. See Create takeoff items. Selected mark appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as Add a cut-out and Delete mark. With several marks selected it becomes Selected marks: how many of each item, and Copy, Duplicate, Cut and Delete marks. The item editor ends with Copy item and Duplicate item: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Quantities (bottom) By item lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table. By sheet lists each item's quantity on each sheet. A warning starting with Incomplete: appears when something is left out of the totals. Job total is at the right of the header. The arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room. See Read quantities and the estimate. Status bar (bottom) From left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the Type box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder \"Shift snaps to 45°\" (or \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\" when that is on in Settings), the Snap button (snapping to the drawing's lines, on when highlighted; F3), and the zoom percentage. Read the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example \"This sheet has no scale yet\". Other layouts Everything above is the TakeoffDesk classic layout, the start. Settings (Ctrl+,) › Global › Layout offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking TakeoffDesk classic again puts every control back where it was. Layout In TakeoffDesk Ribbon and project browser The Takeoff ribbon across the top (Menus, keys and mouse), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing's Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and Fit page under the sheet. The left panel holds Properties (the selected item, note or mark) over the Takeoff browser: Sheets (click one to open it in a tab), Conditions (click one to draw with it) and Estimate (each item's total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab. Toolbox and info box The toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the Bid area, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and Snap and the zoom under the sheet. While the 3D check view is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs. Full screen and themes The Full screen button in the app bar, or Ctrl+Shift+F (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again. Paper is the light theme and Model the dark one. In Model the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Files TakeoffDesk opens and saves","summary":"PDFs in, a takeoff project file, spreadsheets and marked PDFs out - what each holds, where it goes, and what changes online, offline and between browsers.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["files","formats","pdf","takeoff.json","project file","xlsx","csv","marked pdf","download","save","open","offline"],"headings":[{"id":"what-it-opens","text":"What it opens","level":2},{"id":"what-it-saves","text":"What it saves","level":2},{"id":"where-downloads-go","text":"Where downloads go","level":2},{"id":"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate","text":"Why the project file and the PDFs are separate","level":2},{"id":"online-and-offline","text":"Online and offline","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2},{"id":"desktop-and-cloud","text":"Desktop and cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EWhat it opens\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFile\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHow\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENotes\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESeveral at once. Each page becomes a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff project (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOther files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPassword-protected PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E do not open: &quot;(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe same PDF twice\u003C/strong\u003E is opened once: &quot;(name) is already open.&quot; TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScanned PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge plan sets\u003C/strong\u003E: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-saves\"\u003EWhat it saves\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou choose\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou get\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat is in it\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFour worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe estimate as plain values, one row per item and component.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate and a marked PDF\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EExport columns\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-downloads-go\"\u003EWhere downloads go\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate\"\u003EWhy the project file and the PDFs are separate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERenaming or moving a PDF does not matter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-and-offline\"\u003EOnline and offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, &quot;Saving 12 of 40&quot;, while it saves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThe button says\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving (n) of (m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving now.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved. Choose it for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESome files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are offline. If the app bar shows \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E stops with &quot;The marked PDF could not be written&quot;. Your takeoff is safe either way: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E and wait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"desktop-and-cloud\"\u003EDesktop and cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECloud saving is not available yet. Keep your \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E files with the job&#039;s PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EWhere your files go\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What it opens File How Notes PDF (.pdf) Open plans, Ctrl+O, or drop on the page Several at once. Each page becomes a sheet. Takeoff project (.takeoff.json) Open takeoff, or drop on the page Your items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs. Other files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them. Password-protected PDFs do not open: \"(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.\" The same PDF twice is opened once: \"(name) is already open.\" TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names. Scanned PDFs open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF. Large plan sets: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll. What it saves Every save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs. You choose You get What is in it Save takeoff (name).takeoff.json Items, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages. XLSX (name).xlsx Four worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales. CSV (name).csv The estimate as plain values, one row per item and component. Marked PDF (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf A copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF. The name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name. See Export the estimate and a marked PDF and Export columns. Where downloads go Your browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in Finder / File Explorer / your file manager. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks. Marked PDF with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow. Safari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General. Why the project file and the PDFs are separate The .takeoff.json file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so: Renaming or moving a PDF does not matter. A PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name. Marks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Online and offline Your PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself. To work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online: Choose Save for offline in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, \"Saving 12 of 40\", while it saves. Wait for Offline ready. Saving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by Marked PDF and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says Offline ready, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, Auto count, Save takeoff, XLSX, CSV and Marked PDF. The button says Meaning Save for offline Not saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save. Saving (n) of (m) Saving now. Offline ready Saved. Choose it for Save again (get the newest version) or Remove the offline copy. Could not save Some files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again. Offline not available This browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it). More, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: Working offline. You are offline. If the app bar shows Offline ready, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for Marked PDF, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and Marked PDF stops with \"The marked PDF could not be written\". Your takeoff is safe either way: Save takeoff, XLSX and CSV need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again. You are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose Save for offline and wait for Offline ready. Spreadsheets The XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet. The CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly. Desktop and cloud TakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer. Cloud saving is not available yet. Keep your .takeoff.json files with the job's PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See Where your files go.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Početak predmjera i otvaranje seta planova","summary":"Otvorite jedan ili više PDF-ova kao set planova, snađite se među listovima i prelazite sa jednog na drugi.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["otvaranje","set planova","više PDF-ova","više datoteka","listovi","crteži","oznake stranica","lista listova","navigacija","prevlačenje","predaja","otvaranje u drugoj aplikaciji","označavanje"],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-pdf-ove","text":"Otvorite PDF-ove","level":2},{"id":"crte-i-uz-pdf-ove","text":"Crteži uz PDF-ove","level":2},{"id":"pdf-predat-iz-druge-aplikacije","text":"PDF predat iz druge aplikacije","level":2},{"id":"prona-ite-list","text":"Pronađite list","level":2},{"id":"kako-se-listovi-imenuju","text":"Kako se listovi imenuju","level":2},{"id":"pogledajte-list","text":"Pogledajte list","level":2},{"id":"dalje","text":"Dalje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESet planova je često više PDF-ova: arhitektonski, konstruktivni, mašinski. TakeoffDesk ih otvara jedan pored drugog kao jednu listu listova, i jedan predmjer može obuhvatiti sve njih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-pdf-ove\"\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Ostali stilovi menija to zovu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs…\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU dijalogu za datoteke izaberite svaki PDF iz seta. Držite \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E da birate više, ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da birate raspon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite Otvori. Poruka &quot;Otvaranje (naziv)…&quot; se prikazuje dok se svaka datoteka čita. Zatim se svaka stranica pojavljuje pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E, i otvara se prva stranica prvog novog PDF-a.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMožete i prevući PDF-ove iz \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Evašeg upravitelja datoteka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E i ispustiti ih bilo gdje na TakeoffDesk. Dok prevlačite, pojavljuje se okvir &quot;Ispustite PDF-ove, DWG ili DXF crteže, ili .takeoff.json&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa dodate još PDF-ova kasnije, uradite isto ponovo. PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni se preskaču.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPočetni ekran takođe navodi PDF-ove i predmjere koje ste nedavno otvarali, u preglednicima koji dozvoljavaju stranici da ponovo otvori datoteku (Chrome i Edge). Kliknite na jedan da ga otvorite; preglednik može prvo tražiti dozvolu. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EVaše datoteke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENišta se ne otprema. Preglednik čita PDF-ove na vašem računaru, a oni nestaju iz programa TakeoffDesk kad zatvorite karticu ili izaberete \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"crte-i-uz-pdf-ove\"\u003ECrteži uz PDF-ove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E prihvata i DWG i DXF crteže, sami ili zajedno sa PDF-ovima: prostor modela i rasporedi svakog crteža postaju listovi u istoj listi. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOtvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža\u003C/a\u003E, zatim \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-predat-iz-druge-aplikacije\"\u003EPDF predat iz druge aplikacije\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDruga aplikacija iz paketa može vam predati PDF koji ima otvoren: ona otvara TakeoffDesk u novoj kartici, i PDF se tamo otvara kao da ste ga prevukli. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Otvoreno (naziv), predato iz (aplikacija). Izvorna datoteka je nepromijenjena.&quot; Ništa se ne otprema; datoteka prolazi kroz lokalnu memoriju ovog preglednika i iz nje nestaje čim se otvori.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko statusna traka kaže da PDF &quot;nije stigao&quot;, kartica je čekala predugo ili je PDF već otvoren u drugoj kartici: otvorite ga pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObrnuto, kad MarkupCraft radi tamo gdje ste i može preuzeti datoteku, traka lista ispod crteža ima dugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E: ono otvara PDF lista na ekranu, u novoj kartici, u programu MarkupCraft, da ga pregledate i označite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-ite-list\"\u003EPronađite list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPomičite listu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E lijevo i kliknite na list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucajte u \u003Cstrong\u003EPretraži listove\u003C/strong\u003E na vrhu liste da filtrirate po broju lista, nazivu datoteke ili oznaci stranice. Brojka pored \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje &quot;3 od 40&quot; dok je filter uključen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za sljedeći list, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za prethodni. Oni prate listu onako kako je filtrirana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa Mac tastaturi bez tipki Page Up i Page Down pritisnite fn sa strelicom gore ili dolje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-se-listovi-imenuju\"\u003EKako se listovi imenuju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStranica kojoj PDF daje oznaku, kao \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, dobija ime po toj oznaci.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStranica bez oznake (ili sa oznakom koja je samo broj stranice) imenuje se &quot;(naziv datoteke), stranica (n)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad je otvoreno više PDF-ova, označeni listovi nose i naziv datoteke: &quot;A-101 — Arhitektura&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImena listova se još ne mogu unositi ručno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pogledajte-list\"\u003EPogledajte list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkrećite točkić miša da zumirate na mjestu pokazivača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevucite lijevim ili srednjim dugmetom da pomjerate pogled. Uz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E, ili kad počnete na uglu oznake, držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok prevlačite, ili prevucite srednjim dugmetom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E da vidite cijeli list; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E prilagođava njegovu širinu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za uvećanje, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za smanjenje, oko sredine prikaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki list pamti svoj zoom i položaj dok je otvoren.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dalje\"\u003EDalje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije mjerenja lista potrebna mu je razmjera: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje razmjere\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Set planova je često više PDF-ova: arhitektonski, konstruktivni, mašinski. TakeoffDesk ih otvara jedan pored drugog kao jednu listu listova, i jedan predmjer može obuhvatiti sve njih. Otvorite PDF-ove Izaberite Open plans u grupi File, ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. (Ostali stilovi menija to zovu Open PDFs….) U dijalogu za datoteke izaberite svaki PDF iz seta. Držite Command / Ctrl / Ctrl da birate više, ili Shift da birate raspon. Izaberite Otvori. Poruka \"Otvaranje (naziv)…\" se prikazuje dok se svaka datoteka čita. Zatim se svaka stranica pojavljuje pod Sheets, i otvara se prva stranica prvog novog PDF-a. Možete i prevući PDF-ove iz Finder / File Explorer / vašeg upravitelja datoteka i ispustiti ih bilo gdje na TakeoffDesk. Dok prevlačite, pojavljuje se okvir \"Ispustite PDF-ove, DWG ili DXF crteže, ili .takeoff.json\". Da dodate još PDF-ova kasnije, uradite isto ponovo. PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni se preskaču. Početni ekran takođe navodi PDF-ove i predmjere koje ste nedavno otvarali, u preglednicima koji dozvoljavaju stranici da ponovo otvori datoteku (Chrome i Edge). Kliknite na jedan da ga otvorite; preglednik može prvo tražiti dozvolu. Vidi Vaše datoteke. Ništa se ne otprema. Preglednik čita PDF-ove na vašem računaru, a oni nestaju iz programa TakeoffDesk kad zatvorite karticu ili izaberete New. Crteži uz PDF-ove Open plans prihvata i DWG i DXF crteže, sami ili zajedno sa PDF-ovima: prostor modela i rasporedi svakog crteža postaju listovi u istoj listi. Vidi Otvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža, zatim Brojanje iz crteža. PDF predat iz druge aplikacije Druga aplikacija iz paketa može vam predati PDF koji ima otvoren: ona otvara TakeoffDesk u novoj kartici, i PDF se tamo otvara kao da ste ga prevukli. Statusna traka kaže \"Otvoreno (naziv), predato iz (aplikacija). Izvorna datoteka je nepromijenjena.\" Ništa se ne otprema; datoteka prolazi kroz lokalnu memoriju ovog preglednika i iz nje nestaje čim se otvori. Ako statusna traka kaže da PDF \"nije stigao\", kartica je čekala predugo ili je PDF već otvoren u drugoj kartici: otvorite ga pomoću Open plans. Obrnuto, kad MarkupCraft radi tamo gdje ste i može preuzeti datoteku, traka lista ispod crteža ima dugme MarkupCraft: ono otvara PDF lista na ekranu, u novoj kartici, u programu MarkupCraft, da ga pregledate i označite. Pronađite list Pomičite listu Sheets lijevo i kliknite na list. Ukucajte u Pretraži listove na vrhu liste da filtrirate po broju lista, nazivu datoteke ili oznaci stranice. Brojka pored Sheets prikazuje \"3 od 40\" dok je filter uključen. Pritisnite Page Down za sljedeći list, a Page Up za prethodni. Oni prate listu onako kako je filtrirana. Na Mac tastaturi bez tipki Page Up i Page Down pritisnite fn sa strelicom gore ili dolje. Kako se listovi imenuju Stranica kojoj PDF daje oznaku, kao A-101, dobija ime po toj oznaci. Stranica bez oznake (ili sa oznakom koja je samo broj stranice) imenuje se \"(naziv datoteke), stranica (n)\". Kad je otvoreno više PDF-ova, označeni listovi nose i naziv datoteke: \"A-101 — Arhitektura\". Imena listova se još ne mogu unositi ručno. Pogledajte list Okrećite točkić miša da zumirate na mjestu pokazivača. Prevucite lijevim ili srednjim dugmetom da pomjerate pogled. Uz Auto brojanje, ili kad počnete na uglu oznake, držite Space dok prevlačite, ili prevucite srednjim dugmetom. Pritisnite F ili izaberite Fit page da vidite cijeli list; W ili Fit width prilagođava njegovu širinu. Pritisnite + ili = za uvećanje, a − za smanjenje, oko sredine prikaza. Svaki list pamti svoj zoom i položaj dok je otvoren. Dalje Prije mjerenja lista potrebna mu je razmjera: Postavljanje razmjere.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Otvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža","summary":"Otvorite datoteku crteža kao listove (prostor modela i svaki raspored), počnite sa razmjerom koju crtež daje, prikazujte ili skrivajte njegove slojeve i uvezite povezane crteže.","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","cad","crtež","otvaranje crteža","rasporedi","prostor modela","prostor papira","listovi","jedinice","insunits","razmjera pogleda","xref","povezani crtež","slojevi","zamrznuto","bez pdf-a","ispis","bez ispisa"],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-crte","text":"Otvorite crtež","level":2},{"id":"listovi","text":"Listovi","level":2},{"id":"razmjera","text":"Razmjera","level":2},{"id":"slojevi","text":"Slojevi","level":2},{"id":"povezani-crte-i-xref","text":"Povezani crteži (xref)","level":2},{"id":"ograni-enja","text":"Ograničenja","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk otvara DWG ili DXF crtež kao što otvara PDF: ne morate ga prethodno ispisati u PDF. Brojanje iz samog crteža je tačno, jer crtež zna šta je svaki objekat. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-crte\"\u003EOtvorite crtež\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite DWG ili DXF datoteku. Možete izabrati više njih, i PDF-ove uz njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite Otvori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMožete i prevući datoteke crteža na TakeoffDesk, kao PDF-ove. Ništa se ne otprema: preglednik čita datoteku na vašem računaru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk čita DWG od AutoCAD 2000 do 2018 i ASCII DXF od R12 do 2018. Odbija binarni DXF (sačuvajte ga kao ASCII ili kao DWG) i datoteku koja nije ni jedno ni drugo, i kaže zašto. Oštećena datoteka se otvara sa onim što se moglo pročitati, a poruka to kaže; brojanja u njoj mogu biti nepotpuna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"listovi\"\u003EListovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E je prostor modela crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESvaki raspored\u003C/strong\u003E (kartica prostora papira) je list, nazvan po svojoj kartici, po redu kartica. Raspored prikazuje model kroz svoje prozore, onako kako se ispisuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZumiranje, pomjeranje, hvatanje za linije crteža, oznake, bilješke, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E i ostalo rade kao na PDF-u. Listovi crteža se čuvaju u predmjeru po nazivu datoteke i otisku sadržaja, kao i PDF: ponovo otvorite istu datoteku i oznake su na njenim listovima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razmjera\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EList počinje sa razmjerom koju crtež daje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaspored\u003C/strong\u003E uzima razmjeru svog najvećeg prozora. Razmjera poput 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; imenuje se kao unaprijed zadana koju predstavlja; svaka druga se prikazuje kao &quot;Iz vidnog polja crteža: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;&quot;. Ako raspored ima prozore u drugim razmjerama, najveći postavlja razmjeru lista: ostale provjerite pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E uzima jedinice crteža (inči, milimetri, stope…) kao razmjeru: &quot;Jedinice crteža (inči)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrtež bez jedinica\u003C/strong\u003E (crtež nikad nije rekao je li jedinica inč ili milimetar) nema razmjeru: list kaže &quot;Bez razmjere&quot;, a mjerenje na njemu je odbijeno, kao na PDF-u bez razmjere. Brojanje ne traži razmjeru. Dajte mu razmjeru pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E i lista \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E mijenjaju razmjeru u bilo koje vrijeme i imaju prednost nad onom iz crteža. Lista unaprijed zadanih je isključena na Modelu, koji nema veličinu papira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slojevi\"\u003ESlojevi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista navodi slojeve crteža i koliko objekata svaki ima na ovom listu. Slojevi koje je datoteka isključila ili zamrznula počinju skriveni. Poništite oznaku sloja da ga sakrijete, ili označite skriveni sloj da ga prikažete: list se ponovo crta, a skriveno se izostavlja iz brojanja i iz objekata ponuđenih za \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E, osim ako tražite da se broje i skriveni slojevi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje svaki sloj; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the file&#039;s layers\u003C/span\u003E poništava vaše promjene. Izbori slojeva pripadaju ovoj sesiji, a ne datoteci predmjera.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povezani-crte-i-xref\"\u003EPovezani crteži (xref)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtež koji povezuje druge crteže prikazuje ih tamo gdje su umetnuti. TakeoffDesk nalazi povezani crtež među \u003Cstrong\u003Eotvorenim datotekama\u003C/strong\u003E, po njegovom nazivu datoteke: otvorite glavni crtež i povezani zajedno (ili jedan za drugim). Dok to ne uradite, statusna traka kaže koliko povezanih crteža nije nađeno, a crtež koji nedostaje se ne prikazuje, i brojanja to kažu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ograni-enja\"\u003EOgraničenja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObjekti koje TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati ili postaviti (proxy objekti, nepoznate klase) navedeni su u prozoru brojanja po tipu; nikad se ne izostavljaju bez riječi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo veliki crteži se crtaju djelimično, a brojanje staje na granici, uz poruku. Za takav crtež otvorite PDF ispis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECrtež se crta crno i u svojim bojama, potamnjenim za bijeli papir. Tabele stilova ispisa i dodjele olovaka se ne primjenjuju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk otvara DWG ili DXF crtež kao što otvara PDF: ne morate ga prethodno ispisati u PDF. Brojanje iz samog crteža je tačno, jer crtež zna šta je svaki objekat. Vidi Brojanje iz crteža. Otvorite crtež Izaberite Open plans u grupi File, ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. Izaberite DWG ili DXF datoteku. Možete izabrati više njih, i PDF-ove uz njih. Izaberite Otvori. Možete i prevući datoteke crteža na TakeoffDesk, kao PDF-ove. Ništa se ne otprema: preglednik čita datoteku na vašem računaru. TakeoffDesk čita DWG od AutoCAD 2000 do 2018 i ASCII DXF od R12 do 2018. Odbija binarni DXF (sačuvajte ga kao ASCII ili kao DWG) i datoteku koja nije ni jedno ni drugo, i kaže zašto. Oštećena datoteka se otvara sa onim što se moglo pročitati, a poruka to kaže; brojanja u njoj mogu biti nepotpuna. Listovi Model je prostor modela crteža. Svaki raspored (kartica prostora papira) je list, nazvan po svojoj kartici, po redu kartica. Raspored prikazuje model kroz svoje prozore, onako kako se ispisuje. Zumiranje, pomjeranje, hvatanje za linije crteža, oznake, bilješke, Calibrate i ostalo rade kao na PDF-u. Listovi crteža se čuvaju u predmjeru po nazivu datoteke i otisku sadržaja, kao i PDF: ponovo otvorite istu datoteku i oznake su na njenim listovima. Razmjera List počinje sa razmjerom koju crtež daje: Raspored uzima razmjeru svog najvećeg prozora. Razmjera poput 1/2\" = 1'-0\" imenuje se kao unaprijed zadana koju predstavlja; svaka druga se prikazuje kao \"Iz vidnog polja crteža: 1\" = 2.5'\". Ako raspored ima prozore u drugim razmjerama, najveći postavlja razmjeru lista: ostale provjerite pomoću Check. Model uzima jedinice crteža (inči, milimetri, stope…) kao razmjeru: \"Jedinice crteža (inči)\". Crtež bez jedinica (crtež nikad nije rekao je li jedinica inč ili milimetar) nema razmjeru: list kaže \"Bez razmjere\", a mjerenje na njemu je odbijeno, kao na PDF-u bez razmjere. Brojanje ne traži razmjeru. Dajte mu razmjeru pomoću Calibrate. Calibrate, Check i lista Preset mijenjaju razmjeru u bilo koje vrijeme i imaju prednost nad onom iz crteža. Lista unaprijed zadanih je isključena na Modelu, koji nema veličinu papira. Slojevi Layers na traci lista navodi slojeve crteža i koliko objekata svaki ima na ovom listu. Slojevi koje je datoteka isključila ili zamrznula počinju skriveni. Poništite oznaku sloja da ga sakrijete, ili označite skriveni sloj da ga prikažete: list se ponovo crta, a skriveno se izostavlja iz brojanja i iz objekata ponuđenih za Measure drawing, osim ako tražite da se broje i skriveni slojevi. Show all prikazuje svaki sloj; Back to the file's layers poništava vaše promjene. Izbori slojeva pripadaju ovoj sesiji, a ne datoteci predmjera. Povezani crteži (xref) Crtež koji povezuje druge crteže prikazuje ih tamo gdje su umetnuti. TakeoffDesk nalazi povezani crtež među otvorenim datotekama, po njegovom nazivu datoteke: otvorite glavni crtež i povezani zajedno (ili jedan za drugim). Dok to ne uradite, statusna traka kaže koliko povezanih crteža nije nađeno, a crtež koji nedostaje se ne prikazuje, i brojanja to kažu. Ograničenja Objekti koje TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati ili postaviti (proxy objekti, nepoznate klase) navedeni su u prozoru brojanja po tipu; nikad se ne izostavljaju bez riječi. Vrlo veliki crteži se crtaju djelimično, a brojanje staje na granici, uz poruku. Za takav crtež otvorite PDF ispis. Crtež se crta crno i u svojim bojama, potamnjenim za bijeli papir. Tabele stilova ispisa i dodjele olovaka se ne primjenjuju.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uvoz količina iz IFC 4.3 datoteke","summary":"Otvorite IFC 4.3 datoteku puta, željeznice, mosta ili zemljanih radova i dobijte brojanje po klasi, sa dužinama, površinama i zapreminama koje datoteka navodi, kao tipizirane količine.","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","put","cesta","željeznica","most","kolovoz","sloj","ivičnjak","zemljani radovi","ležište","infrastruktura","količine","bim","građevina","tipizirane količine"],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-datoteku","text":"Otvorite datoteku","level":2},{"id":"ta-ne-radi","text":"Šta ne radi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka IFC 4.3 može sadržavati ceste, željeznice, mostove, morske građevine i dijelove od kojih se one sastoje: kolovoze, slojeve, ivičnjake, šine, zemljane radove, ležišta, pilote i još mnogo toga. TakeoffDesk ih čita i pretvara u tipizirane količine koje možete cijeniti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-datoteku\"\u003EOtvorite datoteku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite IFC datoteku (možete je izabrati zajedno sa PDF-ovima), ili je prevucite na TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa svaku klasu i predefinisani tip pravi se jedna tipizirana količina, na primjer &quot;Kolovoz (fleksibilni): brojanje&quot;, i, kad ih datoteka navodi, &quot;dužina&quot; u m, &quot;površina&quot; u m² i &quot;zapremina&quot; u m³. Napomena uz svaku stavku kaže koliko je elemenata izbrojano, a koliko nije imalo nikakvu količinu. Otvaranje novije datoteke istog naziva ažurira te količine umjesto da dodaje nove.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-ne-radi\"\u003EŠta ne radi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EČita skupove količina (IfcElementQuantity) koje datoteka nosi. Ne mjeri 3D oblike, pa element bez skupa količina se broji, ali ne dodaje dužinu, površinu ni zapreminu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EČitaju se samo infrastrukturne klase IFC 4.3. Zgradarska datoteka (zidovi, vrata, međuspratne konstrukcije) se ovdje ne pretvara u količine; datoteka koja nije IFC 4.3 to kaže i ne uvozi ništa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJedinice su jedinice same datoteke, pretvorene u metre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Datoteka IFC 4.3 može sadržavati ceste, željeznice, mostove, morske građevine i dijelove od kojih se one sastoje: kolovoze, slojeve, ivičnjake, šine, zemljane radove, ležišta, pilote i još mnogo toga. TakeoffDesk ih čita i pretvara u tipizirane količine koje možete cijeniti. Otvorite datoteku Izaberite Open plans u grupi File, ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. Izaberite IFC datoteku (možete je izabrati zajedno sa PDF-ovima), ili je prevucite na TakeoffDesk. Za svaku klasu i predefinisani tip pravi se jedna tipizirana količina, na primjer \"Kolovoz (fleksibilni): brojanje\", i, kad ih datoteka navodi, \"dužina\" u m, \"površina\" u m² i \"zapremina\" u m³. Napomena uz svaku stavku kaže koliko je elemenata izbrojano, a koliko nije imalo nikakvu količinu. Otvaranje novije datoteke istog naziva ažurira te količine umjesto da dodaje nove. Šta ne radi Čita skupove količina (IfcElementQuantity) koje datoteka nosi. Ne mjeri 3D oblike, pa element bez skupa količina se broji, ali ne dodaje dužinu, površinu ni zapreminu. Čitaju se samo infrastrukturne klase IFC 4.3. Zgradarska datoteka (zidovi, vrata, međuspratne konstrukcije) se ovdje ne pretvara u količine; datoteka koja nije IFC 4.3 to kaže i ne uvozi ništa. Jedinice su jedinice same datoteke, pretvorene u metre.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Postavi razmjeru","summary":"Daj svakom listu razmjeru preko unaprijed zadane ili kalibracijom na poznatoj dimenziji, provjeri je, i razumi zašto listovi bez razmjere ne ulaze u zbirove.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["otkrij razmjeru","pročitaj razmjeru","razmjera iz teksta","svi listovi","razmjera","kalibriraj","unaprijed zadana","provjeri razmjeru","provjeri","poznata dimenzija","bez razmjere","nema razmjere","odnos","postavi razmjeru"],"headings":[{"id":"koristi-unaprijed-zadanu-kad-je-pdf-od-tampan-u-punoj-veli-ini","text":"Koristi unaprijed zadanu (kad je PDF odštampan u punoj veličini)","level":2},{"id":"itaj-razmjere-iz-teksta-listova","text":"Čitaj razmjere iz teksta listova","level":2},{"id":"kalibriraj-na-poznatoj-dimenziji","text":"Kalibriraj na poznatoj dimenziji","level":2},{"id":"provjeri-razmjeru","text":"Provjeri razmjeru","level":2},{"id":"promijeni-razmjeru","text":"Promijeni razmjeru","level":2},{"id":"za-to-listovi-bez-razmjere-nisu-ra-unati-kao-nula","text":"Zašto listovi bez razmjere nisu računati kao nula","level":2},{"id":"savjeti","text":"Savjeti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaki list ima svoju razmjeru. Ti je postaviš ili pustiš da TakeoffDesk pročita tekst listova (dolje), pa je provjeriš. Dok list nema razmjeru, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKrug\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E odbijaju da mjere na njemu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E rade bez razmjere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpisak listova prikazuje razmjeru svakog lista, ili \u003Cstrong\u003ENema razmjere\u003C/strong\u003E. Traka ispod otvorenog lista kaže isto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristi-unaprijed-zadanu-kad-je-pdf-od-tampan-u-punoj-veli-ini\"\u003EKoristi unaprijed zadanu (kad je PDF odštampan u punoj veličini)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori listu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi razmjeru odštampanu na crtežu, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E pod Arhitektonska. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Razmjera za ovaj list: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjeri je (dolje).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnaprijed zadana razmjera pretpostavlja da je PDF prava papirna veličina za koju je crtež napravljen. Ako je neko napravio PDF s opcijom „prilagodi stranici“, ili je to set u polovičnoj veličini, unaprijed zadana razmjera je pogrešna. Umjesto nje kalibriraj.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECijeli spisak je u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EUnaprijed zadane razmjere\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itaj-razmjere-iz-teksta-listova\"\u003EČitaj razmjere iz teksta listova\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVećina crteža navodi razmjeru: \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E u naslovnom bloku, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E ispod pogleda. TakeoffDesk je može pročitati i postaviti svaki list odjednom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori listu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/span\u003E i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIz teksta listova…\u003C/span\u003E (na vrhu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELista prikazuje svaki list: njegovu trenutnu razmjeru i šta kaže njegov tekst — \u003Cstrong\u003EKaže 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENema razmjere u tekstu\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003EKaže da nije u razmjeri\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EListovi bez razmjere koji imaju je označeni su. Označi ili odznači bilo koji, pa odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi označene razmjere\u003C/span\u003E. Jedan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća sve.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjeri jednu dimenziju na svakom listu sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E (dolje): unaprijed zadana je ispravna samo ako je PDF odštampan u punoj veličini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EČita arhitektonske (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), inženjerske (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) i metričke (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) zapise koji odgovaraju \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Eunaprijed zadanoj razmjeri\u003C/a\u003E. Kad list kaže više od jedne razmjere (plan s uvećanim detaljima), uzima onu koju najčešće navodi, a onu napisanu nakon riječi SCALE broji dvostruko; ostale se prikazuju crveno da ih provjeriš. Skenirani list nema tekst: postavi mu razmjeru ručno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kalibriraj-na-poznatoj-dimenziji\"\u003EKalibriraj na poznatoj dimenziji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristi ovo kad nema odštampane razmjere kojoj vjeruješ, set je promijenjen, ili list kaže „nije u razmjeri“ ali ima dimenzije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori list i uvećaj dugu dimenziju koju znaš, kao razmak mreže ili ukupnu dimenziju zgrade. Što duža, to tačnija.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKlikni jedan kraj dimenzije. Uvećaj svaki kraj radi preciznosti; možeš uvećavati i pomjerati između klikova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKlikni drugi kraj. Drži \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da linija ostane na 0°, 45° ili 90°. Otvara se dijalog \u003Cstrong\u003EKalibriraj ovaj list\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpiši stvarnu dužinu u \u003Cstrong\u003EStvarna dužina\u003C/strong\u003E, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (decimalne stope), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Pogledaj \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos dužine, cijene i postotka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi razmjeru\u003C/span\u003E. Statusna traka prikazuje razmjeru kao &quot;1&quot; = (n)&#039;&quot;, a kad je unutar 0.5% od unaprijed zadane, kaže koja je, na primjer &quot;što odgovara 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; (odaberi tu unaprijed zadanu za tačnu razmjeru)&quot;. TakeoffDesk se vraća na alat \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad se kalibracija poklapa s unaprijed zadanom razmjerom, odabir te unaprijed zadane daje tačnu razmjeru umjesto one koja zavisi od mjesta gdje si kliknuo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjeri-razmjeru\"\u003EProvjeri razmjeru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUvijek provjeri novu razmjeru na drugoj dimenziji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKlikni oba kraja dimenzije odštampane na crtežu. Statusna traka prikazuje &quot;Provjera: 12&#039;-6&quot;&quot; s istom dužinom u decimalnim stopama i metrima, a linija provjere ostaje na listu s svojom dužinom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUporedi s odštampanom dimenzijom. Ako nije tačno, kalibriraj na dužoj dimenziji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da obrišeš liniju provjere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"promijeni-razmjeru\"\u003EPromijeni razmjeru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberi drugu unaprijed zadanu ili ponovo kalibriraj. Ako list već ima mjerenja, TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003EPromijeniti razmjeru ovog lista?\u003C/strong\u003E i kaže koliko će se mjerenja ponovo izmjeriti. Odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPromijeni razmjeru\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka dionica i površina na listu se ponovo mjeri u novoj razmjeri. Možeš poništiti sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"za-to-listovi-bez-razmjere-nisu-ra-unati-kao-nula\"\u003EZašto listovi bez razmjere nisu računati kao nula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznaka na listu bez razmjere nema stvarnu dužinu ni površinu. TakeoffDesk je nikad ne računa kao nulu, jer bi to tiho učinilo tvoj predmjer preniskim. Umjesto toga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizostavlja te oznake iz zbirova,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprikazuje &quot;+(n) bez razmjere&quot; pored stavke u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprikazuje &quot;Nepotpuno: (n) oznaka na listovima bez razmjere (nisu u zbirovima)&quot; u zaglavlju tabele,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eupisuje broj u kolonu napomena izvezene tabele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo se može desiti kad otvoriš projekat čije razmjere nikad nisu postavljene. Daj listu razmjeru i oznake se odmah računaju. Oznake brojanja se uvijek računaju; one ne trebaju razmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"savjeti\"\u003ESavjeti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavi razmjeru na svakom listu koji ćeš mjeriti prije početka. Pregledaj spisak listova za \u003Cstrong\u003ENema razmjere\u003C/strong\u003E da nađeš one koji su ostali (polje za pretragu gleda nazive listova, a ne razmjere).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDetalji i uvećani planovi na istom listu često koriste drugu razmjeru. TakeoffDesk ima jednu razmjeru po listu; pogledaj \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EŠta još nije urađeno\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMetrički crteži: odaberi metričku unaprijed zadanu poput \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, ili kalibriraj metričkom dužinom poput \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Svaki list ima svoju razmjeru. Ti je postaviš ili pustiš da TakeoffDesk pročita tekst listova (dolje), pa je provjeriš. Dok list nema razmjeru, Linijski, Površina, Krug i Izrez odbijaju da mjere na njemu. Brojanje i Auto brojanje rade bez razmjere. Spisak listova prikazuje razmjeru svakog lista, ili Nema razmjere. Traka ispod otvorenog lista kaže isto. Koristi unaprijed zadanu (kad je PDF odštampan u punoj veličini) Otvori list. Otvori listu Unaprijed zadana u grupi Razmjera. Odaberi razmjeru odštampanu na crtežu, na primjer 1/8\" = 1'-0\" pod Arhitektonska. Statusna traka kaže \"Razmjera za ovaj list: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".\" Provjeri je (dolje). Unaprijed zadana razmjera pretpostavlja da je PDF prava papirna veličina za koju je crtež napravljen. Ako je neko napravio PDF s opcijom „prilagodi stranici“, ili je to set u polovičnoj veličini, unaprijed zadana razmjera je pogrešna. Umjesto nje kalibriraj. Cijeli spisak je u Unaprijed zadane razmjere. Čitaj razmjere iz teksta listova Većina crteža navodi razmjeru: SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" u naslovnom bloku, 1:100 ispod pogleda. TakeoffDesk je može pročitati i postaviti svaki list odjednom. Otvori listu Unaprijed zadana i odaberi Iz teksta listova… (na vrhu). Lista prikazuje svaki list: njegovu trenutnu razmjeru i šta kaže njegov tekst — Kaže 1/4\" = 1'-0\", Nema razmjere u tekstu ili Kaže da nije u razmjeri (NTS). Listovi bez razmjere koji imaju je označeni su. Označi ili odznači bilo koji, pa odaberi Postavi označene razmjere. Jedan Ctrl+Z vraća sve. Provjeri jednu dimenziju na svakom listu sa Provjeri (dolje): unaprijed zadana je ispravna samo ako je PDF odštampan u punoj veličini. Čita arhitektonske (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), inženjerske (1\" = 20') i metričke (1:50) zapise koji odgovaraju unaprijed zadanoj razmjeri. Kad list kaže više od jedne razmjere (plan s uvećanim detaljima), uzima onu koju najčešće navodi, a onu napisanu nakon riječi SCALE broji dvostruko; ostale se prikazuju crveno da ih provjeriš. Skenirani list nema tekst: postavi mu razmjeru ručno. Kalibriraj na poznatoj dimenziji Koristi ovo kad nema odštampane razmjere kojoj vjeruješ, set je promijenjen, ili list kaže „nije u razmjeri“ ali ima dimenzije. Otvori list i uvećaj dugu dimenziju koju znaš, kao razmak mreže ili ukupnu dimenziju zgrade. Što duža, to tačnija. Odaberi Kalibriraj u grupi Razmjera, ili pritisni K. Klikni jedan kraj dimenzije. Uvećaj svaki kraj radi preciznosti; možeš uvećavati i pomjerati između klikova. Klikni drugi kraj. Drži Shift da linija ostane na 0°, 45° ili 90°. Otvara se dijalog Kalibriraj ovaj list. Upiši stvarnu dužinu u Stvarna dužina, na primjer 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (decimalne stope), 30\" ili 7.5 m. Pogledaj Unos dužine, cijene i postotka. Odaberi Postavi razmjeru. Statusna traka prikazuje razmjeru kao \"1\" = (n)'\", a kad je unutar 0.5% od unaprijed zadane, kaže koja je, na primjer \"što odgovara 1/4\" = 1'-0\" (odaberi tu unaprijed zadanu za tačnu razmjeru)\". TakeoffDesk se vraća na alat Odaberi. Kad se kalibracija poklapa s unaprijed zadanom razmjerom, odabir te unaprijed zadane daje tačnu razmjeru umjesto one koja zavisi od mjesta gdje si kliknuo. Provjeri razmjeru Uvijek provjeri novu razmjeru na drugoj dimenziji. Odaberi Provjeri u grupi Razmjera, ili pritisni D. Klikni oba kraja dimenzije odštampane na crtežu. Statusna traka prikazuje \"Provjera: 12'-6\"\" s istom dužinom u decimalnim stopama i metrima, a linija provjere ostaje na listu s svojom dužinom. Uporedi s odštampanom dimenzijom. Ako nije tačno, kalibriraj na dužoj dimenziji. Pritisni Esc da obrišeš liniju provjere. Promijeni razmjeru Odaberi drugu unaprijed zadanu ili ponovo kalibriraj. Ako list već ima mjerenja, TakeoffDesk pita Promijeniti razmjeru ovog lista? i kaže koliko će se mjerenja ponovo izmjeriti. Odaberi Promijeni razmjeru. Svaka dionica i površina na listu se ponovo mjeri u novoj razmjeri. Možeš poništiti sa Ctrl+Z. Zašto listovi bez razmjere nisu računati kao nula Oznaka na listu bez razmjere nema stvarnu dužinu ni površinu. TakeoffDesk je nikad ne računa kao nulu, jer bi to tiho učinilo tvoj predmjer preniskim. Umjesto toga: izostavlja te oznake iz zbirova, prikazuje \"+(n) bez razmjere\" pored stavke u Količine, prikazuje \"Nepotpuno: (n) oznaka na listovima bez razmjere (nisu u zbirovima)\" u zaglavlju tabele, upisuje broj u kolonu napomena izvezene tabele. Ovo se može desiti kad otvoriš projekat čije razmjere nikad nisu postavljene. Daj listu razmjeru i oznake se odmah računaju. Oznake brojanja se uvijek računaju; one ne trebaju razmjeru. Savjeti Postavi razmjeru na svakom listu koji ćeš mjeriti prije početka. Pregledaj spisak listova za Nema razmjere da nađeš one koji su ostali (polje za pretragu gleda nazive listova, a ne razmjere). Detalji i uvećani planovi na istom listu često koriste drugu razmjeru. TakeoffDesk ima jednu razmjeru po listu; pogledaj Šta još nije urađeno. Metrički crteži: odaberi metričku unaprijed zadanu poput 1:100, ili kalibriraj metričkom dužinom poput 6000 mm.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Create takeoff items","summary":"Make linear, area and count items and set their unit, height or depth, waste and material and labor rates.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["crew","production rate","crew size","wage","hours","man-hours","worker-hours","crew-days","labor hours","item","new item","condition","multi-condition","also measure","several types","room","linear","area","count","unit","height","depth","waste","material","labor","rate","color","cost"],"headings":[{"id":"typed-quantities-no-drawing","text":"Typed quantities (no drawing)","level":2},{"id":"make-an-item","text":"Make an item","level":2},{"id":"pick-the-item-you-draw-with","text":"Pick the item you draw with","level":2},{"id":"set-up-the-item","text":"Set up the item","level":2},{"id":"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks","text":"One item, several kinds of marks","level":2},{"id":"rates-in-the-table","text":"Rates in the table","level":2},{"id":"how-pricing-works","text":"How pricing works","level":2},{"id":"labor-by-crew","text":"Labor by crew","level":2},{"id":"metric-items","text":"Metric items","level":2},{"id":"next","text":"Next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn \u003Cstrong\u003Eitem\u003C/strong\u003E is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou draw\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIt reports\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnits\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERuns of connected points\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF or m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClosed outlines, with cut-outs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea, perimeter, number of areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne click per thing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow many\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing: you type the quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003ETyped quantities (no drawing)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a \u003Cstrong\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name, pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETyped quantity (no drawing)\u003C/span\u003E and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E (LS for a lump sum) and type the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly&#039;s formulas use \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, the quantity, for example \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E truck loads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EEarthwork and spot elevations\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"make-an-item\"\u003EMake an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType a name, like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet tile\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the type: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E in the form to close it without adding an item.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E form with that type already chosen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-the-item-you-draw-with\"\u003EPick the item you draw with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, its measuring tool comes on (Linear, Area or Count, as the item is; Circle or Room stay on for an area item, Path for a linear one), and its marks glow on every sheet. Every other mark stays fully visible. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClicking a mark with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool also makes its item the current one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"set-up-the-item\"\u003ESet up the item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe item editor (\u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, and each change can be undone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShown in the list, the tables and the exports.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (&quot;An item with marks keeps its type&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow its runs and area outlines are drawn: Solid, Dashed, Dotted or Double. Deducted segments stay thin and dashed. Shown on screen and in the marked PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose an image…\u003C/span\u003E picks any PNG, JPEG or SVG; it is shrunk to a small square and saved inside the takeoff. The icon replaces the color square in the lists and the dot of each count mark, on screen and in the marked PDF. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E goes back to the dot.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E (linear)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E (area)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdded to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabor cost per unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIts CSI MasterFormat number, like \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (or just the division, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). The workbook&#039;s By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Etrade packs\u003C/a\u003E have one already.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeight and depth take feet and inches (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) or decimal feet (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) for imperial units, and meters (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) for metric units. Rates take amounts like \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, up to four decimals. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003ELength, rate and percent entry\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelow the fields, \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E shows the totals the item&#039;s formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the item with its main type, such as an area item \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E in its editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E or both. Each one gets a unit next to it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDraw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E current, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E draws its floor, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E its base and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe items list shows every quantity (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). In the quantities table the item&#039;s row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom 101 (count)\u003C/strong\u003E, with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF&#039;s legend list them the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe main type&#039;s fields stay the main type&#039;s own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type&#039;s totals.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurther down is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the bottom: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove up\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove down\u003C/span\u003E change the item&#039;s place in the list and in the exports, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete item\u003C/span\u003E removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArea items also have \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E (roof planes measured on the slope: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003ERoofs and slopes\u003C/a\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E (their marks come off other items&#039; areas: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003EMeasure areas\u003C/a\u003E). Linear items have \u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rates-in-the-table\"\u003ERates in the table\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou can also type \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, material and labor rates straight into the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E). It is the same setting as in the editor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-pricing-works\"\u003EHow pricing works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor each item and each assembly component:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWith waste\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity × (1 + waste %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabor\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETotal\u003C/strong\u003E = material + labor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item&#039;s rates at 0 when its components carry the cost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"labor-by-crew\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInstead of a labor rate per unit, an item&#039;s labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/span\u003E in the item editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice labor from a crew\u003C/span\u003E and fill in:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EExample\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProduction\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF an hour (in the item&#039;s unit) for the whole crew\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrew size\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E people\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWage $/hour each\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eworker-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours × crew size (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-days\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elabor\u003C/strong\u003E = worker-hours × wage ($495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item&#039;s own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table adds the job&#039;s worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew&#039;s hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metric-items\"\u003EMetric items\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"next\"\u003ENext\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An item is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions. Each item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see One item, several kinds of marks): Type You draw It reports Units Linear Runs of connected points Length, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height LF or m Area Closed outlines, with cut-outs Area, perimeter, number of areas SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Count One click per thing How many EA Typed quantity Nothing: you type the quantity The number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Typed quantities (no drawing) Some things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a Typed quantity: Choose New item, type a name, pick Typed quantity (no drawing) and choose Add. In the item editor pick the Unit (LS for a lump sum) and type the Quantity: 1, 2.5 or 1,250. Set waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly's formulas use Q, the quantity, for example ceil(Q / 12) truck loads. A typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has Bid area: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see Earthwork and spot elevations. Make an item In the Items panel on the right, choose New item. Type a name, like Interior wall type A or Carpet tile. Pick the type: Linear (length), Area or Count. Choose Add (or press Enter). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next. Press Esc in the form to close it without adding an item. If you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the New item form with that type already chosen. Pick the item you draw with Click an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, its measuring tool comes on (Linear, Area or Count, as the item is; Circle or Room stay on for an area item, Path for a linear one), and its marks glow on every sheet. Every other mark stays fully visible. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with. Clicking a mark with the Select tool also makes its item the current one. Set up the item The item editor (Item: (name)) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press Enter, and each change can be undone. Field What it does Name Shown in the list, the tables and the exports. Type Linear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (\"An item with marks keeps its type\"). Color The color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF. Line How its runs and area outlines are drawn: Solid, Dashed, Dotted or Double. Deducted segments stay thin and dashed. Shown on screen and in the marked PDF. Icon Choose an image… picks any PNG, JPEG or SVG; it is shrunk to a small square and saved inside the takeoff. The icon replaces the color square in the lists and the dot of each count mark, on screen and in the marked PDF. Remove goes back to the dot. Unit What the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count. Also measure The other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below. Height (linear) A wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume. Depth (area) A depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume). Waste % Added to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10. Material $/LF Material cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on. Labor $/LF Labor cost per unit. CSI number Its CSI MasterFormat number, like 09 21 16 (or just the division, 09). The workbook's By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from trade packs have one already. Height and depth take feet and inches (9'-0\", 8' 6\") or decimal feet (9) for imperial units, and meters (2.7, 2700 mm) for metric units. Rates take amounts like 12.50 or $1,250, up to four decimals. See Length, rate and percent entry. Below the fields, Measured shows the totals the item's formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count. One item, several kinds of marks Some things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one: Make the item with its main type, such as an area item Room 101. Under Also measure in its editor, tick Linear, Count or both. Each one gets a unit next to it. Draw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with Room 101 current, Area draws its floor, Linear its base and Count its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item. The items list shows every quantity (50.00 SF + 2 EA). In the quantities table the item's row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as Room 101 (count), with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF's legend list them the same way. The main type's fields stay the main type's own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type's totals. A kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under Selected mark, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind. Further down is the Assembly: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See Assemblies and formulas. At the bottom: Move up and Move down change the item's place in the list and in the exports, and Delete item removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it). Area items also have Pitch (roof planes measured on the slope: Roofs and slopes) and Back-out (their marks come off other items' areas: Measure areas). Linear items have Slope (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, Pitch. Rates in the table You can also type Waste %, material and labor rates straight into the Quantities table at the bottom (By item). It is the same setting as in the editor. How pricing works For each item and each assembly component: With waste = quantity × (1 + waste %). Material = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent. Labor = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent. Total = material + labor. The Job total adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item's rates at 0 when its components carry the cost. Labor by crew Instead of a labor rate per unit, an item's labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under Labor by crew in the item editor, tick Price labor from a crew and fill in: Field Example Production 20 LF an hour (in the item's unit) for the whole crew Crew size 2 people Wage $/hour each 45 TakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste: crew-hours = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), worker-hours = crew-hours × crew size (11), crew-days = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69), labor = worker-hours × wage ($495.00). The editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item's own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the Quantities table adds the job's worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew's hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit. Metric items Pick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent. Next Measure linear runs Measure areas with cut-outs Count by hand","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje iz crteža","summary":"Uzmite dužine i površine iz linija, lukova, polilinija i šrafura samog crteža tako što ćete ih odabrati, sa tačnim lukovima i rupama, umjesto ocrtavanja klikovima.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["mjerenje crteža","geometrija","polilinija","luk","krug","šrafura","ispupčenje","tačna dužina","tačna površina","odabir","prozor","ocrtavanje","iz CAD-a","linijski","površina"],"headings":[{"id":"uzimanje-objekata-kao-linijske-ili-povr-inske-stavke","text":"Uzimanje objekata kao linijske ili površinske stavke","level":2},{"id":"ta-koja-vrsta-stavke-uzima","text":"Šta koja vrsta stavke uzima","level":2},{"id":"ta-no-i-gotovo-ta-no","text":"Tačno i gotovo tačno","level":2},{"id":"odakle-uzima","text":"Odakle uzima","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzmjeri crtež\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista DWG ili DXF lista uzima objekte samog crteža kao oznake, pa ih ne ocrtavate klikovima. Dužina polilinije, dužina luka, površina kruga i površina šrafure sa njenim rupama izlaze tačno, iz istog računa koji predmjer koristi za svaku oznaku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uzimanje-objekata-kao-linijske-ili-povr-inske-stavke\"\u003EUzimanje objekata kao linijske ili površinske stavke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite ili kliknite \u003Cstrong\u003Elinijsku\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003Epovršinsku\u003C/strong\u003E stavku ispod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E. List treba razmjeru.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzmjeri crtež\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite objekte na listu da ih odaberete, ili prevucite prozor oko njih: sve što je potpuno unutar njega se odabire. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dodaje prozor izboru; ponovo kliknite odabrani objekat da ga uklonite. Traka prikazuje ukupno: „6 dionica: 108&#039;-9 1/8&quot; ukupno.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite dugme za dodavanje, koje navodi broj i stavku, na primjer \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj 6 u Edge\u003C/span\u003E (ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Svaki objekat postaje jedna oznaka stavke, u jednom koraku poništavanja. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše ono što ste odabrali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-koja-vrsta-stavke-uzima\"\u003EŠta koja vrsta stavke uzima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinijska\u003C/strong\u003E stavka uzima linije, lukove, polilinije, krugove i splajnove po dužini. Zatvoreni oblik se broji po obimu. Šrafura se izostavlja: ima površinu, a ne dužinu, i traka to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinska\u003C/strong\u003E stavka uzima zatvorene oblike: zatvorene polilinije, krugove, 2D tijela i šrafure sa njihovim rupama. Otvorene dionice se izostavljaju, i traka to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-no-i-gotovo-ta-no\"\u003ETačno i gotovo tačno\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinije, lukovi (bilo koje ispupčenje), polilinije sa ispupčenjima i krugovi su tačni: dužine i površine koriste poluprečnik i raspon luka, a ne njegovu sliku. Elipse, splajnovi i šrafure čija je granica sastavljena od ivica mjere se tetivama od jednog stepena ili sitnijih, što je unutar stotinke procenta za elipse i desetinke za ostale; traka kaže koliko od onoga što ste odabrali su krive ove vrste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odakle-uzima\"\u003EOdakle uzima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E: objekti u prostoru modela. \u003Cstrong\u003ERaspored\u003C/strong\u003E: njegove linije i objekti modela unutar viewporta, skalirani kroz njega. Objekat koji prelazi ivicu viewporta se ne nudi (iscrtava se odsječen); objekat koji prikazuju dva viewporta uzima se jednom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamo slojevi koje list prikazuje. Blokovi se broje, ne mjere: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E. 3D polilinije, mreže, tijela i regije se ne nude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izmjeri crtež na traci lista DWG ili DXF lista uzima objekte samog crteža kao oznake, pa ih ne ocrtavate klikovima. Dužina polilinije, dužina luka, površina kruga i površina šrafure sa njenim rupama izlaze tačno, iz istog računa koji predmjer koristi za svaku oznaku. Uzimanje objekata kao linijske ili površinske stavke Napravite ili kliknite linijsku ili površinsku stavku ispod Stavke. List treba razmjeru. Odaberite Izmjeri crtež. Kliknite objekte na listu da ih odaberete, ili prevucite prozor oko njih: sve što je potpuno unutar njega se odabire. Shift dodaje prozor izboru; ponovo kliknite odabrani objekat da ga uklonite. Traka prikazuje ukupno: „6 dionica: 108'-9 1/8\" ukupno.“ Odaberite dugme za dodavanje, koje navodi broj i stavku, na primjer Dodaj 6 u Edge (ili pritisnite Enter). Svaki objekat postaje jedna oznaka stavke, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Esc briše ono što ste odabrali. Šta koja vrsta stavke uzima Linijska stavka uzima linije, lukove, polilinije, krugove i splajnove po dužini. Zatvoreni oblik se broji po obimu. Šrafura se izostavlja: ima površinu, a ne dužinu, i traka to kaže. Površinska stavka uzima zatvorene oblike: zatvorene polilinije, krugove, 2D tijela i šrafure sa njihovim rupama. Otvorene dionice se izostavljaju, i traka to kaže. Tačno i gotovo tačno Linije, lukovi (bilo koje ispupčenje), polilinije sa ispupčenjima i krugovi su tačni: dužine i površine koriste poluprečnik i raspon luka, a ne njegovu sliku. Elipse, splajnovi i šrafure čija je granica sastavljena od ivica mjere se tetivama od jednog stepena ili sitnijih, što je unutar stotinke procenta za elipse i desetinke za ostale; traka kaže koliko od onoga što ste odabrali su krive ove vrste. Odakle uzima Model: objekti u prostoru modela. Raspored: njegove linije i objekti modela unutar viewporta, skalirani kroz njega. Objekat koji prelazi ivicu viewporta se ne nudi (iscrtava se odsječen); objekat koji prikazuju dva viewporta uzima se jednom. Samo slojevi koje list prikazuje. Blokovi se broje, ne mjere: pogledajte Brojanje iz crteža. 3D polilinije, mreže, tijela i regije se ne nude.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hvatanje na linije crteža","summary":"Tačke skaču na vlastite linije PDF-a dok mjerite ili kalibrirate: krajevi, središta, presjeci ili bilo koje mjesto na liniji, sa oznakom koja pokazuje koje je.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["hvatanje","hvatanje objekta","krajnja tačka","središnja tačka","presjek","najbliža","vektor","linije","precizno","tačno","F3","magnet","ugao"],"headings":[{"id":"na-ta-se-hvata","text":"Na šta se hvata","level":2},{"id":"gdje-radi","text":"Gdje radi","level":2},{"id":"listovi-na-kojima-ne-mo-e-da-hvata","text":"Listovi na kojima ne može da hvata","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVećina setova planova su vektorski PDF-ovi: zidovi i ivice su prave linije, a ne pikseli. Dok mjerite, TakeoffDesk hvata vaše klikove na te linije, tako da dionica počinje tačno na uglu zida, a kalibracija čita dimenziju koju je projektant nacrtao, a ne piksel na koji ste kliknuli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHvatanje\u003C/span\u003E je uključeno kada počnete. Uključite ili isključite ga sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHvatanje\u003C/span\u003E u statusnoj traci ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; postavka se čuva u ovom pregledaču (nalazi se i pod \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"na-ta-se-hvata\"\u003ENa šta se hvata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada pokazivač dođe unutar otprilike 10 piksela ekrana od linije, oznaka pokazuje gdje će klik pasti, sa svojim nazivom:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOznaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGdje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKvadrat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKraj\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKraj linije, ili ugao gdje se linije spajaju. Dva kraja krive se računaju; tačke duž nje ne.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrougao\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESredište\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESredina prave linije.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKrst\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPresjek\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMjesto gdje se dvije linije ukrštaju, ili gdje jedna završava na drugoj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPješčani sat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENa liniji\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajbliža tačka na liniji, kada nijedan kraj, središte ili presjek nije blizu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENajbliži kraj, središte ili presjek ima prednost. Tačka ide na samu liniju tek kada nijedan od njih nije blizu. Uvećajte prikaz da birate između tačaka koje su blizu jedna drugoj: 10 piksela su pikseli ekrana, pa pri većem uvećanju pokrivaju manji dio lista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-radi\"\u003EGdje radi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHvatanje radi u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKrug\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E, i kada prevučete ugao odabrane oznake. Također postavlja tačke lukova. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E i lijepljenje se ne hvataju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhvaćena tačka ima prednost nad poravnanjem na 45° sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: da biste crtali pod 45° u odnosu na linije, prvo isključite hvatanje sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalibrirajte sa uključenim hvatanjem. Kliknite blizu dva kraja kote ili zida čiju dužinu znate: obje tačke se tačno poklapaju sa crtežom, a razmjera je tačna (statusna traka tada navodi unaprijed zadanu razmjeru s kojom se poklapa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"listovi-na-kojima-ne-mo-e-da-hvata\"\u003EListovi na kojima ne može da hvata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkenirani listovi\u003C/strong\u003E su slike bez linija za hvatanje. Statusna traka kaže „Ovaj list nema linija za hvatanje (skenirana stranica je slika).“ i tačke idu tamo gdje kliknete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVrlo veliki crteži\u003C/strong\u003E: hvatanje čita do 400.000 segmenata linija po listu. Na listu sa više njih, aplikacija to kaže i hvata samo na prve.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETekst\u003C/strong\u003E se ne hvata, osim ako PDF slova crta kao linije (neki ploteri to rade).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinije lista se čitaju prvi put kada ga otvorite, u pozadini; veliki list može trebati sekundu prije nego se oznake pojave.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Većina setova planova su vektorski PDF-ovi: zidovi i ivice su prave linije, a ne pikseli. Dok mjerite, TakeoffDesk hvata vaše klikove na te linije, tako da dionica počinje tačno na uglu zida, a kalibracija čita dimenziju koju je projektant nacrtao, a ne piksel na koji ste kliknuli. Hvatanje je uključeno kada počnete. Uključite ili isključite ga sa Hvatanje u statusnoj traci ili F3; postavka se čuva u ovom pregledaču (nalazi se i pod Postavke). Na šta se hvata Kada pokazivač dođe unutar otprilike 10 piksela ekrana od linije, oznaka pokazuje gdje će klik pasti, sa svojim nazivom: Oznaka Naziv Gdje Kvadrat Kraj Kraj linije, ili ugao gdje se linije spajaju. Dva kraja krive se računaju; tačke duž nje ne. Trougao Središte Sredina prave linije. Krst Presjek Mjesto gdje se dvije linije ukrštaju, ili gdje jedna završava na drugoj. Pješčani sat Na liniji Najbliža tačka na liniji, kada nijedan kraj, središte ili presjek nije blizu. Najbliži kraj, središte ili presjek ima prednost. Tačka ide na samu liniju tek kada nijedan od njih nije blizu. Uvećajte prikaz da birate između tačaka koje su blizu jedna drugoj: 10 piksela su pikseli ekrana, pa pri većem uvećanju pokrivaju manji dio lista. Gdje radi Hvatanje radi u Linijski, Površina, Krug, Izrez, Kalibriraj i Provjeri, i kada prevučete ugao odabrane oznake. Također postavlja tačke lukova. Brojanje, Auto brojanje i lijepljenje se ne hvataju. Uhvaćena tačka ima prednost nad poravnanjem na 45° sa Shift: da biste crtali pod 45° u odnosu na linije, prvo isključite hvatanje sa F3. Kalibrirajte sa uključenim hvatanjem. Kliknite blizu dva kraja kote ili zida čiju dužinu znate: obje tačke se tačno poklapaju sa crtežom, a razmjera je tačna (statusna traka tada navodi unaprijed zadanu razmjeru s kojom se poklapa). Listovi na kojima ne može da hvata Skenirani listovi su slike bez linija za hvatanje. Statusna traka kaže „Ovaj list nema linija za hvatanje (skenirana stranica je slika).“ i tačke idu tamo gdje kliknete. Vrlo veliki crteži: hvatanje čita do 400.000 segmenata linija po listu. Na listu sa više njih, aplikacija to kaže i hvata samo na prve. Tekst se ne hvata, osim ako PDF slova crta kao linije (neki ploteri to rade). Linije lista se čitaju prvi put kada ga otvorite, u pozadini; veliki list može trebati sekundu prije nego se oznake pojave.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Odabir linija PDF-a","summary":"Kliknite na liniju vektorskog PDF-a da izmjerite čitav povezani put, ili kliknite unutar zatvorene konture za njenu površinu, uz prikazanu toleranciju razmaka i jedno poništavanje po segmentu.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["put","odabir","linije","povezano","cijeli niz","praćenje","kontura","obim","razmak","tolerancija","most","segmenti","tab","vektor","površina iz linija","p"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberite-put-ili-konturu","text":"Odaberite put ili konturu","level":2},{"id":"tolerancija-razmaka","text":"Tolerancija razmaka","level":2},{"id":"tipke","text":"Tipke","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENa vektorskom PDF-u zidovi i ivice su prave linije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ih uzima onakvima kakve su nacrtane: jedan klik na liniju mjeri sve što je spojeno s njom, od kraja do kraja, pa ne morate pratiti zid klikanjem na njegove uglove. List mora imati razmjeru. Skenirana stranica nema linija za odabir; tu koristite \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/a\u003E ili \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-put-ili-konturu\"\u003EOdaberite put ili konturu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath\u003C/span\u003E. Linija ispod pokazivača je ocrtana, a drugi putevi koje bi mogla biti dio prikazani su tanko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite na liniju: odabire se cijeli povezani put. Traka ispod alatne trake prikazuje njegove segmente, dužinu, toleranciju razmaka i koliko je razmaka premošćeno. Put koji se vraća na svoj početak je zatvoren i prikazuje i svoj obim.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kliknite unutar zatvorene konture, dalje od svake linije: kontura oko te tačke se odabire kao površina. Najmanja dolazi prva; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isprobava sljedeću veću.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili desni klik, ili dvostruki klik) da dodate oznake. Odabrani put postaje oznaka \u003Cstrong\u003Elinearne\u003C/strong\u003E stavke, a kontura oznaka \u003Cstrong\u003Epovršinske\u003C/strong\u003E stavke: aktivna stavka ako je te vrste, inače najnovija te vrste. Ako nema nijedne, otvara se obrazac za novu stavku i ništa se ne dodaje dok ponovo ne pritisnete \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sve odabrano se dodaje u jednom koraku poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tolerancija-razmaka\"\u003ETolerancija razmaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtači ostavljaju male rupe tamo gdje se linije treba spojiti. Dvije linije se spajaju kad su im krajevi bliži od \u003Cstrong\u003Etolerancije razmaka\u003C/strong\u003E. Ona počinje sa 1.5 tačke na listu (prikazana u stopama i inčima po razmjeri lista), a isprekidani prsten te širine prati pokazivač i stoji na svakom kraju puta ispod njega. Svaka premošćena rupa je obilježena narandžastim krugom na odabranom putu, a traka ih broji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E čini toleranciju širom, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E užom. Odabrani put se odmah ponovo spaja pri novoj toleranciji. Na spoju put nastavlja pravo, onako kako najmanje skreće, i ostavlja granu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke\"\u003ETipke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire put ispod pokazivača, ili konturu oko njega.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje još jedan put ili konturu odabranom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsprobava sljedeći put ispod pokazivača, ili sljedeću veću konturu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkida posljednji segment sa posljednjeg odabranog puta, jedan po jedan. Put bez preostalih segmenata nestaje. Kad ništa nije odabrano, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je obično poništavanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUža i šira tolerancija razmaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBriše odabir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKrivina u crtežu je lanac kratkih ravnih dijelova, pa je njena dužina malo kraća od prave dužine luka. Za tačan luk izmjerite iz same datoteke crteža (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMjerenje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremošćeni razmak se računa kao ravan skok preko njega, pa obim zatvorene konture uključuje i njega.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamo potezi i ispune u samim putevima stranice su linije. Tekst nacrtan kao slova i slike to nisu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Na vektorskom PDF-u zidovi i ivice su prave linije. Path (P) ih uzima onakvima kakve su nacrtane: jedan klik na liniju mjeri sve što je spojeno s njom, od kraja do kraja, pa ne morate pratiti zid klikanjem na njegove uglove. List mora imati razmjeru. Skenirana stranica nema linija za odabir; tu koristite Linearno ili Površina. Odaberite put ili konturu Izaberite Path. Linija ispod pokazivača je ocrtana, a drugi putevi koje bi mogla biti dio prikazani su tanko. Kliknite na liniju: odabire se cijeli povezani put. Traka ispod alatne trake prikazuje njegove segmente, dužinu, toleranciju razmaka i koliko je razmaka premošćeno. Put koji se vraća na svoj početak je zatvoren i prikazuje i svoj obim. Ili kliknite unutar zatvorene konture, dalje od svake linije: kontura oko te tačke se odabire kao površina. Najmanja dolazi prva; Tab isprobava sljedeću veću. Pritisnite Enter (ili desni klik, ili dvostruki klik) da dodate oznake. Odabrani put postaje oznaka linearne stavke, a kontura oznaka površinske stavke: aktivna stavka ako je te vrste, inače najnovija te vrste. Ako nema nijedne, otvara se obrazac za novu stavku i ništa se ne dodaje dok ponovo ne pritisnete Enter. Sve odabrano se dodaje u jednom koraku poništavanja. Tolerancija razmaka Crtači ostavljaju male rupe tamo gdje se linije treba spojiti. Dvije linije se spajaju kad su im krajevi bliži od tolerancije razmaka. Ona počinje sa 1.5 tačke na listu (prikazana u stopama i inčima po razmjeri lista), a isprekidani prsten te širine prati pokazivač i stoji na svakom kraju puta ispod njega. Svaka premošćena rupa je obilježena narandžastim krugom na odabranom putu, a traka ih broji. ] čini toleranciju širom, a [ užom. Odabrani put se odmah ponovo spaja pri novoj toleranciji. Na spoju put nastavlja pravo, onako kako najmanje skreće, i ostavlja granu. Tipke Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Klik Odabire put ispod pokazivača, ili konturu oko njega. Shift + klik Dodaje još jedan put ili konturu odabranom. Tab Isprobava sljedeći put ispod pokazivača, ili sljedeću veću konturu. Backspace ili Ctrl+Z Skida posljednji segment sa posljednjeg odabranog puta, jedan po jedan. Put bez preostalih segmenata nestaje. Kad ništa nije odabrano, Ctrl+Z je obično poništavanje. [ i ] Uža i šira tolerancija razmaka. Enter Dodaje oznake. Esc Briše odabir. Dobro je znati Krivina u crtežu je lanac kratkih ravnih dijelova, pa je njena dužina malo kraća od prave dužine luka. Za tačan luk izmjerite iz same datoteke crteža (Mjerenje iz crteža). Premošćeni razmak se računa kao ravan skok preko njega, pa obim zatvorene konture uključuje i njega. Samo potezi i ispune u samim putevima stranice su linije. Tekst nacrtan kao slova i slike to nisu.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje linijskih dionica","summary":"Izmjerite zidove, cijevi, lajsne i druge dužine kao dionice, sa pravim segmentima, lukovima i hvatanjem na 45 stepeni pomoću Shift-a.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["linijski","dužina","dionica","polilinija","zidovi","lf","linearne stope","luk","kriva","45 stepeni","ortogonalno","hvatanje","segmenti","polylength","odbitak","otvor","vrata","razmak","unos","upisano","koordinate","udaljenost","direktna udaljenost","polarno"],"headings":[{"id":"crtanje-dionice","text":"Crtanje dionice","level":2},{"id":"prave-linije-u-koracima-od-45","text":"Prave linije u koracima od 45°","level":2},{"id":"lukovi-i-zakrivljeni-zidovi","text":"Lukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi","level":2},{"id":"unos-du-ina-i-koordinata","text":"Unos dužina i koordinata","level":2},{"id":"odbitak-dijela-dionice","text":"Odbitak dijela dionice","level":2},{"id":"pregled-detalja-dionice","text":"Pregled detalja dionice","level":2},{"id":"ispravka-dionice","text":"Ispravka dionice","level":2},{"id":"povr-ina-zida","text":"Površina zida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELinijska stavka mjeri dužinu. Svaka dionica je lanac tačaka: pravi segmenti i lukovi tamo gdje uključite režim luka. Stavka može imati bilo koji broj dionica na bilo kojem broju listova.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba razmjeru (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavi razmjeru\u003C/a\u003E), a potrebna vam je linijska stavka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EKreiranje stavki predmjera\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa vektorskom PDF-u, vaši klikovi se hvataju za linije samog crteža: krajeve, sredine i presjeke (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EHvatanje za linije crteža\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga isključuje).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"crtanje-dionice\"\u003ECrtanje dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite linijsku stavku ispod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite početak dionice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaki ugao duž nje. Statusna traka prikazuje „Dužina“ (dionica do sada, do pokazivača) i „segment“ (segment koji crtate), u stopama i inčima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZavršite dionicu: dvaput kliknite posljednju tačku, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Dionica se crta bojom stavke i postaje odabrana oznaka. Dužina stavke na spisku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E i u tabeli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E se povećava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat ostaje na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E, pa možete odmah početi sljedeću dionicu. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da se vratite na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok crtate:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uklanja posljednju tačku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odbacuje nedovršenu dionicu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevlačenje pomjera list, a točkić zumira, bez dodavanja tačaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa Mac tačpadu, desni klik je klik sa dva prsta (uključite sekundarni klik u Postavkama sistema, pod Tačpad). TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarno dugme, pa Control-klik može biti shvaćen kao običan klik i dodati tačku. Dvostruki klik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uvijek završavaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa ekranu osjetljivom na dodir, dodirnite da postavite tačke, prevucite jednim prstom za pomjeranje i štipnite sa dva za zumiranje. Završite dugim pritiskom, dvostrukim dodirom ili sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZavrši\u003C/span\u003E u traci ispod lista (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E vraća posljednju tačku). Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003ERješavanje problema\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prave-linije-u-koracima-od-45\"\u003EPrave linije u koracima od 45°\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok postavljate tačku. Segment od posljednje tačke hvata se na najbliži pravac od 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135°, zadržavajući dužinu koju ste prevukli duž njega. Statusna traka vas podsjeća: „Shift hvata na 45°“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU režimu luka važi za mjesto gdje luk završava: tetiva luka ide u koracima od 45° od mjesta gdje počinje. Tačka koju kliknete na krivoj nikad se ne hvata.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lukovi-i-zakrivljeni-zidovi\"\u003ELukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDok crtate dionicu, postavite tačku gdje kriva počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUključite režim luka: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dugme ostaje pritisnuto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite bilo koju tačku na krivoj, negdje duž njene sredine. Statusna traka dodaje „(luk: kliknite gdje završava)“, a pregled se savija kroz vašu tačku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite mjesto gdje kriva završava. Luk se dodaje. Njegova dužina je tačna dužina luka, a ne niz kratkih tetiva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite drugu tačku na sljedećoj krivoj i njen kraj da nastavite crtati lukove, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovo da se vratite na prave segmente.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo odbacuju tačku na krivoj koja čeka; pritisnite ponovo da uklonite tačke kao i obično.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unos-du-ina-i-koordinata\"\u003EUnos dužina i koordinata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon prve tačke možete upisati gdje ide sljedeća umjesto da kliknete. Upišite cifru, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E: u statusnoj traci otvara se okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnos\u003C/span\u003E sa onim što ste upisali. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da postavite tačku; okvir ostaje otvoren za sljedeću.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnos\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESljedeća tačka ide\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; od posljednje tačke, prema pokazivaču (pokažite pravac, pa upišite dužinu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; pod 45°, brojano suprotno od kazaljke na satu od desne strane ekrana (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E je gore, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E dolje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; desno i 4&#039; dolje od posljednje tačke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (ili \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; desno i 4&#039; gore od prve tačke ove dionice\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDužine se upisuju kao i svuda u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EFormati unosa\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (stope), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. „Desno“ i „gore“ su kako vidite list, i kada je PDF stranica okrenuta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E u praznom okviru završava dionicu, kao \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na listu; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara okvir i ostavlja dionicu da se nastavi. Upisane tačke prolaze kroz ista pravila kao klikovi: odbici, lukovi i zatvaranje površine svi rade. Isti okvir radi u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E; nakon centra kruga uzima poluprečnik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odbitak-dijela-dionice\"\u003EOdbitak dijela dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDionica zida koja prolazi kroz vrata ili izlog može se nacrtati pravo kroz i i dalje broji samo zid: segmenti preko otvora su \u003Cstrong\u003Eodbici\u003C/strong\u003E. Crtaju se isprekidano i tanko i ne broje se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok crtate:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite tačku gdje otvor počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dugme ostaje pritisnuto, a statusna traka kaže da su sljedeći segmenti odbici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite mjesto gdje otvor završava. Segment se crta isprekidano; „Dužina“ u statusnoj traci ga izostavlja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovo i nastavite duž zida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon crtanja: odaberite dionicu. Ispod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, svaki segment ima okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E: označite ga da odbijete taj segment, odznačite da ga ponovo brojite. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDionica uvijek zadržava bar jedan segment koji se broji. Panel tada prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EOdbici\u003C/strong\u003E (odbijena dužina) i \u003Cstrong\u003ENacrtano\u003C/strong\u003E (cijela dionica); \u003Cstrong\u003EDužina\u003C/strong\u003E, količina stavke, površina zida i troškovi svi koriste dužinu bez odbitaka. 3D prikaz provjere ostavlja prazninu u zidu, označeni PDF crta odbitke isprekidano, a izvezeni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E ih navodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPomjeranje ugla zadržava odbitke. Dodavanje ili uklanjanje tačaka (ponovnim crtanjem dionice) počinje bez njih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pregled-detalja-dionice\"\u003EPregled detalja dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite dionicu. \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E desno prikazuje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Estavku kojoj pripada (odaberite drugu linijsku stavku na spisku da premjestite dionicu tamo),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elist,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDužinu\u003C/strong\u003E u stopama i inčima i u LF,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebroj \u003Cstrong\u003ESegmenata\u003C/strong\u003E, i \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu zida\u003C/strong\u003E kada stavka ima visinu,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edužinu svakog segmenta, uz „(luk)“ nakon lukova, i njegov okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa listu je svaki segment odabrane dionice označen svojom dužinom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ispravka-dionice\"\u003EIspravka dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjerite tačku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite dionicu, zatim prevucite jednu od njenih kvadratnih ručica uglova. Držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da pomjereni segment hvata u koracima od 45°. Luk zadržava svoje ispupčenje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESavijte luk\u003C/strong\u003E: odabrana dionica prikazuje okruglu ručicu u sredini svakog luka. Prevucite je: luk prolazi kroz mjesto gdje otpustite, pa se više, manje ili na drugu stranu izbočuje. Prevučena na pravu liniju između svojih krajeva, postaje pravi segment. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to poništava („Savij luk“).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzbrišite dionicu\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite je i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E u meniju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E na panelu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPoništi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; ponovi sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoš ne možete umetnuti tačku u sredinu dionice. Izbrišite dionicu i ponovo je nacrtajte.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povr-ina-zida\"\u003EPovršina zida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDajte linijskoj stavci \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E (na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Tada prijavljuje \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu zida (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = dužina × visina, u SF (ili m² za metričku stavku), a površina zida ide u kolonu bilješki izvoza tabele. Koristite je u sklopovima za obloge, boju ili izolaciju: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Linijska stavka mjeri dužinu. Svaka dionica je lanac tačaka: pravi segmenti i lukovi tamo gdje uključite režim luka. Stavka može imati bilo koji broj dionica na bilo kojem broju listova. Prije početka: list treba razmjeru (Postavi razmjeru), a potrebna vam je linijska stavka (Kreiranje stavki predmjera). Na vektorskom PDF-u, vaši klikovi se hvataju za linije samog crteža: krajeve, sredine i presjeke (Hvatanje za linije crteža; F3 ga isključuje). Crtanje dionice Kliknite linijsku stavku ispod Stavke. Odaberite Linijski na traci alata, ili pritisnite L. Kliknite početak dionice. Kliknite svaki ugao duž nje. Statusna traka prikazuje „Dužina“ (dionica do sada, do pokazivača) i „segment“ (segment koji crtate), u stopama i inčima. Završite dionicu: dvaput kliknite posljednju tačku, pritisnite Enter ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Dionica se crta bojom stavke i postaje odabrana oznaka. Dužina stavke na spisku Stavke i u tabeli Količine se povećava. Alat ostaje na Linijski, pa možete odmah početi sljedeću dionicu. Pritisnite Esc da se vratite na Odaberi. Dok crtate: Backspace (ili Delete) uklanja posljednju tačku. Esc odbacuje nedovršenu dionicu. Prevlačenje pomjera list, a točkić zumira, bez dodavanja tačaka. Na Mac tačpadu, desni klik je klik sa dva prsta (uključite sekundarni klik u Postavkama sistema, pod Tačpad). TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarno dugme, pa Control-klik može biti shvaćen kao običan klik i dodati tačku. Dvostruki klik ili Enter uvijek završavaju. Na ekranu osjetljivom na dodir, dodirnite da postavite tačke, prevucite jednim prstom za pomjeranje i štipnite sa dva za zumiranje. Završite dugim pritiskom, dvostrukim dodirom ili sa Završi u traci ispod lista (Straga vraća posljednju tačku). Pogledajte Rješavanje problema. Prave linije u koracima od 45° Držite Shift dok postavljate tačku. Segment od posljednje tačke hvata se na najbliži pravac od 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135°, zadržavajući dužinu koju ste prevukli duž njega. Statusna traka vas podsjeća: „Shift hvata na 45°“. U režimu luka važi za mjesto gdje luk završava: tetiva luka ide u koracima od 45° od mjesta gdje počinje. Tačka koju kliknete na krivoj nikad se ne hvata. Lukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi Dok crtate dionicu, postavite tačku gdje kriva počinje. Uključite režim luka: odaberite Luk na traci alata ili pritisnite R. Dugme ostaje pritisnuto. Kliknite bilo koju tačku na krivoj, negdje duž njene sredine. Statusna traka dodaje „(luk: kliknite gdje završava)“, a pregled se savija kroz vašu tačku. Kliknite mjesto gdje kriva završava. Luk se dodaje. Njegova dužina je tačna dužina luka, a ne niz kratkih tetiva. Kliknite drugu tačku na sljedećoj krivoj i njen kraj da nastavite crtati lukove, ili pritisnite R ponovo da se vratite na prave segmente. Backspace ili Esc prvo odbacuju tačku na krivoj koja čeka; pritisnite ponovo da uklonite tačke kao i obično. Unos dužina i koordinata Nakon prve tačke možete upisati gdje ide sljedeća umjesto da kliknete. Upišite cifru, @ ili #: u statusnoj traci otvara se okvir Unos sa onim što ste upisali. Pritisnite Enter da postavite tačku; okvir ostaje otvoren za sljedeću. Unos Sljedeća tačka ide 12'6\" 12'-6\" od posljednje tačke, prema pokazivaču (pokažite pravac, pa upišite dužinu) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" pod 45°, brojano suprotno od kazaljke na satu od desne strane ekrana (\u003C90 je gore, \u003C-90 dolje) @6',-4' 6' desno i 4' dolje od posljednje tačke 6',4' (ili #6',4') 6' desno i 4' gore od prve tačke ove dionice Dužine se upisuju kao i svuda u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk (Formati unosa): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (stope), 30\", 3.2 m. „Desno“ i „gore“ su kako vidite list, i kada je PDF stranica okrenuta. Enter u praznom okviru završava dionicu, kao Enter na listu; Esc zatvara okvir i ostavlja dionicu da se nastavi. Upisane tačke prolaze kroz ista pravila kao klikovi: odbici, lukovi i zatvaranje površine svi rade. Isti okvir radi u Površina i Izrez; nakon centra kruga uzima poluprečnik. Odbitak dijela dionice Dionica zida koja prolazi kroz vrata ili izlog može se nacrtati pravo kroz i i dalje broji samo zid: segmenti preko otvora su odbici. Crtaju se isprekidano i tanko i ne broje se. Dok crtate: Postavite tačku gdje otvor počinje. Odaberite Odbitak na traci alata ili pritisnite E. Dugme ostaje pritisnuto, a statusna traka kaže da su sljedeći segmenti odbici. Kliknite mjesto gdje otvor završava. Segment se crta isprekidano; „Dužina“ u statusnoj traci ga izostavlja. Pritisnite E ponovo i nastavite duž zida. Nakon crtanja: odaberite dionicu. Ispod Odabrana oznaka, svaki segment ima okvir Odbitak: označite ga da odbijete taj segment, odznačite da ga ponovo brojite. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja. Dionica uvijek zadržava bar jedan segment koji se broji. Panel tada prikazuje Odbici (odbijena dužina) i Nacrtano (cijela dionica); Dužina, količina stavke, površina zida i troškovi svi koriste dužinu bez odbitaka. 3D prikaz provjere ostavlja prazninu u zidu, označeni PDF crta odbitke isprekidano, a izvezeni list Oznake ih navodi. Pomjeranje ugla zadržava odbitke. Dodavanje ili uklanjanje tačaka (ponovnim crtanjem dionice) počinje bez njih. Pregled detalja dionice Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite dionicu. Odabrana oznaka desno prikazuje: stavku kojoj pripada (odaberite drugu linijsku stavku na spisku da premjestite dionicu tamo), list, Dužinu u stopama i inčima i u LF, broj Segmenata, i Površinu zida kada stavka ima visinu, dužinu svakog segmenta, uz „(luk)“ nakon lukova, i njegov okvir Odbitak. Na listu je svaki segment odabrane dionice označen svojom dužinom. Ispravka dionice Pomjerite tačku: odaberite dionicu, zatim prevucite jednu od njenih kvadratnih ručica uglova. Držite Shift da pomjereni segment hvata u koracima od 45°. Luk zadržava svoje ispupčenje. Savijte luk: odabrana dionica prikazuje okruglu ručicu u sredini svakog luka. Prevucite je: luk prolazi kroz mjesto gdje otpustite, pa se više, manje ili na drugu stranu izbočuje. Prevučena na pravu liniju između svojih krajeva, postaje pravi segment. Ctrl+Z to poništava („Savij luk“). Izbrišite dionicu: odaberite je i pritisnite Delete, odaberite Izbriši u meniju Više na traci alata, ili Izbriši oznaku na panelu. Poništi: Ctrl+Z; ponovi sa Ctrl+Y. Još ne možete umetnuti tačku u sredinu dionice. Izbrišite dionicu i ponovo je nacrtajte. Površina zida Dajte linijskoj stavci Visina (na primjer 9'-0\"). Tada prijavljuje Površinu zida (A) = dužina × visina, u SF (ili m² za metričku stavku), a površina zida ide u kolonu bilješki izvoza tabele. Koristite je u sklopovima za obloge, boju ili izolaciju: pogledajte Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Prikaz dužina u metrima","summary":"Čitaj dužine u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima umjesto u stopama i inčima, i vidi površine u m2.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["metri","centimetri","milimetri","metrički","prikaži dužine kao","prati global","jedinice","prikaz","m2","kvadratni metri","površina zida","stope i inči","temperatura","celzijus"],"headings":[{"id":"ta-e-uraditi","text":"Šta ćeš uraditi","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"napomene","text":"Napomene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-e-uraditi\"\u003EŠta ćeš uraditi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPromijeni način na koji TakeoffDesk prikazuje dužine, tako da metrički posao čita u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima na listu, u statusnoj traci i u panelima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E preko zupčanika u traci aplikacije ili pritiskom na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, i ostani na kartici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPronađi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži dužine kao\u003C/span\u003E i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStope i inči\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm ili mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrati Global\u003C/span\u003E koristi metričku jedinicu dužine označenu zvjezdicom u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E, a stope i inče kad nijedna nije označena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPogledaj list: dužine u statusnoj traci, u spisku stavki i u panelima sada se čitaju u jedinici koju si odabrao. Visine, dubine, debljine i nivoi takođe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa čitaš temperature stavki u °C ili °F, odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži temperature kao\u003C/span\u003E na istoj kartici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMijenja se samo prikaz. Količine, troškovi i izvozi računaju se iz tačnih dužina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoli broj upisan u polje visine čita se u prikazanoj jedinici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzbor 1/16, 1/8 i 1/4 inča pojavljuje se samo za stope i inče.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovršina izmjerena metričkom stavkom piše m2 na crtežu, u panelu oznake i u tabeli. Linijska stavka s visinom takođe prikazuje svoju površinu zida. Pogledaj \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Šta ćeš uraditi Promijeni način na koji TakeoffDesk prikazuje dužine, tako da metrički posao čita u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima na listu, u statusnoj traci i u panelima. Koraci Otvori Postavke preko zupčanika u traci aplikacije ili pritiskom na Ctrl+,, i ostani na kartici TakeoffDesk. Pronađi Prikaži dužine kao i odaberi Stope i inči, m, cm ili mm. Prati Global koristi metričku jedinicu dužine označenu zvjezdicom u Postavke › Globalno › Jedinice, a stope i inče kad nijedna nije označena. Pogledaj list: dužine u statusnoj traci, u spisku stavki i u panelima sada se čitaju u jedinici koju si odabrao. Visine, dubine, debljine i nivoi takođe. Da čitaš temperature stavki u °C ili °F, odaberi Prikaži temperature kao na istoj kartici. Napomene Mijenja se samo prikaz. Količine, troškovi i izvozi računaju se iz tačnih dužina. Goli broj upisan u polje visine čita se u prikazanoj jedinici. Izbor 1/16, 1/8 i 1/4 inča pojavljuje se samo za stope i inče. Površina izmjerena metričkom stavkom piše m2 na crtežu, u panelu oznake i u tabeli. Linijska stavka s visinom takođe prikazuje svoju površinu zida. Pogledaj Jedinice.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Crtanje lukova na deset načina","summary":"Odaberite kako se luk crta: tri tačke, ili početak, centar, kraj, ugao, dužina, smjer ili radijus.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["luk","lukovi","kriva","zakrivljeni zid","3 tačke","radijus","ugao","dužina tetive","smjer","centar","početak","kraj","metoda luka"],"headings":[{"id":"ta-ete-uraditi","text":"Šta ćete uraditi","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"napomene","text":"Napomene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-ete-uraditi\"\u003EŠta ćete uraditi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENacrtati zakrivljenu ivicu u linijskoj dionici, površini ili izrezu, koristeći metodu luka koja odgovara dimenzijama koje imate.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZapočnite dionicu, konturu ili izrez i postavite tačku gdje kriva počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUključite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMetoda luka\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista. Prikazuje se samo dok je Luk uključen. Odaberite 3 tačke, Početak, Centar, Kraj, Početak, Centar, Ugao, Početak, Centar, Dužina, Početak, Kraj, Ugao, Početak, Kraj, Smjer, Početak, Kraj, Radijus, Centar, Početak, Kraj, Centar, Početak, Ugao ili Centar, Početak, Dužina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPratite statusnu traku. Ona kaže na šta luk čeka: centar, krajnju tačku, ugao, dužinu, smjer ili radijus. Kliknite tačku ili upišite broj (ugao, dužina, radijus i smjer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad se da posljednji unos, luk se dodaje dionici. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E otkazuje luk, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća njegov posljednji korak, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isključuje Luk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuk se odbija, uz poruku u statusnoj traci, kad se njegove tačke poklapaju ili leže na jednoj liniji, ili kad radijus ne može doseći krajnju tačku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENjegova dužina je tačna dužina luka, a stari fajlovi se otvaraju isto. Više: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EMjerenje linijskih dionica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Šta ćete uraditi Nacrtati zakrivljenu ivicu u linijskoj dionici, površini ili izrezu, koristeći metodu luka koja odgovara dimenzijama koje imate. Koraci Započnite dionicu, konturu ili izrez i postavite tačku gdje kriva počinje. Uključite Luk na traci alata ili pritisnite R. Otvorite Metoda luka na traci lista. Prikazuje se samo dok je Luk uključen. Odaberite 3 tačke, Početak, Centar, Kraj, Početak, Centar, Ugao, Početak, Centar, Dužina, Početak, Kraj, Ugao, Početak, Kraj, Smjer, Početak, Kraj, Radijus, Centar, Početak, Kraj, Centar, Početak, Ugao ili Centar, Početak, Dužina. Pratite statusnu traku. Ona kaže na šta luk čeka: centar, krajnju tačku, ugao, dužinu, smjer ili radijus. Kliknite tačku ili upišite broj (ugao, dužina, radijus i smjer). Kad se da posljednji unos, luk se dodaje dionici. Esc otkazuje luk, Backspace vraća njegov posljednji korak, a R isključuje Luk. Napomene Luk se odbija, uz poruku u statusnoj traci, kad se njegove tačke poklapaju ili leže na jednoj liniji, ili kad radijus ne može doseći krajnju tačku. Njegova dužina je tačna dužina luka, a stari fajlovi se otvaraju isto. Više: Mjerenje linijskih dionica.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Nedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje predračuna","summary":"Vidi koje stavke predračuna imaju količinu a nemaju cijenu, potpiši predračun svojim imenom da datoteka zabilježi ko, kada i koji ukupan iznos, i klikni brojku da odabereš oznake iz kojih potiče.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["predračun","potpisivanje","potpisan","odobri","odobrenje","nedostajuća cijena","bez cijene","necijenjeno","cijena","ukupno","količinski inženjer","zapis","revizija","odaberi oznake","brojka","porijeklo"],"headings":[{"id":"ta-e-uraditi","text":"Šta ćeš uraditi","level":2},{"id":"stavke-bez-cijene","text":"Stavke bez cijene","level":2},{"id":"potpi-i-predra-un","text":"Potpiši predračun","level":2},{"id":"klikni-brojku-da-vidi-odakle-poti-e","text":"Klikni brojku da vidiš odakle potiče","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-e-uraditi\"\u003EŠta ćeš uraditi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProvjeri da je svaka stavka predračuna ocijenjena, pa je potpiši svojim imenom. Datoteka predmjera bilježi ko je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupan iznos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stavke-bez-cijene\"\u003EStavke bez cijene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cstrong\u003EKoličine › Po stavci\u003C/strong\u003E, stavka koja ima količinu a nema materijalnu ili radnu cijenu nosi \u003Cstrong\u003EBez cijene\u003C/strong\u003E, a traka iznad tabele kaže koliko ih ima. Takva stavka ne dodaje ništa ukupnom iznosu. Stavka koja sama nema cijenu nije označena kad je neka od njenih komponenti cijenjena: sklop se cijeni preko svojih dijelova. Izvezeni predračun kaže \u003Cstrong\u003EBez cijene\u003C/strong\u003E u koloni Napomene za svaku takvu stavku i broji ih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"potpi-i-predra-un\"\u003EPotpiši predračun\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKlikni \u003Cstrong\u003EPotpiši predračun\u003C/strong\u003E iznad tabele Količine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDijalog navodi ukupan iznos koji potpisuješ i navodi stavke bez cijene. Upiši svoje ime i, ako želiš, svoju ulogu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKlikni \u003Cstrong\u003EPotpiši\u003C/strong\u003E. Traka sada kaže &quot;Potpisano od strane … dana …&quot; s ukupnim iznosom. Spasi predmjer da ga zadržiš u datoteci.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPotpis pripada brojkama koje si potpisao. Svaka kasnija promjena količine, cijene ili stavke ga briše, i TakeoffDesk te obavijesti. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi\u003C/span\u003E vraća predračun koji si potpisao, zajedno s njegovim potpisom. Preimenovanje stavke nije promjena brojke. \u003Cstrong\u003EUkloni potpis\u003C/strong\u003E ga uklanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka predmjera koja je uređivana van TakeoffDesk-a nakon potpisivanja otvara se bez potpisa, uz napomenu o tome. Izvezeni predračun (CSV i XLSX) navodi potpis ispod ukupnih iznosa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPotpisuje samo osoba. AI asistent može pročitati je li predračun potpisan i koje cijene nedostaju; nema način da potpiše.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"klikni-brojku-da-vidi-odakle-poti-e\"\u003EKlikni brojku da vidiš odakle potiče\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKlikni količinu ili iznos stavke da odabereš oznake iz kojih je izmjerena. Kad su na drugom listu, taj list se otvara. Klikni brojku u redu \u003Cstrong\u003EUkupno posla\u003C/strong\u003E da odabereš svaku oznaku na listu. Upisana količina nema oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPotpis bilježi ime onako kako je upisano. To je zapis u datoteci, a ne elektronski potpis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESa paketima ponude dodijeljenim podizvođačima ili alternativama u predmjeru, ukupan potpisani iznos je osnovna ponuda prikazana kao \u003Cstrong\u003EUkupno posla\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Šta ćeš uraditi Provjeri da je svaka stavka predračuna ocijenjena, pa je potpiši svojim imenom. Datoteka predmjera bilježi ko je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupan iznos. Stavke bez cijene U Količine › Po stavci, stavka koja ima količinu a nema materijalnu ili radnu cijenu nosi Bez cijene, a traka iznad tabele kaže koliko ih ima. Takva stavka ne dodaje ništa ukupnom iznosu. Stavka koja sama nema cijenu nije označena kad je neka od njenih komponenti cijenjena: sklop se cijeni preko svojih dijelova. Izvezeni predračun kaže Bez cijene u koloni Napomene za svaku takvu stavku i broji ih. Potpiši predračun Klikni Potpiši predračun iznad tabele Količine. Dijalog navodi ukupan iznos koji potpisuješ i navodi stavke bez cijene. Upiši svoje ime i, ako želiš, svoju ulogu. Klikni Potpiši. Traka sada kaže \"Potpisano od strane … dana …\" s ukupnim iznosom. Spasi predmjer da ga zadržiš u datoteci. Potpis pripada brojkama koje si potpisao. Svaka kasnija promjena količine, cijene ili stavke ga briše, i TakeoffDesk te obavijesti. Poništi vraća predračun koji si potpisao, zajedno s njegovim potpisom. Preimenovanje stavke nije promjena brojke. Ukloni potpis ga uklanja. Datoteka predmjera koja je uređivana van TakeoffDesk-a nakon potpisivanja otvara se bez potpisa, uz napomenu o tome. Izvezeni predračun (CSV i XLSX) navodi potpis ispod ukupnih iznosa. Potpisuje samo osoba. AI asistent može pročitati je li predračun potpisan i koje cijene nedostaju; nema način da potpiše. Klikni brojku da vidiš odakle potiče Klikni količinu ili iznos stavke da odabereš oznake iz kojih je izmjerena. Kad su na drugom listu, taj list se otvara. Klikni brojku u redu Ukupno posla da odabereš svaku oznaku na listu. Upisana količina nema oznake. Dobro je znati Potpis bilježi ime onako kako je upisano. To je zapis u datoteci, a ne elektronski potpis. Sa paketima ponude dodijeljenim podizvođačima ili alternativama u predmjeru, ukupan potpisani iznos je osnovna ponuda prikazana kao Ukupno posla.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"The office layout: grouping, subtotals, title and headings from your Default Policies\"","summary":"Switch on the Default Policies add-on and the estimate, the quantities by sheet, the exports and what an assistant reads take your office's schedule layout, the same one BimCraft's schedules take.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["office standard","office layout","default policies","add-on","schedule layout","group by type","group by sheet","subtotal","totals","title","headings","capitals","estimate layout","export layout","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-ll-do","text":"What you'll do","level":2},{"id":"steps","text":"Steps","level":2},{"id":"what-takes-the-layout","text":"What takes the layout","level":2},{"id":"what-keeps-its-own","text":"What keeps its own","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-ll-do\"\u003EWhat you&#039;ll do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHave TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"steps\"\u003ESteps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E and switch on \u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Global › Default Policies\u003C/strong\u003E and find \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedule layout (the office standard)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPolicy\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does in TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGroup schedules by\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003ENo grouping\u003C/strong\u003E leave both ungrouped\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotals in schedules\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA subtotal under each group and a total\u003C/strong\u003E adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchedule title\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA line over the table, for example \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: office layout\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColumn headings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAs written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClose Settings. The tables follow at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-takes-the-layout\"\u003EWhat takes the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By item\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EBy sheet\u003C/strong\u003E: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe exported estimate\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a \u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat an assistant reads\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (by sheet) add a \u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-keeps-its-own\"\u003EWhat keeps its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By area\u003C/strong\u003E states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe \u003Cstrong\u003Ejob total\u003C/strong\u003E, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (\u003Cstrong\u003ESave to a file\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad from a file\u003C/strong\u003E in the same place), so an office shares one file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft&#039;s side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you'll do Have TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round. Steps Open Settings › Add-ons and switch on Default Policies. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was. Open Settings › Global › Default Policies and find Schedule layout (the office standard): Policy What it does in TakeoffDesk Group schedules by Type groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Level groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. Room and No grouping leave both ungrouped Totals in schedules A subtotal under each group and a total adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays Schedule title A line over the table, for example {schedule}: office layout Column headings As written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals Close Settings. The tables follow at once. What takes the layout Quantities › By item and By sheet: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item. The exported estimate (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a SUBTOTAL formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice. What an assistant reads: takeoff_estimate and takeoff_quantities (by sheet) add a layout block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set. What keeps its own Quantities › By area states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it. The job total, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped. A grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type. Good to know The policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (Save to a file / Load from a file in the same place), so an office shares one file. An estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set. BimCraft's side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje površina sa izrezima","summary":"Ocrtajte podove, plafone i ploče, izrežite rupe iz njih, dodajte zakrivljene ivice, krugove i okrugle izreze i očitajte površinu i obim.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["popunjavanje prostorije","flood fill","kanta za boju","klik unutar prostorije","auto površina","povratni odbitak","backout","stub","okno","odbitak iz više stavki","površina","poligon","obris","kvadratne stope","sf","izrez","rupa","odbitak","krug","okrugli","luk","obim","pod","plafon","ploča"],"headings":[{"id":"ocrtavanje-povr-ine","text":"Ocrtavanje površine","level":2},{"id":"zakrivljene-ivice","text":"Zakrivljene ivice","level":2},{"id":"krug","text":"Krug","level":2},{"id":"popunjavanje-prostorije-jednim-klikom","text":"Popunjavanje prostorije jednim klikom","level":2},{"id":"izrezivanje-rupe-iz-povr-ine","text":"Izrezivanje rupe iz površine","level":2},{"id":"povratni-odbici-stubovi-okna-i-otvori-oduzeti-iz-vi-e-stavki","text":"Povratni odbici: stubovi, okna i otvori oduzeti iz više stavki","level":2},{"id":"o-itavanje-povr-ine","text":"Očitavanje površine","level":2},{"id":"ispravka-povr-ine","text":"Ispravka površine","level":2},{"id":"dubina-za-zapremine","text":"Dubina za zapremine","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EStavka površine mjeri zatvorenu površinu. Iz svakog obrisa mogu se izrezati rupe (okno, stub, saksija), a njegove ivice mogu biti ravne ili zakrivljene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba razmjeru (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavi razmjeru\u003C/a\u003E), a potrebna vam je stavka površine (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EKreiranje stavki predmjera\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ocrtavanje-povr-ine\"\u003EOcrtavanje površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite stavku površine ispod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaki ugao prostorije ili ploče redom. Držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za ivice pod 0°, 45° i 90°. Od treće tačke nadalje, obris se popunjava, a statusna traka prikazuje „Površina“ i „obim“. Mali prsten se pojavljuje oko prve tačke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvorite obris: kliknite prvu tačku (unutar njenog prstena), pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dvaput kliknite ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Površina se lagano popunjava bojom stavke, označena je svojim kvadratnim stopama i postaje odabrana oznaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja posljednji ugao; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odbacuje obris.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObris koji se ukršta sam sa sobom se odbija: „Obris se ukršta sam sa sobom, pa bi njegova površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte ga ponovo bez ukrštanja.“ Oblik u obliku osmice nacrtajte kao dvije površine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zakrivljene-ivice\"\u003EZakrivljene ivice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok ocrtavate, uključite režim luka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Nakon ugla kliknite tačku duž krive, zatim mjesto gdje kriva završava. Da zatvorite obris krivom, učinite taj posljednji klik na prvu tačku. Površina i obim koriste tačnu krivu. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovo za ravne ivice. Da kasnije promijenite krivu, odaberite površinu i prevucite okruglu ručicu u sredini luka. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EMjerenje linijskih dionica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"krug\"\u003EKrug\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESa stavkom površine odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKrug\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite centar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite bilo koju tačku na ivici. Dok pomjerate, statusna traka prikazuje poluprečnik i površinu. Krug se dodaje kao oznaka površine sa tačnom površinom i obimom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"popunjavanje-prostorije-jednim-klikom\"\u003EPopunjavanje prostorije jednim klikom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada su prostorije nacrtane kao zatvoreni zidovi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uzima pod jednim klikom:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stavku površine (na primjer završni pod) i dajte listu razmjeru.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite unutar prostorije, na otvorenom podu (ne na liniji ili oznaci).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk čita linije lista, nalazi prostor oko klika i ocrtava ga duž unutrašnjih strana zidova, kao površinu tekuće stavke. Otvori vrata do \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E tretiraju se kao zatvoreni, pa obris ide ravno preko otvora; \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavke › TakeoffDesk › Popunjavanje prostorije zatvara otvore do\u003C/strong\u003E mijenja tu širinu (od 3&#039;-0&quot; do 8&#039;-0&quot;). Nazivi prostorija, namještaj i pribor unutar prostorije ne prave rupe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdbija, uz objašnjenje zašto, kada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eklik je na liniji („To je na liniji“);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprostor nije zatvoren: otvor širi od postavke pušta da prostor izađe do ivice lista. Povećajte postavku ili ocrtajte tu prostoriju ručno sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprostor je mali (simbol, a ne prostorija).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada je vrata šira od postavke, popunjavanje ulazi u sljedeću prostoriju i ocrtava obje zajedno: poništite (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), povećajte postavku i kliknite ponovo. Provjerite obris kao i svaku površinu: prevucite njegove uglove da ga ispravite. Skenirani list radi isto, ali njegove linije moraju biti dovoljno tamne; svijetlo siva linija možda neće zaustaviti popunjavanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izrezivanje-rupe-iz-povr-ine\"\u003EIzrezivanje rupe iz površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite površinu. Na njenim uglovima prikazuju se kvadratne ručice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata (ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj izrez\u003C/span\u003E ispod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite uglove rupe, unutar površine. I režim luka radi ovdje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvorite je kao površinu: kliknite njenu prvu tačku, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dvaput kliknite ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Rupa ostaje nepopunjena, a statusna traka kaže „Izrez je dodan. Nacrtajte još jedan ili pritisnite Esc.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENacrtajte još rupa u istoj površini, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa okruglu rupu odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj okrugli izrez\u003C/span\u003E ispod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, kliknite njen centar, zatim tačku na njenoj ivici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine i ne smije se preklapati sa drugim izrezom. Inače ga TakeoffDesk odbija: „Izrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine.“ ili „Izrezi se ne mogu preklapati.“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa ponovo uklonite posljednju rupu, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni posljednji izrez\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povratni-odbici-stubovi-okna-i-otvori-oduzeti-iz-vi-e-stavki\"\u003EPovratni odbici: stubovi, okna i otvori oduzeti iz više stavki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzrez pripada jednoj oznaci površine. \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbitak\u003C/strong\u003E se crta jednom i oduzima se od svake površine koju preklapa, za stavke koje odaberete: nacrtajte stubove jednom, i oni se istovremeno oduzimaju od završnog poda, plafona i ploče.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite stavku površine za njih, na primjer „Stubovi“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU njenim postavkama stavke označite \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbitak: njene oznake oduzimaju svoju površinu od drugih stavki\u003C/strong\u003E. Pojavljuje se spisak vaših drugih stavki površine, sve označene: odznačite one koje povratni odbici ne bi smjeli dirati (na primjer boju na zidovima).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzmjerite stubove sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKrug\u003C/span\u003E, kao i obično. Svaki se crta isprekidano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka oznaka površine označene stavke na istom listu gubi dio koji pokriva povratni odbitak: cijeli povratni odbitak kada je unutra, samo preklapajući dio kada prelazi ivicu, a ništa unutar izreza. Panel odabrane površine prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbici\u003C/strong\u003E i preostalu površinu. Količina stavke, njene formule sklopa, troškovi, 3D prikaz provjere i izvoz svi koriste preostalu površinu; bilješke predračuna kažu koliko su povratni odbici oduzeli. Sama stavka povratnog odbitka broji svoju površinu (ostavite njene troškove na nuli ako je ne cijenite).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovratni odbitak mora biti \u003Cstrong\u003Ekonveksan\u003C/strong\u003E: pravougaonik, krug ili bilo koji obris bez unutrašnjeg ugla. TakeoffDesk odbija da nacrta onaj koji nije; okno u obliku slova L nacrtajte kao dva povratna odbitka. Povratni odbici ne mogu imati izreze, a dva povratna odbitka koja se preklapaju računaju se oba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObim (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) se ne mijenja: povratni odbici oduzimaju samo površinu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-itavanje-povr-ine\"\u003EOčitavanje površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite površinu. \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E prikazuje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERed\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeto površina: obris minus izrezi. Ovo je ono što stavka broji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObris\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBruto površina unutar obrisa (prikazuje se kada postoje izrezi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzrezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoliko ima rupa i njihova ukupna površina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObim\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDužina ivice obrisa, \u003Cstrong\u003Eplus\u003C/strong\u003E ivice svakog izreza („sa izrezima“).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObim namjerno uključuje ivice izreza, za stvari poput oplate ivica ili podloge koja ide i oko rupe. Ako vam treba samo vanjska ivica, držite rupe van te stavke ili izmjerite vanjsku ivicu kao linijsku dionicu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E stavke određuje kako se ukupno prijavljuje: SF, SY ili m². Panel \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E i statusna traka uvijek prikazuju kvadratne stope.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ispravka-povr-ine\"\u003EIspravka površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjerite ugao\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite površinu i prevucite ručicu ugla (i rupe imaju ručice). Ako bi novi oblik ukrstio sam sebe ili gurnuo rupu van, ugao se vraća: „Tačka je vraćena.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPremjestite u drugu stavku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite drugu stavku površine na listi \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E ispod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzbriši\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E u meniju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dubina-za-zapremine\"\u003EDubina za zapremine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDajte stavki površine \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubina\u003C/span\u003E (na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E za ploču) i koristite \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E u komponenti sklopa da dobijete kubne jarde. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Stavka površine mjeri zatvorenu površinu. Iz svakog obrisa mogu se izrezati rupe (okno, stub, saksija), a njegove ivice mogu biti ravne ili zakrivljene. Prije početka: list treba razmjeru (Postavi razmjeru), a potrebna vam je stavka površine (Kreiranje stavki predmjera). Ocrtavanje površine Kliknite stavku površine ispod Stavke. Odaberite Površina na traci alata, ili pritisnite A. Kliknite svaki ugao prostorije ili ploče redom. Držite Shift za ivice pod 0°, 45° i 90°. Od treće tačke nadalje, obris se popunjava, a statusna traka prikazuje „Površina“ i „obim“. Mali prsten se pojavljuje oko prve tačke. Zatvorite obris: kliknite prvu tačku (unutar njenog prstena), pritisnite Enter, dvaput kliknite ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Površina se lagano popunjava bojom stavke, označena je svojim kvadratnim stopama i postaje odabrana oznaka. Backspace uklanja posljednji ugao; Esc odbacuje obris. Obris koji se ukršta sam sa sobom se odbija: „Obris se ukršta sam sa sobom, pa bi njegova površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte ga ponovo bez ukrštanja.“ Oblik u obliku osmice nacrtajte kao dvije površine. Zakrivljene ivice Dok ocrtavate, uključite režim luka (Luk ili R). Nakon ugla kliknite tačku duž krive, zatim mjesto gdje kriva završava. Da zatvorite obris krivom, učinite taj posljednji klik na prvu tačku. Površina i obim koriste tačnu krivu. Pritisnite R ponovo za ravne ivice. Da kasnije promijenite krivu, odaberite površinu i prevucite okruglu ručicu u sredini luka. Pogledajte Mjerenje linijskih dionica. Krug Sa stavkom površine odaberite Krug ili pritisnite O. Kliknite centar. Kliknite bilo koju tačku na ivici. Dok pomjerate, statusna traka prikazuje poluprečnik i površinu. Krug se dodaje kao oznaka površine sa tačnom površinom i obimom. Popunjavanje prostorije jednim klikom Kada su prostorije nacrtane kao zatvoreni zidovi, Prostorija (B) uzima pod jednim klikom: Odaberite stavku površine (na primjer završni pod) i dajte listu razmjeru. Odaberite Prostorija u grupi Predmjer, ili pritisnite B. Kliknite unutar prostorije, na otvorenom podu (ne na liniji ili oznaci). TakeoffDesk čita linije lista, nalazi prostor oko klika i ocrtava ga duž unutrašnjih strana zidova, kao površinu tekuće stavke. Otvori vrata do 4'-0\" tretiraju se kao zatvoreni, pa obris ide ravno preko otvora; Postavke › TakeoffDesk › Popunjavanje prostorije zatvara otvore do mijenja tu širinu (od 3'-0\" do 8'-0\"). Nazivi prostorija, namještaj i pribor unutar prostorije ne prave rupe. Odbija, uz objašnjenje zašto, kada: klik je na liniji („To je na liniji“); prostor nije zatvoren: otvor širi od postavke pušta da prostor izađe do ivice lista. Povećajte postavku ili ocrtajte tu prostoriju ručno sa Površina; prostor je mali (simbol, a ne prostorija). Kada je vrata šira od postavke, popunjavanje ulazi u sljedeću prostoriju i ocrtava obje zajedno: poništite (Ctrl+Z), povećajte postavku i kliknite ponovo. Provjerite obris kao i svaku površinu: prevucite njegove uglove da ga ispravite. Skenirani list radi isto, ali njegove linije moraju biti dovoljno tamne; svijetlo siva linija možda neće zaustaviti popunjavanje. Izrezivanje rupe iz površine Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite površinu. Na njenim uglovima prikazuju se kvadratne ručice. Odaberite Izrez na traci alata (ili pritisnite X), ili Dodaj izrez ispod Odabrana oznaka. Kliknite uglove rupe, unutar površine. I režim luka radi ovdje. Zatvorite je kao površinu: kliknite njenu prvu tačku, pritisnite Enter, dvaput kliknite ili kliknite desnim dugmetom. Rupa ostaje nepopunjena, a statusna traka kaže „Izrez je dodan. Nacrtajte još jedan ili pritisnite Esc.“ Nacrtajte još rupa u istoj površini, ili pritisnite Esc. Za okruglu rupu odaberite Dodaj okrugli izrez ispod Odabrana oznaka, kliknite njen centar, zatim tačku na njenoj ivici. Izrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine i ne smije se preklapati sa drugim izrezom. Inače ga TakeoffDesk odbija: „Izrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine.“ ili „Izrezi se ne mogu preklapati.“ Da ponovo uklonite posljednju rupu, odaberite Ukloni posljednji izrez. Povratni odbici: stubovi, okna i otvori oduzeti iz više stavki Izrez pripada jednoj oznaci površine. Povratni odbitak se crta jednom i oduzima se od svake površine koju preklapa, za stavke koje odaberete: nacrtajte stubove jednom, i oni se istovremeno oduzimaju od završnog poda, plafona i ploče. Napravite stavku površine za njih, na primjer „Stubovi“. U njenim postavkama stavke označite Povratni odbitak: njene oznake oduzimaju svoju površinu od drugih stavki. Pojavljuje se spisak vaših drugih stavki površine, sve označene: odznačite one koje povratni odbici ne bi smjeli dirati (na primjer boju na zidovima). Izmjerite stubove sa Površina ili Krug, kao i obično. Svaki se crta isprekidano. Svaka oznaka površine označene stavke na istom listu gubi dio koji pokriva povratni odbitak: cijeli povratni odbitak kada je unutra, samo preklapajući dio kada prelazi ivicu, a ništa unutar izreza. Panel odabrane površine prikazuje Povratni odbici i preostalu površinu. Količina stavke, njene formule sklopa, troškovi, 3D prikaz provjere i izvoz svi koriste preostalu površinu; bilješke predračuna kažu koliko su povratni odbici oduzeli. Sama stavka povratnog odbitka broji svoju površinu (ostavite njene troškove na nuli ako je ne cijenite). Povratni odbitak mora biti konveksan: pravougaonik, krug ili bilo koji obris bez unutrašnjeg ugla. TakeoffDesk odbija da nacrta onaj koji nije; okno u obliku slova L nacrtajte kao dva povratna odbitka. Povratni odbici ne mogu imati izreze, a dva povratna odbitka koja se preklapaju računaju se oba. Obim (P) se ne mijenja: povratni odbici oduzimaju samo površinu. Očitavanje površine Odaberite površinu. Odabrana oznaka prikazuje: Red Značenje Površina Neto površina: obris minus izrezi. Ovo je ono što stavka broji. Obris Bruto površina unutar obrisa (prikazuje se kada postoje izrezi). Izrezi Koliko ima rupa i njihova ukupna površina. Obim Dužina ivice obrisa, plus ivice svakog izreza („sa izrezima“). Obim namjerno uključuje ivice izreza, za stvari poput oplate ivica ili podloge koja ide i oko rupe. Ako vam treba samo vanjska ivica, držite rupe van te stavke ili izmjerite vanjsku ivicu kao linijsku dionicu. Jedinica stavke određuje kako se ukupno prijavljuje: SF, SY ili m². Panel Odabrana oznaka i statusna traka uvijek prikazuju kvadratne stope. Ispravka površine Pomjerite ugao: odaberite površinu i prevucite ručicu ugla (i rupe imaju ručice). Ako bi novi oblik ukrstio sam sebe ili gurnuo rupu van, ugao se vraća: „Tačka je vraćena.“ Premjestite u drugu stavku: odaberite drugu stavku površine na listi Stavka ispod Odabrana oznaka. Izbriši: Delete, Izbriši u meniju Više na traci alata, ili Izbriši oznaku. Dubina za zapremine Dajte stavki površine Dubina (na primjer 0'-4\" za ploču) i koristite A * H / 27 u komponenti sklopa da dobijete kubne jarde. Pogledajte Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Krovovi i nagibi","summary":"Daj površini njen nagib da izmjeriš krovnu površinu iz nacrta, a zabatne rubove, grebene i žlijebove mjeri duž njihovog nagiba.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["krov","nagib","pad","faktor nagiba","uspon","trčanje","6:12","zabatni rub","greben","žlijeb","zabat","krovni pokrov","kvadrati","kosa površina","prava dužina","tlocrtna površina"],"headings":[{"id":"upis-nagiba","text":"Upis nagiba","level":2},{"id":"krovne-povr-ine","text":"Krovne površine","level":2},{"id":"zabatni-rubovi-grebeni-i-lijebovi","text":"Zabatni rubovi, grebeni i žlijebovi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKrovni nacrt prikazuje svaku krovnu ravan ravno, gledano odozgo. Sam krov je veći: ravan pod 6:12 ima oko 12% više površine od svog nacrta, a njene kose ivice su duže nego što izgledaju. Daj stavci njen nagib i TakeoffDesk mjeri duž kosine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"upis-nagiba\"\u003EUpis nagiba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENagib je uspon na svakih 12 jedinica trčanja, kao na simbolima nagiba krovnog nacrta. Upiši ga kao \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E ili samo \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E; radi i drugo trčanje (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E je 4.8:12). Ugao radi sa znakom stepena: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Prazno ili \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E znači ravno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"krovne-povr-ine\"\u003EKrovne površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravi stavku površine za krovni pokrov ili otvori onu koju imaš.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU njenim postavkama upiši \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObrubi svaku krovnu ravan na nacrtu sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, kao i obično.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka ravan se računa kao njena tlocrtna površina puta faktor nagiba: √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)²), 1.118 za 6:12 i 1.414 za 12:12. Odaberi ravan da vidiš njenu \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu\u003C/strong\u003E (na kosini), \u003Cstrong\u003ETlocrtnu površinu\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EFaktor nagiba\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERavni s drugim nagibom: odaberi ravan i upiši njen vlastiti \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E u njenom panelu. Ostavi prazno da koristi nagib stavke. 3D pregled za provjeru, sklopovi (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je kosa površina), troškovi i izvoz svi koriste kosu površinu. Odbici na nagnutoj ravni, kao svjetlarnici, odbijaju se pod istim nagibom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObim (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) ostaje tlocrtni obim. Strehe, zabatne rubove, grebene i žlijebove mjeri kao dionice (dolje).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zabatni-rubovi-grebeni-i-lijebovi\"\u003EZabatni rubovi, grebeni i žlijebovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravi linijsku stavku, na primjer &quot;Zabatni rub&quot; ili &quot;Grebeni&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavi njen \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E na \u003Cstrong\u003EZabatni rub\u003C/strong\u003E (kosu ivicu, kao kod zabata) ili \u003Cstrong\u003EGreben ili žlijeb\u003C/strong\u003E (liniju gdje se sastaju dvije ravni), i upiši \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E krovnih ravni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENacrtaj dionice na nacrtu sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZabatni rub se računa kao njegova tlocrtna dužina puta faktor nagiba. Greben ili žlijeb ide pod 45° preko nacrta između dvije ravni istog nagiba, pa je njegova prava dužina tlocrtna dužina puta √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 za 6:12, 1.225 za 12:12.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedna dionica može miješati ove vrste. Odaberi je: svaki segment u njenom panelu ima listu nagiba — \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavka stavke\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENivo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EZabatni rub\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003EGreben ili žlijeb\u003C/strong\u003E — i njegovu dužinu duž kosine. \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E dionice u panelu zamjenjuje nagib stavke za sve njene segmente. Panel takođe prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003ETlocrtnu dužinu\u003C/strong\u003E, a oznake na listu prikazuju dužine duž kosine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdbici i dalje rade: odbijeni segment ne računa ništa, bio kos ili ne.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGrebeni i žlijebovi pretpostavljaju da obje ravni imaju isti nagib. Za ravni različitih nagiba izmjeri greben po njegovoj pravoj dužini drugdje, ili ga nacrtaj kao zabatni rub s ekvivalentnim nagibom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Krovni nacrt prikazuje svaku krovnu ravan ravno, gledano odozgo. Sam krov je veći: ravan pod 6:12 ima oko 12% više površine od svog nacrta, a njene kose ivice su duže nego što izgledaju. Daj stavci njen nagib i TakeoffDesk mjeri duž kosine. Upis nagiba Nagib je uspon na svakih 12 jedinica trčanja, kao na simbolima nagiba krovnog nacrta. Upiši ga kao 6:12, 6/12 ili samo 6; radi i drugo trčanje (4:10 je 4.8:12). Ugao radi sa znakom stepena: 26.57°. Prazno ili 0 znači ravno. Krovne površine Napravi stavku površine za krovni pokrov ili otvori onu koju imaš. U njenim postavkama upiši Nagib, na primjer 6:12. Obrubi svaku krovnu ravan na nacrtu sa Površina, kao i obično. Svaka ravan se računa kao njena tlocrtna površina puta faktor nagiba: √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)²), 1.118 za 6:12 i 1.414 za 12:12. Odaberi ravan da vidiš njenu Površinu (na kosini), Tlocrtnu površinu i Faktor nagiba. Ravni s drugim nagibom: odaberi ravan i upiši njen vlastiti Nagib u njenom panelu. Ostavi prazno da koristi nagib stavke. 3D pregled za provjeru, sklopovi (A je kosa površina), troškovi i izvoz svi koriste kosu površinu. Odbici na nagnutoj ravni, kao svjetlarnici, odbijaju se pod istim nagibom. Obim (P) ostaje tlocrtni obim. Strehe, zabatne rubove, grebene i žlijebove mjeri kao dionice (dolje). Zabatni rubovi, grebeni i žlijebovi Napravi linijsku stavku, na primjer \"Zabatni rub\" ili \"Grebeni\". Postavi njen Nagib na Zabatni rub (kosu ivicu, kao kod zabata) ili Greben ili žlijeb (liniju gdje se sastaju dvije ravni), i upiši Nagib krovnih ravni. Nacrtaj dionice na nacrtu sa Linijski. Zabatni rub se računa kao njegova tlocrtna dužina puta faktor nagiba. Greben ili žlijeb ide pod 45° preko nacrta između dvije ravni istog nagiba, pa je njegova prava dužina tlocrtna dužina puta √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 za 6:12, 1.225 za 12:12. Jedna dionica može miješati ove vrste. Odaberi je: svaki segment u njenom panelu ima listu nagiba — Postavka stavke, Nivo, Zabatni rub ili Greben ili žlijeb — i njegovu dužinu duž kosine. Nagib dionice u panelu zamjenjuje nagib stavke za sve njene segmente. Panel takođe prikazuje Tlocrtnu dužinu, a oznake na listu prikazuju dužine duž kosine. Odbici i dalje rade: odbijeni segment ne računa ništa, bio kos ili ne. Grebeni i žlijebovi pretpostavljaju da obje ravni imaju isti nagib. Za ravni različitih nagiba izmjeri greben po njegovoj pravoj dužini drugdje, ili ga nacrtaj kao zabatni rub s ekvivalentnim nagibom.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Brojanje ručno","summary":"Kliknite svaka vrata, armaturu ili uređaj da ga prebrojite, provjerite brojanja i ispravite greške.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["brojanje","svaki","ea","armature","vrata","uređaji","simboli","zbrajanje","brojanje klikom","ručno brojanje"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje","text":"Brojanje","level":2},{"id":"ispravite-brojanje","text":"Ispravite brojanje","level":2},{"id":"veli-ina-ta-ke-na-ekranu-i-u-pdf-u","text":"Veličina tačke, na ekranu i u PDF-u","level":2},{"id":"mnogo-jednakih-simbola","text":"Mnogo jednakih simbola","level":2},{"id":"kori-tenje-brojanja-u-formulama","text":"Korištenje brojanja u formulama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EStavka brojanja broji stvari: vrata, svjetiljke, utičnice, sanitarne armature. Svaki klik na list dodaje jednu oznaku brojanja. Brojanje ne treba razmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite ili kliknite stavku brojanja pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E (tip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaku na listu. Svaki klik stavlja tačku u boji stavke, a brojka stavke se povećava za jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPređite na sljedeći list (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i nastavite brojati. Alat ostaje na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kad završite. TakeoffDesk se vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrevlačenje i dalje pomjera pogled, a točkić zumira dok brojite, pa se možete kretati po listu bez dodavanja tačaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite stavku brojanja da istaknete njene tačke na svakom listu. Lista listova tada pokazuje koliko ih ima na svakom listu, što pomaže da nađete listove koje još niste prebrojali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ispravite-brojanje\"\u003EIspravite brojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUklonite tačku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kliknite tačku i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E. Ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odmah nakon pogrešnog klika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjerite tačku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite je, pa je prevucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrebrojano pod pogrešnom stavkom\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite tačku i izaberite ispravnu stavku brojanja na listi \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"veli-ina-ta-ke-na-ekranu-i-u-pdf-u\"\u003EVeličina tačke, na ekranu i u PDF-u\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETačke zadržavaju istu veličinu na ekranu koliko god zumirali. Da je promijenite, otvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E, tab TakeoffDesk, i odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EVeličina oznake brojanja\u003C/strong\u003E: Vrlo mala, Mala, Srednja (podrazumijevano) ili Velika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvoz u PDF (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › označeni PDF) crta svaku tačku iste veličine na papiru, bez obzira na veličinu lista: preglednik koji prikazuje PDF na 100% prikazuje tačke onoliko velike koliko su na ekranu. Ako bi se tačke na listu i dalje dodirivale, izvoz pravi tačke na tom listu manjim da bi se svaka mogla pročitati.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mnogo-jednakih-simbola\"\u003EMnogo jednakih simbola\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa simbol koji se ponavlja mnogo puta na listu, probajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/a\u003E: obuhvatite jedan, pregledajte šta je pronašao i dodajte sve odjednom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kori-tenje-brojanja-u-formulama\"\u003EKorištenje brojanja u formulama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličina stavke brojanja je \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E. Komponente sklopa je mogu koristiti, na primjer šarke \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E za vrata. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Stavka brojanja broji stvari: vrata, svjetiljke, utičnice, sanitarne armature. Svaki klik na list dodaje jednu oznaku brojanja. Brojanje ne treba razmjeru. Brojanje Napravite ili kliknite stavku brojanja pod Stavke (tip Brojanje). Odaberite Brojanje na traci alata ili pritisnite C. Kliknite svaku na listu. Svaki klik stavlja tačku u boji stavke, a brojka stavke se povećava za jedan. Pređite na sljedeći list (Page Down) i nastavite brojati. Alat ostaje na Brojanje. Pritisnite Esc kad završite. TakeoffDesk se vraća na Odaberi. Prevlačenje i dalje pomjera pogled, a točkić zumira dok brojite, pa se možete kretati po listu bez dodavanja tačaka. Kliknite stavku brojanja da istaknete njene tačke na svakom listu. Lista listova tada pokazuje koliko ih ima na svakom listu, što pomaže da nađete listove koje još niste prebrojali. Ispravite brojanje Uklonite tačku: odaberite Odaberi (V), kliknite tačku i pritisnite Delete ili odaberite Izbriši oznaku. Ili pritisnite Ctrl+Z odmah nakon pogrešnog klika. Pomjerite tačku: odaberite je, pa je prevucite. Prebrojano pod pogrešnom stavkom: odaberite tačku i izaberite ispravnu stavku brojanja na listi Stavka pod Odabrana oznaka. Veličina tačke, na ekranu i u PDF-u Tačke zadržavaju istu veličinu na ekranu koliko god zumirali. Da je promijenite, otvorite Postavke, tab TakeoffDesk, i odaberite Veličina oznake brojanja: Vrlo mala, Mala, Srednja (podrazumijevano) ili Velika. Izvoz u PDF (Izvoz › označeni PDF) crta svaku tačku iste veličine na papiru, bez obzira na veličinu lista: preglednik koji prikazuje PDF na 100% prikazuje tačke onoliko velike koliko su na ekranu. Ako bi se tačke na listu i dalje dodirivale, izvoz pravi tačke na tom listu manjim da bi se svaka mogla pročitati. Mnogo jednakih simbola Za simbol koji se ponavlja mnogo puta na listu, probajte Auto brojanje: obuhvatite jedan, pregledajte šta je pronašao i dodajte sve odjednom. Korištenje brojanja u formulama Količina stavke brojanja je N. Komponente sklopa je mogu koristiti, na primjer šarke N * 3 za vrata. Vidi Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Auto brojanje simbola","summary":"Obuhvati jedan simbol, pusti TakeoffDesk da pronađe ostale na ovom listu ili na svim otvorenim listovima, pregledaj podudaranja klizačem i dodaj ih u jednom koraku.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["bilo koji ugao","rotirano","okrenuto","druga razmjera","drugačija razmjera","auto brojanje","automatsko brojanje","pretraga simbola","pronađi simbole","uzorak","šablon","podudaranje","otkrij","alat za brojanje"],"headings":[{"id":"prona-i-simbole","text":"Pronađi simbole","level":2},{"id":"pregledaj-podudaranja","text":"Pregledaj podudaranja","level":2},{"id":"dodaj-ih","text":"Dodaj ih","level":2},{"id":"ta-pronalazi-a-ta-propu-ta","text":"Šta pronalazi, a šta propušta","level":2},{"id":"brzina-i-pregleda-i","text":"Brzina i pregledači","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E pronalazi svaku kopiju simbola nakon što obuhvatite jedan. Zatim pregledate podudaranja na listu i dodajete ona koja prihvatite kao oznake brojanja. To je pomoćno sredstvo, a ne garancija: uvijek pregledajte prije dodavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-i-simbole\"\u003EPronađi simbole\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravi ili klikni stavku brojanja u panelu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori list na kojem se simbol pojavljuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E na traci ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Na vrhu lista pojavljuje se traka: &quot;Prevuci okvir oko jednog simbola na ovom listu.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa pretražite sve otvorene listove, a ne samo ovaj, označi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESearch all open sheets\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUvećaj tako da simbol bude lako vidljiv, zatim prevuci okvir čvrsto oko jedne kopije. Uključi cijeli simbol; prazan papir oko njega se odsijeca. Traka prikazuje &quot;Pretraga…&quot; sa trakom napretka i dugmetom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E. Stranica ostaje responzivna: možete zumirati, pomjerati pogled i prelaziti između listova. Odabir drugog alata ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E otkazuje pretragu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKada završi, podudaranja se pojavljuju na listu kao okviri u boji stavke, a traka prikazuje sažetak, npr. &quot;22 podudaranja, 19 za dodavanje (3 već brojana). Klikni okvir da ga odbaciš ili vratiš.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, prevlačenje po listu crta okvir umjesto pomjeranja pogleda. Za pomjeranje pogleda drži \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i prevuci, ili prevuci srednjim dugmetom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pregledaj-podudaranja\"\u003EPregledaj podudaranja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKlikni okvir\u003C/strong\u003E da ga odbaciš. Odbačen okvir je isprekidan i precrtan. Klikni ponovo da ga vratiš.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjeri klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (od 50% do 95%, počinje na 75%). Više vrijednosti prikazuju samo bliska podudaranja; niže prikazuju labavija. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ne pretražuje ponovo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVeć brojano\u003C/strong\u003E: podudaranja na mjestu koje već ima oznaku brojanja ove stavke počinju kao odbačena, pa ništa ne brojite dvaput.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrugi listovi\u003C/strong\u003E: kada ste pretraživali sve otvorene listove, prelazite s liste listova ili pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i pregledajte svaki. Sažetak kaže koliko listova ima podudaranja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodaj-ih\"\u003EDodaj ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E. Dugme kaže koliko, na primjer &quot;Dodaj 19 oznaka&quot;. Oznake brojanja se dodaju u središte svakog prihvaćenog okvira: &quot;Dodato je 19 oznaka brojanja u &quot;Duplex receptacle&quot;. Ctrl+Z ih uklanja sve.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECijela serija je jedan korak poništavanja, pa jedno \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja sve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa odbacite pregled bez dodavanja, odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Odabir drugog alata također ga odbacuje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-pronalazi-a-ta-propu-ta\"\u003EŠta pronalazi, a šta propušta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk upoređuje crtež, kao piksele, sa simbolom koji ste obuhvatili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPronalazi simbol okrenut za 0°, 90°, 180° i 270°. Označi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAny angle (slower)\u003C/span\u003E na traci auto brojanja prije crtanja okvira da pronađe i simbol pod bilo kojim uglom: pretražuje svakih 15°, zatim fino podešava svaki pronalazak na stepen i pola. To traje otprilike šest puta duže. Ne pronalazi ogledalski simbol (osim ako simbol izgleda isto i u ogledalu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESa označenim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESearch all open sheets\u003C/span\u003E, list u drugoj razmjeri pretražuje se u veličini koju simbol ima na njemu: armatura nacrtana u razmjeri na planu 1/8&quot; je upola manja nego na planu 1/4&quot;, i i dalje se pronalazi. Takav list se također pretražuje u veličini samog okvira, za oznake i simbole štampane u jednoj veličini na svim listovima. Ovo zahtijeva razmjeru na oba lista; list bez razmjere pretražuje se samo u veličini okvira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo slični simboli mogu se međusobno podudarati: dupleks i četverostruka utičnica, ili dvije oznake armature koje se razlikuju za jedno slovo. Podigni klizač dok ne ostanu samo pravi, a ostale odbaci ručno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimbol presječen drugim linijama, šrafurom ili tekstom dobija nižu ocjenu i možda treba niža postavka klizača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo mali okviri se odbijaju: &quot;Taj okvir je premali. Nacrtaj ga oko cijelog simbola.&quot; Prazan okvir se također odbija: &quot;Taj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtaj ga oko simbola.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EList koji bi bio vrlo velik u veličini potrebnoj za ovaj simbol se preskače, a sažetak kaže &quot;1 list je bio prevelik za pretragu u ovoj veličini simbola.&quot; Obuhvati veći simbol ili taj list prebroj ručno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko ništa nije pronađeno, statusna traka kaže &quot;Nema podudaranja. Snizi klizač podudaranja ili obuhvati simbol tješnje.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brzina-i-pregleda-i\"\u003EBrzina i pregledači\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPretraga se izvodi u pozadinskom procesu, pa stranica ostaje responzivna i možete je otkazati u bilo kojem trenutku. Svaki list se prvo iscrtava u radnoj veličini na samoj stranici, što može uzrokovati kratko zastajkivanje vrlo velikog lista. Radi u aktuelnim verzijama Chrome, Edge, Firefox i Safari. Pretraga više listova traje duže; traka napretka se pomjera list po list. Van mreže, auto brojanje radi kada traka aplikacije prikazuje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E čuva i pozadinski proces. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad van mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Auto count pronalazi svaku kopiju simbola nakon što obuhvatite jedan. Zatim pregledate podudaranja na listu i dodajete ona koja prihvatite kao oznake brojanja. To je pomoćno sredstvo, a ne garancija: uvijek pregledajte prije dodavanja. Pronađi simbole Napravi ili klikni stavku brojanja u panelu Items. Otvori list na kojem se simbol pojavljuje. Odaberi Auto count na traci ili pritisni S. Na vrhu lista pojavljuje se traka: \"Prevuci okvir oko jednog simbola na ovom listu.\" Da pretražite sve otvorene listove, a ne samo ovaj, označi Search all open sheets. Uvećaj tako da simbol bude lako vidljiv, zatim prevuci okvir čvrsto oko jedne kopije. Uključi cijeli simbol; prazan papir oko njega se odsijeca. Traka prikazuje \"Pretraga…\" sa trakom napretka i dugmetom Cancel. Stranica ostaje responzivna: možete zumirati, pomjerati pogled i prelaziti između listova. Odabir drugog alata ili Esc otkazuje pretragu. Kada završi, podudaranja se pojavljuju na listu kao okviri u boji stavke, a traka prikazuje sažetak, npr. \"22 podudaranja, 19 za dodavanje (3 već brojana). Klikni okvir da ga odbaciš ili vratiš.\" U Auto count, prevlačenje po listu crta okvir umjesto pomjeranja pogleda. Za pomjeranje pogleda drži Space i prevuci, ili prevuci srednjim dugmetom. Pregledaj podudaranja Klikni okvir da ga odbaciš. Odbačen okvir je isprekidan i precrtan. Klikni ponovo da ga vratiš. Pomjeri klizač Match (od 50% do 95%, počinje na 75%). Više vrijednosti prikazuju samo bliska podudaranja; niže prikazuju labavija. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ne pretražuje ponovo. Već brojano: podudaranja na mjestu koje već ima oznaku brojanja ove stavke počinju kao odbačena, pa ništa ne brojite dvaput. Drugi listovi: kada ste pretraživali sve otvorene listove, prelazite s liste listova ili pomoću Page Down i pregledajte svaki. Sažetak kaže koliko listova ima podudaranja. Dodaj ih Odaberi Add. Dugme kaže koliko, na primjer \"Dodaj 19 oznaka\". Oznake brojanja se dodaju u središte svakog prihvaćenog okvira: \"Dodato je 19 oznaka brojanja u \"Duplex receptacle\". Ctrl+Z ih uklanja sve.\" Cijela serija je jedan korak poništavanja, pa jedno Ctrl+Z uklanja sve. Da odbacite pregled bez dodavanja, odaberi Discard ili pritisni Esc. Odabir drugog alata također ga odbacuje. Šta pronalazi, a šta propušta TakeoffDesk upoređuje crtež, kao piksele, sa simbolom koji ste obuhvatili. Pronalazi simbol okrenut za 0°, 90°, 180° i 270°. Označi Any angle (slower) na traci auto brojanja prije crtanja okvira da pronađe i simbol pod bilo kojim uglom: pretražuje svakih 15°, zatim fino podešava svaki pronalazak na stepen i pola. To traje otprilike šest puta duže. Ne pronalazi ogledalski simbol (osim ako simbol izgleda isto i u ogledalu). Sa označenim Search all open sheets, list u drugoj razmjeri pretražuje se u veličini koju simbol ima na njemu: armatura nacrtana u razmjeri na planu 1/8\" je upola manja nego na planu 1/4\", i i dalje se pronalazi. Takav list se također pretražuje u veličini samog okvira, za oznake i simbole štampane u jednoj veličini na svim listovima. Ovo zahtijeva razmjeru na oba lista; list bez razmjere pretražuje se samo u veličini okvira. Vrlo slični simboli mogu se međusobno podudarati: dupleks i četverostruka utičnica, ili dvije oznake armature koje se razlikuju za jedno slovo. Podigni klizač dok ne ostanu samo pravi, a ostale odbaci ručno. Simbol presječen drugim linijama, šrafurom ili tekstom dobija nižu ocjenu i možda treba niža postavka klizača. Vrlo mali okviri se odbijaju: \"Taj okvir je premali. Nacrtaj ga oko cijelog simbola.\" Prazan okvir se također odbija: \"Taj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtaj ga oko simbola.\" List koji bi bio vrlo velik u veličini potrebnoj za ovaj simbol se preskače, a sažetak kaže \"1 list je bio prevelik za pretragu u ovoj veličini simbola.\" Obuhvati veći simbol ili taj list prebroj ručno. Ako ništa nije pronađeno, statusna traka kaže \"Nema podudaranja. Snizi klizač podudaranja ili obuhvati simbol tješnje.\" Brzina i pregledači Pretraga se izvodi u pozadinskom procesu, pa stranica ostaje responzivna i možete je otkazati u bilo kojem trenutku. Svaki list se prvo iscrtava u radnoj veličini na samoj stranici, što može uzrokovati kratko zastajkivanje vrlo velikog lista. Radi u aktuelnim verzijama Chrome, Edge, Firefox i Safari. Pretraga više listova traje duže; traka napretka se pomjera list po list. Van mreže, auto brojanje radi kada traka aplikacije prikazuje Offline ready: Save for offline čuva i pozadinski proces. Vidi Rad van mreže.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Brojanje iz crteža","summary":"Brojte blokove, objekte na sloju ili tekst direktno iz DWG ili DXF: tačno, sa ugniježđenim blokovima, varijantama dinamičkih blokova i nizovima blokova, u jednom koraku poništavanja.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["brojanje iz crteža","cad brojanje","brojanje blokova","broji blokove","umetanje","naziv bloka","ugniježđeni blokovi","dinamički blok","varijanta","minsert","niz","sloj","tip entiteta","krugovi","tekst","atribut","oznaka","skriveni slojevi","tačno brojanje","kako","vrata","armature"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje-bloka","text":"Brojanje bloka","level":2},{"id":"ta-se-broji","text":"Šta se broji","level":3},{"id":"ta-se-ne-broji","text":"Šta se ne broji","level":3},{"id":"ta-prikazuje-ovaj-list-ili-cijeli-crte","text":"Šta prikazuje ovaj list, ili cijeli crtež","level":2},{"id":"ponovno-brojanje","text":"Ponovno brojanje","level":2},{"id":"po-sloju-i-tipu","text":"Po sloju i tipu","level":2},{"id":"po-tekstu","text":"Po tekstu","level":2},{"id":"kad-koristiti-auto-brojanje-umjesto-toga","text":"Kad koristiti Auto brojanje umjesto toga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje CAD-a\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista (naredba \u003Cstrong\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/strong\u003E u ostalim stilovima menija) broji ono što DWG ili DXF kaže da postoji. Gdje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E traži sliku simbola i može propustiti ili lažno pronaći, ovo broji objekte: svako umetanje bloka imena \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E je jedna vrata. Prvo otvorite crtež: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOtvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje-bloka\"\u003EBrojanje bloka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite list crteža. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje CAD-a\u003C/span\u003E je na traci lista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite ga. Prozor navodi blokove s brojem svakog. Pretražite po nazivu, pa odaberite jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjerite red ispod liste: „22 pronađeno, 22 za dodavanje.”\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u\u003C/span\u003E odaberite stavku brojanja, ili ostavite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovu stavku brojanja\u003C/span\u003E i dajte joj naziv.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite dugme za dodavanje, koje kaže broj: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj 22 oznake\u003C/span\u003E. Oznake se pojavljuju na tačkama umetanja bloka, a količina stavke je brojanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo je jedan korak poništavanja: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja oznake (i novu stavku) zajedno. Procjena, tabela i označeni PDF tretiraju stavku kao svaku drugu stavku brojanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ta-se-broji\"\u003EŠta se broji\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESvako umetanje imena bloka\u003C/strong\u003E, bez obzira na razmjeru i ugao, u prostoru modela ili prostoru papira. Imena blokova ne razlikuju velika i mala slova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENizovi blokova\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): svaka kopija u nizu je jedna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUgniježđeni blokovi.\u003C/strong\u003E Blok postavljen unutar drugog bloka broji se na svakoj dubini. Lista kaže „6 unutar drugih blokova”; isključite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji i blokove unutar drugih blokova\u003C/span\u003E da brojite samo umetanja postavljena direktno u crtežu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDinamički blokovi.\u003C/strong\u003E Dinamički blok se broji pod svojim imenom, a ne pod anonimnim kopijama (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) koje datoteka čuva. Njegova stanja su navedena odvojeno („Jednostruko 12, Dvostruko 4”): odaberite stanje da brojite samo njih, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESve varijante\u003C/span\u003E. Kad datoteka ne kaže koje stanje kopija prikazuje, one su navedene kao „(stanje nepoznato)”.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFilter sloja.\u003C/strong\u003E Blok na nekoliko slojeva: odaberite jedan pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENa sloju\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ta-se-ne-broji\"\u003EŠta se ne broji\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkriveni slojevi.\u003C/strong\u003E Objekt na sloju koji je isključen ili zamrznut u datoteci (ili koji ste sakrili u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlojevi\u003C/span\u003E) se izostavlja, a red kaže koliko: „3 na skrivenim slojevima izostavljena”. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji i njih također\u003C/span\u003E da ih uključite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovezani crteži koji nisu otvoreni\u003C/strong\u003E se ne broje; prozor to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EObjekti naslagani tačno jedan na drugog iste vrste\u003C/strong\u003E se broje kao dva (jer su dva objekta), a prozor to kaže: obično je to greška u crtanju vrijedna provjere.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-prikazuje-ovaj-list-ili-cijeli-crte\"\u003EŠta prikazuje ovaj list, ili cijeli crtež\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EŠta prikazuje ovaj list\u003C/strong\u003E broji objekte koje list prikazuje: na rasporedu, objekte modela unutar njegovih viewport-ova (sloj zamrznut u viewport-u se tamo ne broji) plus sopstvene objekte rasporeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECijeli crtež, svaki objekt jednom\u003C/strong\u003E broji prostor modela jednom, s oznakama na listu Model, i ne broji ponovo ono što više rasporeda prikazuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojanje onoga što raspored prikazuje i brojanje onoga što prikazuje Model daju isti broj za iste objekte; ne dodajte oboje u jednu stavku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovno-brojanje\"\u003EPonovno brojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonovno brojanje istog bloka istom stavkom dodaje samo ono što je novo: „22 već prebrojano.” Svaka oznaka predstavlja jedan objekt.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-sloju-i-tipu\"\u003EPo sloju i tipu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo sloju i tipu\u003C/span\u003E odaberite sloj i tip objekta (krugovi, polilinije, šrafure…): „svi krugovi na E-LITE”. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakođer broji objekte unutar blokova\u003C/span\u003E da uključite one unutar definicija blokova, na svakom mjestu gdje je blok umetnut.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-tekstu\"\u003EPo tekstu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo tekstu\u003C/span\u003E upišite tekst, kao \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, i recite da li je to tačno taj tekst, sadrži ga, ili ga ima kao cijelu riječ. Tekstualni objekti, višeslojni tekst i \u003Cstrong\u003Evrijednosti atributa\u003C/strong\u003E blokova se sve broje (oznaka atributa \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E se nalazi). Odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU atributu\u003C/span\u003E da brojite samo jedan atribut. Najčešći tekstovi su navedeni za klik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kad-koristiti-auto-brojanje-umjesto-toga\"\u003EKad koristiti Auto brojanje umjesto toga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E za PDF-ove i za simbole u crtežu koji nisu blokovi (nacrtani slobodno, ili razloženi). Nacrtane kao blokovi, brojite ih ovdje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Brojanje CAD-a na traci lista (naredba Brojanje iz crteža u ostalim stilovima menija) broji ono što DWG ili DXF kaže da postoji. Gdje Auto brojanje traži sliku simbola i može propustiti ili lažno pronaći, ovo broji objekte: svako umetanje bloka imena DOOR-36 je jedna vrata. Prvo otvorite crtež: Otvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža. Brojanje bloka Otvorite list crteža. Brojanje CAD-a je na traci lista. Odaberite ga. Prozor navodi blokove s brojem svakog. Pretražite po nazivu, pa odaberite jedan. Provjerite red ispod liste: „22 pronađeno, 22 za dodavanje.” Pod Dodaj u odaberite stavku brojanja, ili ostavite Novu stavku brojanja i dajte joj naziv. Odaberite dugme za dodavanje, koje kaže broj: Dodaj 22 oznake. Oznake se pojavljuju na tačkama umetanja bloka, a količina stavke je brojanje. To je jedan korak poništavanja: Ctrl+Z uklanja oznake (i novu stavku) zajedno. Procjena, tabela i označeni PDF tretiraju stavku kao svaku drugu stavku brojanja. Šta se broji Svako umetanje imena bloka, bez obzira na razmjeru i ugao, u prostoru modela ili prostoru papira. Imena blokova ne razlikuju velika i mala slova. Nizovi blokova (MINSERT): svaka kopija u nizu je jedna. Ugniježđeni blokovi. Blok postavljen unutar drugog bloka broji se na svakoj dubini. Lista kaže „6 unutar drugih blokova”; isključite Broji i blokove unutar drugih blokova da brojite samo umetanja postavljena direktno u crtežu. Dinamički blokovi. Dinamički blok se broji pod svojim imenom, a ne pod anonimnim kopijama (*U12) koje datoteka čuva. Njegova stanja su navedena odvojeno („Jednostruko 12, Dvostruko 4”): odaberite stanje da brojite samo njih, ili Sve varijante. Kad datoteka ne kaže koje stanje kopija prikazuje, one su navedene kao „(stanje nepoznato)”. Filter sloja. Blok na nekoliko slojeva: odaberite jedan pod Na sloju. Šta se ne broji Skriveni slojevi. Objekt na sloju koji je isključen ili zamrznut u datoteci (ili koji ste sakrili u Slojevi) se izostavlja, a red kaže koliko: „3 na skrivenim slojevima izostavljena”. Označite Broji i njih također da ih uključite. Povezani crteži koji nisu otvoreni se ne broje; prozor to kaže. Objekti naslagani tačno jedan na drugog iste vrste se broje kao dva (jer su dva objekta), a prozor to kaže: obično je to greška u crtanju vrijedna provjere. Šta prikazuje ovaj list, ili cijeli crtež Šta prikazuje ovaj list broji objekte koje list prikazuje: na rasporedu, objekte modela unutar njegovih viewport-ova (sloj zamrznut u viewport-u se tamo ne broji) plus sopstvene objekte rasporeda. Cijeli crtež, svaki objekt jednom broji prostor modela jednom, s oznakama na listu Model, i ne broji ponovo ono što više rasporeda prikazuje. Brojanje onoga što raspored prikazuje i brojanje onoga što prikazuje Model daju isti broj za iste objekte; ne dodajte oboje u jednu stavku. Ponovno brojanje Ponovno brojanje istog bloka istom stavkom dodaje samo ono što je novo: „22 već prebrojano.” Svaka oznaka predstavlja jedan objekt. Po sloju i tipu Na Po sloju i tipu odaberite sloj i tip objekta (krugovi, polilinije, šrafure…): „svi krugovi na E-LITE”. Označite Također broji objekte unutar blokova da uključite one unutar definicija blokova, na svakom mjestu gdje je blok umetnut. Po tekstu Na Po tekstu upišite tekst, kao A3, i recite da li je to tačno taj tekst, sadrži ga, ili ga ima kao cijelu riječ. Tekstualni objekti, višeslojni tekst i vrijednosti atributa blokova se sve broje (oznaka atributa ITEM = A3 se nalazi). Odaberite U atributu da brojite samo jedan atribut. Najčešći tekstovi su navedeni za klik. Kad koristiti Auto brojanje umjesto toga Koristite Auto brojanje za PDF-ove i za simbole u crtežu koji nisu blokovi (nacrtani slobodno, ili razloženi). Nacrtane kao blokovi, brojite ih ovdje.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Broji sve u setu","summary":"Obuhvatite jednom legendu simbola i TakeoffDesk prebroji svaki simbol na njoj na svakom otvorenom listu u jednom prolazu. Svako brojanje je veza na njegov list, a pregledate prije nego što se bilo šta doda.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["broji sve","legenda","legenda simbola","cijeli set","svaki list","svi listovi","sva vrata","sve armature","uređaji","specifikacija","simboli","auto brojanje","broji sve","set planova","200 listova","nivo podudaranja","slični"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje-legende","text":"Brojanje legende","level":2},{"id":"pregledajte-brojanja","text":"Pregledajte brojanja","level":2},{"id":"dodajte-ih","text":"Dodajte ih","level":2},{"id":"s-va-im-asistentom","text":"S vašim asistentom","level":2},{"id":"simboli-pod-bilo-kojim-uglom","text":"Simboli pod bilo kojim uglom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji sve\u003C/span\u003E čita legendu simbola, pa broji svaki simbol iz nje na svakom otvorenom listu. To je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E za cijelu legendu odjednom. Riječ je o običnom poređenju simbola na vašim listovima, a ne o treniranom modelu, i ništa ne napušta vaš računar. Pregledajte brojanja prije nego što ih dodate: to je pomoćni alat, a ne garancija.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje-legende\"\u003EBrojanje legende\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite planove. Legenda na bilo kom listu je dovoljna: simboli s njihovim nazivima pored.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji sve\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevucite okvir oko legende, simbola i naziva. Naslov bez simbola pored sebe (LEGENDA SIMBOLA) se sam izostavlja. Panel navodi svaki simbol sa slikom i nazivom otisnutim pored. Naziv postaje naziv stavke, pa ga ovdje preimenujte ako želite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsključite svaki simbol koji ne želite da se broji. Simbol koji se ne može pretraživati (premali ili prazan) kaže zašto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji na N listova\u003C/span\u003E. Traka prikazuje list koji se pretražuje; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkaži\u003C/span\u003E zaustavlja prolaz. Stranica ostaje upotrebljiva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESimboli same legende se ne broje na njenom listu. List nacrtan u drugoj razmjeri se pretražuje u toj razmjeri, a simboli se nalaze okrenuti u bilo kojem pravom uglu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pregledajte-brojanja\"\u003EPregledajte brojanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESvaki simbol prikazuje svoj ukupan broj i ispod njega vezu za svaki list koji ga ima („E-103: 4”). Kliknite je da odete na taj list. Nalazi su uokvireni bojom stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKliknite okvir\u003C/strong\u003E da isključite taj nalaz. Crta se isprekidano i precrtano; kliknite ponovo da ga vratite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjerite nivo podudaranja\u003C/strong\u003E (od 50% do 100%, počevši od nivoa iz vaših Postavki). Viši nivo zadržava samo bliska podudaranja. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ništa se ponovo ne pretražuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDva simbola koji izgledaju slično (dupleks i kvadro utičnica) mogu se podudariti s istim mjestom. Bolje podudaranje ga uzima, a panel kaže na koliko je mjesta to bilo, pa možete provjeriti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EList prevelik da se pretraži pri veličini simbola se preskače, a panel to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodajte-ih\"\u003EDodajte ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj N oznaka\u003C/span\u003E. Svaki simbol postaje stavka brojanja s oznakom na svakom nalazu. Naziv koji je već vaša stavka brojanja se ponovo koristi (ništa se ne udvostručuje tamo gdje ste već označili ručno). Cijeli prolaz je jedan korak: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja sve stavke i oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOno što prihvatite takođe ide u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E: simboli se pamte u datoteci predmjera za sljedeći put.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"s-va-im-asistentom\"\u003ES vašim asistentom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko dozvolite asistente u Postavkama, mogu pročitati legendu (legend_open), pokrenuti brojanje u pozadini (legend_count_start, pa legend_count_status), pročitati brojanja (legend_count_result) i dodati ih (legend_count_add, koji prvo može prikazati pregled onoga što bi dodao). To je isti prolaz koji vidite u panelu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simboli-pod-bilo-kojim-uglom\"\u003ESimboli pod bilo kojim uglom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznačite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimboli pod bilo kojim uglom\u003C/span\u003E prije brojanja da nađete i simbole nacrtane pod uglom koji nije pravi (koso postavljen zidni utikač, armatura okrenuta da prati krov). Pretraga tada okreće svaki simbol na svakih 15 stepeni; okrugli simbol i dalje treba jednu pretragu, a simbol koji nije okrugao može trajati do šest puta duže. Ostavite isključeno za planove nacrtane pravougaono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPotrebni su simboli nacrtani na isti način kao u legendi. Legenda nacrtana u drugoj veličini od listova je u redu kad su razmjere listova postavljene; bez razmjera, simboli se pretražuju u veličini legende.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimbol kroz koji prolazi zid ili duga linija može se propustiti, jer više ne liči na sliku iz legende. Provjerite nalaze na prvom listu prije nego što vjerujete ostalima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkeniran dokument bez teksta i dalje radi: simboli se nalaze po njihovim redovima, a nazive upisujete sami.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Broji sve čita legendu simbola, pa broji svaki simbol iz nje na svakom otvorenom listu. To je Auto brojanje za cijelu legendu odjednom. Riječ je o običnom poređenju simbola na vašim listovima, a ne o treniranom modelu, i ništa ne napušta vaš računar. Pregledajte brojanja prije nego što ih dodate: to je pomoćni alat, a ne garancija. Brojanje legende Otvorite planove. Legenda na bilo kom listu je dovoljna: simboli s njihovim nazivima pored. Odaberite Broji sve na traci alata. Prevucite okvir oko legende, simbola i naziva. Naslov bez simbola pored sebe (LEGENDA SIMBOLA) se sam izostavlja. Panel navodi svaki simbol sa slikom i nazivom otisnutim pored. Naziv postaje naziv stavke, pa ga ovdje preimenujte ako želite. Isključite svaki simbol koji ne želite da se broji. Simbol koji se ne može pretraživati (premali ili prazan) kaže zašto. Odaberite Broji na N listova. Traka prikazuje list koji se pretražuje; Otkaži zaustavlja prolaz. Stranica ostaje upotrebljiva. Simboli same legende se ne broje na njenom listu. List nacrtan u drugoj razmjeri se pretražuje u toj razmjeri, a simboli se nalaze okrenuti u bilo kojem pravom uglu. Pregledajte brojanja Svaki simbol prikazuje svoj ukupan broj i ispod njega vezu za svaki list koji ga ima („E-103: 4”). Kliknite je da odete na taj list. Nalazi su uokvireni bojom stavke. Kliknite okvir da isključite taj nalaz. Crta se isprekidano i precrtano; kliknite ponovo da ga vratite. Pomjerite nivo podudaranja (od 50% do 100%, počevši od nivoa iz vaših Postavki). Viši nivo zadržava samo bliska podudaranja. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ništa se ponovo ne pretražuje. Dva simbola koji izgledaju slično (dupleks i kvadro utičnica) mogu se podudariti s istim mjestom. Bolje podudaranje ga uzima, a panel kaže na koliko je mjesta to bilo, pa možete provjeriti. List prevelik da se pretraži pri veličini simbola se preskače, a panel to kaže. Dodajte ih Odaberite Dodaj N oznaka. Svaki simbol postaje stavka brojanja s oznakom na svakom nalazu. Naziv koji je već vaša stavka brojanja se ponovo koristi (ništa se ne udvostručuje tamo gdje ste već označili ručno). Cijeli prolaz je jedan korak: Ctrl+Z uklanja sve stavke i oznake. Ono što prihvatite takođe ide u Naučeno: simboli se pamte u datoteci predmjera za sljedeći put. S vašim asistentom Ako dozvolite asistente u Postavkama, mogu pročitati legendu (legend_open), pokrenuti brojanje u pozadini (legend_count_start, pa legend_count_status), pročitati brojanja (legend_count_result) i dodati ih (legend_count_add, koji prvo može prikazati pregled onoga što bi dodao). To je isti prolaz koji vidite u panelu. Simboli pod bilo kojim uglom Označite Simboli pod bilo kojim uglom prije brojanja da nađete i simbole nacrtane pod uglom koji nije pravi (koso postavljen zidni utikač, armatura okrenuta da prati krov). Pretraga tada okreće svaki simbol na svakih 15 stepeni; okrugli simbol i dalje treba jednu pretragu, a simbol koji nije okrugao može trajati do šest puta duže. Ostavite isključeno za planove nacrtane pravougaono. Dobro je znati Potrebni su simboli nacrtani na isti način kao u legendi. Legenda nacrtana u drugoj veličini od listova je u redu kad su razmjere listova postavljene; bez razmjera, simboli se pretražuju u veličini legende. Simbol kroz koji prolazi zid ili duga linija može se propustiti, jer više ne liči na sliku iz legende. Provjerite nalaze na prvom listu prije nego što vjerujete ostalima. Skeniran dokument bez teksta i dalje radi: simboli se nalaze po njihovim redovima, a nazive upisujete sami.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Šta je naučeno iz vaših predmjera","summary":"TakeoffDesk čuva simbole koje ste potvrdili s Auto brojanjem, vaše skupove uslova, sklopove koje najviše koristite i obrasce koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici, sve unutar vlastite datoteke predmjera. Pogledajte, koristite, obrišite.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["nauči","naučeno","učenje","asistent","zapamti","simboli","šabloni","isto kao prošli posao","prošli posao","skup uslova","uslovi","ponovna upotreba","sklopovi","najčešće korišteni","prijedlozi","ponovi na svakoj stranici","svaka stranica","naslovni blok","obrazac","obriši sve","zaboravi","privatnost"],"headings":[{"id":"simboli","text":"Simboli","level":2},{"id":"skupovi-uslova","text":"Skupovi uslova","level":2},{"id":"isto-kao-pro-li-posao","text":"Isto kao prošli posao","level":2},{"id":"sklopovi-koje-najvi-e-koristite","text":"Sklopovi koje najviše koristite","level":2},{"id":"ponovi-na-svakoj-stranici","text":"Ponovi na svakoj stranici","level":2},{"id":"vidite-bri-ete","text":"Vidite, brišete","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk postaje brži što više predmjera radite s njim. Uči \u003Cstrong\u003Esamo iz onoga što prihvatite\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esimbole koje ste označili s \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/a\u003E i zatim dodali,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eskupove uslova koje sačuvate,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esklopove koje koristite (jednom po poslu),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eobrasce oznaka koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo je jednostavno poklapanje na vašim listovima, ista pretraga koju pokreće Auto brojanje. Nije uvježbani model. Sve što nauči čuva se \u003Cstrong\u003Eu datoteci ovog predmjera\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), i ništa se ne šalje nigdje. Da to prenesete na sljedeći posao, koristite \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata (sijalica, pored \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E) da vidite sve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simboli\"\u003ESimboli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad označite simbol s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E i izaberete \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E, simbol koji ste označili se čuva, sa nivoom poklapanja koji ste prihvatili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi na ovom listu\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi na svim listovima\u003C/span\u003E. Otvara se uobičajeni pregled Auto brojanja: kliknite okvir da ga izostavite, pomjerite klizač, pa ih dodajte. Ništa se ne dodaje dok to ne uradite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad otvorite list na kojem još nema nijednog naučenog simbola, traka na vrhu nudi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi …\u003C/span\u003E za njega. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENe sad\u003C/span\u003E to sakriva za taj list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko predmjer nema stavku tog imena, dodavanje oznaka dodaje i stavku (jedan korak poništavanja).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPonovno dodavanje simbola iste stavke ide na onu koju već poznaje; simbol drugačijeg izgleda čuva se kao drugi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKao i Auto brojanje, pronalazi simbol pod pravim uglovima i na listovima druge razmjere.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skupovi-uslova\"\u003ESkupovi uslova\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkup čuva uslove predmjera (stavke sa jedinicama, cijenama, otpadom i sklopovima), bez oznaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESačuvaj uslove ove procjene kao skup…\u003C/span\u003E i dajte mu ime. Skup s istim imenom se zamjenjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU predmjeru koji ima skup, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E ubacuje uslove koje još nema. Uslovi istog imena i tipa ostaju netaknuti. To je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isto-kao-pro-li-posao\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka vašeg posljednjeg posla čuva ono što je naučila. Da započnete novi posao iz nje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite nove planove, pa izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E prošlog posla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite šta uvozite: njegove uslove (samo one koje ovaj predmjer nema) i ono što je naučio (simboli, skupovi, sklopovi, obrasci). Zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi ih\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjegovi uslovi se također čuvaju kao skup s imenom tog posla. Njegove oznake i količine ostaju u njegovoj datoteci. Sve je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sklopovi-koje-najvi-e-koristite\"\u003ESklopovi koje najviše koristite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavka koja ima sklop računa se kao korištena jednom po poslu kad ima količinu i kad sačuvate predmjer. Posao je skup planova od kojih se predmjer radi, pa ponovno čuvanje istog predmjera ne računa se dvaput. Spisak pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklopovi koje najviše koristite\u003C/span\u003E stavlja one koje najviše koristite na vrh. Izostavlja one koje ovaj predmjer već ima. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E ubacuje jedan onako kako ste ga posljednji put koristili, sa svim dijelovima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovi-na-svakoj-stranici\"\u003EPonovi na svakoj stranici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa oznake koje su iste na svakoj stranici skupa, kao brojanje naslovnog bloka ili tipičan detalj:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite oznake na jednom listu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EOdabir oznaka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi odabrane oznake na svakoj stranici…\u003C/span\u003E, dajte obrascu ime i potvrdite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdu na svaku drugu otvorenu stranicu \u003Cstrong\u003Eiste veličine\u003C/strong\u003E, na istom mjestu, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Dužine i površine idu samo na stranice iste razmjere; brojanja idu na bilo koju stranicu te veličine. Stranica koja ih već ima se preskače. Obrazac se čuva, pa stranice koje kasnije otvorite dobijaju ponudu u traci, ili možete koristiti \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi na svakoj stranici\u003C/span\u003E u spisku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vidite-bri-ete\"\u003EVidite, brišete\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESve što je naučeno navedeno je u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E. Kanta briše jednu stvar. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EObriši sve\u003C/span\u003E briše sve što je naučeno i ostavlja vaše stavke i oznake netaknutim. Oba se mogu poništiti dok ne zatvorite predmjer, i oba se čuvaju s predmjerom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa prestanete učiti u jednom predmjeru, isključite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUči iz ove procjene\u003C/span\u003E. Ništa novo se ne uči, a ono što je navedeno ostaje dok ga ne obrišete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStarije verzije TakeoffDesk-a otvaraju datoteku s naučenim stvarima normalno. Ignorišu taj dio i izbace ga ako datoteku ponovo sačuvaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaučeni simbol je mala slika onoga što ste označili, čuva se u datoteci (nekoliko kilobajta svaki).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaučeni simboli se pretražuju kao što Auto brojanje pretražuje, pa važe ista ograničenja: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto brojanje simbola\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk postaje brži što više predmjera radite s njim. Uči samo iz onoga što prihvatite: simbole koje ste označili s Auto brojanje i zatim dodali, skupove uslova koje sačuvate, sklopove koje koristite (jednom po poslu), obrasce oznaka koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici. To je jednostavno poklapanje na vašim listovima, ista pretraga koju pokreće Auto brojanje. Nije uvježbani model. Sve što nauči čuva se u datoteci ovog predmjera (.takeoff.json), i ništa se ne šalje nigdje. Da to prenesete na sljedeći posao, koristite Isto kao prošli posao. Izaberite Naučeno na traci alata (sijalica, pored Auto brojanje) da vidite sve. Simboli Kad označite simbol s Auto brojanje i izaberete Dodaj, simbol koji ste označili se čuva, sa nivoom poklapanja koji ste prihvatili. U Naučeno izaberite Pronađi na ovom listu ili Pronađi na svim listovima. Otvara se uobičajeni pregled Auto brojanja: kliknite okvir da ga izostavite, pomjerite klizač, pa ih dodajte. Ništa se ne dodaje dok to ne uradite. Kad otvorite list na kojem još nema nijednog naučenog simbola, traka na vrhu nudi Pronađi … za njega. Ne sad to sakriva za taj list. Ako predmjer nema stavku tog imena, dodavanje oznaka dodaje i stavku (jedan korak poništavanja). Ponovno dodavanje simbola iste stavke ide na onu koju već poznaje; simbol drugačijeg izgleda čuva se kao drugi. Kao i Auto brojanje, pronalazi simbol pod pravim uglovima i na listovima druge razmjere. Skupovi uslova Skup čuva uslove predmjera (stavke sa jedinicama, cijenama, otpadom i sklopovima), bez oznaka. U Naučeno izaberite Sačuvaj uslove ove procjene kao skup… i dajte mu ime. Skup s istim imenom se zamjenjuje. U predmjeru koji ima skup, Dodaj ubacuje uslove koje još nema. Uslovi istog imena i tipa ostaju netaknuti. To je jedan korak poništavanja. Isto kao prošli posao Datoteka vašeg posljednjeg posla čuva ono što je naučila. Da započnete novi posao iz nje: Otvorite nove planove, pa izaberite Naučeno › Isto kao prošli posao…. Izaberite .takeoff.json prošlog posla. Označite šta uvozite: njegove uslove (samo one koje ovaj predmjer nema) i ono što je naučio (simboli, skupovi, sklopovi, obrasci). Zatim Uvezi ih. Njegovi uslovi se također čuvaju kao skup s imenom tog posla. Njegove oznake i količine ostaju u njegovoj datoteci. Sve je jedan korak poništavanja. Sklopovi koje najviše koristite Stavka koja ima sklop računa se kao korištena jednom po poslu kad ima količinu i kad sačuvate predmjer. Posao je skup planova od kojih se predmjer radi, pa ponovno čuvanje istog predmjera ne računa se dvaput. Spisak pod Sklopovi koje najviše koristite stavlja one koje najviše koristite na vrh. Izostavlja one koje ovaj predmjer već ima. Dodaj ubacuje jedan onako kako ste ga posljednji put koristili, sa svim dijelovima. Ponovi na svakoj stranici Za oznake koje su iste na svakoj stranici skupa, kao brojanje naslovnog bloka ili tipičan detalj: Odaberite oznake na jednom listu (Odabir oznaka). U Naučeno izaberite Ponovi odabrane oznake na svakoj stranici…, dajte obrascu ime i potvrdite. Idu na svaku drugu otvorenu stranicu iste veličine, na istom mjestu, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Dužine i površine idu samo na stranice iste razmjere; brojanja idu na bilo koju stranicu te veličine. Stranica koja ih već ima se preskače. Obrazac se čuva, pa stranice koje kasnije otvorite dobijaju ponudu u traci, ili možete koristiti Ponovi na svakoj stranici u spisku. Vidite, brišete Sve što je naučeno navedeno je u Naučeno. Kanta briše jednu stvar. Obriši sve briše sve što je naučeno i ostavlja vaše stavke i oznake netaknutim. Oba se mogu poništiti dok ne zatvorite predmjer, i oba se čuvaju s predmjerom. Da prestanete učiti u jednom predmjeru, isključite Uči iz ove procjene. Ništa novo se ne uči, a ono što je navedeno ostaje dok ga ne obrišete. Dobro je znati Starije verzije TakeoffDesk-a otvaraju datoteku s naučenim stvarima normalno. Ignorišu taj dio i izbace ga ako datoteku ponovo sačuvaju. Naučeni simbol je mala slika onoga što ste označili, čuva se u datoteci (nekoliko kilobajta svaki). Naučeni simboli se pretražuju kao što Auto brojanje pretražuje, pa važe ista ograničenja: Auto brojanje simbola.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Price memory from your past jobs","summary":"TakeoffDesk remembers the rates you used on past takeoffs, on this computer only, so a new takeoff can start from what you paid last time. See it, use it, forget it.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["price memory","prices","remember prices","last job","past jobs","typical price","median","rates","unpriced","reprice","learn from a past takeoff","forget","library"],"headings":[{"id":"what-gets-remembered","text":"What gets remembered","level":2},{"id":"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff","text":"Use it on a new takeoff","level":2},{"id":"see-it-change-it-forget-it","text":"See it, change it, forget it","level":2},{"id":"with-your-assistant","text":"With your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-gets-remembered\"\u003EWhat gets remembered\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo start with your older work, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from a past takeoff…\u003C/span\u003E and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENames match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; and &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff\"\u003EUse it on a new takeoff\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the items of the new takeoff.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis takeoff\u003C/span\u003E you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job&#039;s rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse last\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse typical\u003C/span\u003E on one item, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice N unpriced items from memory\u003C/span\u003E to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach use is one step: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name&#039;s rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-it-change-it-forget-it\"\u003ESee it, change it, forget it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything remembered\u003C/span\u003E lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all prices\u003C/span\u003E forgets them all. Turn off \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemember my prices when I save a takeoff\u003C/span\u003E to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"with-your-assistant\"\u003EWith your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff&#039;s items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Prices on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model. What gets remembered When you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name. To start with your older work, choose Learn from a past takeoff… and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way. Names match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" and \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price. Use it on a new takeoff Make the items of the new takeoff. Choose Prices. Under This takeoff you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job's rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range. Choose Use last or Use typical on one item, or Price N unpriced items from memory to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job. Each use is one step: Ctrl+Z takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name's rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone. See it, change it, forget it Everything remembered lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; Clear all prices forgets them all. Turn off Remember my prices when I save a takeoff to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched. With your assistant If you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff's items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Provjeri zalihe dobavljača i rokove čekanja","summary":"Dodajte listu zaliha dobavljača (CSV ili tabelu) i TakeoffDesk provjerava šta predmjer traži, uključujući otpad, u odnosu na nju: ima li dovoljno na zalihi i koliko traje čekanje. Manjkovi i dugi rokovi prikazuju se u panelu Problemi.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["dobavljač","zalihe","na zalihi","rok čekanja","dostupnost","manjak","zaostatak narudžbe","lista narudžbe","csv","sku","prodavac","materijali","nabavka","problemi"],"headings":[{"id":"datoteka","text":"Datoteka","level":2},{"id":"provjera-predmjera","text":"Provjera predmjera","level":2},{"id":"tabelarne-datoteke-i-biblioteka-cijena","text":"Tabelarne datoteke i biblioteka cijena","level":2},{"id":"u-panelu-problemi","text":"U panelu Problemi","level":2},{"id":"sa-va-im-asistentom","text":"Sa vašim asistentom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENabavka\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci (kamion) provjerava šta vaš predmjer traži u odnosu na listu zaliha dobavljača. Redovi dobavljača koji su bitni čuvaju se u vlastitoj datoteci predmjera. Ništa se ne šalje nigdje i ništa ne pita dobavljača: vi donosite datoteku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"datoteka\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV datoteka sa redom zaglavlja. Treba joj kolona naziva ili SKU i kolona zaliha ili roka čekanja. Ova zaglavlja se prepoznaju (bilo kojim redom, bilo kojim velikim ili malim slovima): Item, Name, Description ili Product; SKU, Part ili Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ili Quantity; Lead time ili Delivery days; Unit ili UOM; Price ili Cost; Supplier ili Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaliha može biti broj (1,200), „In stock“ ili „Out of stock“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERok čekanja može biti „5 days“, „2 weeks“, „2-3 weeks“ (duži se koristi), „3 months“, „same day“ ili „backorder“. Obični broj je u jedinici zaglavlja (dani, osim ako zaglavlje kaže weeks ili months).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExcel datoteke se ne čitaju: prvo spasite list kao CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjera-predmjera\"\u003EProvjera predmjera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENabavka\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj datoteku dobavljača…\u003C/span\u003E i izaberite CSV. Dodajte više od jedne: do pet datoteka, ukupno se zadržava 2.000 redova, prvo oni koji odgovaraju vašim stavkama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESvaka stavka, drugi uslov i dio sklopa sa količinom uparuje se sa redom po nazivu, ili po SKU u njegovom nazivu. Sličan naziv (jedan unutar drugog) koristi se kada tačnog nema, i aplikacija to navodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠta predmjer traži\u003C/span\u003E prvo se prikazuju manjkajuće stavke: „Manjak 120 EA“, „Rok čekanja 21 dana“, „Na čekanju“, „Jedinica se razlikuje“, „Nema podatka o zalihi“ ili „Na zalihi“. Potreba uključuje otpad. Jedinica dobavljača koja nije jedinica procjene (tona umjesto stope) se prijavljuje i nikada se ne upoređuje. Svaki red ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi stavku\u003C/span\u003E, koji skače na stavku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPodesite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENajduži željeni rok čekanja (dana)\u003C/span\u003E (zadano 14). Stavka koja nije na zalihi i čeka duže od toga se označava, a sažetak navodi najduži rok čekanja koji je bitan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELista narudžbe (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E preuzima manjkajuće stavke sa iznosom manjka, dobavljačem i rokom čekanja. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzostavi\u003C/span\u003E uklanja potrebu iz provjere (to je korak poništavanja).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tabelarne-datoteke-i-biblioteka-cijena\"\u003ETabelarne datoteke i biblioteka cijena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELista dobavljača može biti Excel radna knjiga (.xlsx) kao i CSV: čita se prvi list, sa istim nazivima kolona. Formule se nikada ne izvršavaju; čita se vrijednost koju datoteka sadrži.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada se doda datoteka sa cijenama, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijene u biblioteku\u003C/span\u003E u dijalogu postavlja cijenu materijala za svaku stavku \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EBiblioteka\u003C/a\u003E koju datoteka cijeni: isti naziv i jedinica koja je ista (ili nije navedena). Rad, otpad, visina i sklopovi ostaju kakvi jesu, a napomena stavke navodi iz koje datoteke dolazi cijena. Stavka u metrima se ne cijeni iz liste u stopama, a stavka bez odgovarajućeg naziva ostaje netaknuta; statusni red kaže koliko je preskočeno zbog jedinice. Ponovo odredite cijene iz Biblioteke da biste nove cijene unijeli u ovaj predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-panelu-problemi\"\u003EU panelu Problemi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EManjak je upozorenje, a dug rok čekanja je napomena, u zajedničkom panelu Problemi („Zalihe dobavljača“), pa stoje uz svaku drugu provjeru. Možete prihvatiti jedno uz razlog, a prihvatanje se čuva u predmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sa-va-im-asistentom\"\u003ESa vašim asistentom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko dozvolite asistente u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E, mogu čitati provjeru (supply_check). Dodavanje datoteke dobavljača radite vi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPodaci o zalihama su aktuelni koliko i datoteka koju dodate. Ponovo dodajte datoteku da je osvježite: datoteka istog naziva zamjenjuje raniju.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nabavka na alatnoj traci (kamion) provjerava šta vaš predmjer traži u odnosu na listu zaliha dobavljača. Redovi dobavljača koji su bitni čuvaju se u vlastitoj datoteci predmjera. Ništa se ne šalje nigdje i ništa ne pita dobavljača: vi donosite datoteku. Datoteka CSV datoteka sa redom zaglavlja. Treba joj kolona naziva ili SKU i kolona zaliha ili roka čekanja. Ova zaglavlja se prepoznaju (bilo kojim redom, bilo kojim velikim ili malim slovima): Item, Name, Description ili Product; SKU, Part ili Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ili Quantity; Lead time ili Delivery days; Unit ili UOM; Price ili Cost; Supplier ili Vendor. Zaliha može biti broj (1,200), „In stock“ ili „Out of stock“. Rok čekanja može biti „5 days“, „2 weeks“, „2-3 weeks“ (duži se koristi), „3 months“, „same day“ ili „backorder“. Obični broj je u jedinici zaglavlja (dani, osim ako zaglavlje kaže weeks ili months). Excel datoteke se ne čitaju: prvo spasite list kao CSV. Provjera predmjera Izaberite Nabavka, zatim Dodaj datoteku dobavljača… i izaberite CSV. Dodajte više od jedne: do pet datoteka, ukupno se zadržava 2.000 redova, prvo oni koji odgovaraju vašim stavkama. Svaka stavka, drugi uslov i dio sklopa sa količinom uparuje se sa redom po nazivu, ili po SKU u njegovom nazivu. Sličan naziv (jedan unutar drugog) koristi se kada tačnog nema, i aplikacija to navodi. Pod Šta predmjer traži prvo se prikazuju manjkajuće stavke: „Manjak 120 EA“, „Rok čekanja 21 dana“, „Na čekanju“, „Jedinica se razlikuje“, „Nema podatka o zalihi“ ili „Na zalihi“. Potreba uključuje otpad. Jedinica dobavljača koja nije jedinica procjene (tona umjesto stope) se prijavljuje i nikada se ne upoređuje. Svaki red ima Odaberi stavku, koji skače na stavku. Podesite Najduži željeni rok čekanja (dana) (zadano 14). Stavka koja nije na zalihi i čeka duže od toga se označava, a sažetak navodi najduži rok čekanja koji je bitan. Lista narudžbe (CSV) preuzima manjkajuće stavke sa iznosom manjka, dobavljačem i rokom čekanja. Izostavi uklanja potrebu iz provjere (to je korak poništavanja). Tabelarne datoteke i biblioteka cijena Lista dobavljača može biti Excel radna knjiga (.xlsx) kao i CSV: čita se prvi list, sa istim nazivima kolona. Formule se nikada ne izvršavaju; čita se vrijednost koju datoteka sadrži. Kada se doda datoteka sa cijenama, Cijene u biblioteku u dijalogu postavlja cijenu materijala za svaku stavku Biblioteka koju datoteka cijeni: isti naziv i jedinica koja je ista (ili nije navedena). Rad, otpad, visina i sklopovi ostaju kakvi jesu, a napomena stavke navodi iz koje datoteke dolazi cijena. Stavka u metrima se ne cijeni iz liste u stopama, a stavka bez odgovarajućeg naziva ostaje netaknuta; statusni red kaže koliko je preskočeno zbog jedinice. Ponovo odredite cijene iz Biblioteke da biste nove cijene unijeli u ovaj predmjer. U panelu Problemi Manjak je upozorenje, a dug rok čekanja je napomena, u zajedničkom panelu Problemi („Zalihe dobavljača“), pa stoje uz svaku drugu provjeru. Možete prihvatiti jedno uz razlog, a prihvatanje se čuva u predmjeru. Sa vašim asistentom Ako dozvolite asistente u Postavke, mogu čitati provjeru (supply_check). Dodavanje datoteke dobavljača radite vi. Dobro je znati Podaci o zalihama su aktuelni koliko i datoteka koju dodate. Ponovo dodajte datoteku da je osvježite: datoteka istog naziva zamjenjuje raniju.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kopiraj, zalijepi i dupliciraj oznake","summary":"Kopirajte oznake sa stavkama, zalijepite ih gdje kliknete ili na istom mjestu na drugom listu, dupliciraj, izreži, izbriši i odaberi sve, svaki korak se može poništiti.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["kopiraj","zalijepi","izreži","dupliciraj","zalijepi na mjestu","međumemorija","odaberi sve","poništi odabir","više oznaka","tipičan sprat","ponovi","isti plan","drugi list","kopiraj stavku","dupliciraj stavku"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberite-oznake","text":"Odaberite oznake","level":2},{"id":"kopirajte-i-zalijepite-gdje-kliknete","text":"Kopirajte i zalijepite gdje kliknete","level":2},{"id":"zalijepi-na-mjestu","text":"Zalijepi na mjestu","level":2},{"id":"razmjera-mora-odgovarati","text":"Razmjera mora odgovarati","level":2},{"id":"dupliciraj","text":"Dupliciraj","level":2},{"id":"izre-i-i-izbri-i","text":"Izreži i izbriši","level":2},{"id":"kopirajte-stavku","text":"Kopirajte stavku","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGrupa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata sadrži \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E. Njen meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E sadrži ostalo, svaki sa svojim tasterom: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi na mjestu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi sve\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi odabir\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka od njih se poništava jednim korakom s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-oznake\"\u003EOdaberite oznake\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite oznaku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i kliknite još oznaka da ih dodate. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na odabranu oznaku je ponovo uklanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi sve\u003C/span\u003E) da odaberete svaku oznaku na otvorenom listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad je odabrano više oznaka, desni panel prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrane oznake\u003C/strong\u003E: koliko čega ima, s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznake\u003C/span\u003E. Ručke za uglove se pokazuju samo kad je odabrana jedna oznaka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi odabir\u003C/span\u003E) briše odabir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopirajte-i-zalijepite-gdje-kliknete\"\u003EKopirajte i zalijepite gdje kliknete\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite oznake i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E). Oznake se kopiraju sa svojim stavkama, uključujući sklop, otpad i troškove svake stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdite na list na koji ih želite (može biti i isti list).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E). Isprekidana kopija prati pokazivač.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite gdje ide. Sredina kopiranih oznaka se spušta na pokazivač.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E otkazuje i ne dodaje ništa. Zalijepljene oznake su nakon toga odabrane, pa ih \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovo uklanjaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU istom predmjeru, zalijepljene oznake idu na \u003Cstrong\u003Eiste stavke\u003C/strong\u003E, pa se njihove količine dodaju tim stavkama. U drugom predmjeru (drugi tab ili nakon \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovi\u003C/span\u003E), koristi se stavka istog naziva i tipa; inače se stavka dodaje sa svojim sklopom. Ako je naziv zauzet stavkom drugog tipa, dodana stavka se zove „(naziv) (kopija)”.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZalijepljene oznake idu u ponudnu cjelinu odabranu na vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E (ili ni u jednu). Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EPonudne cjeline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zalijepi-na-mjestu\"\u003EZalijepi na mjestu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi na mjestu\u003C/span\u003E) stavlja kopiju na tačno isto mjesto na otvorenom listu, po njenoj poziciji na stranici. Koristite to za tipičan sprat: označite nivo 2, kopirajte, otvorite nivo 3, zalijepite na mjestu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZalijepi na mjestu traži list iste veličine kao onaj s kojeg ste kopirali. Na listu druge veličine TakeoffDesk to kaže i ništa ne zalijepi; umjesto toga koristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E i kliknite. Na listu s kojeg ste kopirali, kopija ide preko originala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razmjera-mora-odgovarati\"\u003ERazmjera mora odgovarati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDužine i površine zavise od razmjere lista. Dionica koja mjeri 10&#039; pri 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; mjerila bi 20&#039; na listu pri 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Zato TakeoffDesk lijepi dionice i površine samo na list s \u003Cstrong\u003Eistom razmjerom\u003C/strong\u003E kao list s kojeg su došle, i to jasno kaže kad nije:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvoreni list još nema razmjeru: prvo mu je dajte (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje razmjere\u003C/a\u003E), pa zalijepite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvoreni list ima drugu razmjeru: poruka navodi obje razmjere. Zalijepite na list iste razmjere.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrojanja ne trebaju razmjeru: kopirana brojanja se lijepe bilo gdje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dupliciraj\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E) kopira odabrane oznake i odmah ih stavlja na pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide. Ništa se ne dodaje dok ne kliknete, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne ostavlja ništa. Dupliciraj ne mijenja ono što \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E lijepi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izre-i-i-izbri-i\"\u003EIzreži i izbriši\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E) kopira odabrane oznake i briše ih. Zalijepite ih tamo gdje pripadaju, ili poništite izrezivanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E) briše odabrane oznake bez kopiranja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopirajte-stavku\"\u003EKopirajte stavku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUređivač stavke (pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavke\u003C/strong\u003E) završava s:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E: kopira stavku sa sklopom, otpadom i troškovima, bez oznaka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E zatim dodaje njenu kopiju ovom predmjeru, ili drugom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E: odmah dodaje kopiju, nazvanu „(naziv) (kopija)”.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKopija ostaje na ovom računaru: čuva se u ovom tabu i u memoriji pregledača, pa je drugi TakeoffDesk tab može zalijepiti. Ništa se ne šalje na server, a sistemska međumemorija se ne koristi, pa oznake ne možete lijepiti u druge programe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKopija dolazi s jednog lista u jednom trenutku. Oznake se lijepe onakve kakve jesu: rotiranje ili preslikavanje kopije još nije podržano.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Grupa Uređivanje na traci alata sadrži Poništi, Ponovi, Kopiraj i Zalijepi. Njen meni Više sadrži ostalo, svaki sa svojim tasterom: Izreži, Kopiraj, Zalijepi, Zalijepi na mjestu, Dupliciraj, Izbriši, Odaberi sve i Poništi odabir. Svaka od njih se poništava jednim korakom s Ctrl+Z. Odaberite oznake Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite oznaku. Držite Shift i kliknite još oznaka da ih dodate. Shift + klik na odabranu oznaku je ponovo uklanja. Ili pritisnite Ctrl+A (Odaberi sve) da odaberete svaku oznaku na otvorenom listu. Kad je odabrano više oznaka, desni panel prikazuje Odabrane oznake: koliko čega ima, s Kopiraj, Dupliciraj, Izreži i Izbriši oznake. Ručke za uglove se pokazuju samo kad je odabrana jedna oznaka. Esc (Poništi odabir) briše odabir. Kopirajte i zalijepite gdje kliknete Odaberite oznake i pritisnite Ctrl+C (Kopiraj). Oznake se kopiraju sa svojim stavkama, uključujući sklop, otpad i troškove svake stavke. Idite na list na koji ih želite (može biti i isti list). Pritisnite Ctrl+V (Zalijepi). Isprekidana kopija prati pokazivač. Kliknite gdje ide. Sredina kopiranih oznaka se spušta na pokazivač. Esc otkazuje i ne dodaje ništa. Zalijepljene oznake su nakon toga odabrane, pa ih Delete ili Ctrl+Z ponovo uklanjaju. U istom predmjeru, zalijepljene oznake idu na iste stavke, pa se njihove količine dodaju tim stavkama. U drugom predmjeru (drugi tab ili nakon Novi), koristi se stavka istog naziva i tipa; inače se stavka dodaje sa svojim sklopom. Ako je naziv zauzet stavkom drugog tipa, dodana stavka se zove „(naziv) (kopija)”. Zalijepljene oznake idu u ponudnu cjelinu odabranu na vrhu panela Stavke (ili ni u jednu). Vidi Ponudne cjeline. Zalijepi na mjestu Ctrl+Shift+V (Zalijepi na mjestu) stavlja kopiju na tačno isto mjesto na otvorenom listu, po njenoj poziciji na stranici. Koristite to za tipičan sprat: označite nivo 2, kopirajte, otvorite nivo 3, zalijepite na mjestu. Zalijepi na mjestu traži list iste veličine kao onaj s kojeg ste kopirali. Na listu druge veličine TakeoffDesk to kaže i ništa ne zalijepi; umjesto toga koristite Zalijepi i kliknite. Na listu s kojeg ste kopirali, kopija ide preko originala. Razmjera mora odgovarati Dužine i površine zavise od razmjere lista. Dionica koja mjeri 10' pri 1/4\" = 1'-0\" mjerila bi 20' na listu pri 1/8\" = 1'-0\". Zato TakeoffDesk lijepi dionice i površine samo na list s istom razmjerom kao list s kojeg su došle, i to jasno kaže kad nije: Otvoreni list još nema razmjeru: prvo mu je dajte (Postavljanje razmjere), pa zalijepite. Otvoreni list ima drugu razmjeru: poruka navodi obje razmjere. Zalijepite na list iste razmjere. Brojanja ne trebaju razmjeru: kopirana brojanja se lijepe bilo gdje. Dupliciraj Ctrl+D (Dupliciraj) kopira odabrane oznake i odmah ih stavlja na pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide. Ništa se ne dodaje dok ne kliknete, a Esc ne ostavlja ništa. Dupliciraj ne mijenja ono što Zalijepi lijepi. Izreži i izbriši Ctrl+X (Izreži) kopira odabrane oznake i briše ih. Zalijepite ih tamo gdje pripadaju, ili poništite izrezivanje. Delete ili Backspace (Izbriši) briše odabrane oznake bez kopiranja. Kopirajte stavku Uređivač stavke (pod Stavke) završava s: Kopiraj stavku: kopira stavku sa sklopom, otpadom i troškovima, bez oznaka. Zalijepi zatim dodaje njenu kopiju ovom predmjeru, ili drugom. Dupliciraj stavku: odmah dodaje kopiju, nazvanu „(naziv) (kopija)”. Kopija ostaje na ovom računaru: čuva se u ovom tabu i u memoriji pregledača, pa je drugi TakeoffDesk tab može zalijepiti. Ništa se ne šalje na server, a sistemska međumemorija se ne koristi, pa oznake ne možete lijepiti u druge programe. Kopija dolazi s jednog lista u jednom trenutku. Oznake se lijepe onakve kakve jesu: rotiranje ili preslikavanje kopije još nije podržano.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ugrađeni ugljik i tabela cijena 5D","summary":"Ugljik zbraja ugrađeni ugljik predmjera iz količine svake stavke i otvorene tabele faktora, a stope predmjera šalje u BimCraft kao tabelu cijena za 5D troškove.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["ugljik","ugrađeni ugljik","kgco2e","co2","faktori","a1-a3","transport","otpad","5d","tabela cijena","trošak","bimcraft","epd"],"headings":[{"id":"ugra-eni-ugljik","text":"Ugrađeni ugljik","level":2},{"id":"tabela-cijena-za-5d-tro-kove","text":"Tabela cijena za 5D troškove","level":2},{"id":"sa-va-im-asistentom","text":"Sa vašim asistentom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgljik\u003C/span\u003E na traci s alatima zbraja ugrađeni ugljik onoga što ste izmjerili i pretvara vaše stope u tabelu cijena koju model zgrade može koristiti. To je procjena, a ne ocjena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ugra-eni-ugljik\"\u003EUgrađeni ugljik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličina svake stavke, sa njenim otpadom, množi se redom iz tabele faktora. Red se pronalazi po riječima iz naziva stavke (&quot;betonska ploča&quot; pronalazi red s ključnom riječju beton). Tabela je ista otvorena tabela koju koristi BimCraft, pa datoteka koju ovdje učitate radi i tamo. \u003Cstrong\u003ERedovi koji dolaze uz program su početne vrijednosti: generičke, neprovjerene i ne potiču ni iz jedne baze.\u003C/strong\u003E Dijalog to kaže uz brojke; zamijenite ih vlastitim izvorom prije nego što se oslonite na broj.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgljik\u003C/span\u003E. Prebrojane stavke navode se s njihovim vrijednostima u kilograms CO2e; ukupno je iznad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 transport\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 otpad na gradilištu\u003C/span\u003E da brojite i te faze, za redove koji daju vrijednost za njih. Faza proizvoda se uvijek broji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa za stavku koristite drugi red, ili nijedan, koristite spisak u njenom redu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaktori iz datoteke…\u003C/span\u003E učitava tabelu faktora (JSON ili CSV) napravljenu iz vašeg izvora; njeni redovi zamjenjuju početne redove s istim ID-em. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaktori (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E čuva vaše.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaktor je po meters, square meters, cubic meters, stavci ili kilogramu. Linija izmjerena u feet ili square feet se pretvara. Faktor u kilogramima treba zapreminu (cubic yards ili meters) i gustinu reda. Stavka čiji faktor treba količinu koju ne mjeri navodi se pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzostavljeno\u003C/span\u003E s razlogom, nikad se ne pogađa. Tekući zbir u statusnoj traci prikazuje istu brojku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaši redovi faktora, vaši izbori i faze koje brojite čuvaju se u datoteci predmjera.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tabela-cijena-za-5d-tro-kove\"\u003ETabela cijena za 5D troškove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijene 5D (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijene 5D (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E čuvaju stope predmjera kao tabelu cijena: jedan red po stavci s cijenom, s njenom stopom materijala i rada po jedinici i njenim otpadom. Učitajte je u panel troškova BimCraft-a (Ugrađeni ugljik i 5D trošak) da cijenite zadatke modela zgrade istim stopama koje su napravile ponudu. Stavke izmjerene u jedinici koju tabela nema, i stavke bez stope, izostavljaju se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sa-va-im-asistentom\"\u003ESa vašim asistentom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko u Postavkama dozvolite asistente, mogu čitati ugljik (carbon_check). Učitavanje faktora radite vi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENišta se nigdje ne šalje. Brojke su samo onoliko dobre koliko su faktori koje učitate.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ugljik na traci s alatima zbraja ugrađeni ugljik onoga što ste izmjerili i pretvara vaše stope u tabelu cijena koju model zgrade može koristiti. To je procjena, a ne ocjena. Ugrađeni ugljik Količina svake stavke, sa njenim otpadom, množi se redom iz tabele faktora. Red se pronalazi po riječima iz naziva stavke (\"betonska ploča\" pronalazi red s ključnom riječju beton). Tabela je ista otvorena tabela koju koristi BimCraft, pa datoteka koju ovdje učitate radi i tamo. Redovi koji dolaze uz program su početne vrijednosti: generičke, neprovjerene i ne potiču ni iz jedne baze. Dijalog to kaže uz brojke; zamijenite ih vlastitim izvorom prije nego što se oslonite na broj. Izaberite Ugljik. Prebrojane stavke navode se s njihovim vrijednostima u kilograms CO2e; ukupno je iznad. Označite A4 transport ili A5 otpad na gradilištu da brojite i te faze, za redove koji daju vrijednost za njih. Faza proizvoda se uvijek broji. Da za stavku koristite drugi red, ili nijedan, koristite spisak u njenom redu. Faktori iz datoteke… učitava tabelu faktora (JSON ili CSV) napravljenu iz vašeg izvora; njeni redovi zamjenjuju početne redove s istim ID-em. Faktori (JSON) čuva vaše. Faktor je po meters, square meters, cubic meters, stavci ili kilogramu. Linija izmjerena u feet ili square feet se pretvara. Faktor u kilogramima treba zapreminu (cubic yards ili meters) i gustinu reda. Stavka čiji faktor treba količinu koju ne mjeri navodi se pod Izostavljeno s razlogom, nikad se ne pogađa. Tekući zbir u statusnoj traci prikazuje istu brojku. Vaši redovi faktora, vaši izbori i faze koje brojite čuvaju se u datoteci predmjera. Tabela cijena za 5D troškove Cijene 5D (JSON) i Cijene 5D (CSV) čuvaju stope predmjera kao tabelu cijena: jedan red po stavci s cijenom, s njenom stopom materijala i rada po jedinici i njenim otpadom. Učitajte je u panel troškova BimCraft-a (Ugrađeni ugljik i 5D trošak) da cijenite zadatke modela zgrade istim stopama koje su napravile ponudu. Stavke izmjerene u jedinici koju tabela nema, i stavke bez stope, izostavljaju se. Sa vašim asistentom Ako u Postavkama dozvolite asistente, mogu čitati ugljik (carbon_check). Učitavanje faktora radite vi. Dobro je znati Ništa se nigdje ne šalje. Brojke su samo onoliko dobre koliko su faktori koje učitate.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uvezi specifikaciju oznaka kao količine","summary":"Specifikacija oznaka izvezena iz modela zgrade (CSV) postaje tipizirane količine u predmjeru, jedna po oznaci, pa se brojevi i površine iz modela nalaze uz ono što ste izmjerili.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["oznake","specifikacija oznaka","model zgrade","bimcraft","ifc","količine","csv","specifikacija","uvoz","tipizirana količina"],"headings":[{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznake\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci uvozi specifikaciju oznaka koju je BimCraft sačuvao kao CSV datoteku. Svaka različita oznaka postaje tipizirana količina, iste vrste kakve postaju iskop i nasip iz CivilCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU BimCraft napravite specifikaciju oznaka koju želite i spasite je kao CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznake\u003C/span\u003E i izaberite datoteku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENavedite koja kolona imenuje red (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenuj red prema\u003C/span\u003E, obično oznaka) i koja sadrži broj (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličina iz\u003C/span\u003E). Sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji redove\u003C/span\u003E svaki red se računa kao jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite jedinicu. Dužina u milimetrima postaje metri sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomnoži sa\u003C/span\u003E 0.001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj količine\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedovi sa istom oznakom se zbrajaju. Ćelija koja nije broj se izostavlja i broji se u sažetku. Ponovni uvoz iste specifikacije ažurira količine koje već imate umjesto da dodaje nove; njihovi nazivi, jedinične cijene i otpad ostaju vaši.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipizirana količina se ne mjeri na listu, pa nema oznaka. Ništa se ne šalje nigdje; datoteka se čita ovdje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Oznake na alatnoj traci uvozi specifikaciju oznaka koju je BimCraft sačuvao kao CSV datoteku. Svaka različita oznaka postaje tipizirana količina, iste vrste kakve postaju iskop i nasip iz CivilCraft. U BimCraft napravite specifikaciju oznaka koju želite i spasite je kao CSV. Izaberite Oznake i izaberite datoteku. Navedite koja kolona imenuje red (Imenuj red prema, obično oznaka) i koja sadrži broj (Količina iz). Sa Broji redove svaki red se računa kao jedan. Izaberite jedinicu. Dužina u milimetrima postaje metri sa Pomnoži sa 0.001. Dodaj količine. Redovi sa istom oznakom se zbrajaju. Ćelija koja nije broj se izostavlja i broji se u sažetku. Ponovni uvoz iste specifikacije ažurira količine koje već imate umjesto da dodaje nove; njihovi nazivi, jedinične cijene i otpad ostaju vaši. Dobro je znati Tipizirana količina se ne mjeri na listu, pa nema oznaka. Ništa se ne šalje nigdje; datoteka se čita ovdje.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sklopovi i formule","summary":"Dodajte komponente stavci i pustite formule da pretvore njenu dužinu, površinu ili broj u stubove, podrmice, ploče, beton i okov, uz primjer zida.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["sklop","komponente","formula","stubovi","gips-karton","ploče","podrmice","beton","cubic yards","okov","recept","tipično","dijelovi stavke"],"headings":[{"id":"varijable-koje-mo-ete-koristiti","text":"Varijable koje možete koristiti","level":2},{"id":"primjer-unutra-nji-zid","text":"Primjer: unutrašnji zid","level":2},{"id":"jo-formula","text":"Još formula","level":2},{"id":"kada-je-formula-pogre-na","text":"Kada je formula pogrešna","level":2},{"id":"ograni-enja","text":"Ograničenja","level":2},{"id":"uklanjanje-komponente","text":"Uklanjanje komponente","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESklop\u003C/strong\u003E stavke je popis komponenti, a svaka ima svoju formulu količine te vlastiti otpad i stope. Formula koristi izmjerene ukupne vrijednosti stavke, pa jedno mjerenje zida daje stubove, podrmice i ploče odjednom, a one se ažuriraju dok mjerite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varijable-koje-mo-ete-koristiti\"\u003EVarijable koje možete koristiti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVarijable\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E dužina, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E visina, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E površina zida (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj trasa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršinska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E površina, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E obim (kontura + izrezi), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E dubina ili debljina, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj površina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVrijednosti su u jedinicama same stavke: feet i square feet za stavke LF i SF, meters i square meters za stavke m i m². Za stavku SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je u square yards, dok \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ostaju u feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormule koriste \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (ili × ÷), zagrade, brojeve i funkcije \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. Potpuna pravila su u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"primjer-unutra-nji-zid\"\u003EPrimjer: unutrašnji zid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERecimo da ste predmjerili \u003Cstrong\u003EUnutrašnji zid tip A\u003C/strong\u003E kao linijsku stavku: 4 trase ukupno 120 LF, uz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E postavljenu na \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Njegove \u003Cstrong\u003Eizmjerene\u003C/strong\u003E vrijednosti su L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF zida, jedna strana).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklop\u003C/span\u003E, izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj komponentu\u003C/span\u003E. Pojavljuje se komponenta pod nazivom &quot;Komponenta&quot;, s formulom \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E i rezultatom ispod.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite \u003Ccode\u003EStubovi na 16 inches o.c.\u003C/code\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormula količine\u003C/span\u003E, upišite \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat se ažurira dok kucate: &quot;= 94 EA&quot;. To je jedan stub na svakih 16 inches duž 120 feet (90), plus jedan dodatni da zatvori svaku od 4 trase.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPonovo izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj komponentu\u003C/span\u003E za podrmice: naziv \u003Ccode\u003EPodrmice gore i dolje\u003C/code\u003E, jedinica \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDodajte ploče: naziv \u003Ccode\u003EGips-karton 4x8, s obje strane\u003C/code\u003E, jedinica \u003Ccode\u003Elistovi\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat: 68 listova (2,160 SF ploča ÷ 32 SF po listu = 67.5, zaokruženo naviše).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPopunite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtpad %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterijal $\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERad $\u003C/span\u003E za svaku komponentu. Svaka komponenta dobija svoj red ispod stavke u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E, cijenjen kao stavka, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkupno za posao\u003C/span\u003E je uključuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko je cijena zida u potpunosti u komponentama, ostavite vlastite stope materijala i rada stavke na 0, inače se računa dvaput.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtpad se primjenjuje nakon formule i nije zaokružen: 68 listova uz 10% otpada iznosi 74.8 listova. Da naručite cijele listove, stavite otpad unutar formule, npr. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, i ostavite otpad komponente na 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jo-formula\"\u003EJoš formula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStavka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFormula\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStubovi na 24 inches od osi do osi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzolacioni paneli, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoja, s obje strane, gallons na 350 SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKartoni pločica na 15 SF, 10% viška\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršinska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodna ili rubna letvica, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršinska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeton, cubic yards\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršinska s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeton zaokružen naviše na quarter yard\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršinska s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EŠarke, tri po vratima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajmanje jedna kutija, jedna na 12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kada-je-formula-pogre-na\"\u003EKada je formula pogrešna\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERed ispod formule pretvara se u poruku o grešci, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;X&quot; nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristite L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003ENedostaje &quot;)&quot;.\u003C/code\u003E Komponenta tada nema količine, njen red u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje &quot;Greška u formuli: …&quot;, a zaglavlje kaže &quot;Nepotpuno: 1 greška u formuli (nije u ukupnim vrijednostima)&quot;. Ispravite formulu i ukupne vrijednosti se ažuriraju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula koja dijeli nulom je također greška (&quot;Formula dijeli sa nulom.&quot;), na primjer \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E na stavci bez dubine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ograni-enja\"\u003EOgraničenja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFormule se računaju na \u003Cstrong\u003Eukupnim vrijednostima\u003C/strong\u003E stavke, a ne trasu po trasu. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E dodaje jedan stub po trasi; zaokruživanje po trasi još nije dostupno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFormula može koristiti samo varijable svoje stavke, a ne varijable druge stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo 50 komponenti po stavci, 500 znakova po formuli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uklanjanje-komponente\"\u003EUklanjanje komponente\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni komponentu\u003C/span\u003E ispod nje. Možete je poništiti sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sklop stavke je popis komponenti, a svaka ima svoju formulu količine te vlastiti otpad i stope. Formula koristi izmjerene ukupne vrijednosti stavke, pa jedno mjerenje zida daje stubove, podrmice i ploče odjednom, a one se ažuriraju dok mjerite. Varijable koje možete koristiti Vrsta stavke Varijable Linijska L dužina, H visina, A površina zida (L × H), N broj trasa Površinska A površina, P obim (kontura + izrezi), H dubina ili debljina, N broj površina Brojana N broj Vrijednosti su u jedinicama same stavke: feet i square feet za stavke LF i SF, meters i square meters za stavke m i m². Za stavku SY, A je u square yards, dok P i H ostaju u feet. Formule koriste + - * / (ili × ÷), zagrade, brojeve i funkcije ceil, floor, round, min, max i abs. Potpuna pravila su u Jezik formula. Primjer: unutrašnji zid Recimo da ste predmjerili Unutrašnji zid tip A kao linijsku stavku: 4 trase ukupno 120 LF, uz Visina postavljenu na 9'-0\". Njegove izmjerene vrijednosti su L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF zida, jedna strana). Odaberite stavku pod Stavke. U Sklop, izaberite Dodaj komponentu. Pojavljuje se komponenta pod nazivom \"Komponenta\", s formulom L i rezultatom ispod. Upišite Stubovi na 16 inches o.c. u Naziv i EA u Jedinica. U Formula količine, upišite ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. Rezultat se ažurira dok kucate: \"= 94 EA\". To je jedan stub na svakih 16 inches duž 120 feet (90), plus jedan dodatni da zatvori svaku od 4 trase. Ponovo izaberite Dodaj komponentu za podrmice: naziv Podrmice gore i dolje, jedinica LF, formula L * 2. Rezultat: 240 LF. Dodajte ploče: naziv Gips-karton 4x8, s obje strane, jedinica listovi, formula ceil(A * 2 / 32). Rezultat: 68 listova (2,160 SF ploča ÷ 32 SF po listu = 67.5, zaokruženo naviše). Popunite Otpad %, Materijal $ i Rad $ za svaku komponentu. Svaka komponenta dobija svoj red ispod stavke u Količine, cijenjen kao stavka, a Ukupno za posao je uključuje. Ako je cijena zida u potpunosti u komponentama, ostavite vlastite stope materijala i rada stavke na 0, inače se računa dvaput. Otpad se primjenjuje nakon formule i nije zaokružen: 68 listova uz 10% otpada iznosi 74.8 listova. Da naručite cijele listove, stavite otpad unutar formule, npr. ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), i ostavite otpad komponente na 0. Još formula Šta Stavka Formula Stubovi na 24 inches od osi do osi Linijska ceil(L / 2) + N Izolacioni paneli, SF Linijska s visinom A Boja, s obje strane, gallons na 350 SF Linijska s visinom ceil(A * 2 / 350) Kartoni pločica na 15 SF, 10% viška Površinska ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Podna ili rubna letvica, LF Površinska P Beton, cubic yards Površinska s dubinom A * H / 27 Beton zaokružen naviše na quarter yard Površinska s dubinom ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Šarke, tri po vratima Brojana N * 3 Najmanje jedna kutija, jedna na 12 Brojana max(1, ceil(N / 12)) Kada je formula pogrešna Red ispod formule pretvara se u poruku o grešci, na primjer \"X\" nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristite L, H, A, N. ili Nedostaje \")\". Komponenta tada nema količine, njen red u Količine prikazuje \"Greška u formuli: …\", a zaglavlje kaže \"Nepotpuno: 1 greška u formuli (nije u ukupnim vrijednostima)\". Ispravite formulu i ukupne vrijednosti se ažuriraju. Formula koja dijeli nulom je također greška (\"Formula dijeli sa nulom.\"), na primjer A / H na stavci bez dubine. Ograničenja Formule se računaju na ukupnim vrijednostima stavke, a ne trasu po trasu. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N dodaje jedan stub po trasi; zaokruživanje po trasi još nije dostupno. Formula može koristiti samo varijable svoje stavke, a ne varijable druge stavke. Do 50 komponenti po stavci, 500 znakova po formuli. Uklanjanje komponente Izaberite Ukloni komponentu ispod nje. Možete je poništiti sa Ctrl+Z.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Biblioteka cijena","summary":"Čuvajte stavke, stope i sklopove u biblioteci, uvezite je iz CSV-a ili ranije procjene, dodajte stavke iz nje u bilo koji predmjer i ažurirajte cijene predmjera iz nje.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["biblioteka","paketi za struku","cjenovnik","knjiga cijena","baza troškova","uvoz CSV","stope","sklopovi","ponovna upotreba","šablon stavke","ažuriranje cijena","ponovno određivanje cijena"],"headings":[{"id":"punite-biblioteku","text":"Punite biblioteku","level":2},{"id":"koristite-je-u-predmjeru","text":"Koristite je u predmjeru","level":2},{"id":"kolone-csv-a","text":"Kolone CSV-a","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBiblioteka cijena\u003C/strong\u003E čuva stavke koje koristite iz posla u posao: njihov tip, jedinicu, visinu, otpad, stope za materijal i rad, i njihov sklop. Čuva se u ovom pregledniku, odvojeno od svakog predmjera, pa je može koristiti svaki predmjer koji otvorite ovdje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite je pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"punite-biblioteku\"\u003EPunite biblioteku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport CSV…\u003C/span\u003E čita tabelu sačuvanu kao CSV (vidi kolone ispod). Stavke čiji su naziv i tip već u biblioteci se zamjenjuju; ostale se dodaju. Redovi koje ne može pročitati se preskaču, a program kaže koji su i zašto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd this takeoff&#039;s items\u003C/span\u003E kopira svaku stavku otvorenog predmjera u biblioteku, sa njenim stopama i sklopom (ne sa oznakama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV procjene koju TakeoffDesk izvozi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EIzvoz procjene\u003C/a\u003E) uvozi se kakav jeste: cijene posljednjeg posla služe kao polazna tačka za sljedeći.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrade packs…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje besplatne sklopove za struku, kao što su gips-karton, elektro ili beton, bez cijena. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EPaketi za struku\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport CSV\u003C/span\u003E čuva biblioteku kao CSV, da zadržite kopiju, da je uredite u tabelarnom programu ili da je date kolegi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E je isprazni (kliknite dvaput).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiblioteka živi u memoriji ovog preglednika. Drugi preglednik, drugi računar ili privatni prozor imaju svoju (ili nijednu). Izvezite je da je premjestite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristite-je-u-predmjeru\"\u003EKoristite je u predmjeru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite stavke (ukucajte u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind in the library\u003C/span\u003E da suzite listu) i izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to takeoff\u003C/span\u003E. Dodaju se sa svojim sklopovima u jednom koraku koji \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E poništava. Naziv koji već postoji u predmjeru dobija broj, kao \u003Ccode\u003ETepih (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate prices\u003C/span\u003E daje stavkama predmjera otpad i stope iz biblioteke, za svaku stavku čiji se naziv i tip podudaraju sa stavkom iz biblioteke, i isto za komponente sklopa istog naziva. Visine, jedinice i formule ostaju kakve jesu. Jedno \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća sve stare cijene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kolone-csv-a\"\u003EKolone CSV-a\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrvi red imenuje kolone, bilo kojim redom; ostale kolone se ignorišu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta ide u nju\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (or Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke. Obavezno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area ili Count (LF, SF i EA također rade). Ako je prazno, odlučuje jedinica.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA. Prazno: uobičajena jedinica tipa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStope poput \u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (or Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E, ili \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E za metričke jedinice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERed sa nazivom komponente (ili tipom \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) je dio sklopa stavke iznad njega. Njegova jedinica, otpad i stope su njegovi; njegova formula koristi slova stavke, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nPregradni zid tip A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Podkonstrukcija 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nVCT podna obloga,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nDupleks utičnice,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZarezi, tačke sa zarezom ili tabulatori između kolona – svi rade.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Biblioteka cijena čuva stavke koje koristite iz posla u posao: njihov tip, jedinicu, visinu, otpad, stope za materijal i rad, i njihov sklop. Čuva se u ovom pregledniku, odvojeno od svakog predmjera, pa je može koristiti svaki predmjer koji otvorite ovdje. Otvorite je pomoću Library na vrhu panela Items. Punite biblioteku Import CSV… čita tabelu sačuvanu kao CSV (vidi kolone ispod). Stavke čiji su naziv i tip već u biblioteci se zamjenjuju; ostale se dodaju. Redovi koje ne može pročitati se preskaču, a program kaže koji su i zašto. Add this takeoff's items kopira svaku stavku otvorenog predmjera u biblioteku, sa njenim stopama i sklopom (ne sa oznakama). CSV procjene koju TakeoffDesk izvozi (Izvoz procjene) uvozi se kakav jeste: cijene posljednjeg posla služe kao polazna tačka za sljedeći. Trade packs… dodaje besplatne sklopove za struku, kao što su gips-karton, elektro ili beton, bez cijena. Vidi Paketi za struku. Export CSV čuva biblioteku kao CSV, da zadržite kopiju, da je uredite u tabelarnom programu ili da je date kolegi. Clear je isprazni (kliknite dvaput). Biblioteka živi u memoriji ovog preglednika. Drugi preglednik, drugi računar ili privatni prozor imaju svoju (ili nijednu). Izvezite je da je premjestite. Koristite je u predmjeru Označite stavke (ukucajte u Find in the library da suzite listu) i izaberite Add to takeoff. Dodaju se sa svojim sklopovima u jednom koraku koji Ctrl+Z poništava. Naziv koji već postoji u predmjeru dobija broj, kao Tepih (2). Update prices daje stavkama predmjera otpad i stope iz biblioteke, za svaku stavku čiji se naziv i tip podudaraju sa stavkom iz biblioteke, i isto za komponente sklopa istog naziva. Visine, jedinice i formule ostaju kakve jesu. Jedno Ctrl+Z vraća sve stare cijene. Kolone CSV-a Prvi red imenuje kolone, bilo kojim redom; ostale kolone se ignorišu. Kolona Šta ide u nju Item (or Name) Naziv stavke. Obavezno. Type Linear, Area ili Count (LF, SF i EA također rade). Ako je prazno, odlučuje jedinica. Unit LF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA. Prazno: uobičajena jedinica tipa. Waste % 10 ili 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit Stope poput 2.10 ili $1,250. Height (or Depth) 9'-0\", 9, ili 2.7 za metričke jedinice. Component, Formula Red sa nazivom komponente (ili tipom Component) je dio sklopa stavke iznad njega. Njegova jedinica, otpad i stope su njegovi; njegova formula koristi slova stavke, vidi Sklopovi i formule. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Pregradni zid tip A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Podkonstrukcija 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N VCT podna obloga,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Dupleks utičnice,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Zarezi, tačke sa zarezom ili tabulatori između kolona – svi rade.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Paketi za struku","summary":"Dodajte besplatne sklopove za struku u biblioteku cijena, uklonite ih u jednom koraku i podijelite vlastitu biblioteku kao paket.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["paket za struku","paket","sklopovi","šabloni","početne stavke","električni","gips-karton","konstrukcija","bojenje","beton","podovi","zidarski","krovni radovi","fasadna obloga","stolarija","vodoinstalacije","grijanje i ventilacija","izolacija","uređenje okoliša","terasa","glavni izvođač","csi","masterformat","cc0","dodaj","ukloni","podijeli"],"headings":[{"id":"dodaj-paket","text":"Dodaj paket","level":2},{"id":"ukloni-paket","text":"Ukloni paket","level":2},{"id":"ta-je-u-paketu","text":"Šta je u paketu","level":2},{"id":"podijelite-svoju-biblioteku-kao-paket","text":"Podijelite svoju biblioteku kao paket","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaket za struku\u003C/strong\u003E je skup gotovih stavki za jednu struku: svaka sa svojom jedinicom, visinom ili dubinom, otpadom i svojim \u003Cstrong\u003Esklopom\u003C/strong\u003E, dijelovima i formulama koje pretvaraju izmjerenu dionicu, površinu ili broj u materijale. Gips-karton pregrada, na primjer, donosi svoje vodilice, podužnice, ploče, vijke, traku i masu za glet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaketi se dodaju u vašu \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Ecjenovnu biblioteku\u003C/a\u003E, a odatle dodajete njihove stavke u bilo koji predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodaj-paket\"\u003EDodaj paket\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiblioteka\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaketi za struku…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E: imperijalne (LF, SF), metričke (m, m²) ili obje. Svaki sklop dolazi u oba sistema.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E pored paketa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavke paketa se pojavljuju u biblioteci, označene nazivom paketa. Za korištenje označite ih u biblioteci i izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u predmjer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaket ne donosi cijene.\u003C/strong\u003E Njegove stavke u biblioteci pokazuju „postavite svoju cijenu“. Cijene su vaše: upišite ih u biblioteci ili u uređivaču stavke, ili uvezite svoj cjenovnik kao CSV i koristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAžuriraj cijene\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko već imate stavku istog naziva i tipa u biblioteci, paket ostavlja vašu nepromijenjenu. Ponovno dodavanje paketa zamjenjuje njegove stavke novom verzijom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukloni-paket\"\u003EUkloni paket\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaketi za struku…\u003C/span\u003E izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni\u003C/span\u003E pored paketa koji ste dodali, zatim još jednom za potvrdu. Svaka stavka koja je došla iz njega napušta biblioteku u jednom koraku. Stavke koje ste već dodali u predmjer ostaju u tom predmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-je-u-paketu\"\u003EŠta je u paketu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvori i detalji\u003C/span\u003E ispod paketa da vidite iz čega je svaki sklop napisan: građevinski propisi, standardi i uputstva za ugradnju strukovnih udruženja. U biblioteci zadržite pokazivač na stavci da pročitate njene izvore i pretpostavke, kao što su razmak profila ili potrošnja boje. Provjerite ih u odnosu na vaš posao i tehničke listove vaših proizvoda, i promijenite formule gdje se razlikuju (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki paket je označen sa \u003Cstrong\u003EPočetni: još nije pregledao procjenitelj\u003C/strong\u003E dok ga radni procjenitelji ne pregledaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka stavka također nosi svoj broj CSI MasterFormat, kao što je \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"podijelite-svoju-biblioteku-kao-paket\"\u003EPodijelite svoju biblioteku kao paket\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi kao paket…\u003C/span\u003E u biblioteci čuva je kao datoteku paketa (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) koju svako može dodati sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori datoteku paketa…\u003C/span\u003E. Podrazumijevano izostavlja stavke koje su došle iz paketa koje ste dodali, i ne nosi cijene. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUključi moje stope kao primjerne stope\u003C/span\u003E da pošaljete i svoje cijene: one idu označene regijom i datumom koje navedete, a onaj ko doda paket bira hoće li ih koristiti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteke paketa su običan podatak, nikada programi. TakeoffDesk provjerava svaki dio prije upotrebe i izostavlja sve što ne može pročitati.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Paket za struku je skup gotovih stavki za jednu struku: svaka sa svojom jedinicom, visinom ili dubinom, otpadom i svojim sklopom, dijelovima i formulama koje pretvaraju izmjerenu dionicu, površinu ili broj u materijale. Gips-karton pregrada, na primjer, donosi svoje vodilice, podužnice, ploče, vijke, traku i masu za glet. Paketi se dodaju u vašu cjenovnu biblioteku, a odatle dodajete njihove stavke u bilo koji predmjer. Dodaj paket Otvorite Biblioteka na vrhu panela Stavke, zatim Paketi za struku…. Izaberite Jedinice: imperijalne (LF, SF), metričke (m, m²) ili obje. Svaki sklop dolazi u oba sistema. Izaberite Dodaj pored paketa. Stavke paketa se pojavljuju u biblioteci, označene nazivom paketa. Za korištenje označite ih u biblioteci i izaberite Dodaj u predmjer. Paket ne donosi cijene. Njegove stavke u biblioteci pokazuju „postavite svoju cijenu“. Cijene su vaše: upišite ih u biblioteci ili u uređivaču stavke, ili uvezite svoj cjenovnik kao CSV i koristite Ažuriraj cijene. Ako već imate stavku istog naziva i tipa u biblioteci, paket ostavlja vašu nepromijenjenu. Ponovno dodavanje paketa zamjenjuje njegove stavke novom verzijom. Ukloni paket U Paketi za struku… izaberite Ukloni pored paketa koji ste dodali, zatim još jednom za potvrdu. Svaka stavka koja je došla iz njega napušta biblioteku u jednom koraku. Stavke koje ste već dodali u predmjer ostaju u tom predmjeru. Šta je u paketu Izaberite Izvori i detalji ispod paketa da vidite iz čega je svaki sklop napisan: građevinski propisi, standardi i uputstva za ugradnju strukovnih udruženja. U biblioteci zadržite pokazivač na stavci da pročitate njene izvore i pretpostavke, kao što su razmak profila ili potrošnja boje. Provjerite ih u odnosu na vaš posao i tehničke listove vaših proizvoda, i promijenite formule gdje se razlikuju (vidi Sklopovi i formule). Svaki paket je označen sa Početni: još nije pregledao procjenitelj dok ga radni procjenitelji ne pregledaju. Svaka stavka također nosi svoj broj CSI MasterFormat, kao što je 09 21 16. Podijelite svoju biblioteku kao paket Izvezi kao paket… u biblioteci čuva je kao datoteku paketa (.ccpack.json) koju svako može dodati sa Otvori datoteku paketa…. Podrazumijevano izostavlja stavke koje su došle iz paketa koje ste dodali, i ne nosi cijene. Označite Uključi moje stope kao primjerne stope da pošaljete i svoje cijene: one idu označene regijom i datumom koje navedete, a onaj ko doda paket bira hoće li ih koristiti. Datoteke paketa su običan podatak, nikada programi. TakeoffDesk provjerava svaki dio prije upotrebe i izostavlja sve što ne može pročitati.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Zemljani radovi i kote tačaka","summary":"Označi kote tačaka na situacionom planu, predaj ih aplikaciji CivilCraft za površ terena te iskop i nasip, a ovdje uzmi jednostavne količine iskopa.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["zemljani radovi","iskop","iskop","nasip","iskop i nasip","nivelacija","kota tačke","kote","topo","površ","triangulacija","civilcraft","tačke","pnezd","rov"],"headings":[{"id":"jednostavan-iskop-ovdje","text":"Jednostavan iskop ovdje","level":2},{"id":"kote-ta-aka-za-civilcraft","text":"Kote tačaka za CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"iskop-i-nasip-iz-civilcraft-a","text":"Iskop i nasip iz CivilCraft-a","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk mjeri ono što je nacrtano na listu. Zemljani radovi zahtijevaju površ terena, pa se dijele s aplikacijom CivilCraft, koja gradi površi od tačaka, nivelira ih i računa iskop, nasip i odvoz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jednostavan-iskop-ovdje\"\u003EJednostavan iskop ovdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa tlocrt iskopan do jedne dubine dovoljna je stavka površine s \u003Cstrong\u003Edubinom\u003C/strong\u003E: zapremina je površina × dubina. Opći izvođač ima \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Epaket za izvođača\u003C/a\u003E sa stavkom za masovni iskop (zapremina u tlu, rastresita zapremina i broj kamiona) i stavkom za komunalni rov (iskop, posteljica i zatrpavanje po dužini i dubini).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kote-ta-aka-za-civilcraft\"\u003EKote tačaka za CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavi razmjeru situacionog lista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravi stavku \u003Cstrong\u003EBrojanje\u003C/strong\u003E, na primjer &quot;Postojeći teren&quot;, i klikni svaku kotu tačke na listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberi oznaku i upiši njenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E u panel Odabrana oznaka: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Negativne i nulte kote su u redu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E i izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpot elevations\u003C/span\u003E. Dobijaš datoteku tačaka (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) s kolonama Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation i Description, jedan red po označenoj tački otvorenog lista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori tu datoteku u aplikaciji CivilCraft (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003EUvoz tačaka\u003C/a\u003E). Ona iz tačaka gradi površ (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EIzrada površi\u003C/a\u003E); odatle upoređuje površi i daje iskop i nasip (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EZapremine\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESjever (northing) i istok (easting) su sopstvene koordinate lista u stopama, mjerene od ugla stranice po njenoj razmjeri: razmaci i zapremine između tačaka su tačni, ali nisu koordinate geodetskog snimanja tvoje lokacije. Kada ih trebaš, prebaci ih na koordinate lokacije u aplikaciji CivilCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETačke s različitih listova nemaju zajedničke koordinate, pa izvoz uzima samo otvoreni list. Kote se spašavaju s predmjerom i prenose kopiranjem i lijepljenjem.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iskop-i-nasip-iz-civilcraft-a\"\u003EIskop i nasip iz CivilCraft-a\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZemljani radovi iz aplikacije CivilCraft vraćaju se kao dvije stavke koje možeš cijeniti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU aplikaciji CivilCraft nivelira podloge i koridore, pa izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend to TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EZapremine zemljanih radova\u003C/a\u003E). Sprema se datoteka količina (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU TakeoffDesk-u otvori je s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E ili je prevuci na aplikaciju. Predmjer ostaje otvoren: datoteka dodaje \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi: iskop\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi: nasip\u003C/strong\u003E kao \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Eunesene količine\u003C/a\u003E u kubnim jardama (CY) za projekat u stopama, ili u kubnim metrima (m³) za projekat u metrima. To je jedan korak: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga poništava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreimenuj ih, postavi otpad, cijene i sklopove kako želiš.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada se projekat promijeni, ponovo pošalji iz aplikacije CivilCraft i otvori novu datoteku: iste dvije stavke dobiju nove količine. Njihova imena, cijene, otpad i sklopovi ostaju onako kako su postavljeni. Ako se jedinica projekta promijenila, statusna traka to kaže: provjeri cijene. Datoteka iz drugog projekta aplikacije CivilCraft dodaje svoje dvije stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličine su zapremine u tlu, kako ih je CivilCraft izmjerio (metoda mreže): bez skupljanja ili nabrekavanja. Dodaj ih kao otpad ili formulom poput \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E za rastresitu zapreminu. Uređivač stavke pokazuje odakle je svaka došla i kada; kolona napomena u predračunu to također navodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka količina je običan JSON (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), pa skripta ili drugi program može također napisati jednu: naziv aplikacije, projekat i stavke s ključem, imenom, jedinicom i količinom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk mjeri ono što je nacrtano na listu. Zemljani radovi zahtijevaju površ terena, pa se dijele s aplikacijom CivilCraft, koja gradi površi od tačaka, nivelira ih i računa iskop, nasip i odvoz. Jednostavan iskop ovdje Za tlocrt iskopan do jedne dubine dovoljna je stavka površine s dubinom: zapremina je površina × dubina. Opći izvođač ima paket za izvođača sa stavkom za masovni iskop (zapremina u tlu, rastresita zapremina i broj kamiona) i stavkom za komunalni rov (iskop, posteljica i zatrpavanje po dužini i dubini). Kote tačaka za CivilCraft Postavi razmjeru situacionog lista. Napravi stavku Brojanje, na primjer \"Postojeći teren\", i klikni svaku kotu tačke na listu. Izaberi oznaku i upiši njenu Elevation u panel Odabrana oznaka: 102.5, 102'-6\" ili 31.24 m. Negativne i nulte kote su u redu. Otvori meni Export i izaberi Spot elevations. Dobijaš datoteku tačaka (.csv) s kolonama Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation i Description, jedan red po označenoj tački otvorenog lista. Otvori tu datoteku u aplikaciji CivilCraft (vidi Uvoz tačaka). Ona iz tačaka gradi površ (Izrada površi); odatle upoređuje površi i daje iskop i nasip (Zapremine). Sjever (northing) i istok (easting) su sopstvene koordinate lista u stopama, mjerene od ugla stranice po njenoj razmjeri: razmaci i zapremine između tačaka su tačni, ali nisu koordinate geodetskog snimanja tvoje lokacije. Kada ih trebaš, prebaci ih na koordinate lokacije u aplikaciji CivilCraft. Tačke s različitih listova nemaju zajedničke koordinate, pa izvoz uzima samo otvoreni list. Kote se spašavaju s predmjerom i prenose kopiranjem i lijepljenjem. Iskop i nasip iz CivilCraft-a Zemljani radovi iz aplikacije CivilCraft vraćaju se kao dvije stavke koje možeš cijeniti: U aplikaciji CivilCraft nivelira podloge i koridore, pa izaberi Send to TakeoffDesk pod Zemljani radovi (Zapremine zemljanih radova). Sprema se datoteka količina (.quantities.json). U TakeoffDesk-u otvori je s Open takeoff ili je prevuci na aplikaciju. Predmjer ostaje otvoren: datoteka dodaje Zemljani radovi: iskop i Zemljani radovi: nasip kao unesene količine u kubnim jardama (CY) za projekat u stopama, ili u kubnim metrima (m³) za projekat u metrima. To je jedan korak: Ctrl+Z ga poništava. Preimenuj ih, postavi otpad, cijene i sklopove kako želiš. Kada se projekat promijeni, ponovo pošalji iz aplikacije CivilCraft i otvori novu datoteku: iste dvije stavke dobiju nove količine. Njihova imena, cijene, otpad i sklopovi ostaju onako kako su postavljeni. Ako se jedinica projekta promijenila, statusna traka to kaže: provjeri cijene. Datoteka iz drugog projekta aplikacije CivilCraft dodaje svoje dvije stavke. Količine su zapremine u tlu, kako ih je CivilCraft izmjerio (metoda mreže): bez skupljanja ili nabrekavanja. Dodaj ih kao otpad ili formulom poput Q * 1.25 za rastresitu zapreminu. Uređivač stavke pokazuje odakle je svaka došla i kada; kolona napomena u predračunu to također navodi. Datoteka količina je običan JSON (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\"), pa skripta ili drugi program može također napisati jednu: naziv aplikacije, projekat i stavke s ključem, imenom, jedinicom i količinom.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ponudne cjeline","summary":"Označite oznake po zgradi, spratu ili fazi, predmjerite u jednu cjelinu u jednom trenutku i čitajte količine i troškove za svaku cjelinu.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["dodatna alternativa","odbitna alternativa","osnovna ponuda","alternative","ponudna cjelina","cjelina","zgrada","sprat","nivo","faza","zona","alternativa","raščlamba","podjela","tipični sprat","međuzbir","po cjelini"],"headings":[{"id":"napravite-ponudnu-cjelinu","text":"Napravite ponudnu cjelinu","level":2},{"id":"predmjerite-u-cjelinu","text":"Predmjerite u cjelinu","level":2},{"id":"premjestite-oznake-u-drugu-cjelinu","text":"Premjestite oznake u drugu cjelinu","level":2},{"id":"preimenovanje-redoslijed-ili-brisanje","text":"Preimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje","level":2},{"id":"itanje-koli-ina-po-cjelini","text":"Čitanje količina po cjelini","level":2},{"id":"alternative-osnovna-ponuda-plus-dodaci-i-odbici","text":"Alternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici","level":2},{"id":"u-izvozu","text":"U izvozu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPonudna cjelina je dio posla koji cijenite zasebno: zgrada, sprat, faza, krilo. Svaka oznaka može biti u jednoj ponudnoj cjelini. Količine i predračun se zatim mogu čitati za svaku cjelinu, uz međuzbir za svaku, dok ukupna vrijednost posla ostaje zbir svega.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napravite-ponudnu-cjelinu\"\u003ENapravite ponudnu cjelinu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E otvorite spisak \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonudna cjelina\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cstrong\u003ENova ponudna cjelina…\u003C/strong\u003E, upišite naziv kao &quot;Zgrada A&quot; ili &quot;Nivo 2&quot;, pa izaberite \u003Cstrong\u003ENapravi\u003C/strong\u003E. Nova cjelina postaje trenutna. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Nove oznake idu u (naziv). Oznake u drugim ponudnim cjelinama su prigušene.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predmjerite-u-cjelinu\"\u003EPredmjerite u cjelinu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok je ponudna cjelina izabrana u spisku, svaka nova oznaka ide u nju: trase, površine, krugovi, brojanja, oznake koje dodaje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E i ono što zalijepite. Oznake u drugim ponudnim cjelinama, kao i one ni u jednoj, prigušene su na listu da vidite šta kome pripada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EBez ponudne cjeline\u003C/strong\u003E u spisku da predmjerite bez nje; tada se ništa ne prigušuje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipični spratovi: predmjerite Nivo 2, izaberite njegove oznake (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na listu), kopirajte ih, izaberite Nivo 3 u spisku i zalijepite. Kopije idu u Nivo 3. Kada su spratovi isti i ne trebaju vam odvojeno, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Etipična grupa\u003C/a\u003E broji jedan sprat više puta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premjestite-oznake-u-drugu-cjelinu\"\u003EPremjestite oznake u drugu cjelinu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite jednu oznaku ili više (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik, ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E (ili \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrane oznake\u003C/strong\u003E) izaberite cjelinu u polju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonudna cjelina\u003C/span\u003E. Statusna traka kaže &quot;3 oznake premještene u Nivo 2.&quot; To je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"preimenovanje-redoslijed-ili-brisanje\"\u003EPreimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUpravljanje ponudnim cjelinama…\u003C/strong\u003E u spisku. Prepišite naziv da ga preimenujete, koristite strelice da promijenite redoslijed (tabele i radna knjiga ga prate) ili izbrišite jednu ikonom za brisanje. Brisanje ponudne cjeline zadržava njene oznake: tada nisu ni u jednoj ponudnoj cjelini. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E poništava svaku promjenu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itanje-koli-ina-po-cjelini\"\u003EČitanje količina po cjelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU tabeli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo cjelini\u003C/span\u003E (prikazuje se kada predmjer ima ponudnu cjelinu). Svaka cjelina navodi stavke koje sadrži, s njihovom količinom, jedinicom i ukupnom vrijednošću, zatim red međuzbira. Oznake bez ponudne cjeline idu na kraj, kao \u003Cstrong\u003EBez ponudne cjeline\u003C/strong\u003E. Kliknite red stavke da je istaknete i da cjelina postane trenutna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESklopovi se računaju za svaku cjelinu iz vlastitih ukupnih vrijednosti te cjeline. Formula koja zaokružuje naviše, kao \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E, može tada dati nešto više zajedno po cjelinama nego za cijeli posao, kao što bi bilo kod ponude cijenjene po cjelinama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alternative-osnovna-ponuda-plus-dodaci-i-odbici\"\u003EAlternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonudna cjelina može biti \u003Cstrong\u003Ealternativa\u003C/strong\u003E: radovi koje investitor može dodati ponudi ili izbaciti iz nje. U \u003Cstrong\u003EUpravljanje ponudnim cjelinama…\u003C/strong\u003E, svaka cjelina ima spisak pored svog naziva:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzbor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOsnovna ponuda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU ponudi, kao i obično.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodatna alternativa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijenjena zasebno i \u003Cstrong\u003Eizostavljena iz osnovne ponude\u003C/strong\u003E: nadogradnja tepiha, dodatna nadstrešnica.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitna alternativa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU osnovnoj ponudi, i ponuđena kao odbitak: &quot;obrišite nadstrešnicu&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPredmjerite radove alternative u njenu ponudnu cjelinu kao i svaku drugu cjelinu. Kada predmjer ima alternativu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaglavlje tabele \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E kaže \u003Cstrong\u003EOsnovna ponuda\u003C/strong\u003E umjesto Ukupno za posao: cijeli predmjer bez dodatnih alternativa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo cjelini\u003C/span\u003E završava osnovnom ponudom i jednim redom po alternativi: \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E za dodatak, \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E za odbitak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlternativa cijeni samo stavke koje imaju oznake u njoj, sa njihovim sklopovima, pa dio sklopa druge stavke ne ulazi nepozvano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU izvozima, CSV završava osnovnom ponudom i alternativama, a radna knjiga dobija list \u003Cstrong\u003EAlternative\u003C/strong\u003E: osnovnu ponudu, stavke svake alternative i njenu promjenu, te osnovnu ponudu sa svim uzetim dodatnim alternativama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-izvozu\"\u003EU izvozu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E dodaje list \u003Cstrong\u003EPo ponudnoj cjelini\u003C/strong\u003E: stavke i komponente svake cjeline s količinom, količinom sa otpadom, materijalom, radom i ukupno, međuzbir po cjelini (formula \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E) i na kraju \u003Cstrong\u003ESve ponudne cjeline\u003C/strong\u003E. List \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E dobija kolonu \u003Cstrong\u003EPonudna cjelina\u003C/strong\u003E. Predmjer bez ponudnih cjelina izvozi se kao i prije. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EKolone izvoza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonudne cjeline se čuvaju u datoteci projekta zajedno sa oznakama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ponudna cjelina je dio posla koji cijenite zasebno: zgrada, sprat, faza, krilo. Svaka oznaka može biti u jednoj ponudnoj cjelini. Količine i predračun se zatim mogu čitati za svaku cjelinu, uz međuzbir za svaku, dok ukupna vrijednost posla ostaje zbir svega. Napravite ponudnu cjelinu Na vrhu panela Stavke otvorite spisak Ponudna cjelina. Izaberite Nova ponudna cjelina…, upišite naziv kao \"Zgrada A\" ili \"Nivo 2\", pa izaberite Napravi. Nova cjelina postaje trenutna. Statusna traka kaže \"Nove oznake idu u (naziv). Oznake u drugim ponudnim cjelinama su prigušene.\" Predmjerite u cjelinu Dok je ponudna cjelina izabrana u spisku, svaka nova oznaka ide u nju: trase, površine, krugovi, brojanja, oznake koje dodaje Auto brojanje i ono što zalijepite. Oznake u drugim ponudnim cjelinama, kao i one ni u jednoj, prigušene su na listu da vidite šta kome pripada. Izaberite Bez ponudne cjeline u spisku da predmjerite bez nje; tada se ništa ne prigušuje. Tipični spratovi: predmjerite Nivo 2, izaberite njegove oznake (Ctrl+A na listu), kopirajte ih, izaberite Nivo 3 u spisku i zalijepite. Kopije idu u Nivo 3. Kada su spratovi isti i ne trebaju vam odvojeno, tipična grupa broji jedan sprat više puta. Premjestite oznake u drugu cjelinu Izaberite jednu oznaku ili više (Shift + klik, ili Ctrl+A). Pod Odabrana oznaka (ili Odabrane oznake) izaberite cjelinu u polju Ponudna cjelina. Statusna traka kaže \"3 oznake premještene u Nivo 2.\" To je jedan korak poništavanja. Preimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje Izaberite Upravljanje ponudnim cjelinama… u spisku. Prepišite naziv da ga preimenujete, koristite strelice da promijenite redoslijed (tabele i radna knjiga ga prate) ili izbrišite jednu ikonom za brisanje. Brisanje ponudne cjeline zadržava njene oznake: tada nisu ni u jednoj ponudnoj cjelini. Ctrl+Z poništava svaku promjenu. Čitanje količina po cjelini U tabeli Količine izaberite Po cjelini (prikazuje se kada predmjer ima ponudnu cjelinu). Svaka cjelina navodi stavke koje sadrži, s njihovom količinom, jedinicom i ukupnom vrijednošću, zatim red međuzbira. Oznake bez ponudne cjeline idu na kraj, kao Bez ponudne cjeline. Kliknite red stavke da je istaknete i da cjelina postane trenutna. Sklopovi se računaju za svaku cjelinu iz vlastitih ukupnih vrijednosti te cjeline. Formula koja zaokružuje naviše, kao ceil(L / 4), može tada dati nešto više zajedno po cjelinama nego za cijeli posao, kao što bi bilo kod ponude cijenjene po cjelinama. Alternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici Ponudna cjelina može biti alternativa: radovi koje investitor može dodati ponudi ili izbaciti iz nje. U Upravljanje ponudnim cjelinama…, svaka cjelina ima spisak pored svog naziva: Izbor Šta radi Osnovna ponuda U ponudi, kao i obično. Dodatna alternativa Cijenjena zasebno i izostavljena iz osnovne ponude: nadogradnja tepiha, dodatna nadstrešnica. Odbitna alternativa U osnovnoj ponudi, i ponuđena kao odbitak: \"obrišite nadstrešnicu\". Predmjerite radove alternative u njenu ponudnu cjelinu kao i svaku drugu cjelinu. Kada predmjer ima alternativu: Zaglavlje tabele Količine kaže Osnovna ponuda umjesto Ukupno za posao: cijeli predmjer bez dodatnih alternativa. Po cjelini završava osnovnom ponudom i jednim redom po alternativi: +$300.00 za dodatak, −$1,050.00 za odbitak. Alternativa cijeni samo stavke koje imaju oznake u njoj, sa njihovim sklopovima, pa dio sklopa druge stavke ne ulazi nepozvano. U izvozima, CSV završava osnovnom ponudom i alternativama, a radna knjiga dobija list Alternative: osnovnu ponudu, stavke svake alternative i njenu promjenu, te osnovnu ponudu sa svim uzetim dodatnim alternativama. U izvozu XLSX dodaje list Po ponudnoj cjelini: stavke i komponente svake cjeline s količinom, količinom sa otpadom, materijalom, radom i ukupno, međuzbir po cjelini (formula SUM) i na kraju Sve ponudne cjeline. List Oznake dobija kolonu Ponudna cjelina. Predmjer bez ponudnih cjelina izvozi se kao i prije. Pogledajte Kolone izvoza. Ponudne cjeline se čuvaju u datoteci projekta zajedno sa oznakama.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izdanja, revizije i dnevnik promjena crteža","summary":"Vodite jednu historiju izdanja uz arhitektov model: učitajte izdanja, zabilježite uputstva sa gradilišta, radioničke crteže i povezane modele uz izdanje i pregledajte dnevnik promjena crteža.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["izdanje","revizija","revizije","dnevnik promjena","dnevnik promjena crteža","registar crteža","uputstvo sa gradilišta","radionički crtež","povezani model","tender","gradnja","historija izdanja","predmjer","predračun"],"headings":[{"id":"ta-ete-raditi","text":"Šta ćete raditi","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"korisno-je-znati","text":"Korisno je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-ete-raditi\"\u003EŠta ćete raditi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadite sa istom historijom izdanja kao ostatak tima. Pogledajte koji su listovi poslani u kojoj reviziji i vodite ono što se dešava na gradilištu uz izdanje kojem pripada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cstrong\u003EIzdanja i revizije\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUčitaj historiju izdanja\u003C/strong\u003E i izaberite datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E sačuvanu iz aplikacije BimCraft ili druge aplikacije. Njena izdanja i zapisi dodaju se vašim. Ništa se ne zamjenjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EDodaj zapis\u003C/strong\u003E za uputstvo sa gradilišta, radionički crtež, skup označavanja, povezani model ili bilješku. Izaberite izdanje na koje se odnosi i njegov status. Datoteka koju odaberete bilježi se po imenu, veličini i SHA-256; datoteka ostaje gdje jeste.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDnevnik promjena crteža\u003C/strong\u003E prikazuje jedan red za svaki list i jednu kolonu za svako izdanje. Revizija u zagradama ponovo je izdata bez promjena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPreuzmi dnevnik promjena (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E čuva izdanja, tabelu listova i zapise. \u003Cstrong\u003ESpasi historiju izdanja\u003C/strong\u003E upisuje datoteku koju čitaju ostale aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"korisno-je-znati\"\u003EKorisno je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZabilježi izdanje\u003C/strong\u003E izdaje vaše izmjerene listove, na primjer uz predmjer. \u003Cstrong\u003EPromjene od\u003C/strong\u003E zatim pokazuju koji su listovi ponovo izmjereni nakon tog izdanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHistorija se čuva u datoteci predmjera. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUčitavanje iste datoteke dva puta ništa ne dodaje dvaput. Kada dvije kopije sadrže isti zapis, zadržava se noviji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Šta ćete raditi Radite sa istom historijom izdanja kao ostatak tima. Pogledajte koji su listovi poslani u kojoj reviziji i vodite ono što se dešava na gradilištu uz izdanje kojem pripada. Koraci Otvorite Izdanja i revizije. Odaberite Učitaj historiju izdanja i izaberite datoteku .issues.json sačuvanu iz aplikacije BimCraft ili druge aplikacije. Njena izdanja i zapisi dodaju se vašim. Ništa se ne zamjenjuje. Odaberite Dodaj zapis za uputstvo sa gradilišta, radionički crtež, skup označavanja, povezani model ili bilješku. Izaberite izdanje na koje se odnosi i njegov status. Datoteka koju odaberete bilježi se po imenu, veličini i SHA-256; datoteka ostaje gdje jeste. Dnevnik promjena crteža prikazuje jedan red za svaki list i jednu kolonu za svako izdanje. Revizija u zagradama ponovo je izdata bez promjena. Preuzmi dnevnik promjena (CSV) čuva izdanja, tabelu listova i zapise. Spasi historiju izdanja upisuje datoteku koju čitaju ostale aplikacije. Korisno je znati Zabilježi izdanje izdaje vaše izmjerene listove, na primjer uz predmjer. Promjene od zatim pokazuju koji su listovi ponovo izmjereni nakon tog izdanja. Historija se čuva u datoteci predmjera. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja. Učitavanje iste datoteke dva puta ništa ne dodaje dvaput. Kada dvije kopije sadrže isti zapis, zadržava se noviji.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tipične grupe","summary":"Napravite predmjer tipične jedinice, sobe ili sprata jednom i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, promijenite broj kasnije i vidite koje su oznake tipične.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["tipično","tipična grupa","ponavljanje","broj ponavljanja","množenje","puta","jedinica","hotelska soba","stan","tipičan sprat","x24","kopije"],"headings":[{"id":"napravite-tipi-nu-grupu","text":"Napravite tipičnu grupu","level":2},{"id":"kasnije-promijenite","text":"Kasnije promijenite","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EZgrada se često ponavlja: 24 identične hotelske sobe, 6 tipičnih spratova, 40 parking mjesta sa istom oznakom. \u003Cstrong\u003ETipična grupa\u003C/strong\u003E vam omogućava da napravite predmjer jedne od njih i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, bez crtanja kopija.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napravite-tipi-nu-grupu\"\u003ENapravite tipičnu grupu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite predmjer jedne jedinice: njenih zidova, poda, utičnica, bilo koje stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite njene oznake alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E: kliknite jednu, zatim \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na ostale (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EOdaberi oznake\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E otvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipično\u003C/span\u003E i izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova tipična grupa…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDajte joj naziv (\u003Ccode\u003EJedinica A\u003C/code\u003E) i koliko puta se ponavlja (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), zatim izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENapravi grupu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka količina tih oznaka sada se broji 24 puta: dionica zida od 10 ft daje 240 ft, pod od 80 SF daje 1,920 SF, dvije utičnice daju 48. Troškovi slijede, a formule sklopova vide ponovljene ukupne iznose (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E također broji svaku dionicu 24 puta).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa listu, isprekidani okvir ide oko oznaka grupe sa njenim nazivom i brojem, kao \u003Cstrong\u003EJedinica A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kasnije-promijenite\"\u003EKasnije promijenite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGrupe su navedene pod \u003Cstrong\u003ETipične grupe\u003C/strong\u003E u desnom panelu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPromijenite broj iza \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E da promijenite koliko puta se broji (1 do 10,000). Sve količine se ažuriraju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreimenujte je u polju za naziv.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkona kutije bira njene oznake (i prikazuje njihov list).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKanta briše grupu. Njene oznake ostaju, brojene jednom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa dodate oznake u grupu ili ih izvadite, odaberite ih i izaberite grupu (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENije tipično (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipično\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake grupe mogu biti na više listova i od bilo kojih stavki. Svaka oznaka je najviše u jednoj grupi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKopije koje zalijepite nisu u grupi: zalijepljena kopija tipične jedinice inače bi se ponovo brojala 24 puta. Koristite grupu za „istu stvar N puta“, a kopiranje i lijepljenje za kopije koje crtate.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake se crtaju jednom, pa 3D prikaz i označeni PDF prikazuju jednu jedinicu; količine, izvozi i tabela po listu broje je ×N. List \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E u Excel izvozu kaže koje su oznake tipične i koliko puta se broje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESa površinama ponude, oznake grupe se broje ×N u sopstvenoj površini ponude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Zgrada se često ponavlja: 24 identične hotelske sobe, 6 tipičnih spratova, 40 parking mjesta sa istom oznakom. Tipična grupa vam omogućava da napravite predmjer jedne od njih i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, bez crtanja kopija. Napravite tipičnu grupu Napravite predmjer jedne jedinice: njenih zidova, poda, utičnica, bilo koje stavke. Odaberite njene oznake alatom Odaberi: kliknite jednu, zatim Shift + klik na ostale (Odaberi oznake). Pod Odabrana oznaka otvorite Tipično i izaberite Nova tipična grupa…. Dajte joj naziv (Jedinica A) i koliko puta se ponavlja (24), zatim izaberite Napravi grupu. Svaka količina tih oznaka sada se broji 24 puta: dionica zida od 10 ft daje 240 ft, pod od 80 SF daje 1,920 SF, dvije utičnice daju 48. Troškovi slijede, a formule sklopova vide ponovljene ukupne iznose (N također broji svaku dionicu 24 puta). Na listu, isprekidani okvir ide oko oznaka grupe sa njenim nazivom i brojem, kao Jedinica A ×24. Kasnije promijenite Grupe su navedene pod Tipične grupe u desnom panelu: Promijenite broj iza × da promijenite koliko puta se broji (1 do 10,000). Sve količine se ažuriraju. Preimenujte je u polju za naziv. Ikona kutije bira njene oznake (i prikazuje njihov list). Kanta briše grupu. Njene oznake ostaju, brojene jednom. Da dodate oznake u grupu ili ih izvadite, odaberite ih i izaberite grupu (ili Nije tipično (×1)) pod Tipično. Dobro je znati Oznake grupe mogu biti na više listova i od bilo kojih stavki. Svaka oznaka je najviše u jednoj grupi. Kopije koje zalijepite nisu u grupi: zalijepljena kopija tipične jedinice inače bi se ponovo brojala 24 puta. Koristite grupu za „istu stvar N puta“, a kopiranje i lijepljenje za kopije koje crtate. Oznake se crtaju jednom, pa 3D prikaz i označeni PDF prikazuju jednu jedinicu; količine, izvozi i tabela po listu broje je ×N. List Oznake u Excel izvozu kaže koje su oznake tipične i koliko puta se broje. Sa površinama ponude, oznake grupe se broje ×N u sopstvenoj površini ponude.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Read quantities and the estimate","summary":"Use the Quantities table by item and by sheet, the job total, highlighting, and the Incomplete warning.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["quantities","totals","by item","by sheet","job total","estimate","summary","report","highlight","incomplete","costs"],"headings":[{"id":"by-item","text":"By item","level":2},{"id":"by-sheet","text":"By sheet","level":2},{"id":"by-area","text":"By area","level":2},{"id":"the-incomplete-warning","text":"The Incomplete warning","level":2},{"id":"highlight-an-item","text":"Highlight an item","level":2},{"id":"item-totals-in-the-side-panel","text":"Item totals in the side panel","level":2},{"id":"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open","text":"Marks on PDFs that are not open","level":2},{"id":"more-room","text":"More room","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-item\"\u003EBy item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EName, with the item&#039;s color. &quot;+(n) unscaled&quot; means some marks are on sheets with no scale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measured total in the item&#039;s unit (components: the formula result).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component&#039;s unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped here or in the item editor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity × (1 + waste).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial/unit, Labor/unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERates; you can type them here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste × rate, rounded to the cent.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial + labor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe last row, \u003Cstrong\u003EJob total\u003C/strong\u003E, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table&#039;s header.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EType into a waste or rate cell and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example &quot;Type an amount like 12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item&#039;s name in its row to make it the current item, turn on its measuring tool and highlight its marks, without moving the view (the same as clicking it under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E). Clicking one of the row&#039;s figures selects the marks behind it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-sheet\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E to see each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-area\"\u003EBy area\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen the takeoff has bid areas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E lists each area&#039;s items and a subtotal. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EThe Incomplete warning\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormula errors\u003C/strong\u003E: an assembly component&#039;s formula cannot be worked out. Its row says &quot;Formula error: …&quot;. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks on sheets with no scale\u003C/strong\u003E: give those sheets a scale. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"highlight-an-item\"\u003EHighlight an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E or in the table. Its marks glow on every sheet; every other mark stays fully visible. The sheets list shows &quot;(n) highlighted&quot; on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"item-totals-in-the-side-panel\"\u003EItem totals in the side panel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E list shows its quantity too. The item editor&#039;s \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open\"\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"more-room\"\u003EMore room\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe arrow button at the right of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The Quantities table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date. By item Choose By item (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it. Column Meaning Item Name, with the item's color. \"+(n) unscaled\" means some marks are on sheets with no scale. Quantity The measured total in the item's unit (components: the formula result). Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component's unit. Waste % Typed here or in the item editor. With waste Quantity × (1 + waste). Material/unit, Labor/unit Rates; you can type them here. Material, Labor With waste × rate, rounded to the cent. Total Material + labor. The last row, Job total, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table's header. Type into a waste or rate cell and press Enter or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example \"Type an amount like 12.50.\" Click an item's name in its row to make it the current item, turn on its measuring tool and highlight its marks, without moving the view (the same as clicking it under Items). Clicking one of the row's figures selects the marks behind it. By sheet Choose By sheet to see each item's quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work. By area When the takeoff has bid areas, By area lists each area's items and a subtotal. See Bid areas. The Incomplete warning When something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example: \"Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)\" Formula errors: an assembly component's formula cannot be worked out. Its row says \"Formula error: …\". See Assemblies and formulas. Marks on sheets with no scale: give those sheets a scale. See Set the scale. The same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete. Highlight an item Click an item under Items or in the table. Its marks glow on every sheet; every other mark stays fully visible. The sheets list shows \"(n) highlighted\" on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting. Item totals in the side panel Each item in the Items list shows its quantity too. The item editor's Measured block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count. Marks on PDFs that are not open A takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See Save and reopen a takeoff. More room The arrow button at the right of the Quantities header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bilješke, oblaci i isticanja","summary":"Označite pitanja i izmjene na listovima bilješkama, revizionim oblacima i isticanjima, pratite svaku kao otvorenu, odgovorenu ili zatvorenu i šaljite ih u označenom PDF-u.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["označavanje","označavanja","bilješka","komentar","pitanje","rfi","oblak","revizioni oblak","isticanje","status","otvoreno","odgovoreno","zatvoreno","pregled","spisak označavanja"],"headings":[{"id":"dodavanje","text":"Dodavanje","level":2},{"id":"status-i-ure-ivanje","text":"Status i uređivanje","level":2},{"id":"spisak","text":"Spisak","level":2},{"id":"dijelite-ih","text":"Dijelite ih","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOznačavanja služe za ono što treba da zapamtite ili pitate dok radite predmjer: „potvrdite vrstu podloge“, revizioni oblak oko promijenjenog zida, istaknuta bilješka na planu. Stoje na listu sa statusom, navedena su na jednom mjestu i ispisuju se u označenom PDF-u. Ona se \u003Cstrong\u003Enikada ne broje\u003C/strong\u003E: nema količine, nema troška.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodavanje\"\u003EDodavanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačavanje\u003C/span\u003E na traci iznad lista i odaberite:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKako\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilješka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite gdje ide, upišite bilješku, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E. Prikazuje se kao okrugla igla sa prvim redom pored nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOblak\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite jedan ugao, zatim suprotni, i upišite bilješku (ili je ostavite praznu). Nazubljeni revizioni oblak ide oko okvira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticanje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite dva ugla: prozirni žuti okvir, sa bilješkom ako želite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nakon prvog ugla poništava. Alat ostaje uključen za sljedeći; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-i-ure-ivanje\"\u003EStatus i uređivanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite označavanje alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E da ga odaberete. Desni panel prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EOznačavanje\u003C/strong\u003E: njegovu vrstu i list, njegov \u003Cstrong\u003EStatus\u003C/strong\u003E — Otvoreno, Odgovoreno ili Zatvoreno — i tekst, koji možete promijeniti. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E) ga uklanja; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga vraća.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgla bilješke je narandžasta dok je otvorena, plava kad je odgovoreno i siva kad je zatvorena; zatvoreni oblak postaje siv.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spisak\"\u003ESpisak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOznačavanja\u003C/strong\u003E u desnom panelu navode svako označavanje predmjera sa njegovim statusom i pokazuju koliko je još otvoreno. Označite \u003Cstrong\u003ESamo otvorena\u003C/strong\u003E da vidite šta je ostalo za riješiti. Kliknite red da idete na njegov list i da ga odaberete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dijelite-ih\"\u003EDijelite ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E ih crta na stranicama: isticanja, oblake i igle, svaku sa okvirom koji navodi njen status velikim slovima (OTVORENO, ODGOVORENO, ZATVORENO) i njen tekst. Stranica sa označavanjima, a bez oznaka predmjera, također je uključena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E dodaje radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznačavanja\u003C/strong\u003E: list, vrstu, status i tekst, po jedan red za svako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EČuvaju se u \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF-u sa predmjerom unutra\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Označavanja služe za ono što treba da zapamtite ili pitate dok radite predmjer: „potvrdite vrstu podloge“, revizioni oblak oko promijenjenog zida, istaknuta bilješka na planu. Stoje na listu sa statusom, navedena su na jednom mjestu i ispisuju se u označenom PDF-u. Ona se nikada ne broje: nema količine, nema troška. Dodavanje Otvorite Označavanje na traci iznad lista i odaberite: Vrsta Kako Bilješka Kliknite gdje ide, upišite bilješku, odaberite Dodaj. Prikazuje se kao okrugla igla sa prvim redom pored nje. Oblak Kliknite jedan ugao, zatim suprotni, i upišite bilješku (ili je ostavite praznu). Nazubljeni revizioni oblak ide oko okvira. Isticanje Kliknite dva ugla: prozirni žuti okvir, sa bilješkom ako želite. Esc nakon prvog ugla poništava. Alat ostaje uključen za sljedeći; V vraća na Odaberi. Status i uređivanje Kliknite označavanje alatom Odaberi da ga odaberete. Desni panel prikazuje Označavanje: njegovu vrstu i list, njegov Status — Otvoreno, Odgovoreno ili Zatvoreno — i tekst, koji možete promijeniti. Delete (ili Izbriši) ga uklanja; Ctrl+Z ga vraća. Igla bilješke je narandžasta dok je otvorena, plava kad je odgovoreno i siva kad je zatvorena; zatvoreni oblak postaje siv. Spisak Označavanja u desnom panelu navode svako označavanje predmjera sa njegovim statusom i pokazuju koliko je još otvoreno. Označite Samo otvorena da vidite šta je ostalo za riješiti. Kliknite red da idete na njegov list i da ga odaberete. Dijelite ih Označeni PDF ih crta na stranicama: isticanja, oblake i igle, svaku sa okvirom koji navodi njen status velikim slovima (OTVORENO, ODGOVORENO, ZATVORENO) i njen tekst. Stranica sa označavanjima, a bez oznaka predmjera, također je uključena. XLSX dodaje radni list Označavanja: list, vrstu, status i tekst, po jedan red za svako. Čuvaju se u .takeoff.json i u PDF-u sa predmjerom unutra.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Provjera predmjera u 3D","summary":"Pogledajte zidove, ploče i brojanja otvorenog lista kako stoje na crtežu, okrećite se oko njih i kliknite jedan da izaberete njegovu oznaku.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","slika","fotografija","snimak ekrana","slaganje","spratovi","nivoi","izgled","glb","gltf","izvoz 3D","debljina zida","visina baze","otvor","gornja ivica vrata","3d","tri d","provjera","pogled","zidovi","visina zida","ploča","dubina","zapremina","orbita","model","odabir","izometrija","perspektiva"],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-pogled-3d","text":"Otvorite pogled 3D","level":2},{"id":"ta-vidite","text":"Šta vidite","level":2},{"id":"pogledajte-okolo","text":"Pogledajte okolo","level":2},{"id":"zidovi-s-debljinom-podlogom-i-otvorima","text":"Zidovi s debljinom, podlogom i otvorima","level":2},{"id":"slo-ite-spratove","text":"Složite spratove","level":2},{"id":"sa-uvajte-pogled-3d-kao-sliku","text":"Sačuvajte pogled 3D kao sliku","level":2},{"id":"sa-uvajte-pogled-3d-kao-model","text":"Sačuvajte pogled 3D kao model","level":2},{"id":"odaberite-oznaku-iz-3d","text":"Odaberite oznaku iz 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPogled 3D je provjera, a ne drugi crtež: predmjer lista na ekranu podiže na samom listu, pa nedostajući zid, dvostruka ploča ili slučajno brojanje odmah se vidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba razmjeru (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje razmjere\u003C/a\u003E). Visine i dubine trebaju stvarne feet, pa na listu bez razmjere \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E to kaže i ostaje na ravnom listu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-pogled-3d\"\u003EOtvorite pogled 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrikažite list koji želite provjeriti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E na traci koja prikazuje naziv i razmjeru lista, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Prvi put pogled 3D treba trenutak da se učita. List se crta na podlozi, a predmjer stoji na njemu u boji svake stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa se vratite, izaberite ponovo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENazad na list\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Izbor alata za crtanje (Linijski, Površinski, Brojanje i tako dalje) također vraća, jer se oznake crtaju na ravnom listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrikazuje list na ekranu; mijenjajte listove u spisku listova, ili s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, a pogled 3D prati. Da vidite više spratova odjednom, složite ih (ispod).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-vidite\"\u003EŠta vidite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOznaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EU 3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska trasa, stavka s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZid te visine duž trase. Zakrivljene trase prate krivu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijska trasa, stavka bez visine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinija na listu. Dajte stavki visinu pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E da je podignete.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina, stavka s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPloča te dubine, s otvorenim izrezima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina, stavka bez dubine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanka ploča od 2&quot; da se i dalje vidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMali stub na svakoj brojanoj tački.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisina je polje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E linijske stavke, a dubina polje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubina\u003C/span\u003E površinske stavke, pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E (pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EKreiranje stavki predmjera\u003C/a\u003E). Promijenite je i pogled 3D se odmah ažurira. Napomena ispod naziva lista kaže šta list sadrži, na primjer &quot;Ovaj list u 3D: 2 zida, 1 ploča, 3 brojanja&quot;, i koliko trasa ili površina nema visinu ili dubinu. Klikovi prolaze kroz nju do pogleda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojke se ne mijenjaju u 3D: površina zida je njegova tačna dužina puta visina, a zapremina ploče je njena neto površina (kontura minus izrezi, krive tačne) puta dubina. Krive se crtaju kao kratki ravni dijelovi samo na ekranu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pogledajte-okolo\"\u003EPogledajte okolo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERadnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevlačenje, ili prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkreće oko predmjera.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomjera pogled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočkić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećava i smanjuje na pokazivaču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevlačenje s dva prsta na tačpedu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkreće (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pomjera). Štipanje uvećava.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESprijeda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELijevo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDesno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDolje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStandardni pogledi, uokvireni na predmjer. Pogled 3D se otvara u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerspektiva uključena ili isključena (paralelna kad je isključena).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZumiraj na sve\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijeli list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EList\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrikazuje ili skriva crtež na podlozi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKocka pogleda, gore desno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite stranu, ivicu ili ugao da gledate odatle; prevucite je da se okrećete; prevucite njen prsten kompasa da okrenete; dugme kuće vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUgao prikazuje kocku pogleda, malu ikonu osa X, Y, Z ili ništa: izaberite u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E, na kartici TakeoffDesk, pod \u003Cstrong\u003EIndikator ugla\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E). Ravni list nema indikator ugla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan prst okreće; dva prsta štipaju za uvećavanje i pomjeraju za pomjeranje. Dodir bira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zidovi-s-debljinom-podlogom-i-otvorima\"\u003EZidovi s debljinom, podlogom i otvorima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinijska stavka s visinom stoji kao tanka traka. Da je vidite kao pravi zid, dajte stavki njen oblik pod \u003Cstrong\u003EU 3D\u003C/strong\u003E u njenim postavkama:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDebljina zida\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot;, 0.2 m): zid postaje čvrsto tijelo, centrirano na liniju koju ste nacrtali, sa spojenim uglovima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVisina baze\u003C/strong\u003E: zid počinje toliko iznad poda (podgled, red gornjih ormarića). I površinske stavke je imaju: plafon na 9&#039;-0&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGornja ivica otvora\u003C/strong\u003E: oduzeti segment (vrata, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003EOduzimanje dijela trase\u003C/a\u003E) zadržava zid iznad te visine, pa se vrata vide kao vrata. Bez nje, oduzeti segment ostavlja prazninu do vrha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvi podaci samo oblikuju pogled 3D: količine (dužina, površina zida, troškovi) ostaju kakve su bile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slo-ite-spratove\"\u003ESložite spratove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove svakog sprata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU pogledu 3D izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENivoi…\u003C/span\u003E i upišite kotu svakog sprata, npr. \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E za prizemlje i \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E za sljedeći. Prazno izostavlja list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlaži\u003C/span\u003E. Svaki list s nivoom prikazuje svoj predmjer na svojoj visini; list na ekranu leži pod vlastitim spratom, a ostali su obrisani. Napomena kaže koliko je spratova složeno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EListovi se poravnavaju po svom položaju na stranici, pa ovo radi za osnove spratova iscrtane na isti način (ista veličina i položaj lista). List s nivoom bez razmjere se izostavlja, a napomena to kaže. Izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlaži\u003C/span\u003E ponovo za jedan list u isto vrijeme. Nivoi se čuvaju uz predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sa-uvajte-pogled-3d-kao-sliku\"\u003ESačuvajte pogled 3D kao sliku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E na traci 3D za sliku pogleda kakav je na ekranu (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E ga pravi dvostruko većim (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), za štampu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sa-uvajte-pogled-3d-kao-model\"\u003ESačuvajte pogled 3D kao model\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E na traci 3D. Dobijate datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E (glTF, binarna) onoga što pogled prikazuje — sprat na ekranu ili svaki složeni sprat — koju otvaraju drugi 3D programi: jedan objekat po oznaci, nazvan po njenoj stavki, u boji stavke, u metrima s Y prema gore. Sam list i obrisi nisu u njoj.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-oznaku-iz-3d\"\u003EOdaberite oznaku iz 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite zid, ploču, lim ili stub. Njegova oznaka postaje odabrana oznaka, kao da ste je kliknuli na listu: prikazuje se pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, njena stavka postaje trenutna, a statusna traka daje njenu dužinu i visinu, ili površinu, dubinu i cubic yards. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik dodaje oznake u izbor ili ih izbacuje iz njega. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše odabrane oznake, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ih vraća; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne bira ništa. Na listu, iste oznake ostaju odabrane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtež prati temu: u temi Model list na podlozi postaje taman, kao i ravni prikaz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Pogled 3D je provjera, a ne drugi crtež: predmjer lista na ekranu podiže na samom listu, pa nedostajući zid, dvostruka ploča ili slučajno brojanje odmah se vidi. Prije početka: list treba razmjeru (Postavljanje razmjere). Visine i dubine trebaju stvarne feet, pa na listu bez razmjere 3D to kaže i ostaje na ravnom listu. Otvorite pogled 3D Prikažite list koji želite provjeriti. Izaberite 3D na traci koja prikazuje naziv i razmjeru lista, ili pritisnite 3. Prvi put pogled 3D treba trenutak da se učita. List se crta na podlozi, a predmjer stoji na njemu u boji svake stavke. Da se vratite, izaberite ponovo 3D, Nazad na list ili pritisnite 3. Izbor alata za crtanje (Linijski, Površinski, Brojanje i tako dalje) također vraća, jer se oznake crtaju na ravnom listu. Prikazuje list na ekranu; mijenjajte listove u spisku listova, ili s Page Down i Page Up, a pogled 3D prati. Da vidite više spratova odjednom, složite ih (ispod). Šta vidite Oznaka U 3D Linijska trasa, stavka s visinom Zid te visine duž trase. Zakrivljene trase prate krivu. Linijska trasa, stavka bez visine Linija na listu. Dajte stavki visinu pod Stavka da je podignete. Površina, stavka s dubinom Ploča te dubine, s otvorenim izrezima. Površina, stavka bez dubine Tanka ploča od 2\" da se i dalje vidi. Brojanje Mali stub na svakoj brojanoj tački. Visina je polje Visina linijske stavke, a dubina polje Dubina površinske stavke, pod Stavka (pogledajte Kreiranje stavki predmjera). Promijenite je i pogled 3D se odmah ažurira. Napomena ispod naziva lista kaže šta list sadrži, na primjer \"Ovaj list u 3D: 2 zida, 1 ploča, 3 brojanja\", i koliko trasa ili površina nema visinu ili dubinu. Klikovi prolaze kroz nju do pogleda. Brojke se ne mijenjaju u 3D: površina zida je njegova tačna dužina puta visina, a zapremina ploče je njena neto površina (kontura minus izrezi, krive tačne) puta dubina. Krive se crtaju kao kratki ravni dijelovi samo na ekranu. Pogledajte okolo Radnja Šta radi Prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom Okreće oko predmjera. Shift + prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom Pomjera pogled. Točkić miša Uvećava i smanjuje na pokazivaču. Prevlačenje s dva prsta na tačpedu Okreće (Shift pomjera). Štipanje uvećava. Iso, Gore, Sprijeda, Straga, Lijevo, Desno, Dolje Standardni pogledi, uokvireni na predmjer. Pogled 3D se otvara u Iso. Perspektiva Perspektiva uključena ili isključena (paralelna kad je isključena). Zumiraj na sve ili F Cijeli list. List Prikazuje ili skriva crtež na podlozi. Kocka pogleda, gore desno Kliknite stranu, ivicu ili ugao da gledate odatle; prevucite je da se okrećete; prevucite njen prsten kompasa da okrenete; dugme kuće vraća na Iso. Ugao prikazuje kocku pogleda, malu ikonu osa X, Y, Z ili ništa: izaberite u Postavke, na kartici TakeoffDesk, pod Indikator ugla (Postavke TakeoffDesk). Ravni list nema indikator ugla. Jedan prst okreće; dva prsta štipaju za uvećavanje i pomjeraju za pomjeranje. Dodir bira. Zidovi s debljinom, podlogom i otvorima Linijska stavka s visinom stoji kao tanka traka. Da je vidite kao pravi zid, dajte stavki njen oblik pod U 3D u njenim postavkama: Debljina zida (8\", 0.2 m): zid postaje čvrsto tijelo, centrirano na liniju koju ste nacrtali, sa spojenim uglovima. Visina baze: zid počinje toliko iznad poda (podgled, red gornjih ormarića). I površinske stavke je imaju: plafon na 9'-0\". Gornja ivica otvora: oduzeti segment (vrata, Oduzimanje dijela trase) zadržava zid iznad te visine, pa se vrata vide kao vrata. Bez nje, oduzeti segment ostavlja prazninu do vrha. Ovi podaci samo oblikuju pogled 3D: količine (dužina, površina zida, troškovi) ostaju kakve su bile. Složite spratove Otvorite PDF-ove svakog sprata. U pogledu 3D izaberite Nivoi… i upišite kotu svakog sprata, npr. 0 za prizemlje i 12' za sljedeći. Prazno izostavlja list. Izaberite Slaži. Svaki list s nivoom prikazuje svoj predmjer na svojoj visini; list na ekranu leži pod vlastitim spratom, a ostali su obrisani. Napomena kaže koliko je spratova složeno. Listovi se poravnavaju po svom položaju na stranici, pa ovo radi za osnove spratova iscrtane na isti način (ista veličina i položaj lista). List s nivoom bez razmjere se izostavlja, a napomena to kaže. Izaberite Slaži ponovo za jedan list u isto vrijeme. Nivoi se čuvaju uz predmjer. Sačuvajte pogled 3D kao sliku Izaberite PNG na traci 3D za sliku pogleda kakav je na ekranu (… 3D.png); Shift + klik na PNG ga pravi dvostruko većim (… 3D@2x.png), za štampu. Sačuvajte pogled 3D kao model Izaberite GLB na traci 3D. Dobijate datoteku .glb (glTF, binarna) onoga što pogled prikazuje — sprat na ekranu ili svaki složeni sprat — koju otvaraju drugi 3D programi: jedan objekat po oznaci, nazvan po njenoj stavki, u boji stavke, u metrima s Y prema gore. Sam list i obrisi nisu u njoj. Odaberite oznaku iz 3D Kliknite zid, ploču, lim ili stub. Njegova oznaka postaje odabrana oznaka, kao da ste je kliknuli na listu: prikazuje se pod Odabrana oznaka, njena stavka postaje trenutna, a statusna traka daje njenu dužinu i visinu, ili površinu, dubinu i cubic yards. Shift + klik dodaje oznake u izbor ili ih izbacuje iz njega. Delete briše odabrane oznake, a Ctrl+Z ih vraća; Esc ne bira ništa. Na listu, iste oznake ostaju odabrane. Crtež prati temu: u temi Model list na podlozi postaje taman, kao i ravni prikaz.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izvoz predračuna i označenog PDF-a","summary":"Preuzmi predračun kao XLSX radnu knjigu sa živim formulama ili kao CSV, te kopije PDF-ova s nacrtanim predmjerom.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["prijedlog","sažetak ponude","izvoz","xlsx","tabela","radna knjiga","csv","označeni pdf","ispis predmjera","izvještaj","dijeljenje","slanje","legenda"],"headings":[{"id":"predra-un-kao-tabela-xlsx","text":"Predračun kao tabela (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"predra-un-kao-csv","text":"Predračun kao CSV","level":2},{"id":"predra-un-u-google-sheets","text":"Predračun u Google Sheets","level":2},{"id":"nedostaju-e-cijene-i-odobrenje","text":"Nedostajuće cijene i odobrenje","level":2},{"id":"ozna-eni-pdf","text":"Označeni PDF","level":2},{"id":"nema-ta-izvesti","text":"Nema šta izvesti?","level":2},{"id":"spasi-i-predmjer","text":"Spasi i predmjer","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzvozi su preuzimanja. Prave se na računaru iz predmjera i otvorenih PDF-ova; ništa se nigdje ne šalje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-kao-tabela-xlsx\"\u003EPredračun kao tabela (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci i izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E. Preglednik preuzima \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Izvezeno (name).xlsx (predračun sa živim formulama, po listu, oznake, razmjere).&quot; i dodaje upozorenje kada je predračun nepotpun.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori ga u tabličnom programu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadna knjiga ima četiri radna lista, a izvještaji ispod kada se primjenjuju:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERadni list\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPredračun\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERed po stavci i po komponenti: količina, otpad, količina s otpadom, cijene, materijal, rad, ukupno, napomene. Ukupno za posao na dnu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPo listu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina svake stavke na svakom listu, s brojem oznaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaka oznaka: list, stavka, vrsta, količina i detalji (dužine segmenata, bruto i površine izreza, obim).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERazmjere\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki list koji ima razmjeru ili oznake: njegova razmjera, kako je postavljena (unaprijed podešeno ili kalibrirano na kojoj udaljenosti) i stope po jedinici PDF-a.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESažetak predmjera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina svake stavke, CSI broj, oznake i listovi, bez cijena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpisak materijala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki dio sklopa zbrojen kroz cijeli predmjer (dio koji koristi više stavki je jedan red), s otpadom i troškom materijala, te stavke koje ga koriste.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZahtjev za ponudu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpisak materijala za slanje dobavljaču: količine s otpadom, prazna kolona jediničnih cijena, a iznosi i ukupno se popunjavaju kako se cijene upisuju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPo diviziji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, rad i ukupno po CSI MasterFormat diviziji, kada stavke imaju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUz \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003Esažetak ponude\u003C/a\u003E, radni list Predračun se također završava svojim uvećanjima (troškovi rada, porez na promet, režije, dobit, garancija i ponuda), kao žive formule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadni list Predračun zadržava \u003Cstrong\u003Ežive formule\u003C/strong\u003E: količina s otpadom, zaokruženi iznosi materijala i rada, ukupno svakog reda i ukupno za posao. Tablični programi ih ponovo računaju, pa možeš promijeniti cijenu ili otpad u tabeli i ukupni iznosi se prate. Brojevi koje je TakeoffDesk izračunao također su upisani u ćelije i podudaraju se do centa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKolona napomena navodi formulu svake komponente, greške u formulama, oznake na listovima bez razmjere, površinu zida i obim. Kada nešto nedostaje, red ukupno za posao kaže &quot;Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadna knjiga je provjerena u LibreOffice Calc-u, koji ju je ponovo izračunao na iste ukupne iznose. Još nije otvorena u Excelu. Detalji po kolonama su u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EKolone izvoza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-kao-csv\"\u003EPredračun kao CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvori meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E i izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. Dobijaš \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E: iste redove i kolone kao radni list Predračun, kao obične vrijednosti (bez formula), i ukupno za posao. Koristi ga za unos u drugi sistem za predračune ili računovodstvo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV sadrži samo predračun; za količine po listu i spisak oznaka koristi XLSX. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial list\u003C/span\u003E u istom meniju čuva sam spisak materijala kao CSV, za naručivanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-u-google-sheets\"\u003EPredračun u Google Sheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIznad tabele \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKopiraj za Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E stavlja predračun na međuspremnik kao tekst odvojen tabulatorima, s istim redovima kao CSV. U Google tabeli klikni na ćeliju A1 i zalijepi. TakeoffDesk se ne prijavljuje na Google i ništa tamo ne šalje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nedostaju-e-cijene-i-odobrenje\"\u003ENedostajuće cijene i odobrenje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavka s količinom bez cijene u napomenama kaže \u003Cstrong\u003ENema cijene\u003C/strong\u003E, a izvoz je broji pod ukupnim iznosima. Kada je predračun odobren, izvoz navodi ko ga je odobrio, kada i za koji ukupan iznos. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003ENedostajuće cijene i odobravanje predračuna\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ozna-eni-pdf\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori PDF-ove čije oznake želiš nacrtane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E i izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Prikazuje se &quot;Upisujem označeni PDF…&quot;, zatim preglednik preuzima jednu datoteku po označenom PDF-u, nazvanu \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU kopiji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edionice su nacrtane kao linije u boji svoje stavke,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epovršine su lagano popunjene uz punu konturu, a izrezi ostaju otvoreni,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebrojanja su tačke,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esvaka stranica s oznakama dobija malu legendu u donjem lijevom uglu: boju, naziv i količinu svake stavke na toj stranici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOriginalni PDF-ovi se ne mijenjaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENapomene:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPiše se samo za PDF-ove koji su otvoreni. Oznake na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni ostaju u ukupnim iznosima, ali se ne crtaju; prvo otvori te PDF-ove.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENazivi u legendi koriste standardni PDF font. Slova koja ne može prikazati ispisuju se kao &quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EŠifrovani PDF se ne može kopirati s oznakama: &quot;Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifrovan, pa označena kopija ne može biti napravljena. Sam predmjer je u redu; izvezi tabelu umjesto toga.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrvi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E u kartici učitava pisač PDF-a. Van mreže, on je dostupan samo ako traka aplikacije pokazuje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E; vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad van mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESa više označenih PDF-ova, Chrome i Edge mogu jednom pitati smije li ovaj sajt preuzeti više datoteka. Izaberi Dozvoli, inače dobijaš samo prvu datoteku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nema-ta-izvesti\"\u003ENema šta izvesti?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E trebaju bar jednu stavku: &quot;Još nema ničega za izvoz: napravi stavku i izmjeri je.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E treba oznake na otvorenom PDF-u: &quot;Još nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spasi-i-predmjer\"\u003ESpasi i predmjer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvoz je izvještaj. Da nastaviš rad na predmjeru kasnije, također izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESpasi i ponovo otvori predmjer\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa dodaš režije, dobit, porez i garanciju te pošalješ prijedlog, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003ESažetak ponude i prijedlog\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izvozi su preuzimanja. Prave se na računaru iz predmjera i otvorenih PDF-ova; ništa se nigdje ne šalje. Predračun kao tabela (XLSX) Otvori meni Export na alatnoj traci i izaberi XLSX. Preglednik preuzima (name).xlsx. Statusna traka kaže \"Izvezeno (name).xlsx (predračun sa živim formulama, po listu, oznake, razmjere).\" i dodaje upozorenje kada je predračun nepotpun. Otvori ga u tabličnom programu. Radna knjiga ima četiri radna lista, a izvještaji ispod kada se primjenjuju: Radni list Sadržaj Predračun Red po stavci i po komponenti: količina, otpad, količina s otpadom, cijene, materijal, rad, ukupno, napomene. Ukupno za posao na dnu. Po listu Količina svake stavke na svakom listu, s brojem oznaka. Oznake Svaka oznaka: list, stavka, vrsta, količina i detalji (dužine segmenata, bruto i površine izreza, obim). Razmjere Svaki list koji ima razmjeru ili oznake: njegova razmjera, kako je postavljena (unaprijed podešeno ili kalibrirano na kojoj udaljenosti) i stope po jedinici PDF-a. Sažetak predmjera Količina svake stavke, CSI broj, oznake i listovi, bez cijena. Spisak materijala Svaki dio sklopa zbrojen kroz cijeli predmjer (dio koji koristi više stavki je jedan red), s otpadom i troškom materijala, te stavke koje ga koriste. Zahtjev za ponudu Spisak materijala za slanje dobavljaču: količine s otpadom, prazna kolona jediničnih cijena, a iznosi i ukupno se popunjavaju kako se cijene upisuju. Po diviziji Materijal, rad i ukupno po CSI MasterFormat diviziji, kada stavke imaju CSI number. Uz sažetak ponude, radni list Predračun se također završava svojim uvećanjima (troškovi rada, porez na promet, režije, dobit, garancija i ponuda), kao žive formule. Radni list Predračun zadržava žive formule: količina s otpadom, zaokruženi iznosi materijala i rada, ukupno svakog reda i ukupno za posao. Tablični programi ih ponovo računaju, pa možeš promijeniti cijenu ili otpad u tabeli i ukupni iznosi se prate. Brojevi koje je TakeoffDesk izračunao također su upisani u ćelije i podudaraju se do centa. Kolona napomena navodi formulu svake komponente, greške u formulama, oznake na listovima bez razmjere, površinu zida i obim. Kada nešto nedostaje, red ukupno za posao kaže \"Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad\". Radna knjiga je provjerena u LibreOffice Calc-u, koji ju je ponovo izračunao na iste ukupne iznose. Još nije otvorena u Excelu. Detalji po kolonama su u Kolone izvoza. Predračun kao CSV Otvori meni Export i izaberi CSV. Dobijaš (name).csv: iste redove i kolone kao radni list Predračun, kao obične vrijednosti (bez formula), i ukupno za posao. Koristi ga za unos u drugi sistem za predračune ili računovodstvo. CSV sadrži samo predračun; za količine po listu i spisak oznaka koristi XLSX. Material list u istom meniju čuva sam spisak materijala kao CSV, za naručivanje. Predračun u Google Sheets Iznad tabele Quantities, Kopiraj za Google Sheets stavlja predračun na međuspremnik kao tekst odvojen tabulatorima, s istim redovima kao CSV. U Google tabeli klikni na ćeliju A1 i zalijepi. TakeoffDesk se ne prijavljuje na Google i ništa tamo ne šalje. Nedostajuće cijene i odobrenje Stavka s količinom bez cijene u napomenama kaže Nema cijene, a izvoz je broji pod ukupnim iznosima. Kada je predračun odobren, izvoz navodi ko ga je odobrio, kada i za koji ukupan iznos. Vidi Nedostajuće cijene i odobravanje predračuna. Označeni PDF Otvori PDF-ove čije oznake želiš nacrtane. Otvori meni Export i izaberi Marked PDF. Prikazuje se \"Upisujem označeni PDF…\", zatim preglednik preuzima jednu datoteku po označenom PDF-u, nazvanu (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf. U kopiji: dionice su nacrtane kao linije u boji svoje stavke, površine su lagano popunjene uz punu konturu, a izrezi ostaju otvoreni, brojanja su tačke, svaka stranica s oznakama dobija malu legendu u donjem lijevom uglu: boju, naziv i količinu svake stavke na toj stranici. Originalni PDF-ovi se ne mijenjaju. Napomene: Piše se samo za PDF-ove koji su otvoreni. Oznake na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni ostaju u ukupnim iznosima, ali se ne crtaju; prvo otvori te PDF-ove. Nazivi u legendi koriste standardni PDF font. Slova koja ne može prikazati ispisuju se kao \"?\". Šifrovani PDF se ne može kopirati s oznakama: \"Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifrovan, pa označena kopija ne može biti napravljena. Sam predmjer je u redu; izvezi tabelu umjesto toga.\" Prvi Marked PDF u kartici učitava pisač PDF-a. Van mreže, on je dostupan samo ako traka aplikacije pokazuje Offline ready; vidi Rad van mreže. Sa više označenih PDF-ova, Chrome i Edge mogu jednom pitati smije li ovaj sajt preuzeti više datoteka. Izaberi Dozvoli, inače dobijaš samo prvu datoteku. Nema šta izvesti? XLSX i CSV trebaju bar jednu stavku: \"Još nema ničega za izvoz: napravi stavku i izmjeri je.\" Marked PDF treba oznake na otvorenom PDF-u: \"Još nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima.\" Spasi i predmjer Izvoz je izvještaj. Da nastaviš rad na predmjeru kasnije, također izaberi Save takeoff: vidi Spasi i ponovo otvori predmjer. Da dodaš režije, dobit, porez i garanciju te pošalješ prijedlog, vidi Sažetak ponude i prijedlog.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sažetak ponude i prijedlog ponude","summary":"Dodajte opterećenje rada, porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i garanciju na procjenu, napišite uključeno i isključeno i preuzmite PDF prijedloga za slanje.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["ponuda","opterećenje rada","platni spisak","prijedlog","prijedlog ponude","režija","dobit","dodatak","marža","porez na promet","garancija","uključeno","isključeno","uslovi","potpis","klijent","cijena"],"headings":[{"id":"dodaci","text":"Dodaci","level":2},{"id":"prijedlog","text":"Prijedlog","level":2},{"id":"u-izvozima","text":"U izvozima","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPredračun određuje cijene onoga što ste predmjerili. \u003Cstrong\u003ESažetak ponude\u003C/strong\u003E pretvara ga u cijenu: dodaje porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i garanciju, i pravi \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF prijedloga\u003C/strong\u003E s vašim uključenim i isključenim stavkama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite ga iz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESažetak ponude i ponuda…\u003C/span\u003E. Sve u njemu čuva se uz predmjer, a svaka promjena se može poništiti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodaci\"\u003EDodaci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpišite postotak u bilo koji od pet (ostale ostavite na 0). Računaju se ovim redoslijedom, svaki na onome što je iznad njega:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERed\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERačuna se kao\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, Rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupne vrijednosti predračuna (osnovna ponuda kada predmjer ima \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Ealternative\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpterećenje rada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% opterećenja × rad: porezi na platni spisak, osiguranje i beneficije na plaće vaših ekipa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrošak\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal + rad + opterećenje rada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPorez na promet na materijal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% poreza × materijal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERežijski troškovi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% režije × (trošak + porez).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDobit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% dobiti × (trošak + porez + režija).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGarancija\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% garancije × sve gore navedeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPonuda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZbir redova.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki red se zaokružuje na cent. Radna knjiga prikazuje iste redove ispod ukupne vrijednosti lista Predračun, sa živim formulama. Sažetak se ažurira dok kucate: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E potvrđuje postotak. Svaka alternativa prikazana je s istim dodacima na vlastitom trošku, pa investitor vidi šta njeno uzimanje zaista mijenja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prijedlog\"\u003EPrijedlog\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpišite šta prijedlog treba da kaže:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProjekt\u003C/strong\u003E (naziv predmjera kada je prazno), \u003Cstrong\u003EZa\u003C/strong\u003E (klijent) i \u003Cstrong\u003EOd\u003C/strong\u003E (vaša firma).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUključeno\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EIsključeno\u003C/strong\u003E: jedno po redu; crtica ili tačka na početku je u redu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUslovi\u003C/strong\u003E: slobodan tekst, na primjer &quot;Važi 30 dana.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENavedi stavke i količine\u003C/strong\u003E: obim, stavku po stavku, s količinama i bez cijena. Odznačite za paušalni prijedlog.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF ponuda\u003C/span\u003E. PDF (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;takeoff&gt; - proposal.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) sadrži datum, blok cijene sa svakim dodatkom i ponudom, alternative, obim, uključeno i isključeno, uslove, te redove za potpis i datum. Ako se neke količine nisu mogle izmjeriti (list bez razmjere), to se navodi ispod cijene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-izvozima\"\u003EU izvozima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada predmjer ima sažetak ponude, CSV se završava njime, a radna knjiga dobija list \u003Cstrong\u003ESažetak ponude\u003C/strong\u003E sa svakim redom, njegovim postotkom i iznosom. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EIzvoz predračuna\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Predračun određuje cijene onoga što ste predmjerili. Sažetak ponude pretvara ga u cijenu: dodaje porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i garanciju, i pravi PDF prijedloga s vašim uključenim i isključenim stavkama. Otvorite ga iz Izvoz › Sažetak ponude i ponuda…. Sve u njemu čuva se uz predmjer, a svaka promjena se može poništiti. Dodaci Upišite postotak u bilo koji od pet (ostale ostavite na 0). Računaju se ovim redoslijedom, svaki na onome što je iznad njega: Red Računa se kao Materijal, Rad Ukupne vrijednosti predračuna (osnovna ponuda kada predmjer ima alternative). Opterećenje rada % opterećenja × rad: porezi na platni spisak, osiguranje i beneficije na plaće vaših ekipa. Trošak Materijal + rad + opterećenje rada. Porez na promet na materijal % poreza × materijal. Režijski troškovi % režije × (trošak + porez). Dobit % dobiti × (trošak + porez + režija). Garancija % garancije × sve gore navedeno. Ponuda Zbir redova. Svaki red se zaokružuje na cent. Radna knjiga prikazuje iste redove ispod ukupne vrijednosti lista Predračun, sa živim formulama. Sažetak se ažurira dok kucate: Enter potvrđuje postotak. Svaka alternativa prikazana je s istim dodacima na vlastitom trošku, pa investitor vidi šta njeno uzimanje zaista mijenja. Prijedlog Upišite šta prijedlog treba da kaže: Projekt (naziv predmjera kada je prazno), Za (klijent) i Od (vaša firma). Uključeno i Isključeno: jedno po redu; crtica ili tačka na početku je u redu. Uslovi: slobodan tekst, na primjer \"Važi 30 dana.\" Navedi stavke i količine: obim, stavku po stavku, s količinama i bez cijena. Odznačite za paušalni prijedlog. Izaberite PDF ponuda. PDF (\u003Ctakeoff\u003E - proposal.pdf) sadrži datum, blok cijene sa svakim dodatkom i ponudom, alternative, obim, uključeno i isključeno, uslove, te redove za potpis i datum. Ako se neke količine nisu mogle izmjeriti (list bez razmjere), to se navodi ispod cijene. U izvozima Kada predmjer ima sažetak ponude, CSV se završava njime, a radna knjiga dobija list Sažetak ponude sa svakim redom, njegovim postotkom i iznosom. Pogledajte Izvoz predračuna.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bid packages and bid leveling","summary":"Split the estimate into packages by trade, send each package's scope to subcontractors, compare the bids that come back on the same scope, and use the chosen bid as the package's price.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["bid leveling","leveling","bid package","subcontractor","sub bid","scope","plug","trade","csi division","compare bids","low bid","bid tab","bidder","award","chosen bid","use a bid","subcontract price"],"headings":[{"id":"packages","text":"Packages","level":2},{"id":"enter-the-bids","text":"Enter the bids","level":2},{"id":"how-the-bids-are-leveled","text":"How the bids are leveled","level":2},{"id":"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price","text":"Use a bid as the package's price","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EA general contractor sends each trade&#039;s scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"packages\"\u003EPackages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook&#039;s quote request has the parts list (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enter-the-bids\"\u003EEnter the bids\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the empty row under the package, type the bidder&#039;s name and the amount of the bid, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E list and tick those items.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach change is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-the-bids-are-leveled\"\u003EHow the bids are leveled\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a \u003Cstrong\u003Eplug\u003C/strong\u003E at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeveled = the bid + the plugs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe lowest leveled bid is marked \u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; on a tie, the one entered first. \u003Cstrong\u003EAgainst our cost\u003C/strong\u003E is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe workbook gets a \u003Cstrong\u003EBid leveling\u003C/strong\u003E sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price\"\u003EUse a bid as the package&#039;s price\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package&#039;s own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, carries the bid&#039;s amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook&#039;s Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package&#039;s material, because the subcontractor supplies it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA package inside an alternate&#039;s bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"A general contractor sends each trade's scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Packages There is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item's CSI number, see Create takeoff items). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid). Choose Scope CSV to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook's quote request has the parts list (see Export the estimate). Enter the bids In the empty row under the package, type the bidder's name and the amount of the bid, then choose Add the bid. If a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its Left out list and tick those items. To correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid. Each change is one step that Ctrl+Z takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff. How the bids are leveled Bids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a plug at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package: Leveled = the bid + the plugs The lowest leveled bid is marked Low; on a tie, the one entered first. Against our cost is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted. The workbook gets a Bid leveling sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out. Use a bid as the package's price Choose Use on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package's own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, Chosen bid, carries the bid's amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that Ctrl+Z undoes. In the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook's Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package's material, because the subcontractor supplies it. A package inside an alternate's bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Spasi i ponovo otvori predmjer","summary":"Spasi predmjer kao projektnu datoteku .takeoff.json, ponovo ga otvori uz iste PDF-ove, i šta se dešava kad PDF nedostaje ili je promijenjen.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["predmjer u PDF-u","ugradi","prilog","spasi","otvori","ponovo otvori","projekat","takeoff.json","nastavi","nastavak","revidirani PDF","promijenjeni PDF","nedostajući PDF","rezervna kopija","automatsko spašavanje","oporavi","pad"],"headings":[{"id":"spasi","text":"Spasi","level":2},{"id":"uvaj-predmjer-unutar-pdf-a","text":"Čuvaj predmjer unutar PDF-a","level":2},{"id":"ako-se-kartica-ili-preglednik-zaustavi","text":"Ako se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi","level":2},{"id":"ponovno-otvaranje","text":"Ponovno otvaranje","level":2},{"id":"kad-pdf-nedostaje","text":"Kad PDF nedostaje","level":2},{"id":"kad-je-pdf-promijenjen","text":"Kad je PDF promijenjen","level":2},{"id":"o-te-ena-ili-tu-a-datoteka","text":"Oštećena ili tuđa datoteka","level":2},{"id":"historija-poni-tavanja","text":"Historija poništavanja","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPredmjer se spašava kao mala projektna datoteka, \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Sadrži tvoje stavke, sklopove, cijene, razmjeru svakog lista i svaku oznaku. \u003Cstrong\u003ENe\u003C/strong\u003E sadrži PDF-ove; pronalazi ih ponovo prema njihovom sadržaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spasi\"\u003ESpasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tvoj preglednik preuzima \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Spašeno (name).takeoff.json. Ponovo se otvara preko istih PDF-ova (poklapaju se prema sadržaju).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremjesti datoteku pored PDF-ova posla, da ostanu zajedno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako spašavanje preuzima novu datoteku. Tvoj preglednik može drugu nazvati \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E; zadrži najnoviju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a koji si otvorio u ovom predmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpasi predmjer je i dalje jedini način da predmjer čuvaš kao datoteku. Dok radiš, TakeoffDesk takođe čuva rezervnu kopiju u ovom pregledniku (pogledaj dolje), a čuvanje u oblaku još nije dostupno. Ako pokušaš zatvoriti karticu s nespašenim promjenama, preglednik pita želiš li otići.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uvaj-predmjer-unutar-pdf-a\"\u003EČuvaj predmjer unutar PDF-a\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF sa predmjerom unutra\u003C/span\u003E preuzima kopiju svakog otvorenog PDF-a, nazvanu \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E, koja nosi cijeli predmjer kao prilog: stavke, oznake, razmjere, ponuđačke površine, sve što sadrži \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Stranice su netaknute, pa izgledaju i štampaju se kao original, a drugi PDF čitači prikazuju predmjer među svojim prilozima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvori taj PDF u TakeoffDesk-u (kako god otvaraš PDF-ove) i on pita \u003Cstrong\u003EOvaj PDF ima predmjer unutra\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori predmjer\u003C/span\u003E da ga vratiš, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo PDF\u003C/span\u003E da otvoriš samo nacrt. Kopija predstavlja PDF iz kojeg je napravljena, pa se \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E spašen iz bilo koje od njih otvara na obje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUz više PDF-ova, svaka kopija nosi cijeli predmjer; otvori ih zajedno. Ponovno spašavanje iz kopije zamjenjuje predmjer unutra, ne dodaje drugi. \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E je i dalje datoteka koju treba čuvati: mala je, i to je ono što automatsko spašavanje i desktop aplikacija pišu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ako-se-kartica-ili-preglednik-zaustavi\"\u003EAko se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENekoliko sekundi nakon svake promjene, TakeoffDesk čuva kopiju predmjera u vlastitom prostoru za pohranu ovog preglednika, zajedno s PDF-ovima kad ukupno iznose 64 MB ili manje. Ništa se ne otprema. Kad spasiš predmjer, započneš novi ili otvoriš drugi projekat, kopija nestaje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko se kartica sruši, preglednik ili računar se zaustavi, ili izađeš s nespašenim promjenama, sljedeći put kad otvoriš TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003EOporaviti tvoj rad?\u003C/strong\u003E i navodi predmjer po nazivu. Odaberi \u003Cstrong\u003EOporavi\u003C/strong\u003E da ga vratiš: stavke, oznake i razmjere se vraćaju, a PDF-ovi se ponovo otvaraju ako su sačuvani. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Oporavljeno (name). Još nije spašeno u datoteku: Spasi predmjer ga čuva.&quot; Kad PDF-ovi bili preveliki da bi se sačuvali, otvori ih ponovo; oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima. Više: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EOporavi svoj rad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovno-otvaranje\"\u003EPonovno otvaranje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevuci datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i njene PDF-ove na stranicu zajedno. Ili odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori planove\u003C/span\u003E za PDF-ove i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori predmjer\u003C/span\u003E za projekat, bilo kojim redom. Statusna traka kaže &quot;Otvoreno (name): 12 stavki, 340 oznaka.&quot; Svaki list dobija svoju razmjeru nazad, a oznake se pojavljuju na listovima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedoslijed PDF-ova nije važan, kao ni njihovi nazivi ili fascikle. TakeoffDesk prepoznaje svaki PDF po otisku njegovog sadržaja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko otvoriš projekat dok trenutni predmjer ima nespašene promjene, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: \u003Cstrong\u003EOtkaži\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOdbaci promjene\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003EPrvo spasi predmjer\u003C/strong\u003E. Otvaranje projekta zamjenjuje trenutne stavke i oznake; PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni ostaju otvoreni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kad-pdf-nedostaje\"\u003EKad PDF nedostaje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko otvoriš projekat bez svih njegovih PDF-ova, statusna traka dodaje &quot;Otvori njegove PDF-ove da vidiš oznake (navedene pod Listovi).&quot; Ispod spiska listova, napomena kaže:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Ovaj predmjer obuhvata i PDF-ove koji nisu otvoreni. Njihove količine se računaju; otvori ih da vidiš i uređuješ njihove oznake:&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Epraćeno nazivima datoteka i veličinama. Njihove oznake i dalje ulaze u svaki zbir i izvoz, s razmjerama na kojima su izmjerene. Otvori te PDF-ove da vidiš i uređuješ oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kad-je-pdf-promijenjen\"\u003EKad je PDF promijenjen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF koji je revidiran, ili samo ponovo spašen drugim programom, ima drugačiji sadržaj, pa je za TakeoffDesk \u003Cstrong\u003Edrugačija datoteka\u003C/strong\u003E, čak i s istim nazivom. U napomeni ispod spiska listova, takva datoteka kaže &quot;datoteka s ovim nazivom je otvorena, ali se sadržaj razlikuje&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake ostaju vezane za staru verziju. I dalje se računaju, na starim pozicijama i razmjerama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERevidirani PDF se otvara kao novi listovi bez razmjere i bez oznaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa prebaciš predmjer na reviziju, otvori oba PDF-a i koristi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUporedi\u003C/span\u003E na novom listu: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EUporedi revidirani list i prebaci predmjer\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-te-ena-ili-tu-a-datoteka\"\u003EOštećena ili tuđa datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk provjerava svaku projektnu datoteku prije upotrebe. Poruke koje možeš vidjeti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(file) nije TakeoffDesk projekat (nije valjan JSON).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ovo nije TakeoffDesk projektna datoteka.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ovaj projekat je spašen novijim TakeoffDesk-om. Otvori ga tamo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;3 oznake su oštećene i izostavljene.&quot; (ostalo se otvara)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"historija-poni-tavanja\"\u003EHistorija poništavanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHistorija poništavanja počinje ispočetka kad otvoriš projekat. Spašavanje je ne briše.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Predmjer se spašava kao mala projektna datoteka, (name).takeoff.json. Sadrži tvoje stavke, sklopove, cijene, razmjeru svakog lista i svaku oznaku. Ne sadrži PDF-ove; pronalazi ih ponovo prema njihovom sadržaju. Spasi Odaberi Spasi predmjer u grupi Datoteka, ili pritisni Ctrl+S. Tvoj preglednik preuzima (name).takeoff.json. Statusna traka kaže \"Spašeno (name).takeoff.json. Ponovo se otvara preko istih PDF-ova (poklapaju se prema sadržaju).\" Premjesti datoteku pored PDF-ova posla, da ostanu zajedno. Svako spašavanje preuzima novu datoteku. Tvoj preglednik može drugu nazvati (name) (1).takeoff.json; zadrži najnoviju. Naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a koji si otvorio u ovom predmjeru. Spasi predmjer je i dalje jedini način da predmjer čuvaš kao datoteku. Dok radiš, TakeoffDesk takođe čuva rezervnu kopiju u ovom pregledniku (pogledaj dolje), a čuvanje u oblaku još nije dostupno. Ako pokušaš zatvoriti karticu s nespašenim promjenama, preglednik pita želiš li otići. Čuvaj predmjer unutar PDF-a Izvoz › PDF sa predmjerom unutra preuzima kopiju svakog otvorenog PDF-a, nazvanu Plans (with takeoff).pdf, koja nosi cijeli predmjer kao prilog: stavke, oznake, razmjere, ponuđačke površine, sve što sadrži .takeoff.json. Stranice su netaknute, pa izgledaju i štampaju se kao original, a drugi PDF čitači prikazuju predmjer među svojim prilozima. Otvori taj PDF u TakeoffDesk-u (kako god otvaraš PDF-ove) i on pita Ovaj PDF ima predmjer unutra: odaberi Otvori predmjer da ga vratiš, ili Samo PDF da otvoriš samo nacrt. Kopija predstavlja PDF iz kojeg je napravljena, pa se .takeoff.json spašen iz bilo koje od njih otvara na obje. Uz više PDF-ova, svaka kopija nosi cijeli predmjer; otvori ih zajedno. Ponovno spašavanje iz kopije zamjenjuje predmjer unutra, ne dodaje drugi. .takeoff.json je i dalje datoteka koju treba čuvati: mala je, i to je ono što automatsko spašavanje i desktop aplikacija pišu. Ako se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi Nekoliko sekundi nakon svake promjene, TakeoffDesk čuva kopiju predmjera u vlastitom prostoru za pohranu ovog preglednika, zajedno s PDF-ovima kad ukupno iznose 64 MB ili manje. Ništa se ne otprema. Kad spasiš predmjer, započneš novi ili otvoriš drugi projekat, kopija nestaje. Ako se kartica sruši, preglednik ili računar se zaustavi, ili izađeš s nespašenim promjenama, sljedeći put kad otvoriš TakeoffDesk pita Oporaviti tvoj rad? i navodi predmjer po nazivu. Odaberi Oporavi da ga vratiš: stavke, oznake i razmjere se vraćaju, a PDF-ovi se ponovo otvaraju ako su sačuvani. Statusna traka kaže \"Oporavljeno (name). Još nije spašeno u datoteku: Spasi predmjer ga čuva.\" Kad PDF-ovi bili preveliki da bi se sačuvali, otvori ih ponovo; oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima. Više: Oporavi svoj rad. Ponovno otvaranje Otvori TakeoffDesk. Prevuci datoteku .takeoff.json i njene PDF-ove na stranicu zajedno. Ili odaberi Otvori planove za PDF-ove i Otvori predmjer za projekat, bilo kojim redom. Statusna traka kaže \"Otvoreno (name): 12 stavki, 340 oznaka.\" Svaki list dobija svoju razmjeru nazad, a oznake se pojavljuju na listovima. Redoslijed PDF-ova nije važan, kao ni njihovi nazivi ili fascikle. TakeoffDesk prepoznaje svaki PDF po otisku njegovog sadržaja. Ako otvoriš projekat dok trenutni predmjer ima nespašene promjene, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: Otkaži, Odbaci promjene ili Prvo spasi predmjer. Otvaranje projekta zamjenjuje trenutne stavke i oznake; PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni ostaju otvoreni. Kad PDF nedostaje Ako otvoriš projekat bez svih njegovih PDF-ova, statusna traka dodaje \"Otvori njegove PDF-ove da vidiš oznake (navedene pod Listovi).\" Ispod spiska listova, napomena kaže: \"Ovaj predmjer obuhvata i PDF-ove koji nisu otvoreni. Njihove količine se računaju; otvori ih da vidiš i uređuješ njihove oznake:\" praćeno nazivima datoteka i veličinama. Njihove oznake i dalje ulaze u svaki zbir i izvoz, s razmjerama na kojima su izmjerene. Otvori te PDF-ove da vidiš i uređuješ oznake. Kad je PDF promijenjen PDF koji je revidiran, ili samo ponovo spašen drugim programom, ima drugačiji sadržaj, pa je za TakeoffDesk drugačija datoteka, čak i s istim nazivom. U napomeni ispod spiska listova, takva datoteka kaže \"datoteka s ovim nazivom je otvorena, ali se sadržaj razlikuje\". Oznake ostaju vezane za staru verziju. I dalje se računaju, na starim pozicijama i razmjerama. Revidirani PDF se otvara kao novi listovi bez razmjere i bez oznaka. Da prebaciš predmjer na reviziju, otvori oba PDF-a i koristi Uporedi na novom listu: Uporedi revidirani list i prebaci predmjer. Oštećena ili tuđa datoteka TakeoffDesk provjerava svaku projektnu datoteku prije upotrebe. Poruke koje možeš vidjeti: \"(file) nije TakeoffDesk projekat (nije valjan JSON).\" \"Ovo nije TakeoffDesk projektna datoteka.\" \"Ovaj projekat je spašen novijim TakeoffDesk-om. Otvori ga tamo.\" \"3 oznake su oštećene i izostavljene.\" (ostalo se otvara) Historija poništavanja Historija poništavanja počinje ispočetka kad otvoriš projekat. Spašavanje je ne briše.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uporedi revidirani list i premjesti predmjer","summary":"Postavite stari list preko revizije, poravnajte ih, pogledajte šta se promijenilo i premjestite predmjer na novi list, uz oznake za provjeru.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["revizija","revidirano","uporedi","preklapanje","stari","novi","promjene","dodatak","bilten","ponovno izdanje","premjesti predmjer","prenos","prenesi","poravnaj","označeno","provjeri"],"headings":[{"id":"uporedi","text":"Uporedi","level":2},{"id":"poravnajte-ih","text":"Poravnajte ih","level":2},{"id":"prona-ite-ta-se-promijenilo","text":"Pronađite šta se promijenilo","level":2},{"id":"premjestite-predmjer","text":"Premjestite predmjer","level":2},{"id":"provjerite-ozna-ene-oznake","text":"Provjerite označene oznake","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKad se list ponovo izda, ne morate ga ponovo predmjeriti. Otvorite stari PDF i novi, uporedite dva lista i prenesite predmjer. TakeoffDesk označava svaku oznaku na kojoj se crtež promijenio, pa provjerite te i zadržite ostale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uporedi\"\u003EUporedi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite oba PDF-a: stari skup i revidirani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori planove\u003C/span\u003E; mogu biti u jednoj datoteci ili u više).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrikažite \u003Cstrong\u003Enovi\u003C/strong\u003E list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUporedi\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista ispod crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stari list s liste. TakeoffDesk predlaže list s istim brojem u drugom PDF-u, ili istu stranicu. Odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUporedi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStari crtež sada leži preko novog, crveno. Tamo gdje se slažu, crvene linije su na crnim; tamo gdje se razlikuju, vidite samo crvene linije (uklonjene) i samo crne linije (dodane). Traka na dnu lista sadrži korake ispod; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZatvori\u003C/span\u003E završava poređenje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"poravnajte-ih\"\u003EPoravnajte ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERevidirani listovi su često štampani malo pomjereno: pomaknuti na stranici ili u nešto drugačijoj veličini. Ako crveni crtež ne leži na crnom, odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPoravnaj po dvije tačke\u003C/strong\u003E i kliknite četiri puta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etačku na starom (crvenom) crtežu, kao centar stuba ili ugao zgrade,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eistu tačku na novom (crnom) crtežu,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edrugu tačku na crvenom crtežu, daleko od prve,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eistu tačku na crnom crtežu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrveni crtež se pomjera, okreće i skalira na crni. Statusna traka kaže koliko je novi crtež veći („veličina × 1,000” kad je ista). Zumirajte za odabir tačaka: što preciznije kliknete, to je bolje poklapanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-ite-ta-se-promijenilo\"\u003EPronađite šta se promijenilo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPronađi promjene\u003C/strong\u003E. TakeoffDesk uspoređuje crtež dva lista: tinta samo na starom listu postaje crvena, tinta samo na novom listu postaje plava, a statusna traka ih broji. Linije koje su se pomjerile za dlaku (ponovno štampanje) se ne broje kao promjene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakođe gleda svaku oznaku na starom listu i broji one koje su na mjestu gdje se crtež promijenio:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edionicu ili površinu kad se crtež promijenio na jednom od njenih krajeva ili uglova, ili duž barem otprilike šestine njene dužine;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebrojanje kad se nešto promijenilo odmah pored njega.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premjestite-predmjer\"\u003EPremjestite predmjer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPremjesti predmjer ovdje\u003C/strong\u003E. Svaka oznaka sa starog lista se premješta na novi, kroz poravnanje, u jednom koraku poništavanja. One pored promjene su označene: crtaju se narandžastim haloom, a traka lista pokazuje „(n) za provjeru”.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko novi list nije imao razmjeru, preuzima razmjeru starog lista (prilagođenu ako su crteži morali biti skalirani da se poklope). Ako je već imao drugačiju razmjeru, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: premještene oznake se mjere u razmjeri novog lista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjerite-ozna-ene-oznake\"\u003EProvjerite označene oznake\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite „(n) za provjeru” na traci lista. Zumira na sljedeću označenu oznaku i odabire je; njen panel kaže zašto je označena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIspravite oznaku ako se crtež promijenio ispod nje (povucite njene uglove, dodajte ili izbrišite oznake, ili je ponovo uklonite).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EProvjereno\u003C/strong\u003E u njenom panelu. Oznaka nestaje, a brojka na traci lista se smanjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznake se čuvaju s predmjerom, pa ih možete provjeriti kasnije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPoređenje radi i na vektorskim PDF-ovima i na skenovima, jer uspoređuje ono što je nacrtano. Skeniran list koji je iskrivljen ili rastegnut može se poklopiti samo grubo s dvije tačke; tada provjerite više oznaka na oko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kad se list ponovo izda, ne morate ga ponovo predmjeriti. Otvorite stari PDF i novi, uporedite dva lista i prenesite predmjer. TakeoffDesk označava svaku oznaku na kojoj se crtež promijenio, pa provjerite te i zadržite ostale. Uporedi Otvorite oba PDF-a: stari skup i revidirani (Otvori planove; mogu biti u jednoj datoteci ili u više). Prikažite novi list. Odaberite Uporedi na traci lista ispod crteža. Odaberite stari list s liste. TakeoffDesk predlaže list s istim brojem u drugom PDF-u, ili istu stranicu. Odaberite Uporedi. Stari crtež sada leži preko novog, crveno. Tamo gdje se slažu, crvene linije su na crnim; tamo gdje se razlikuju, vidite samo crvene linije (uklonjene) i samo crne linije (dodane). Traka na dnu lista sadrži korake ispod; Esc ili Zatvori završava poređenje. Poravnajte ih Revidirani listovi su često štampani malo pomjereno: pomaknuti na stranici ili u nešto drugačijoj veličini. Ako crveni crtež ne leži na crnom, odaberite Poravnaj po dvije tačke i kliknite četiri puta: tačku na starom (crvenom) crtežu, kao centar stuba ili ugao zgrade, istu tačku na novom (crnom) crtežu, drugu tačku na crvenom crtežu, daleko od prve, istu tačku na crnom crtežu. Crveni crtež se pomjera, okreće i skalira na crni. Statusna traka kaže koliko je novi crtež veći („veličina × 1,000” kad je ista). Zumirajte za odabir tačaka: što preciznije kliknete, to je bolje poklapanje. Pronađite šta se promijenilo Odaberite Pronađi promjene. TakeoffDesk uspoređuje crtež dva lista: tinta samo na starom listu postaje crvena, tinta samo na novom listu postaje plava, a statusna traka ih broji. Linije koje su se pomjerile za dlaku (ponovno štampanje) se ne broje kao promjene. Takođe gleda svaku oznaku na starom listu i broji one koje su na mjestu gdje se crtež promijenio: dionicu ili površinu kad se crtež promijenio na jednom od njenih krajeva ili uglova, ili duž barem otprilike šestine njene dužine; brojanje kad se nešto promijenilo odmah pored njega. Premjestite predmjer Odaberite Premjesti predmjer ovdje. Svaka oznaka sa starog lista se premješta na novi, kroz poravnanje, u jednom koraku poništavanja. One pored promjene su označene: crtaju se narandžastim haloom, a traka lista pokazuje „(n) za provjeru”. Ako novi list nije imao razmjeru, preuzima razmjeru starog lista (prilagođenu ako su crteži morali biti skalirani da se poklope). Ako je već imao drugačiju razmjeru, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: premještene oznake se mjere u razmjeri novog lista. Provjerite označene oznake Odaberite „(n) za provjeru” na traci lista. Zumira na sljedeću označenu oznaku i odabire je; njen panel kaže zašto je označena. Ispravite oznaku ako se crtež promijenio ispod nje (povucite njene uglove, dodajte ili izbrišite oznake, ili je ponovo uklonite). Odaberite Provjereno u njenom panelu. Oznaka nestaje, a brojka na traci lista se smanjuje. Oznake se čuvaju s predmjerom, pa ih možete provjeriti kasnije. Poređenje radi i na vektorskim PDF-ovima i na skenovima, jer uspoređuje ono što je nacrtano. Skeniran list koji je iskrivljen ili rastegnut može se poklopiti samo grubo s dvije tačke; tada provjerite više oznaka na oko.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Use TakeoffDesk with an AI assistant","summary":"Let your own AI assistant or script read the takeoff's quantities and estimate, add items and marks, count and measure on a DWG or DXF, and export: permissions, connecting through the dev server, and the activity log.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","assistant","agent","mcp","model context protocol","script","automation","quantities","estimate","permissions","disconnect","activity"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"connect-your-assistant","text":"Connect your assistant","level":2},{"id":"you-stay-in-charge","text":"You stay in charge","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for","text":"What an assistant can ask for","level":2},{"id":"if-something-doesn-t-work","text":"If something doesn't work","level":2},{"id":"see-also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk has \u003Cstrong\u003Eno AI of its own\u003C/strong\u003E and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and go to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, tick \u003Cstrong\u003ELet AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose what it may do: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E is ticked to start with; tick \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E only when you need them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E turns it off too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"connect-your-assistant\"\u003EConnect your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E instead of \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E: the server then also answers assistants at \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp\u003C/code\u003E, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/MCP.md\u003C/code\u003E has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStarted with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"you-stay-in-charge\"\u003EYou stay in charge\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEvery change is one undo step\u003C/strong\u003E, labelled with the assistant&#039;s name for it (for example &quot;Assistant: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back the assistant&#039;s last change as a whole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYou know when one is connected.\u003C/strong\u003E A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EActivity.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E keeps a copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EWhat an assistant can ask for\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETool\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPermission\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet&#039;s scale and marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet_image\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers \u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe items with their units, rates and assembly formulas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;s own CSV or XLSX export\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds items with their units, rates and waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E makes them (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECount from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures a linear or an area item from the drawing&#039;s own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E does (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMeasure from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E); only on a sheet with a scale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA scaled sheet&#039;s measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD package (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E in the 3D check view writes it (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EExport the 3D check view as USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-something-doesn-t-work\"\u003EIf something doesn&#039;t work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools:\u003C/strong\u003E check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the export permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E tick \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, then ask again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;401&quot; or &quot;token&quot; errors:\u003C/strong\u003E the token changed (\u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant&#039;s settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-also\"\u003ESee also\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ERecipes for AI assistants\u003C/a\u003E: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch. TakeoffDesk has no AI of its own and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,) and go to the TakeoffDesk tab. Under Assistants, tick Let AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk. It is off until you do. Choose what it may do: Read is ticked to start with; tick Edit, Save or Export only when you need them. Tools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; Reset TakeoffDesk settings turns it off too. Connect your assistant Assistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with npm run mcp instead of npm start: the server then also answers assistants at http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in devshell/.mcp-token. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. devshell/MCP.md has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token. Started with npm start, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect. You stay in charge Every change is one undo step, labelled with the assistant's name for it (for example \"Assistant: …\"). Ctrl+Z takes back the assistant's last change as a whole. You know when one is connected. A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to Disconnect it. Activity. Settings › TakeoffDesk › Assistants › Activity lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. Save the log keeps a copy. What an assistant can ask for Tool Permission What it does app_info, sheets_list Read The takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet's scale and marks sheet_image Read A picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers marks_add takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF items_list Read The items with their units, rates and assembly formulas takeoff_quantities Read Quantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero takeoff_estimate Read The priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals takeoff_export Export TakeoffDesk's own CSV or XLSX export items_add Edit Adds items with their units, rates and waste marks_add Edit Measures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Read On a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as CAD count makes them (Count from a drawing) cad_count_add Edit Counts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new cad_measure Edit Measures a linear or an area item from the drawing's own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as Measure drawing does (Measure from a drawing); only on a sheet with a scale usd_export Export A scaled sheet's measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (.usdz, .usda or .usdc), as USD package (.usdz) in the 3D check view writes it (Export the 3D check view as USD) With Edit ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there. If something doesn't work The assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools: check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with npm run mcp. \"needs the export permission\": tick Export under Assistants, then ask again. \"401\" or \"token\" errors: the token changed (devshell/.mcp-token was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant's settings. See also Recipes for AI assistants: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Početak novog predmjera","summary":"Obrišite sve i započnite prazan predmjer bez ponovnog učitavanja stranice, a prije toga sačuvajte svoj rad.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["novi","novi predmjer","obriši","resetuj","počni ispočetka","prazno","zatvori PDF-ove","sljedeći posao"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovi\u003C/span\u003E zatvara sve PDF-ove i počinje prazan predmjer na istoj stranici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpasite trenutni predmjer ako ga želite zadržati: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovi\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko postoje nesačuvane promjene, TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003ENesačuvan predmjer\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrvo spasi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E (preuzima projekat, zatim briše), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbaci promjene\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkaži\u003C/span\u003E. Ekran se vraća u prazno stanje: nema PDF-ova, stavki, oznaka ni razmjera. Statusna traka kaže „Novi predmjer. Otvorite PDF-ove da započnete.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EŠta se briše:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esvaki otvoreni PDF, njegovi listovi i sličice,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Estavke, sklopovi, oznake i razmjere,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ezumiranje i položaj svakog lista,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehistorija poništavanja (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovi\u003C/span\u003E se ne može poništiti),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Erežim luka i svaka pretraga ili pregled auto brojanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaše datoteke na disku se ne diraju. Da ponovo preuzmete stari predmjer, otvorite njegov \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i PDF-ove: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EČuvanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki novi predmjer počinje bez stavki. Da prenesete stavke, prvo ih kopirajte: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E pod Stavke (ili kopirajte oznake, koje nose svoje stavke), zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E u novom predmjeru. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka\u003C/a\u003E. Za stavke koje koristite na svakom poslu, držite ih u svojoj \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Ebiblioteci cijena\u003C/a\u003E i dodajte ih odatle, ili dodajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Epaket radova\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Novi zatvara sve PDF-ove i počinje prazan predmjer na istoj stranici. Spasite trenutni predmjer ako ga želite zadržati: Spasi predmjer ili Ctrl+S. Odaberite Novi u grupi Datoteka. Ako postoje nesačuvane promjene, TakeoffDesk pita Nesačuvan predmjer: odaberite Prvo spasi predmjer (preuzima projekat, zatim briše), Odbaci promjene ili Otkaži. Ekran se vraća u prazno stanje: nema PDF-ova, stavki, oznaka ni razmjera. Statusna traka kaže „Novi predmjer. Otvorite PDF-ove da započnete.“ Šta se briše: svaki otvoreni PDF, njegovi listovi i sličice, stavke, sklopovi, oznake i razmjere, zumiranje i položaj svakog lista, historija poništavanja (Novi se ne može poništiti), režim luka i svaka pretraga ili pregled auto brojanja. Vaše datoteke na disku se ne diraju. Da ponovo preuzmete stari predmjer, otvorite njegov .takeoff.json i PDF-ove: pogledajte Čuvanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera. Svaki novi predmjer počinje bez stavki. Da prenesete stavke, prvo ih kopirajte: Kopiraj stavku pod Stavke (ili kopirajte oznake, koje nose svoje stavke), zatim Zalijepi u novom predmjeru. Pogledajte Kopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka. Za stavke koje koristite na svakom poslu, držite ih u svojoj biblioteci cijena i dodajte ih odatle, ili dodajte paket radova.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izvezi 3D prikaz za provjeru kao USD","summary":"Zapiši zidove, ploče, limove i dionice iz 3D prikaza za provjeru kao USD paket, svaki sa svojom stavkom i količinom.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","izvoz","3d","prikaz za provjeru","zidovi","ploče","prikazivanje"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EU 3D prikazu za provjeru izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD paket (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E pored \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki objekat (zid, ploča, lim, brojački stub ili dionica) je jedan objekat u datoteci, nazvan po svojoj stavki, i nosi naziv stavke i količinu koju je prikaz izmjerio. Ploče i limovi su providni kao u prikazu. Datoteka je u metrima, sa Z osom prema gore.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"U 3D prikazu za provjeru izaberite USD paket (.usdz) pored GLB. Svaki objekat (zid, ploča, lim, brojački stub ili dionica) je jedan objekat u datoteci, nazvan po svojoj stavki, i nosi naziv stavke i količinu koju je prikaz izmjerio. Ploče i limovi su providni kao u prikazu. Datoteka je u metrima, sa Z osom prema gore.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Coming from other takeoff software","summary":"How the habits of dedicated takeoff programs and PDF markup tools map to TakeoffDesk, and the differences that trip people up.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["switching","migrate","conditions","parts","measurement tools","markups list","quantity link","takeoff habits","differences","compare"],"headings":[{"id":"habits-mapped","text":"Habits mapped","level":2},{"id":"differences-that-trip-people-up","text":"Differences that trip people up","level":2},{"id":"not-here-yet","text":"Not here yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E menu style in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habits-mapped\"\u003EHabits mapped\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou are used to\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the PDFs and the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E, drawn in the marked PDF. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003ENotes, clouds and highlights\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff lives in the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EItems\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components with a formula using \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetting the page scale, or calibrating (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group, per sheet. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E measures a known dimension.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApplying one scale to a page range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: set each sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: one scale per sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHolding Shift for straight lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E snaps to 45° steps, the same idea.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESnapping to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to turn it off, as in CAD programs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount tool (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisual search for symbols (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): box one symbol, review, add.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs or deductions in areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) on a selected area, and round cut-outs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeductions on linear runs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraw the run straight through and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E) for the opening. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArc segments in a polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): click a point on the curve, then its end.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExporting to Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E with live formulas, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEscape to stop a tool\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E cancels and returns to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click to finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"differences-that-trip-people-up\"\u003EDifferences that trip people up\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe takeoff is not inside your PDF.\u003C/strong\u003E Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDFs are matched by contents, not by name.\u003C/strong\u003E A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero.\u003C/strong\u003E If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says &quot;Incomplete&quot;. In many programs you would just see 0. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThere is no page-size guessing.\u003C/strong\u003E Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or &quot;fit to page&quot; PDF needs \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E. Always use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne item, one main type, more if you ask.\u003C/strong\u003E An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under \u003Cstrong\u003EAlso measure\u003C/strong\u003E: each is priced on its own row. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormulas run on totals.\u003C/strong\u003E Assembly formulas use the item&#039;s totals across every sheet, not each run separately. \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPerimeter includes cut-outs.\u003C/strong\u003E An area&#039;s \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E adds the edges of its holes. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDragging pans.\u003C/strong\u003E A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA recovery copy, not a cloud.\u003C/strong\u003E TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EIf the tab or the browser stops\u003C/a\u003E), but the takeoff is yours to save: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cloud saving is not available yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEverything is in the browser.\u003C/strong\u003E There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-here-yet\"\u003ENot here yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPer-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWhat is not built yet\u003C/a\u003E for the full list and what to do instead.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"If you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below. If you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the Takeoff desk menu style in Settings › TakeoffDesk › Menus, keys and mouse: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See Menus, keys and mouse. Habits mapped You are used to In TakeoffDesk Opening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift) Open the PDFs and the .takeoff.json project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files. A markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam) Markup on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under Markups, drawn in the marked PDF. See Notes, clouds and highlights. Measurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam) The takeoff lives in the .takeoff.json file. Marked PDF writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; PDF with the takeoff inside writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk. Takeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Items under Items: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates. Parts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift) The item's Assembly: components with a formula using L H A N P. Setting the page scale, or calibrating (both) Preset list or Calibrate in the Scale group, per sheet. Check measures a known dimension. Applying one scale to a page range Not yet: set each sheet. Viewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam) Not yet: one scale per sheet. Polylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift) Linear (L) and Area (A). Holding Shift for straight lines Shift snaps to 45° steps, the same idea. Snapping to the drawing's lines On by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with F3 to turn it off, as in CAD programs. Count tool (both) Count (C). Visual search for symbols (Bluebeam) Auto count (S): box one symbol, review, add. Cut-outs or deductions in areas Cut-out (X) on a selected area, and round cut-outs. Deductions on linear runs Draw the run straight through and press E (Deduct) for the opening. See Measure linear runs. Arc segments in a polyline Arc (R): click a point on the curve, then its end. The Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam) The Quantities table, By item or By sheet. Estimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift) The same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, Job total. Exporting to Excel XLSX with live formulas, or CSV. Escape to stop a tool Esc cancels and returns to Select. Right-click to finish Right-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu. Differences that trip people up The takeoff is not inside your PDF. Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the .takeoff.json file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a PDF with the takeoff inside. PDFs are matched by contents, not by name. A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Unscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero. If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says \"Incomplete\". In many programs you would just see 0. See Set the scale. There is no page-size guessing. Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or \"fit to page\" PDF needs Calibrate. Always use Check. One item, one main type, more if you ask. An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the P variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under Also measure: each is priced on its own row. See One item, several kinds of marks. Formulas run on totals. Assembly formulas use the item's totals across every sheet, not each run separately. N (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall. Perimeter includes cut-outs. An area's P adds the edges of its holes. See Measure areas with cut-outs. Dragging pans. A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except Auto count. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll. A recovery copy, not a cloud. TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (If the tab or the browser stops), but the takeoff is yours to save: Ctrl+S. Cloud saving is not available yet. Everything is in the browser. There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded. Not here yet Per-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See What is not built yet for the full list and what to do instead.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"TakeoffDesk settings","summary":"Show inches to 1/16, 1/8 or 1/4, start new items with a waste percentage, choose where the Auto count slider starts, snap to the drawing's lines or to 45° without holding Shift, set how wide a door Room fill closes, and pick the 3D view's corner indicator.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["settings","preferences","options","precision","fractions","inches","rounding","waste","default waste","auto count","threshold","match","slider","snap","45","angle","shift","view cube","axis icon","corner indicator","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"feet-and-inches","text":"Feet and inches","level":2},{"id":"waste-to-start-with","text":"Waste to start with","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts","text":"Auto count: where the match slider starts","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines","text":"Snap to the drawing's own lines","level":2},{"id":"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes","text":"Room fill: how wide an opening it closes","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift","text":"Snap to 45° without holding Shift","level":2},{"id":"count-marker-size","text":"Count marker size","level":2},{"id":"corner-indicator","text":"Corner indicator","level":2},{"id":"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins","text":"Path tool: the largest gap it joins","level":2},{"id":"measurement-labels","text":"Measurement labels","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear in the app bar or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. The first tab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, holds the settings that belong to this app; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk&#039;s settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E puts them back to the start.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"feet-and-inches\"\u003EFeet and inches\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShow lengths to the nearest \u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (the start), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waste-to-start-with\"\u003EWaste to start with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts\"\u003EAuto count: where the match slider starts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E slider sits when an \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s own lines\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes\"\u003ERoom fill: how wide an opening it closes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom fill closes openings up to\u003C/span\u003E sets how wide a door opening or gap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E tool treats as closed: 3&#039;-0&quot; to 8&#039;-0&quot;, 4&#039;-0&quot; at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EFill a room with one click\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift\"\u003ESnap to 45° without holding Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOff at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hold \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to click at any angle. The status bar then reads &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot;. The point you click on an arc&#039;s curve and circles are never snapped; an arc&#039;s end is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"count-marker-size\"\u003ECount marker size\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow big the count dots are: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtra small\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E (the start: the size the dots always had) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge\u003C/span\u003E. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"corner-indicator\"\u003ECorner indicator\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E only: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView cube\u003C/span\u003E (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis icon\u003C/span\u003E (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENone\u003C/span\u003E. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins\"\u003EPath tool: the largest gap it joins\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath tool: largest gap to join\u003C/span\u003E is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing&#039;s lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E change it while you pick, and this field follows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EPick the lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measurement-labels\"\u003EMeasurement labels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShow measurement labels on marks\u003C/strong\u003E writes the length of each segment and the size of a selected area on the sheet. It is off at the start; the figures are always in the item panel, the status bar and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Open Settings with the gear in the app bar or Ctrl+,. The first tab, TakeoffDesk, holds the settings that belong to this app; General holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk's settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. Reset TakeoffDesk settings puts them back to the start. Feet and inches Show lengths to the nearest 1/16\" (the start), 1/8\" or 1/4\". This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar. Only the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16\". Waste to start with The waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste. Auto count: where the match slider starts Where the Match slider sits when an Auto count search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review. Snap to the drawing's own lines On at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. F3 and Snap in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: Snap to the drawing's lines. Room fill: how wide an opening it closes Room fill closes openings up to sets how wide a door opening or gap the Room tool treats as closed: 3'-0\" to 8'-0\", 4'-0\" at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See Fill a room with one click. Snap to 45° without holding Shift Off at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding Shift; hold Shift to click at any angle. The status bar then reads \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\". The point you click on an arc's curve and circles are never snapped; an arc's end is. Count marker size How big the count dots are: Extra small, Small, Medium (the start: the size the dots always had) or Large. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: Count by hand. Corner indicator For the 3D check view only: View cube (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), Axis icon (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or None. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one. Path tool: the largest gap it joins Path tool: largest gap to join is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing's lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. [ and ] change it while you pick, and this field follows. See Pick the lines. Measurement labels Show measurement labels on marks writes the length of each segment and the size of a selected area on the sheet. It is off at the start; the figures are always in the item panel, the status bar and Quantities.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Meniji, tipke i miš","summary":"Izaberite stil menija koji odgovara načinu na koji već radite, dodijelite bilo kojoj naredbi svoju tipku, premjestite naredbe između menija i podesite šta rade točkić i dugmad miša.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["stil menija","meniji","traka menija","traka","kartice trake","alatna traka","prečice","tipke","prilagodi","ponovno dodijeli","miš","točkić","obrni","smjer zumiranja","srednje dugme","desno dugme","pomjeranje pogleda","izvoz","uvoz","prebacivanje","poznato","radni sto za predmjer","uvjeti"],"headings":[{"id":"tri-stila","text":"Tri stila","level":2},{"id":"prilagodite-po-svom","text":"Prilagodite po svom","level":2},{"id":"mi","text":"Miš","level":2},{"id":"ponesite-ga-sa-sobom","text":"Ponesite ga sa sobom","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENaredbe aplikacije TakeoffDesk su iste bez obzira kojim putem do njih dođete. \u003Cstrong\u003EStil menija\u003C/strong\u003E samo određuje gdje se naredbe nalaze na ekranu, kako se tamo zovu i koje tipke ih pokreću. Odaberite ga u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeniji, tipke i miš\u003C/span\u003E; promjena je odmah vidljiva, a ovaj pregledač to pamti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tri-stila\"\u003ETri stila\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta dobijate\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESopstvena alatna traka aplikacije TakeoffDesk: Datoteka, Izvoz, Razmjera, Predmjer, Uređivanje i Pogled, sa jednoslovnim tipkama alata. Početni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni sto za predmjer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETraka menija (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPogled\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačavanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E) iznad jednog reda alata za predmjer, kako programi za predmjer na ekranu raspoređuju svoje. Stavke se na tom redu zovu uvjeti. Iste tipke, plus \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za novu stavku. Predlošci razmjere premještaju se na traku lista, pored razmjere lista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka predmjera\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKartice trake nazvane po poslu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E (mjerenje, oblik, razmjera, iz crteža, uvjeti), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPogled\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačavanje\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredračun\u003C/span\u003E (radna sveska, označeni PDF-ovi, ponuda), sa menijem \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E i brzim redom sa dugmadima za otvori, spasi, poništi i ponovi. Alati koje koristite cijeli dan su veliki, a njihovi susjedi mali i poredani jedan preko drugog. Iste tipke; predlošci razmjere premještaju se na traku lista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESva tri stila zadržavaju tipke aplikacije TakeoffDesk: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odabir, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E linijski, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E površina, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E krug, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prostorija, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E putanja (odabir linija PDF-a), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E izrez, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E brojanje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E auto brojanje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kalibracija, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E provjera, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E režim luka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E režim odbitka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za uklapanje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E 3D prikaz provjere, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hvatanje, i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlati trake lista (bilješke, oblaci, isticanja, Uporedi, 3D) čekaju dok nije otvoren PDF; ako ih odaberete prije toga, statusna linija to kaže.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipka koja pripada rasporedu aplikacije TakeoffDesk, ali ju je vaš stil dodijelio drugoj naredbi, ne radi ništa, a statusna linija kaže gdje je otišla njena naredba („U Mojim tipkama, Brojanje je Ctrl+Alt+C“). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i strelice uvijek zadržavaju svoje značenje. Dok crtate dionicu ili obris, lijepite ili pregledate auto brojanje, slova i brojevi upisane dužine ostaju uz crtež.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prilagodite-po-svom\"\u003EPrilagodite po svom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stil koji je najbliži onome što želite, zatim kliknite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipke i meniji\u003C/span\u003E pronađite naredbu (pomaže polje za pretragu). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj ključ\u003C/span\u003E i pritisnite tipku, ili dvije tipke jednu za drugom za dvoslovnu tipku. Kliknite tipku da je uklonite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUz traku menija, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGdje stoji\u003C/span\u003E premješta naredbu u drugi meni ili u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo tipke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiš\u003C/span\u003E podesite točkić i dugmad koja pomjeraju list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDajte mu ime i kliknite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESačuvaj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EČuvanje ugrađenog stila pravi vašu kopiju („Moj radni sto za predmjer“); ugrađeni se nikad ne mijenja. Tipka dodijeljena dvjema naredbama prikazuje se crveno i mora se ispraviti prije snimanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mi\"\u003EMiš\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETočkić miša\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkrolanje prema gore zumira unutra\u003C/span\u003E (početno) ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkrolanje prema gore zumira van\u003C/span\u003E, i koliko brzo. Štipanje na tačpadu uvijek zumira onako kako se pomjeraju vaši prsti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomjeranje lista\u003C/strong\u003E: srednjim dugmetom, desnim dugmetom ili oboje. Prevlačenje lijevim dugmetom po praznom papiru i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sa prevlačenjem uvijek pomjeraju pogled; desni klik bez prevlačenja uvijek završava dionicu ili obris.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrevlačenje u 3D prikazima\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvaki prikaz zasebno\u003C/span\u003E zadržava dugmad 3D prikaza provjere (lijevo i srednje kruži, desno pomjera). Ili postavite srednje i desno dugme na kruženje, pomjeranje, zumiranje ili ništa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uz dugme mijenja mjesta kruženju i pomjeranju. Lijevo dugme uvijek kruži i bira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponesite-ga-sa-sobom\"\u003EPonesite ga sa sobom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E čuva stil u upotrebi kao malu datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje jednu, sa drugog računara ili od kolege. Uvezena datoteka može pokazivati samo na naredbe aplikacije TakeoffDesk: sve drugo u njoj se izostavlja i broji u statusnoj liniji. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši ovaj stil\u003C/span\u003E uklanja jedan od vaših.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOve postavke ostaju u ovom pregledaču. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoristi ovaj stil u svakoj aplikaciji\u003C/span\u003E ispod kartica stilova čini da se svaka aplikacija otvara u odgovarajućem stilu (sopstvena alatna traka, traka menija ili traka kartica), sa promjenama koje ste napravili u svakoj aplikaciji. TakeoffDesk nema stil sa komandnom linijom: kada se jedan odabere za svaku aplikaciju, TakeoffDesk zadržava sopstvenu alatnu traku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka predmjera\u003C/span\u003E je također traka rasporeda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka i pregled projekta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E): pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EEkran aplikacije TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovezano: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003ETastatura i miš\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke aplikacije TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EDolazak sa drugog softvera za predmjer\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Naredbe aplikacije TakeoffDesk su iste bez obzira kojim putem do njih dođete. Stil menija samo određuje gdje se naredbe nalaze na ekranu, kako se tamo zovu i koje tipke ih pokreću. Odaberite ga u Postavke (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffDesk › Meniji, tipke i miš; promjena je odmah vidljiva, a ovaj pregledač to pamti. Tri stila Stil Šta dobijate TakeoffDesk Sopstvena alatna traka aplikacije TakeoffDesk: Datoteka, Izvoz, Razmjera, Predmjer, Uređivanje i Pogled, sa jednoslovnim tipkama alata. Početni. Radni sto za predmjer Traka menija (Datoteka, Uređivanje, Pogled, Razmjera, Predmjer, Stavke, Označavanje, Izvoz) iznad jednog reda alata za predmjer, kako programi za predmjer na ekranu raspoređuju svoje. Stavke se na tom redu zovu uvjeti. Iste tipke, plus N za novu stavku. Predlošci razmjere premještaju se na traku lista, pored razmjere lista. Traka predmjera Kartice trake nazvane po poslu: Predmjer (mjerenje, oblik, razmjera, iz crteža, uvjeti), Uređivanje, Pogled, Označavanje i Predračun (radna sveska, označeni PDF-ovi, ponuda), sa menijem Datoteka i brzim redom sa dugmadima za otvori, spasi, poništi i ponovi. Alati koje koristite cijeli dan su veliki, a njihovi susjedi mali i poredani jedan preko drugog. Iste tipke; predlošci razmjere premještaju se na traku lista. Sva tri stila zadržavaju tipke aplikacije TakeoffDesk: V odabir, L linijski, A površina, O krug, B prostorija, P putanja (odabir linija PDF-a), X izrez, C brojanje, S auto brojanje, K kalibracija, D provjera, R režim luka, E režim odbitka, F i W za uklapanje, 3 3D prikaz provjere, F3 hvatanje, i Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Alati trake lista (bilješke, oblaci, isticanja, Uporedi, 3D) čekaju dok nije otvoren PDF; ako ih odaberete prije toga, statusna linija to kaže. Tipka koja pripada rasporedu aplikacije TakeoffDesk, ali ju je vaš stil dodijelio drugoj naredbi, ne radi ništa, a statusna linija kaže gdje je otišla njena naredba („U Mojim tipkama, Brojanje je Ctrl+Alt+C“). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space i strelice uvijek zadržavaju svoje značenje. Dok crtate dionicu ili obris, lijepite ili pregledate auto brojanje, slova i brojevi upisane dužine ostaju uz crtež. Prilagodite po svom Odaberite stil koji je najbliži onome što želite, zatim kliknite Prilagodi…. Na Tipke i meniji pronađite naredbu (pomaže polje za pretragu). Dodaj ključ i pritisnite tipku, ili dvije tipke jednu za drugom za dvoslovnu tipku. Kliknite tipku da je uklonite. Uz traku menija, Gdje stoji premješta naredbu u drugi meni ili u Samo tipke. Na Miš podesite točkić i dugmad koja pomjeraju list. Dajte mu ime i kliknite Sačuvaj. Čuvanje ugrađenog stila pravi vašu kopiju („Moj radni sto za predmjer“); ugrađeni se nikad ne mijenja. Tipka dodijeljena dvjema naredbama prikazuje se crveno i mora se ispraviti prije snimanja. Miš Točkić miša: Skrolanje prema gore zumira unutra (početno) ili Skrolanje prema gore zumira van, i koliko brzo. Štipanje na tačpadu uvijek zumira onako kako se pomjeraju vaši prsti. Pomjeranje lista: srednjim dugmetom, desnim dugmetom ili oboje. Prevlačenje lijevim dugmetom po praznom papiru i Space sa prevlačenjem uvijek pomjeraju pogled; desni klik bez prevlačenja uvijek završava dionicu ili obris. Prevlačenje u 3D prikazima: Svaki prikaz zasebno zadržava dugmad 3D prikaza provjere (lijevo i srednje kruži, desno pomjera). Ili postavite srednje i desno dugme na kruženje, pomjeranje, zumiranje ili ništa; Shift uz dugme mijenja mjesta kruženju i pomjeranju. Lijevo dugme uvijek kruži i bira. Ponesite ga sa sobom Izvoz čuva stil u upotrebi kao malu datoteku .ccinput.json; Uvezi… dodaje jednu, sa drugog računara ili od kolege. Uvezena datoteka može pokazivati samo na naredbe aplikacije TakeoffDesk: sve drugo u njoj se izostavlja i broji u statusnoj liniji. Izbriši ovaj stil uklanja jedan od vaših. Ove postavke ostaju u ovom pregledaču. Koristi ovaj stil u svakoj aplikaciji ispod kartica stilova čini da se svaka aplikacija otvara u odgovarajućem stilu (sopstvena alatna traka, traka menija ili traka kartica), sa promjenama koje ste napravili u svakoj aplikaciji. TakeoffDesk nema stil sa komandnom linijom: kada se jedan odabere za svaku aplikaciju, TakeoffDesk zadržava sopstvenu alatnu traku. Traka predmjera je također traka rasporeda Traka i pregled projekta (Postavke › Globalno › Raspored): pogledajte Ekran aplikacije TakeoffDesk. Povezano: Tastatura i miš · Postavke aplikacije TakeoffDesk · Dolazak sa drugog softvera za predmjer","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tastatura i miš","summary":"Svaka tipka, miš, tačpad i radnja dodirom u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk, grupisano, sa razlikama među platformama.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["tipke","prečice","tastatura","miš","tačpad","dodir","pomjeranje pogleda","zumiranje","točkić","desni klik","dvostruki klik","razmaknica","shift","kopiraj","zalijepi","izreži","dupliciraj","odaberi sve"],"headings":[{"id":"alati","text":"Alati","level":2},{"id":"dok-crtate","text":"Dok crtate","level":2},{"id":"odabir-i-ure-ivanje","text":"Odabir i uređivanje","level":2},{"id":"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje","text":"Kopiranje i lijepljenje","level":2},{"id":"datoteke","text":"Datoteke","level":2},{"id":"prikaz-i-listovi","text":"Prikaz i listovi","level":2},{"id":"3d-prikaz","text":"3D prikaz","level":2},{"id":"auto-brojanje","text":"Auto brojanje","level":2},{"id":"pomo","text":"Pomoć","level":2},{"id":"dijalozi-i-polja","text":"Dijalozi i polja","level":2},{"id":"napomene-o-platformama","text":"Napomene o platformama","level":2},{"id":"tipke-koje-pregleda-zadr-ava","text":"Tipke koje pregledač zadržava","level":2},{"id":"gdje-je-premjesti","text":"Gdje je Premjesti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETipke sa slovima rade kada je pokazivač bilo gdje na stranici i ne kucate u polju. Dok je dijalog otvoren, važe njegove tipke. Slova rade sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili bez njega.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alati\"\u003EAlati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAlat\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinijski\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKrug\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E (popuni prostoriju jednim klikom)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E uključen ili isključen (u Linijskom, Površini i Izrezu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E uključen ili isključen: sljedeći segmenti dionice se crtaju, ali se ne broje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECifra, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E dok crtate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnos\u003C/span\u003E: unesite dužinu ili koordinate, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E postavlja tačku (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003EMjerenje linijskih dionica\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E (prvo odaberite površinu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E razmjeru\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dok-crtate\"\u003EDok crtate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavlja tačku (tačku, uz Brojanje).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPutanja: odaberite cijelu povezanu putanju linije PDF-a ili obris oko klika (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EOdabir linija PDF-a\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje za linije crteža uključeno ili isključeno (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EHvatanje za linije crteža\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E držan pri kliku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvata segment na 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135° u odnosu na posljednju tačku. Ne važi za tačke luka ni krugove.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvostruki klik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDesni klik (bez pomjeranja)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na prvu tačku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara površinu ili izrez (od treće tačke).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUklanja posljednju tačku (prvo tačku luka koja čeka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdbacuje tačku luka koja čeka; zatim poništava nedovršenu oznaku; zatim se vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odabir-i-ure-ivanje\"\u003EOdabir i uređivanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na oznaku (alat Odaberi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire je i čini njenu stavku aktivnom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na oznaku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje je u izbor ili je uklanja iz njega.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire sve oznake na otvorenom listu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevucite ručicu ugla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPremješta tu tačku (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hvata na 45°). Radi kada je odabrana jedna oznaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBriše odabrane oznake (kada ne crtate).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENe odabire ništa: briše izbor i liniju provjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoništi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPonovi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje\"\u003EKopiranje i lijepljenje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopira odabrane oznake, sa njihovim stavkama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzreže: kopira odabrane oznake, zatim ih briše.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZalijepi: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba da ide.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZalijepi na mjestu: isto mjesto na otvorenom listu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDupliraj odabrane oznake: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba da ide.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENe postavlja ništa: poništava lijepljenje ili duplikat koji je na pokazivaču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESlova sama po sebi i dalje biraju alate (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E); samo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uz njih kopira i lijepi. U tekstualnom polju ove tipke kopiraju i lijepe tekst kao obično. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše odabranu oznaku kada ne crtate. Ako se to desi slučajno, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"datoteke\"\u003EDatoteke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori planove\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOve dvije rade i dok kucate u polju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prikaz-i-listovi\"\u003EPrikaz i listovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočkić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira unutra i van na mjestu pokazivača.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevlačenje (lijevim, srednjim ili desnim dugmetom)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomjera pogled. U \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E prevlačenje lijevim dugmetom umjesto toga crta okvir za pretragu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E držan + prevlačenje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomjera pogled, u bilo kojem alatu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijela stranica\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠirina\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira unutra na sredini prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira van na sredini prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESljedeći ili prethodni list na spisku listova.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrebacuje načine rada preko cijelog ekrana (Control na svim platformama, također na Mac-u).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvara ili zatvara ovu pomoć, panel sa strane.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3D prikaz provjere lista, uključen ili isključen.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-prikaz\"\u003E3D prikaz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevlačenje, ili prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKruži oko objekta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomjera pogled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočkić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira na mjestu pokazivača. Na tačpadu, prevlačenje sa dva prsta kruži, a štipanje zumira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire oznaku ispod pokazivača (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik dodaje ili uklanja).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira na cijeli sadržaj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVraća na ravan list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EProvjera predmjera u 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-brojanje\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevucite okvir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUokviruje simbol za pretragu (pokreće pretragu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na okvir podudaranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdbacuje ga ili vraća.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtkazuje pokrenutu pretragu ili odbacuje pregled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pomo\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvara ili zatvara panel pomoći (također dugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E u traci aplikacije). Radi u svakom alatu, čak i dok kucate u polju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara panel pomoći. U njegovom polju za pretragu, prvi Esc briše pretragu. Dok je panel otvoren, Esc pritisnut nakon klika na list prvo zatvara panel; pritisnite ga ponovo da otkažete u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa mnogim Mac tastaturama gornji red kontroliše svjetlinu i zvuk. Pritisnite fn sa F1, ili uključite „Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys“ u Postavkama sistema, pod Tastatura.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dijalozi-i-polja\"\u003EDijalozi i polja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠta radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU polju: primjenjuje vrijednost. U dijalogu za kalibraciju: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi razmjeru\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara dijalog (kao \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkaži\u003C/span\u003E); zatvara obrazac \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova stavka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrelazi na sljedeće polje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene-o-platformama\"\u003ENapomene o platformama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je tipka Command: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cijeli ekran je izuzetak: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDesni klik je klik sa dva prsta na tačpadu, kada je sekundarni klik uključen u Postavkama sistema, pod Tačpad. TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarno dugme; Control-klik može se računati kao običan klik i dodati tačku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPomicanje sa dva prsta na tačpadu zumira list (ne pomjera ga). Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite, ili držite razmaknicu i prevucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up i Page Down su fn sa strelicama gore i dolje na tastaturama bez njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBackspace je tipka označena natpisom Delete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa tačpadu laptopa, pomicanje sa dva prsta zumira list. Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je Ctrl. Neka radna okruženja koriste sopstvene prečice Ctrl+Alt ili Super; TakeoffDesk ne koristi nijednu od njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa tačpadu, pomicanje sa dva prsta zumira list. Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk dodir čita kao jedan pokazivač:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDodir postavlja tačku, odabire oznaku ili dodaje tačku brojanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevlačenje jednim prstom pomjera list (u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E crta okvir za pretragu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZumiranje štipanjem još nije podržano. Koristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijela stranica\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠirina\u003C/span\u003E, ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na tastaturi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZa zatvaranje površine dodirnite njenu prvu tačku. Za završetak dionice dvaput dodirnite tamo gdje pregledač dvostruki dodir pretvara u dvostruki klik, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na tastaturi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENema prikaza dužine uživo dok ne dodirnete, jer nema lebdenja pokazivača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETastatura i miš ili tačpad su danas bolji način za predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke-koje-pregleda-zadr-ava\"\u003ETipke koje pregledač zadržava\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPregledači zadržavaju neke prečice za sebe, pa ih stranica ne može koristiti: zatvaranje kartice (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), nova kartica ili prozor (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i zumiranje pregledača (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Zato TakeoffDesk zumira list točkićem i samim tipkama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ako greškom pritisnete \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, cijela stranica se uvećava; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003ETipke, miševi i tačpadovi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-je-premjesti\"\u003EGdje je Premjesti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENe postoji naredba Premjesti: odaberite tačku brojanja i prevucite je, ili odaberite površinu ili liniju i prevucite njene ručice uglova.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tipke sa slovima rade kada je pokazivač bilo gdje na stranici i ne kucate u polju. Dok je dijalog otvoren, važe njegove tipke. Slova rade sa Shift ili bez njega. Alati Tipka Alat V Odaberi L Linijski A Površina O Krug B Prostorija (popuni prostoriju jednim klikom) R Luk uključen ili isključen (u Linijskom, Površini i Izrezu) E Odbitak uključen ili isključen: sljedeći segmenti dionice se crtaju, ali se ne broje Cifra, @ ili # dok crtate Otvorite okvir Unos: unesite dužinu ili koordinate, Enter postavlja tačku (Mjerenje linijskih dionica) X Izrez (prvo odaberite površinu) C Brojanje S Auto brojanje K Kalibriraj D Provjeri razmjeru Dok crtate Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Klik Postavlja tačku (tačku, uz Brojanje). P Putanja: odaberite cijelu povezanu putanju linije PDF-a ili obris oko klika (Odabir linija PDF-a). F3 Hvatanje za linije crteža uključeno ili isključeno (Hvatanje za linije crteža). Shift držan pri kliku Hvata segment na 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135° u odnosu na posljednju tačku. Ne važi za tačke luka ni krugove. Dvostruki klik Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez. Enter Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez. Desni klik (bez pomjeranja) Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili izrez. Klik na prvu tačku Zatvara površinu ili izrez (od treće tačke). Backspace ili Delete Uklanja posljednju tačku (prvo tačku luka koja čeka). Esc Odbacuje tačku luka koja čeka; zatim poništava nedovršenu oznaku; zatim se vraća na Odaberi. Odabir i uređivanje Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Klik na oznaku (alat Odaberi) Odabire je i čini njenu stavku aktivnom. Shift + klik na oznaku Dodaje je u izbor ili je uklanja iz njega. Ctrl+A Odabire sve oznake na otvorenom listu. Prevucite ručicu ugla Premješta tu tačku (Shift hvata na 45°). Radi kada je odabrana jedna oznaka. Delete ili Backspace Briše odabrane oznake (kada ne crtate). Esc Ne odabire ništa: briše izbor i liniju provjere. Ctrl+Z Poništi. Ctrl+Y ili Ctrl+Shift+Z Ponovi. Kopiranje i lijepljenje Tipka Šta radi Ctrl+C Kopira odabrane oznake, sa njihovim stavkama. Ctrl+X Izreže: kopira odabrane oznake, zatim ih briše. Ctrl+V Zalijepi: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba da ide. Ctrl+Shift+V Zalijepi na mjestu: isto mjesto na otvorenom listu. Ctrl+D Dupliraj odabrane oznake: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba da ide. Esc Ne postavlja ništa: poništava lijepljenje ili duplikat koji je na pokazivaču. Slova sama po sebi i dalje biraju alate (C je Brojanje, D je Provjeri, X je Izrez, V je Odaberi, A je Površina); samo Ctrl uz njih kopira i lijepi. U tekstualnom polju ove tipke kopiraju i lijepe tekst kao obično. Pogledajte Kopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka. Backspace briše odabranu oznaku kada ne crtate. Ako se to desi slučajno, Ctrl+Z je vraća. Datoteke Tipka Šta radi Ctrl+O Otvori planove Ctrl+S Spasi predmjer Ove dvije rade i dok kucate u polju. Prikaz i listovi Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Točkić miša Zumira unutra i van na mjestu pokazivača. Prevlačenje (lijevim, srednjim ili desnim dugmetom) Pomjera pogled. U Auto brojanje prevlačenje lijevim dugmetom umjesto toga crta okvir za pretragu. Space držan + prevlačenje Pomjera pogled, u bilo kojem alatu. F Cijela stranica W Širina + ili = Zumira unutra na sredini prikaza. − Zumira van na sredini prikaza. Page Down / Page Up Sljedeći ili prethodni list na spisku listova. Ctrl+Shift+F Prebacuje načine rada preko cijelog ekrana (Control na svim platformama, također na Mac-u). F1 Otvara ili zatvara ovu pomoć, panel sa strane. 3 3D prikaz provjere lista, uključen ili isključen. 3D prikaz Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom Kruži oko objekta. Shift + prevlačenje, ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom Pomjera pogled. Točkić miša Zumira na mjestu pokazivača. Na tačpadu, prevlačenje sa dva prsta kruži, a štipanje zumira. Klik Odabire oznaku ispod pokazivača (Shift + klik dodaje ili uklanja). F ili W Zumira na cijeli sadržaj. 3 Vraća na ravan list. Pogledajte Provjera predmjera u 3D. Auto brojanje Tipka ili radnja Šta radi Prevucite okvir Uokviruje simbol za pretragu (pokreće pretragu). Klik na okvir podudaranja Odbacuje ga ili vraća. Esc Otkazuje pokrenutu pretragu ili odbacuje pregled. Pomoć Tipka Šta radi F1 Otvara ili zatvara panel pomoći (također dugme Pomoć u traci aplikacije). Radi u svakom alatu, čak i dok kucate u polju. Esc Zatvara panel pomoći. U njegovom polju za pretragu, prvi Esc briše pretragu. Dok je panel otvoren, Esc pritisnut nakon klika na list prvo zatvara panel; pritisnite ga ponovo da otkažete u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk. Na mnogim Mac tastaturama gornji red kontroliše svjetlinu i zvuk. Pritisnite fn sa F1, ili uključite „Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys“ u Postavkama sistema, pod Tastatura. Dijalozi i polja Tipka Šta radi Enter U polju: primjenjuje vrijednost. U dijalogu za kalibraciju: Postavi razmjeru. Esc Zatvara dijalog (kao Otkaži); zatvara obrazac Nova stavka. Tab Prelazi na sljedeće polje. Napomene o platformama Ctrl je tipka Command: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Cijeli ekran je izuzetak: Control+Shift+F. Desni klik je klik sa dva prsta na tačpadu, kada je sekundarni klik uključen u Postavkama sistema, pod Tačpad. TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarno dugme; Control-klik može se računati kao običan klik i dodati tačku. Pomicanje sa dva prsta na tačpadu zumira list (ne pomjera ga). Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite, ili držite razmaknicu i prevucite. Page Up i Page Down su fn sa strelicama gore i dolje na tastaturama bez njih. Backspace je tipka označena natpisom Delete. Ctrl je Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Na tačpadu laptopa, pomicanje sa dva prsta zumira list. Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite. Ctrl je Ctrl. Neka radna okruženja koriste sopstvene prečice Ctrl+Alt ili Super; TakeoffDesk ne koristi nijednu od njih. Na tačpadu, pomicanje sa dva prsta zumira list. Za pomjeranje pogleda pritisnite i prevucite. TakeoffDesk dodir čita kao jedan pokazivač: Dodir postavlja tačku, odabire oznaku ili dodaje tačku brojanja. Prevlačenje jednim prstom pomjera list (u Auto brojanje crta okvir za pretragu). Zumiranje štipanjem još nije podržano. Koristite Cijela stranica i Širina, ili + i − na tastaturi. Za zatvaranje površine dodirnite njenu prvu tačku. Za završetak dionice dvaput dodirnite tamo gdje pregledač dvostruki dodir pretvara u dvostruki klik, ili pritisnite Enter na tastaturi. Nema prikaza dužine uživo dok ne dodirnete, jer nema lebdenja pokazivača. Tastatura i miš ili tačpad su danas bolji način za predmjer. Tipke koje pregledač zadržava Pregledači zadržavaju neke prečice za sebe, pa ih stranica ne može koristiti: zatvaranje kartice (Ctrl+W), nova kartica ili prozor (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N) i zumiranje pregledača (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Zato TakeoffDesk zumira list točkićem i samim tipkama + i −. Ako greškom pritisnete Ctrl++, cijela stranica se uvećava; Ctrl+0 je vraća. Pogledajte Tipke, miševi i tačpadovi. Gdje je Premjesti Ne postoji naredba Premjesti: odaberite tačku brojanja i prevucite je, ili odaberite površinu ili liniju i prevucite njene ručice uglova.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Unos dužina, cijena i postotaka","summary":"Šta možeš upisati za udaljenosti, visine, novčane cijene i postotke otpada, s primjerima i porukama za unos koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["unos","format","stope inči","razlomci","decimalne stope","metrički","metri","milimetri","cijena","novac","dolari","postotak","otpad","kucanje"],"headings":[{"id":"du-ine","text":"Dužine","level":2},{"id":"ra-unanje","text":"Računanje","level":3},{"id":"kako-se-du-ine-prikazuju","text":"Kako se dužine prikazuju","level":2},{"id":"cijene-materijal-i-rad-po-jedinici","text":"Cijene (materijal i rad po jedinici)","level":2},{"id":"postotak-otpada","text":"Postotak otpada","level":2},{"id":"nazivi-i-jedinice","text":"Nazivi i jedinice","level":2},{"id":"formule","text":"Formule","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"du-ine\"\u003EDužine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristi se za \u003Cstrong\u003EStvarna udaljenost\u003C/strong\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E, te za \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E u uređivaču stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpisuješ\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope 6½ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 stopa 6½ inča (razmak umjesto crtice)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 stopa 6½ inča (crtice između dijelova)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6½ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E¾ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope 6 inča (također \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 u zadanoj jedinici (vidi dolje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 stopa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5 metara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E750 centimetara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7,500 milimetara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObičan broj je u \u003Cstrong\u003Estopama\u003C/strong\u003E za kalibraciju i za stavke u LF, SF ili SY, a u \u003Cstrong\u003Emetrima\u003C/strong\u003E za stavke u m ili m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKovrčavi navodnici i oznake za prim iz tekst procesora (′ ″ ’ ”) rade kao \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Dva apostrofa \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E znače \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZarezi se zanemaruju: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E je 1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERazlomci zahtijevaju cijele brojeve s obje strane: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E radi, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ne.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENulte i negativne udaljenosti se odbijaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPoruke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Upiši udaljenost, na primjer 24&#039;-0&quot; ili 7.5 m.&quot; (polje je prazno)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Upiši udaljenost veću od nule.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Koristi stope i inče (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), decimalne stope, m, cm ili mm.&quot; (nepoznata jedinica)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ta udaljenost se nije mogla pročitati. Pokušaj 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; ili 24.5.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa obrišeš visinu ili dubinu stavke, isprazni polje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ra-unanje\"\u003ERačunanje\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako polje za dužinu, kao i polje za unos dok crtaš, prima i račun sa \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E i zagradama: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (4.4375 u zadanoj jedinici), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (8 stopa), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECrtica upisana u dužinu i dalje je dio nje: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E je 24 stope 6 inča, a \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E je 6½. Stavi razmake oko crtice da oduzmeš: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E je 23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObičan broj množi ili dijeli dužinu kao broj; dodan dužini znači zadanu jedinicu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERade i \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E. Račun koji se ne može pročitati se odbija uz navod gdje je pogriješeno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-se-du-ine-prikazuju\"\u003EKako se dužine prikazuju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDužine se prikazuju kao stope, inči i šesnaestine: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Vrijednosti se za prikaz zaokružuju na najbližu 1/16 inča; same količine nisu zaokružene. Decimalne vrijednosti se prikazuju s dvije decimale i separatorima hiljada, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cijene-materijal-i-rad-po-jedinici\"\u003ECijene (materijal i rad po jedinici)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpisuješ\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (do četiri decimale; više se zaokružuje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(prazno)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPoruka: &quot;Upiši iznos, na primjer 12.50.&quot; ili &quot;Taj iznos je prevelik.&quot; Negativne cijene nisu prihvaćene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProšireni iznosi (materijal, rad, ukupno) računaju se do centa: količina s otpadom × cijena, zaokruženo na polovinu od nule, potpuno kao \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E u tabličnom programu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"postotak-otpada\"\u003EPostotak otpada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpisuješ\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(prazno)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDo dvije decimale, od 0% do 1000%. Poruke: &quot;Upiši postotak, na primjer 10 ili 7.5.&quot; ili &quot;Otpad iznad 1000% nije dozvoljen.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nazivi-i-jedinice\"\u003ENazivi i jedinice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENazivi stavki i komponenti: do 200 znakova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E komponente: bilo koji tekst do 20 znakova, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elistovi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. To je samo oznaka; TakeoffDesk je ne pretvara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"formule\"\u003EFormule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormule sklopova imaju svoja pravila: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dužine Koristi se za Stvarna udaljenost u Calibrate, te za Height i Depth u uređivaču stavke. Upisuješ Znači 24'-0\" 24 stope 24'-6 1/2\" 24 stope 6½ inča 12' 6 1/2\" 12 stopa 6½ inča (razmak umjesto crtice) 12'-6-1/2\" 12 stopa 6½ inča (crtice između dijelova) 24' 24 stope 30\" 30 inča 6 1/2\" 6½ inča 3/4\" ¾ inča 24 ft 6 in 24 stope 6 inča (također foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 u zadanoj jedinici (vidi dolje) 24.5' 24.5 stopa 7.5 m 7.5 metara 750 cm 750 centimetara 7500 mm 7,500 milimetara Običan broj je u stopama za kalibraciju i za stavke u LF, SF ili SY, a u metrima za stavke u m ili m². Kovrčavi navodnici i oznake za prim iz tekst procesora (′ ″ ’ ”) rade kao ' i \". Dva apostrofa '' znače \". Zarezi se zanemaruju: 1,200 mm je 1200 mm. Razlomci zahtijevaju cijele brojeve s obje strane: 6 1/2\" radi, 6.5 1/2\" ne. Nulte i negativne udaljenosti se odbijaju. Poruke: \"Upiši udaljenost, na primjer 24'-0\" ili 7.5 m.\" (polje je prazno) \"Upiši udaljenost veću od nule.\" \"Koristi stope i inče (24'-6 1/2\"), decimalne stope, m, cm ili mm.\" (nepoznata jedinica) \"Ta udaljenost se nije mogla pročitati. Pokušaj 24'-6 1/2\" ili 24.5.\" Da obrišeš visinu ili dubinu stavke, isprazni polje. Računanje Svako polje za dužinu, kao i polje za unos dok crtaš, prima i račun sa +, -, *, / i zagradama: 4+7/16 (4.4375 u zadanoj jedinici), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (8 stopa), 2*450mm. Crtica upisana u dužinu i dalje je dio nje: 24'-6\" je 24 stope 6 inča, a 6-1/2 je 6½. Stavi razmake oko crtice da oduzmeš: 24' - 6\" je 23'-6\". Običan broj množi ili dijeli dužinu kao broj; dodan dužini znači zadanu jedinicu. Rade i abs, round, ceil i floor. Račun koji se ne može pročitati se odbija uz navod gdje je pogriješeno. Kako se dužine prikazuju Dužine se prikazuju kao stope, inči i šesnaestine: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Vrijednosti se za prikaz zaokružuju na najbližu 1/16 inča; same količine nisu zaokružene. Decimalne vrijednosti se prikazuju s dvije decimale i separatorima hiljada, na primjer 1,234.50 LF. Cijene (materijal i rad po jedinici) Upisuješ Znači 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (do četiri decimale; više se zaokružuje) (prazno) $0 Poruka: \"Upiši iznos, na primjer 12.50.\" ili \"Taj iznos je prevelik.\" Negativne cijene nisu prihvaćene. Prošireni iznosi (materijal, rad, ukupno) računaju se do centa: količina s otpadom × cijena, zaokruženo na polovinu od nule, potpuno kao ROUND(x, 2) u tabličnom programu. Postotak otpada Upisuješ Znači 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (prazno) 0% Do dvije decimale, od 0% do 1000%. Poruke: \"Upiši postotak, na primjer 10 ili 7.5.\" ili \"Otpad iznad 1000% nije dozvoljen.\" Nazivi i jedinice Nazivi stavki i komponenti: do 200 znakova. Unit komponente: bilo koji tekst do 20 znakova, na primjer EA, listovi, CY, gal. To je samo oznaka; TakeoffDesk je ne pretvara. Formule Formule sklopova imaju svoja pravila: vidi Jezik formula.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Unaprijed zadane razmjere","summary":"Svaka unaprijed zadana razmjera na listi Unaprijed zadana — arhitektonska, inženjerska i metrička — i šta svaka pretpostavlja o PDF-u.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["razmjera","unaprijed zadana","arhitektonska razmjera","inženjerska razmjera","metrička razmjera","odnos","1/4 inča","1/8 inča","1:100","puna veličina"],"headings":[{"id":"arhitektonska","text":"Arhitektonska","level":2},{"id":"in-enjerska","text":"Inženjerska","level":2},{"id":"metri-ka","text":"Metrička","level":2},{"id":"kalibrirane-razmjere","text":"Kalibrirane razmjere","level":2},{"id":"neobi-ni-pdf-ovi","text":"Neobični PDF-ovi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELista \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/span\u003E ima 32 razmjere u tri grupe. Unaprijed zadana razmjera postavlja razmjeru otvorenog lista tačno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka unaprijed zadana razmjera pretpostavlja da je stranica PDF-a stvarna veličina papira za koji je crtež napravljen: jedan inč na stranici PDF-a je jedan inč papira (stranice PDF-a imaju 72 tačke po inču). Ako je PDF promijenjene veličine, koristi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E. Koristi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E nakon postavljanja bilo koje razmjere. Pogledaj \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavi razmjeru\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arhitektonska\"\u003EArhitektonska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedan inč papira iznosi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-enjerska\"\u003EInženjerska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedan inč papira iznosi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metri-ka\"\u003EMetrička\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMetrički odnos znači da je jedna jedinica na papiru toliko jedinica u stvarnosti: kod \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, 10 mm na stranici je 1 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kalibrirane-razmjere\"\u003EKalibrirane razmjere\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalibrirana razmjera se u traci ispod lista prikazuje kao &quot;Kalibrirano 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; na 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot;: realne stope po inču papira i razdaljina koju si upisao. Kad je unutar 0.5% od unaprijed zadane, traka dodaje &quot;(odgovara 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;)&quot;, a spisak listova prikazuje naziv unaprijed zadane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"neobi-ni-pdf-ovi\"\u003ENeobični PDF-ovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeki PDF-ovi deklariraju veću jedinicu stranice („user unit“); TakeoffDesk je uzima u obzir za unaprijed zadane razmjere i za prikazanu razmjeru. Stranice zarotirane u PDF-u mjere se isto kao uspravne.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lista Unaprijed zadana u grupi Razmjera ima 32 razmjere u tri grupe. Unaprijed zadana razmjera postavlja razmjeru otvorenog lista tačno. Svaka unaprijed zadana razmjera pretpostavlja da je stranica PDF-a stvarna veličina papira za koji je crtež napravljen: jedan inč na stranici PDF-a je jedan inč papira (stranice PDF-a imaju 72 tačke po inču). Ako je PDF promijenjene veličine, koristi Kalibriraj. Koristi Provjeri nakon postavljanja bilo koje razmjere. Pogledaj Postavi razmjeru. Arhitektonska Unaprijed zadana Jedan inč papira iznosi 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 ft 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 ft 8 in 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 ft 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 ft 4 in 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 ft 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 8 in 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 4 in 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 in 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 in Inženjerska Unaprijed zadana Jedan inč papira iznosi 1\" = 10' 10 ft 1\" = 20' 20 ft 1\" = 30' 30 ft 1\" = 40' 40 ft 1\" = 50' 50 ft 1\" = 60' 60 ft 1\" = 100' 100 ft Metrička 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Metrički odnos znači da je jedna jedinica na papiru toliko jedinica u stvarnosti: kod 1:100, 10 mm na stranici je 1 m. Kalibrirane razmjere Kalibrirana razmjera se u traci ispod lista prikazuje kao \"Kalibrirano 1\" = 4.002' na 24'-6\"\": realne stope po inču papira i razdaljina koju si upisao. Kad je unutar 0.5% od unaprijed zadane, traka dodaje \"(odgovara 1/4\" = 1'-0\")\", a spisak listova prikazuje naziv unaprijed zadane. Neobični PDF-ovi Neki PDF-ovi deklariraju veću jedinicu stranice („user unit“); TakeoffDesk je uzima u obzir za unaprijed zadane razmjere i za prikazanu razmjeru. Stranice zarotirane u PDF-u mjere se isto kao uspravne.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Jezik formula","summary":"Pravila za formule količina sklopova - varijable, operatori, funkcije, zaokruživanje i svaka poruka o grešci.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["formula","izraz","sintaksa","funkcije","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","varijable","operatori","računanje"],"headings":[{"id":"varijable","text":"Varijable","level":2},{"id":"operatori","text":"Operatori","level":2},{"id":"funkcije","text":"Funkcije","level":2},{"id":"gre-ke","text":"Greške","level":2},{"id":"sigurno-po-dizajnu","text":"Sigurno po dizajnu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKomponente sklopa dobijaju količinu iz formule. Formula je mali aritmetički izraz nad izmjerenim vrijednostima stavke. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E za primjere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varijable\"\u003EVarijable\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVarijabla\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupna dužina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisina stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina zida, L × H, umanjena za otvore dionica koje ih nose (predmjer iz aplikacije BimCraft). Kada predmjer navede metodu mjerenja, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E se mjeri njome: otvori ne veći od najmanje veličine metode ostaju uključeni, a ono što metoda izostavlja tamo gdje se zidovi spajaju je izostavljeno. Napomena ispod stavke navodi metodu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj dionica\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupna neto površina (konture umanjene za izreze)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupni obim, uključujući ivice izreza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDubina ili debljina stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj površina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVarijable su u jedinicama stavke: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVelika i mala slova su ista: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E je \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERade samo varijable vlastite vrste stavke. \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E na linearnoj stavci daje \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristi L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrazna visina ili dubina je 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"operatori\"\u003EOperatori\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPiše se\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESabiranje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOduzimanje ili negativna vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMnoženje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDijeljenje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGrupisanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMnoženje i dijeljenje idu prije sabiranja i oduzimanja: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E je (L × 2) + 4. Kada nisi siguran, koristi zagrade.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojevi mogu imati decimale (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) i eksponente (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Razmaci se ignorišu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funkcije\"\u003EFunkcije\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFunkcija\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERezultat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPrimjer\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na gore na cijeli broj\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na dolje na cijeli broj\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na najbliži cijeli broj, polovine od nule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na d decimala (0 do 10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajmanja vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajveća vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrijednost bez predznaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E zanemaruju sitni šum računara pri zaokruživanju, pa vrijednost koja treba biti tačno 1 nikada nije zaokružena na 2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gre-ke\"\u003EGreške\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula koja se ne može pročitati ili izračunati prikazuje svoju grešku ispod polja, a komponenta je izostavljena iz ukupnih iznosa (zaglavlje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E kaže &quot;Nepotpuno&quot;). Poruke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPopravka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpiši formulu, na primjer L ili ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula je prazna.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristi …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristi jednu od navedenih varijabli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; nije funkcija ovdje. Koristi ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristi jednu od tih funkcija.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;#&quot; nije dozvoljeno u formuli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkloni taj znak (jedinice, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E nisu dozvoljeni).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENedostaje &quot;)&quot;. / Ima &quot;)&quot; bez &quot;(&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUravnoteži zagrade.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrijednost nedostaje prije &quot;)&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENešto kao \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E: upiši vrijednost.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula se završava prerano.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENešto kao \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E: dovrši je.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeočekivano &quot;…&quot;. Nedostaje li operator?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvije vrijednosti jedna pored druge, kao \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: napiši \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() prima 1 vrijednost.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaj funkciji tačan broj vrijednosti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) treba cijele cifre od 0 do 10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristi cijeli broj decimala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula dijeli sa nulom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObično je H 0: postavi visinu ili dubinu stavke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula ne daje broj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERezultat je prevelik da bi bio broj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETa formula je predugačka (najviše 500 znakova).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrati je.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sigurno-po-dizajnu\"\u003ESigurno po dizajnu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula može raditi samo aritmetiku s navedenim varijablama i funkcijama. Ne može pokretati kod niti čitati išta drugo, pa je formula u projektnoj datoteci koju ti neko pošalje bezopasna.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Komponente sklopa dobijaju količinu iz formule. Formula je mali aritmetički izraz nad izmjerenim vrijednostima stavke. Vidi Sklopovi i formule za primjere. Varijable Vrsta stavke Varijabla Značenje Linearna L Ukupna dužina Linearna H Visina stavke Linearna A Površina zida, L × H, umanjena za otvore dionica koje ih nose (predmjer iz aplikacije BimCraft). Kada predmjer navede metodu mjerenja, A se mjeri njome: otvori ne veći od najmanje veličine metode ostaju uključeni, a ono što metoda izostavlja tamo gdje se zidovi spajaju je izostavljeno. Napomena ispod stavke navodi metodu Linearna N Broj dionica Površina A Ukupna neto površina (konture umanjene za izreze) Površina P Ukupni obim, uključujući ivice izreza Površina H Dubina ili debljina stavke Površina N Broj površina Brojanje N Broj Varijable su u jedinicama stavke: vidi Jedinice. Velika i mala slova su ista: l je L. Rade samo varijable vlastite vrste stavke. P na linearnoj stavci daje \"P\" nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristi L, H, A, N. Prazna visina ili dubina je 0. Operatori Piše se Značenje + Sabiranje - ili − Oduzimanje ili negativna vrijednost * ili × Množenje / ili ÷ Dijeljenje ( ) Grupisanje Množenje i dijeljenje idu prije sabiranja i oduzimanja: L * 2 + 4 je (L × 2) + 4. Kada nisi siguran, koristi zagrade. Brojevi mogu imati decimale (1.333, .5) i eksponente (1e3 = 1000). Razmaci se ignorišu. Funkcije Funkcija Rezultat Primjer ceil(x) Zaokruži na gore na cijeli broj ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) Zaokruži na dolje na cijeli broj floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Zaokruži na najbliži cijeli broj, polovine od nule round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) Zaokruži na d decimala (0 do 10) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Najmanja vrijednost min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Najveća vrijednost max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Vrijednost bez predznaka abs(-3) = 3 ceil i floor zanemaruju sitni šum računara pri zaokruživanju, pa vrijednost koja treba biti tačno 1 nikada nije zaokružena na 2. Greške Formula koja se ne može pročitati ili izračunati prikazuje svoju grešku ispod polja, a komponenta je izostavljena iz ukupnih iznosa (zaglavlje Quantities kaže \"Nepotpuno\"). Poruke: Poruka Popravka Upiši formulu, na primjer L ili ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Formula je prazna. \"X\" nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristi … Koristi jednu od navedenih varijabli. \"X\" nije funkcija ovdje. Koristi ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Koristi jednu od tih funkcija. \"#\" nije dozvoljeno u formuli. Ukloni taj znak (jedinice, %, $ i = nisu dozvoljeni). Nedostaje \")\". / Ima \")\" bez \"(\". Uravnoteži zagrade. Vrijednost nedostaje prije \")\". Nešto kao max(1, ): upiši vrijednost. Formula se završava prerano. Nešto kao L *: dovrši je. Neočekivano \"…\". Nedostaje li operator? Dvije vrijednosti jedna pored druge, kao 2L: napiši 2 * L. ceil() prima 1 vrijednost. Daj funkciji tačan broj vrijednosti. round(x, digits) treba cijele cifre od 0 do 10. Koristi cijeli broj decimala. Formula dijeli sa nulom. Obično je H 0: postavi visinu ili dubinu stavke. Formula ne daje broj. Rezultat je prevelik da bi bio broj. Ta formula je predugačka (najviše 500 znakova). Skrati je. Sigurno po dizajnu Formula može raditi samo aritmetiku s navedenim varijablama i funkcijama. Ne može pokretati kod niti čitati išta drugo, pa je formula u projektnoj datoteci koju ti neko pošalje bezopasna.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Jedinice","summary":"Jedinice u kojima stavka može prijaviti, jedinice koje koriste varijable formule i kako se imperijalne i metričke jedinice mješaju.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["jedinice","lf","sf","sy","sq","kvadratni jardi","krovni kvadrati","akri","hektari","metri","kvadratni metri","ea","svaki","metrički","imperijalni","pretvorba","zadana jedinica"],"headings":[{"id":"jedinice-stavke","text":"Jedinice stavke","level":2},{"id":"jedinice-varijabli-formula","text":"Jedinice varijabli formula","level":2},{"id":"gdje-su-jedinice-fiksne","text":"Gdje su jedinice fiksne","level":2},{"id":"razmjere-i-jedinice-su-odvojene","text":"Razmjere i jedinice su odvojene","level":2},{"id":"preciznost","text":"Preciznost","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"jedinice-stavke\"\u003EJedinice stavke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETip stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijski\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elinearne stope (zadano)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinijski\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope (zadano)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni jardi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekrovni kvadrati (100 kvadratnih stopa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekomad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPromijenite je sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E u uređivaču stavke bilo kada, čak i nakon mjerenja; količina se odmah pretvara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELista \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje jedinice uključene u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpšte\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E, i uvijek vlastitu jedinicu stavke. Nova stavka počinje u jedinici dužine ili površine označenoj zvjezdicom, kada je to jedna od jedinica stavke; inače u LF ili SF. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EJedinice, uneseni podaci i liste jedinica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jedinice-varijabli-formula\"\u003EJedinice varijabli formula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedinica stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope (površina zida)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri (površina zida)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni jardi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrati\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa stavke u SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je u kvadratnim jardima, dok \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ostaju u stopama. Zapremina iz stavke u SY je \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E kubnih jardi; korištenje SF za ploče je jednostavnije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-su-jedinice-fiksne\"\u003EGdje su jedinice fiksne\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeka očitavanja uvijek koriste stope:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eživo očitavanje u statusnoj traci dok crtate (stope-inči, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E (stope-inči, LF i SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Erezultat provjere (stope-inči, sa decimalnim stopama i metrima),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edužine segmenata i obimi na listu Oznake tabele (stope-inči).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkupni iznosi stavki, tabela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E, formule i list Procjena koriste vlastitu jedinicu stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razmjere-i-jedinice-su-odvojene\"\u003ERazmjere i jedinice su odvojene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERazmjera lista govori koliko je crtež velik; jedinica stavke govori kako se prijavljuje. Metrički crtež u \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E može se uzeti u LF, a imperijalni crtež u m². Kalibracija prihvata bilo koju jedinicu: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"preciznost\"\u003EPreciznost\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk mjeri tačno iz tačaka na koje kliknete, uključujući stvarne dužine i površine lukova, i ne zaokružuje količine. Prikaz zaokružuje dužine na 1/16 inča, a decimale na dva mjesta. Novac se zaokružuje tek u ukupnim iznosima, na cent.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jedinice stavke Tip stavke Jedinica Naziv Linijski LF linearne stope (zadano) Linijski m metri Površina SF kvadratne stope (zadano) Površina SY kvadratni jardi Površina SQ krovni kvadrati (100 kvadratnih stopa) Površina ac akri Površina m² kvadratni metri Površina ha hektari Brojanje EA komad Promijenite je sa Jedinica u uređivaču stavke bilo kada, čak i nakon mjerenja; količina se odmah pretvara. Lista Jedinica prikazuje jedinice uključene u Postavke › Opšte › Jedinice, i uvijek vlastitu jedinicu stavke. Nova stavka počinje u jedinici dužine ili površine označenoj zvjezdicom, kada je to jedna od jedinica stavke; inače u LF ili SF. Vidi Jedinice, uneseni podaci i liste jedinica. Jedinice varijabli formula Jedinica stavke L, P, H A LF stope kvadratne stope (površina zida) m metri kvadratni metri (površina zida) SF stope kvadratne stope SY stope kvadratni jardi SQ stope kvadrati ac stope akri m² metri kvadratni metri ha metri hektari Za stavke u SY, A je u kvadratnim jardima, dok P i H ostaju u stopama. Zapremina iz stavke u SY je A * 9 * H / 27 kubnih jardi; korištenje SF za ploče je jednostavnije. Gdje su jedinice fiksne Neka očitavanja uvijek koriste stope: živo očitavanje u statusnoj traci dok crtate (stope-inči, SF), Odabrana oznaka (stope-inči, LF i SF), rezultat provjere (stope-inči, sa decimalnim stopama i metrima), dužine segmenata i obimi na listu Oznake tabele (stope-inči). Ukupni iznosi stavki, tabela Količine, formule i list Procjena koriste vlastitu jedinicu stavke. Razmjere i jedinice su odvojene Razmjera lista govori koliko je crtež velik; jedinica stavke govori kako se prijavljuje. Metrički crtež u 1:100 može se uzeti u LF, a imperijalni crtež u m². Kalibracija prihvata bilo koju jedinicu: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Preciznost TakeoffDesk mjeri tačno iz tačaka na koje kliknete, uključujući stvarne dužine i površine lukova, i ne zaokružuje količine. Prikaz zaokružuje dužine na 1/16 inča, a decimale na dva mjesta. Novac se zaokružuje tek u ukupnim iznosima, na cent.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kolone izvoza","summary":"Svaki radni list i kolona XLSX izvoza i CSV-a, s formulama koje radni list Predračun sadrži.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["izvoz","kolone","xlsx","csv","radni list","predračun","po listu","oznake","razmjere","formule","polja"],"headings":[{"id":"predra-un-radni-list-xlsx-i-csv","text":"Predračun (radni list XLSX i CSV)","level":2},{"id":"po-listu-samo-xlsx","text":"Po listu (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"oznake-samo-xlsx","text":"Oznake (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"po-podru-ju-ponude-samo-xlsx-kada-predmjer-ima-podru-ja-ponude","text":"Po području ponude (samo XLSX, kada predmjer ima područja ponude)","level":2},{"id":"razmjere-samo-xlsx","text":"Razmjere (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"nazivi-datoteka","text":"Nazivi datoteka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-radni-list-xlsx-i-csv\"\u003EPredračun (radni list XLSX i CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan red po stavci, nakon kojeg slijedi red po komponenti njenog sklopa (uvučen). Zatim prazan red i ukupno za posao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EU XLSX-u\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Stavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke (podebljano) ili naziv komponente (uvučen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Vrsta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna, Površina, Brojanje ili Komponenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Jedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA ili jedinica komponente\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Količina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzmjereni ukupno ili rezultat formule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Otpad %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Količina s otpadom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina × (1 + otpad)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Materijal po jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena materijala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Rad po jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena rada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Materijal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireni materijal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireni rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Ukupno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal + rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Napomene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKorištena formula, greška u formuli, oznake na listovima bez razmjere, površina zida, obim\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERed ukupno za posao: \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E kolona I, J i K nad svim redovima iznad, a u Napomenama &quot;Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad&quot; kada je nešto izostavljeno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERed s greškom u formuli nema količinu ni iznose; njegova napomena navodi grešku. Zaglavlje je zamrznuto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU CSV-u iste kolone sadrže obične vrijednosti, Otpad % je broj postotaka (10 za 10%), a novac je u dolarima s dvije decimale. Tekst koji tablični program može shvatiti kao formulu (počinje s \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) dobija vodeći \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E da ostane tekst.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-listu-samo-xlsx\"\u003EPo listu (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista (uz naziv PDF-a kada nije otvoren)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina te stavke na tom listu, u njenoj jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj oznaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oznake-samo-xlsx\"\u003EOznake (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan red po oznaci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrsta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna, Površina ili Brojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDužina, neto površina ili 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDetalji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna: dužine segmenata, oduzeti označeni kao &quot;(oduzeto)&quot;, i &quot;oduzima (dužina) od (dužina) nacrtanih&quot;. Površina: bruto i površine izreza kada ih ima, te obim. &quot;Nema razmjere&quot; za oznake bez razmjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamo kada predmjer ima područja ponude: površina oznake ili &quot;Nema područja ponude&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-podru-ju-ponude-samo-xlsx-kada-predmjer-ima-podru-ja-ponude\"\u003EPo području ponude (samo XLSX, kada predmjer ima područja ponude)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv područja, ili &quot;Nema područja ponude&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka, ili komponenta uvučena ispod nje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica stavke ili komponente\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzmjereno u tom području (komponente: formula nad ukupnim iznosima područja)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina s otpadom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina × (1 + otpad)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, Rad, Ukupno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireno do centa, kao na Predračunu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENapomene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula, greške i oznake bez razmjere, kao na Predračunu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako područje završava redom &quot;(naziv) međuzbir&quot; čiji su troškovi formule \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E nad njegovim redovima; posljednji red, \u003Cstrong\u003ESva područja ponude\u003C/strong\u003E, zbraja međuzbirove. Radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E tada ima sedmu kolonu, \u003Cstrong\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razmjere-samo-xlsx\"\u003ERazmjere (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan red po listu koji ima razmjeru ili oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKolona\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERazmjera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv postavke, ili kalibrirana razmjera, ili &quot;Nema razmjere&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENačin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Unaprijed podešeno&quot;, ili &quot;Kalibrirano na (upisana udaljenost)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStope po jedinici PDF-a\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETačan faktor razmjere koji TakeoffDesk koristi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nazivi-datoteka\"\u003ENazivi datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, gdje naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a otvorenog u predmjeru.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV je UTF-8 s oznakom redoslijeda bajtova (BOM) i Windows završecima redova, koje čitaju tablični programi na svim platformama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Predračun (radni list XLSX i CSV) Jedan red po stavci, nakon kojeg slijedi red po komponenti njenog sklopa (uvučen). Zatim prazan red i ukupno za posao. Kolona Sadržaj U XLSX-u A Stavka Naziv stavke (podebljano) ili naziv komponente (uvučen) Tekst B Vrsta Linearna, Površina, Brojanje ili Komponenta Tekst C Jedinica LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA ili jedinica komponente Tekst D Količina Izmjereni ukupno ili rezultat formule Broj E Otpad % Otpad Postotak (0.10 = 10%) F Količina s otpadom Količina × (1 + otpad) Formula D*(1+E) G Materijal po jedinici Cijena materijala Broj H Rad po jedinici Cijena rada Broj I Materijal Prošireni materijal Formula ROUND(F*G,2) J Rad Prošireni rad Formula ROUND(F*H,2) K Ukupno Materijal + rad Formula I+J L Napomene Korištena formula, greška u formuli, oznake na listovima bez razmjere, površina zida, obim Tekst Red ukupno za posao: SUM kolona I, J i K nad svim redovima iznad, a u Napomenama \"Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad\" kada je nešto izostavljeno. Red s greškom u formuli nema količinu ni iznose; njegova napomena navodi grešku. Zaglavlje je zamrznuto. U CSV-u iste kolone sadrže obične vrijednosti, Otpad % je broj postotaka (10 za 10%), a novac je u dolarima s dvije decimale. Tekst koji tablični program može shvatiti kao formulu (počinje s =, +, - ili @) dobija vodeći ' da ostane tekst. Po listu (samo XLSX) Kolona Sadržaj List Naziv lista (uz naziv PDF-a kada nije otvoren) Stavka Naziv stavke Količina Količina te stavke na tom listu, u njenoj jedinici Jedinica Jedinica stavke Oznake Broj oznaka Oznake (samo XLSX) Jedan red po oznaci. Kolona Sadržaj List Naziv lista Stavka Naziv stavke Vrsta Linearna, Površina ili Brojanje Količina Dužina, neto površina ili 1 Jedinica LF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA Detalji Linearna: dužine segmenata, oduzeti označeni kao \"(oduzeto)\", i \"oduzima (dužina) od (dužina) nacrtanih\". Površina: bruto i površine izreza kada ih ima, te obim. \"Nema razmjere\" za oznake bez razmjere. Područje ponude Samo kada predmjer ima područja ponude: površina oznake ili \"Nema područja ponude\" Po području ponude (samo XLSX, kada predmjer ima područja ponude) Kolona Sadržaj Područje ponude Naziv područja, ili \"Nema područja ponude\" Stavka Stavka, ili komponenta uvučena ispod nje Jedinica Jedinica stavke ili komponente Količina Izmjereno u tom području (komponente: formula nad ukupnim iznosima područja) Količina s otpadom Količina × (1 + otpad) Materijal, Rad, Ukupno Prošireno do centa, kao na Predračunu Napomene Formula, greške i oznake bez razmjere, kao na Predračunu Svako područje završava redom \"(naziv) međuzbir\" čiji su troškovi formule SUM nad njegovim redovima; posljednji red, Sva područja ponude, zbraja međuzbirove. Radni list Oznake tada ima sedmu kolonu, Područje ponude. Razmjere (samo XLSX) Jedan red po listu koji ima razmjeru ili oznake. Kolona Sadržaj List Naziv lista Razmjera Naziv postavke, ili kalibrirana razmjera, ili \"Nema razmjere\" Način \"Unaprijed podešeno\", ili \"Kalibrirano na (upisana udaljenost)\" Stope po jedinici PDF-a Tačan faktor razmjere koji TakeoffDesk koristi Nazivi datoteka (name).xlsx i (name).csv, gdje naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a otvorenog u predmjeru. CSV je UTF-8 s oznakom redoslijeda bajtova (BOM) i Windows završecima redova, koje čitaju tablični programi na svim platformama.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Rješavanje problema","summary":"Simptomi, uzroci i rješenja za poruke i iznenađenja na koje možete naići u aplikaciji TakeoffDesk, navedeni onako kako ih aplikacija prikazuje.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["problemi","greške","ne radi","rješenje","pomoć","odbijeno","ne mjeri","bez razmjere","nedostajuće oznake","izvoz nije uspio","van mreže","dodir"],"headings":[{"id":"otvaranje-datoteka","text":"Otvaranje datoteka","level":2},{"id":"mjerenje","text":"Mjerenje","level":2},{"id":"razmjera","text":"Razmjera","level":2},{"id":"koli-ine-i-formule","text":"Količine i formule","level":2},{"id":"automatsko-brojanje","text":"Automatsko brojanje","level":2},{"id":"uvanje-i-izvoz","text":"Čuvanje i izvoz","level":2},{"id":"tasteri-i-mi","text":"Tasteri i miš","level":2},{"id":"ekrani-osjetljivi-na-dodir","text":"Ekrani osjetljivi na dodir","level":2},{"id":"rad-van-mre-e","text":"Rad van mreže","level":2},{"id":"jo-uvijek-zaglavljeni","text":"Još uvijek zaglavljeni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk objašnjava većinu odbijanja u statusnoj traci na dnu prozora. Pronađite poruku ispod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvaranje-datoteka\"\u003EOtvaranje datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČitač PDF-a se nije učitao. Ponovo učitajte stranicu da pokušate ponovo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČitač PDF-a aplikacije se nije učitao, obično zato što ste van mreže, a aplikacija nikada nije sačuvana za rad van mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPonovo se povežite i učitajte stranicu. Zatim izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E i sačekajte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E; vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad van mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(naziv) je zaštićen lozinkom. Otvorite kopiju bez zaštite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF za otvaranje traži lozinku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatražite kopiju bez zaštite, ili uklonite lozinku u PDF programu kojem vjerujete.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(naziv) se nije mogao pročitati kao PDF (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteka je oštećena ili nije zaista PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPonovo je preuzmite, ili je ponovo spasite iz programa koji ju je napravio.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(naziv) je već otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsti PDF (isti sadržaj) je otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta ne treba raditi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk otvara PDF-ove i .takeoff.json projekte. Preskočeno: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrugi tipovi datoteka su odbačeni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo pretvorite crteže u PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta se ne dešava kada prevučem datoteke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteke su prevučene van prozora pregledača, ili je pregledač otvorio PDF u novoj kartici.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevucite na samu stranicu TakeoffDesk; okvir „Prevuci PDF-ove ili .takeoff.json“ pokazuje hoće li to raditi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvaranje velikog seta traje neko vrijeme\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki PDF se čita u cijelosti da bi se dobio njegov otisak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESačekajte da poruka „Otvaranje (naziv)…“ nestane. Sličice se popunjavaju dok skrolujete.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerenje\"\u003EMjerenje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo otvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENijedan list nije otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj list još nema razmjeru, pa se ne može mjeriti. Prvo izaberite unaprijed zadanu razmjeru ili kalibrirajte (brojanje radi i bez nje).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlati za linije, površine, krugove i izreze trebaju razmjeru.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavite razmjeru\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo napravite linijsku stavku (imenujte je pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E), zatim kliknite na list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema stavke tog tipa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPopunite formu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova stavka\u003C/span\u003E koja se otvorila, i izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo izaberite stavku za predmjer (panel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrenutna stavka je obrisana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDionica treba najmanje dvije tačke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršili ste nakon jednog klika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite najmanje dvije tačke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina treba najmanje tri tačke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPremalo uglova.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite najmanje tri ugla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontura siječe samu sebe, pa bi njena površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte je ponovo bez presijecanja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOblik u obliku osmice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte je kao dvije površine, ili idite po ivici redom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETe tačke ne zatvaraju nikakvu površinu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESve tačke su na jednoj liniji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite uglove koji zatvaraju prostor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo odaberite oznaku površine (alat \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E), zatim izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E i nacrtajte rupu unutar nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzrez\u003C/span\u003E traži odabranu površinu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kliknite površinu, zatim \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERupa siječe ili izlazi iz konture.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte rupu unutar površine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzrezi se ne mogu preklapati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvije rupe se preklapaju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte jednu rupu oko obje, ili ih držite odvojeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… Tačka je vraćena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevučeni ugao bi naveo konturu da se siječe ili bi gurnuo rupu van.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevucite na mjesto koje održava oblik ispravnim.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite tačku na ivici kruga, dalje od njegovog središta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrugi klik je bio preblizu središtu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite dalje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlikovi pomjeraju list umjesto da dodaju tačke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPokazivač se pomjerio za više piksela dok je dugme bilo pritisnuto; to se računa kao prevlačenje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite bez pomjeranja, naročito na trackpadu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift ne poravnava\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavljate tačku na luk, ili crtate krug.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoravnanje na 45° važi samo za prave dionice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETačke skaču na obližnju liniju\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje na linije crteža je uključeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećajte da kliknete između linija, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da isključite hvatanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema oznake hvatanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje je isključeno, list je skeniran, ili alat ne hvata (Brojanje, Auto brojanje, lijepljenje).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; na skeniranom listu nema linija za hvatanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDužina je pogrešna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERazmjera je pogrešna (često PDF promijenjene veličine sa unaprijed zadanom razmjerom).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E na poznatoj koti, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razmjera\"\u003ERazmjera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzaberite dvije tačke dalje jednu od druge.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETačke kalibracije su gotovo jedna na drugoj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKalibrirajte na dužoj koti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoruka u dijalogu kalibracije, kao „Ta udaljenost se nije mogla pročitati“\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdaljenost je u obliku koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos dužine, cijene i procenta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj list još nema razmjeru, pa nema šta provjeriti. Kalibrirajte ga ili izaberite unaprijed zadanu razmjeru.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E na listu bez razmjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo postavite razmjeru.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELista \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnaprijed zadana\u003C/span\u003E je zasivljena\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENijedan list nije otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koli-ine-i-formule\"\u003EKoličine i formule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENepotpuno: … (nije u ukupnim iznosima)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGreška u formuli, ili oznake na listovima bez razmjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EČitanje količina i procjene\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+(n) bez razmjere pored stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeke od njenih oznaka su na listovima bez razmjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDajte tim listovima razmjeru.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGreška u formuli: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulu nije moguće izračunati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOva stavka ima oznake, pa se njen tip ne može promijeniti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETip je zaključan čim postoje oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENapravite novu stavku drugog tipa i ponovo nacrtajte oznake sa njom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka mora imati naziv.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolje za naziv je ispražnjeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpišite naziv.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpišite iznos, npr. 12.50. / Upišite procenat, npr. 10 ili 7.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena ili otpad nisu mogli biti pročitani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos dužine, cijene i procenta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupan iznos izgleda udvostručen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka ima sopstvene cijene i komponente koje nose isti trošak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavite sopstvene cijene stavke na 0 kada komponente nose trošak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake ove stavke su na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknuli ste stavku čije su sve oznake na PDF-ovima koje niste otvorili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite te PDF-ove; njihovi nazivi su navedeni pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EListovi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"automatsko-brojanje\"\u003EAutomatsko brojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaj okvir je premali. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkvir je sitan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećajte i uokvirite cijeli simbol.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaj okvir je skoro prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkvir sadrži samo papir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUokvirite sam simbol.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema podudaranja. Spustite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E, ili uokvirite simbol tješnje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta nije ostvarilo dovoljno visok rezultat.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUokvirite simbol tješnje, ili spustite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreviše podudaranja, uključujući pogrešne simbole\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESlični simboli imaju rezultat blizu pravog.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodignite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E i kliknite pogrešne okvire da ih odbacite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodudaranja nedostaju na drugim listovima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETi listovi crtaju simbol drugačije veličine, ili pod uglom koji nije korak od 90°.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPretražite te listove sa okvirom nacrtanim tamo, ili prebrojite ručno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) listova je previše veliko za pretragu pri ovoj veličini simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList bi bio prevelik pri radnoj veličini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUokvirite veći simbol, ili prebrojite taj list ručno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPretraga nije uspjela: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPozadinska pretraga je stala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPokušajte ponovo; ponovo učitajte stranicu ako se ponavlja (prvo spasite). Van mreže radi samo kada traka aplikacije pokaže \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevlačenje crta okvir umjesto pomjeranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETako radi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto brojanje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i prevucite, ili prevucite srednjim dugmetom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uvanje-i-izvoz\"\u003EČuvanje i izvoz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoš nema šta izvesti: napravite stavku i uzmite predmjer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema stavki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo napravite stavku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoš nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E nema šta da nacrta na otvorenim PDF-ovima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove koji imaju oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifrovan, pa se označena kopija ne može napisati. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF je šifrovan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzvezite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E umjesto toga, ili koristite nešifrovanu kopiju PDF-a (ona tada treba vlastiti predmjer, jer je to druga datoteka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznačeni PDF se nije mogao napisati: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČesto: van mreže, a aplikacija nije sačuvana za rad van mreže, pa nedostaje pisač PDF-a.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdite na mrežu i ponovo izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Da to izbjegnete, izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E i sačekajte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreuzet je samo jedan označeni PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPregledač je blokirao više preuzimanja odjednom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDozvolite više preuzimanja za ovu stranicu, pa izvezite ponovo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(datoteka) nije TakeoffDesk projekt (nije ispravan JSON). / Ovo nije TakeoffDesk datoteka projekta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPogrešna datoteka, ili oštećena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzaberite datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj projekt je spašen u novijoj verziji aplikacije TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteka potiče iz novije verzije.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite je u novijoj verziji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) oznaka je oštećeno i izostavljeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDio datoteke je oštećen ili ručno izmijenjen.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOstatak se otvorio. Ponovo nacrtajte nedostajuće oznake, ili otvorite stariju kopiju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake nedostaju nakon ponovnog otvaranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-ovi nisu otvoreni, ili se jedan od njih promijenio.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESpasi i ponovo otvori predmjer\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPregledač pita „Napustiti stranicu?“\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostoje nespašene promjene.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOstanite i spasite sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tasteri-i-mi\"\u003ETasteri i miš\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESimptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETasteri slova ne rade ništa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor je u polju (pretraga, uređivač stavke, tabela).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite na list, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da izađete iz polja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočkić uvećava umjesto skrolovanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočkić uvijek uvećava list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrevucite da pomjerate.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijela stranica je postala veća ili manja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumiranje pregledača (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Uvećajte list točkićem ili samim \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznaka je nestala kada sam pritisnuo Backspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace briše odabranu oznaku kada ne crtate.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDesni klik ne završava na Mac-u\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl-klik stiže kao običan klik.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristite klik dvama prstima uz uključen sekundarni klik, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ekrani-osjetljivi-na-dodir\"\u003EEkrani osjetljivi na dodir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa ekranu osjetljivom na dodir:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDodir\u003C/strong\u003E postavlja tačku (ili bira oznaku sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E). Prevlačenje jednim prstom pomjera pogled.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDva prsta\u003C/strong\u003E štipanjem uvećavaju oko tačke između njih, a pomjeraju kada se kreću zajedno. Spuštanje drugog prsta poništava ono što je započeo prvi, pa štipanje nikada ne ostavlja tačku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZavršite\u003C/strong\u003E dionicu ili konturu \u003Cstrong\u003Edugim pritiskom\u003C/strong\u003E (desni klik), \u003Cstrong\u003Edvostrukim dodirom\u003C/strong\u003E, ili sa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZavrši\u003C/span\u003E u traci na dnu lista. Ista traka ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E (vraća posljednju tačku) i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkaži\u003C/span\u003E. Površine se također zatvaraju dodirom prve tačke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrsti imaju veće mete: tačke se hvataju, zatvaraju i biraju sa veće udaljenosti, a ručice uglova su veće.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnos dužina zahtijeva tastaturu; ekranska tastatura radi kada je polje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnos\u003C/span\u003E aktivno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa tabletu, tastatura i miš ili trackpad znatno olakšavaju predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rad-van-mre-e\"\u003ERad van mreže\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDugme ili simptom\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENije moguće spasiti\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeke datoteke aplikacije se nisu preuzele pri spašavanju za rad van mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProvjerite vezu i ponovo izaberite dugme.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERad van mreže nije dostupan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrivatni prozori i neki upravljani računari blokiraju kopije za rad van mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoristite običan prozor, ili drugi pregledač.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„Spašavanje…“ nikada ne počinje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVan ste mreže; spašavanje traži vezu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpasite dok ste na mreži.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAplikacija je stara nakon ažuriranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopija za rad van mreže je iz ranijeg dana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENa mreži izaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi ponovo (preuzmi najnoviju verziju)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EŽelite nazad prostor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopija za rad van mreže je oko 6 MB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni kopiju za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad van mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jo-uvijek-zaglavljeni\"\u003EJoš uvijek zaglavljeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonovo učitajte stranicu ako aplikacija prestane da reaguje. Predmjer se gubi pri ponovnom učitavanju ako ga niste spasili, pa prvo spasite sa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ako možete. Za pitanja o pregledačima vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EPregledači i računari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk objašnjava većinu odbijanja u statusnoj traci na dnu prozora. Pronađite poruku ispod. Otvaranje datoteka Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Čitač PDF-a se nije učitao. Ponovo učitajte stranicu da pokušate ponovo. Čitač PDF-a aplikacije se nije učitao, obično zato što ste van mreže, a aplikacija nikada nije sačuvana za rad van mreže. Ponovo se povežite i učitajte stranicu. Zatim izaberite Spasi za rad van mreže i sačekajte Spremno za rad van mreže; vidi Rad van mreže. (naziv) je zaštićen lozinkom. Otvorite kopiju bez zaštite. PDF za otvaranje traži lozinku. Zatražite kopiju bez zaštite, ili uklonite lozinku u PDF programu kojem vjerujete. (naziv) se nije mogao pročitati kao PDF (…) Datoteka je oštećena ili nije zaista PDF. Ponovo je preuzmite, ili je ponovo spasite iz programa koji ju je napravio. (naziv) je već otvoren. Isti PDF (isti sadržaj) je otvoren. Ništa ne treba raditi. TakeoffDesk otvara PDF-ove i .takeoff.json projekte. Preskočeno: … Drugi tipovi datoteka su odbačeni. Prvo pretvorite crteže u PDF. Ništa se ne dešava kada prevučem datoteke Datoteke su prevučene van prozora pregledača, ili je pregledač otvorio PDF u novoj kartici. Prevucite na samu stranicu TakeoffDesk; okvir „Prevuci PDF-ove ili .takeoff.json“ pokazuje hoće li to raditi. Otvaranje velikog seta traje neko vrijeme Svaki PDF se čita u cijelosti da bi se dobio njegov otisak. Sačekajte da poruka „Otvaranje (naziv)…“ nestane. Sličice se popunjavaju dok skrolujete. Mjerenje Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Prvo otvorite PDF. Nijedan list nije otvoren. Otvorite PDF. Ovaj list još nema razmjeru, pa se ne može mjeriti. Prvo izaberite unaprijed zadanu razmjeru ili kalibrirajte (brojanje radi i bez nje). Alati za linije, površine, krugove i izreze trebaju razmjeru. Postavite razmjeru. Prvo napravite linijsku stavku (imenujte je pod Stavke), zatim kliknite na list. Nema stavke tog tipa. Popunite formu Nova stavka koja se otvorila, i izaberite Dodaj. Prvo izaberite stavku za predmjer (panel Stavke). Trenutna stavka je obrisana. Kliknite stavku pod Stavke. Dionica treba najmanje dvije tačke. Završili ste nakon jednog klika. Kliknite najmanje dvije tačke. Površina treba najmanje tri tačke. Premalo uglova. Kliknite najmanje tri ugla. Kontura siječe samu sebe, pa bi njena površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte je ponovo bez presijecanja. Oblik u obliku osmice. Nacrtajte je kao dvije površine, ili idite po ivici redom. Te tačke ne zatvaraju nikakvu površinu. Sve tačke su na jednoj liniji. Kliknite uglove koji zatvaraju prostor. Prvo odaberite oznaku površine (alat Odaberi), zatim izaberite Izrez i nacrtajte rupu unutar nje. Izrez traži odabranu površinu. Pritisnite V, kliknite površinu, zatim X. Izrez mora biti potpuno unutar površine. Rupa siječe ili izlazi iz konture. Nacrtajte rupu unutar površine. Izrezi se ne mogu preklapati. Dvije rupe se preklapaju. Nacrtajte jednu rupu oko obje, ili ih držite odvojeno. … Tačka je vraćena. Prevučeni ugao bi naveo konturu da se siječe ili bi gurnuo rupu van. Prevucite na mjesto koje održava oblik ispravnim. Kliknite tačku na ivici kruga, dalje od njegovog središta. Drugi klik je bio preblizu središtu. Kliknite dalje. Klikovi pomjeraju list umjesto da dodaju tačke Pokazivač se pomjerio za više piksela dok je dugme bilo pritisnuto; to se računa kao prevlačenje. Kliknite bez pomjeranja, naročito na trackpadu. Shift ne poravnava Postavljate tačku na luk, ili crtate krug. Poravnanje na 45° važi samo za prave dionice. Tačke skaču na obližnju liniju Hvatanje na linije crteža je uključeno. Uvećajte da kliknete između linija, ili pritisnite F3 da isključite hvatanje. Nema oznake hvatanja Hvatanje je isključeno, list je skeniran, ili alat ne hvata (Brojanje, Auto brojanje, lijepljenje). Pritisnite F3; na skeniranom listu nema linija za hvatanje. Dužina je pogrešna Razmjera je pogrešna (često PDF promijenjene veličine sa unaprijed zadanom razmjerom). Koristite Provjeri na poznatoj koti, zatim Kalibriraj. Razmjera Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Izaberite dvije tačke dalje jednu od druge. Tačke kalibracije su gotovo jedna na drugoj. Kalibrirajte na dužoj koti. Poruka u dijalogu kalibracije, kao „Ta udaljenost se nije mogla pročitati“ Udaljenost je u obliku koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati. Vidi Unos dužine, cijene i procenta. Ovaj list još nema razmjeru, pa nema šta provjeriti. Kalibrirajte ga ili izaberite unaprijed zadanu razmjeru. Provjeri na listu bez razmjere. Prvo postavite razmjeru. Lista Unaprijed zadana je zasivljena Nijedan list nije otvoren. Otvorite PDF. Količine i formule Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Nepotpuno: … (nije u ukupnim iznosima) Greška u formuli, ili oznake na listovima bez razmjere. Vidi Čitanje količina i procjene. +(n) bez razmjere pored stavke Neke od njenih oznaka su na listovima bez razmjere. Dajte tim listovima razmjeru. Greška u formuli: … Formulu nije moguće izračunati. Vidi Jezik formula. Ova stavka ima oznake, pa se njen tip ne može promijeniti. Tip je zaključan čim postoje oznake. Napravite novu stavku drugog tipa i ponovo nacrtajte oznake sa njom. Stavka mora imati naziv. Polje za naziv je ispražnjeno. Upišite naziv. Upišite iznos, npr. 12.50. / Upišite procenat, npr. 10 ili 7.5. Cijena ili otpad nisu mogli biti pročitani. Vidi Unos dužine, cijene i procenta. Ukupan iznos izgleda udvostručen Stavka ima sopstvene cijene i komponente koje nose isti trošak. Postavite sopstvene cijene stavke na 0 kada komponente nose trošak. Oznake ove stavke su na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni. Kliknuli ste stavku čije su sve oznake na PDF-ovima koje niste otvorili. Otvorite te PDF-ove; njihovi nazivi su navedeni pod Listovi. Automatsko brojanje Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Taj okvir je premali. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola. Okvir je sitan. Uvećajte i uokvirite cijeli simbol. Taj okvir je skoro prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola. Okvir sadrži samo papir. Uokvirite sam simbol. Nema podudaranja. Spustite klizač Podudaranje, ili uokvirite simbol tješnje. Ništa nije ostvarilo dovoljno visok rezultat. Uokvirite simbol tješnje, ili spustite klizač Podudaranje. Previše podudaranja, uključujući pogrešne simbole Slični simboli imaju rezultat blizu pravog. Podignite klizač Podudaranje i kliknite pogrešne okvire da ih odbacite. Podudaranja nedostaju na drugim listovima Ti listovi crtaju simbol drugačije veličine, ili pod uglom koji nije korak od 90°. Pretražite te listove sa okvirom nacrtanim tamo, ili prebrojite ručno. (n) listova je previše veliko za pretragu pri ovoj veličini simbola. List bi bio prevelik pri radnoj veličini. Uokvirite veći simbol, ili prebrojite taj list ručno. Pretraga nije uspjela: … Pozadinska pretraga je stala. Pokušajte ponovo; ponovo učitajte stranicu ako se ponavlja (prvo spasite). Van mreže radi samo kada traka aplikacije pokaže Spremno za rad van mreže. Prevlačenje crta okvir umjesto pomjeranja Tako radi Auto brojanje. Držite Space i prevucite, ili prevucite srednjim dugmetom. Čuvanje i izvoz Poruka ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Još nema šta izvesti: napravite stavku i uzmite predmjer. Nema stavki. Prvo napravite stavku. Još nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima. Označeni PDF nema šta da nacrta na otvorenim PDF-ovima. Otvorite PDF-ove koji imaju oznake. Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifrovan, pa se označena kopija ne može napisati. … PDF je šifrovan. Izvezite XLSX umjesto toga, ili koristite nešifrovanu kopiju PDF-a (ona tada treba vlastiti predmjer, jer je to druga datoteka). Označeni PDF se nije mogao napisati: … Često: van mreže, a aplikacija nije sačuvana za rad van mreže, pa nedostaje pisač PDF-a. Idite na mrežu i ponovo izaberite Označeni PDF. Da to izbjegnete, izaberite Spasi za rad van mreže i sačekajte Spremno za rad van mreže. Preuzet je samo jedan označeni PDF Pregledač je blokirao više preuzimanja odjednom. Dozvolite više preuzimanja za ovu stranicu, pa izvezite ponovo. (datoteka) nije TakeoffDesk projekt (nije ispravan JSON). / Ovo nije TakeoffDesk datoteka projekta. Pogrešna datoteka, ili oštećena. Izaberite datoteku .takeoff.json. Ovaj projekt je spašen u novijoj verziji aplikacije TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo. Datoteka potiče iz novije verzije. Otvorite je u novijoj verziji. (n) oznaka je oštećeno i izostavljeno. Dio datoteke je oštećen ili ručno izmijenjen. Ostatak se otvorio. Ponovo nacrtajte nedostajuće oznake, ili otvorite stariju kopiju. Oznake nedostaju nakon ponovnog otvaranja PDF-ovi nisu otvoreni, ili se jedan od njih promijenio. Vidi Spasi i ponovo otvori predmjer. Pregledač pita „Napustiti stranicu?“ Postoje nespašene promjene. Ostanite i spasite sa Ctrl+S. Tasteri i miš Simptom Uzrok Rješenje Tasteri slova ne rade ništa Kursor je u polju (pretraga, uređivač stavke, tabela). Kliknite na list, ili pritisnite Tab da izađete iz polja. Točkić uvećava umjesto skrolovanja Točkić uvijek uvećava list. Prevucite da pomjerate. Cijela stranica je postala veća ili manja Zumiranje pregledača (Ctrl++ ili Ctrl+−). Pritisnite Ctrl+0. Uvećajte list točkićem ili samim + i −. Oznaka je nestala kada sam pritisnuo Backspace Backspace briše odabranu oznaku kada ne crtate. Ctrl+Z je vraća. Desni klik ne završava na Mac-u Control-klik stiže kao običan klik. Koristite klik dvama prstima uz uključen sekundarni klik, ili pritisnite Enter. Ekrani osjetljivi na dodir Na ekranu osjetljivom na dodir: Dodir postavlja tačku (ili bira oznaku sa Odaberi). Prevlačenje jednim prstom pomjera pogled. Dva prsta štipanjem uvećavaju oko tačke između njih, a pomjeraju kada se kreću zajedno. Spuštanje drugog prsta poništava ono što je započeo prvi, pa štipanje nikada ne ostavlja tačku. Završite dionicu ili konturu dugim pritiskom (desni klik), dvostrukim dodirom, ili sa Završi u traci na dnu lista. Ista traka ima Straga (vraća posljednju tačku) i Otkaži. Površine se također zatvaraju dodirom prve tačke. Prsti imaju veće mete: tačke se hvataju, zatvaraju i biraju sa veće udaljenosti, a ručice uglova su veće. Unos dužina zahtijeva tastaturu; ekranska tastatura radi kada je polje Unos aktivno. Na tabletu, tastatura i miš ili trackpad znatno olakšavaju predmjer. Rad van mreže Dugme ili simptom Uzrok Rješenje Nije moguće spasiti Neke datoteke aplikacije se nisu preuzele pri spašavanju za rad van mreže. Provjerite vezu i ponovo izaberite dugme. Rad van mreže nije dostupan Privatni prozori i neki upravljani računari blokiraju kopije za rad van mreže. Koristite običan prozor, ili drugi pregledač. „Spašavanje…“ nikada ne počinje Van ste mreže; spašavanje traži vezu. Spasite dok ste na mreži. Aplikacija je stara nakon ažuriranja Kopija za rad van mreže je iz ranijeg dana. Na mreži izaberite Spremno za rad van mreže, zatim Spasi ponovo (preuzmi najnoviju verziju). Želite nazad prostor Kopija za rad van mreže je oko 6 MB. Izaberite Spremno za rad van mreže, zatim Ukloni kopiju za rad van mreže. Vidi Rad van mreže. Još uvijek zaglavljeni Ponovo učitajte stranicu ako aplikacija prestane da reaguje. Predmjer se gubi pri ponovnom učitavanju ako ga niste spasili, pa prvo spasite sa Ctrl+S ako možete. Za pitanja o pregledačima vidi Pregledači i računari.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"What is not built yet","summary":"Takeoff features this build does not have, and what to do instead today.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["limits","missing","not yet","roadmap","planned","workaround","per run","cloud","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"measuring","text":"Measuring","level":2},{"id":"items-and-pricing","text":"Items and pricing","level":2},{"id":"drawings-dwg-and-dxf","text":"Drawings (DWG and DXF)","level":2},{"id":"auto-count","text":"Auto count","level":2},{"id":"files-and-sharing","text":"Files and sharing","level":2},{"id":"screen-and-input","text":"Screen and input","level":2},{"id":"3d-view","text":"3D view","level":2},{"id":"bidding","text":"Bidding","level":2},{"id":"panels","text":"Panels","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measuring\"\u003EMeasuring\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInserting a point in the middle of a run or outline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete the mark and draw it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBox (window) selection\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + click each mark, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E for every mark on the sheet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick the preset, or calibrate on the bar&#039;s length.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMore than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasure the part at the sheet&#039;s scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-and-pricing\"\u003EItems and pricing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas that use an item&#039;s other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor&#039;s formulas)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the main type&#039;s totals; price the other kinds on their own rows.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas worked out run by run\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the item&#039;s totals; use \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E for per-run extras.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas that use another item&#039;s quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWrite it in the note&#039;s text; change its status as it is settled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA price library shared by a team, or kept with your account\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrade packs reviewed by working estimators\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003ETrade packs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrices in trade packs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPacks bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenaming the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaming sheets by hand\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets are named from the PDF&#039;s page labels; search by file name and page.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"drawings-dwg-and-dxf\"\u003EDrawings (DWG and DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing&#039;s sheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESave it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the linked drawing&#039;s file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EText in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECharacters Helvetica has no glyph for print as &quot;?&quot; in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the same file in that app.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E does for PDFs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E: the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImages show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding mirrored symbols\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-and-sharing\"\u003EFiles and sharing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E for people to see the marks; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECloud saving\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA desktop app\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (\u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E) or any web server (the browser edition).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"screen-and-input\"\u003EScreen and input\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA right-click (or long-press) menu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating the view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPages rotated in the PDF already show upright.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-view\"\u003E3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or editing marks in 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGo back to the sheet (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) to draw; select and delete work in 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount posts sized like the counted object\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bidding\"\u003EBidding\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport the package&#039;s CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepricing an alternate&#039;s bid area with a chosen bid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAutomatic reminders before a subcontractor&#039;s insurance or license date runs out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels\"\u003EPanels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoving the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panels move. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway. Measuring Not built yet Instead, today Inserting a point in the middle of a run or outline Delete the mark and draw it again. Box (window) selection Shift + click each mark, or Ctrl+A for every mark on the sheet. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Rotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy Paste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand. Reading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar Pick the preset, or calibrate on the bar's length. More than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans) Measure the part at the sheet's scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one. Items and pricing Not built yet Instead, today Assembly formulas that use an item's other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor's formulas) Formulas use the main type's totals; price the other kinds on their own rows. Assembly formulas worked out run by run Formulas use the item's totals; use N for per-run extras. Formulas that use another item's quantities Repeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export. Crews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours Give the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day. Markups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note Write it in the note's text; change its status as it is settled. A price library shared by a team, or kept with your account The library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer. Trade packs reviewed by working estimators Every pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See Trade packs. Prices in trade packs Packs bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV. Renaming the takeoff The name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files. Naming sheets by hand Sheets are named from the PDF's page labels; search by file name and page. Drawings (DWG and DXF) Not built yet Instead, today Plot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing's sheets A drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing. Opening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000 Save it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG. Finding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in Open the linked drawing's file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files. Measuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions Count them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools. Text in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin Characters Helvetica has no glyph for print as \"?\" in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected. A hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar Open the same file in that app. A drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as PDF with the takeoff inside does for PDFs Save takeoff: the .takeoff.json reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents. Drawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing Images show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet. Auto count Not built yet Instead, today Finding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size Give the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there. Finding mirrored symbols Count those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one. Files and sharing Not built yet Instead, today One PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff Marked PDF for people to see the marks; PDF with the takeoff inside to reopen in TakeoffDesk. A CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks Use XLSX: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them. Cloud saving Not available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up. A desktop app TakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (npm start) or any web server (the browser edition). Screen and input Not built yet Instead, today A right-click (or long-press) menu Use the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline. Rotating the view Pages rotated in the PDF already show upright. 3D view Not built yet Instead, today Drawing or editing marks in 3D Go back to the sheet (3) to draw; select and delete work in 3D. Lining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages Stack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time. Count posts sized like the counted object Every post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is. Bidding Not built yet Instead, today Sending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters Export the package's CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table. Repricing an alternate's bid area with a chosen bid Alternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand. Automatic reminders before a subcontractor's insurance or license date runs out The date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite. Panels Not built yet Instead, today Moving the Quantities table Only the Sheets and Items panels move. See Arrange the panels. Spreadsheets The XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Korištenje ove pomoći","summary":"Otvori pomoć, pretraži je i pogledaj korake za svoj računar.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["pomoć","f1","pretraga","tutorijali","priručnik"],"headings":[{"id":"otvori-pomo","text":"Otvori pomoć","level":2},{"id":"prona-i-temu","text":"Pronađi temu","level":2},{"id":"koraci-za-tvoj-ra-unar","text":"Koraci za tvoj računar","level":2},{"id":"ista-pomo-na-sajtu","text":"Ista pomoć na sajtu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaka aplikacija ima svoju pomoć. Ona je dio aplikacije, pa se otvara bez veze i uvijek opisuje verziju koju pokrećeš.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvori-pomo\"\u003EOtvori pomoć\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ili izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZatvori\u003C/span\u003E da je sklonite. Tvoj crtež ostaje kakav je bio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa većini Mac tastatura gornji red kontroliše svjetlinu i zvuk. Pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zajedno s tipkom \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ili tipkom globus), ili koristi dugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003ETipke na Macu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-i-temu\"\u003EPronađi temu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucaj u polje za pretragu na vrhu pomoći. Rezultati se mijenjaju dok kucaš i uključuju i komande drugih programa, pa ukucavanje onoga što bi inače ukucao drugdje obično nađe pravu stranicu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeme su grupisane isto u svakoj aplikaciji: početak rada, vodiči korak po korak, dolazak iz drugog softvera, referenca i rješavanje problema.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinkovi unutar teme otvaraju sljedeću temu u istom panelu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENazad\u003C/span\u003E te vraća na mjesto gdje si bio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci-za-tvoj-ra-unar\"\u003EKoraci za tvoj računar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeki koraci se razlikuju između Maca, Windowsa i Linuxa, između pregledača i između rada na mreži i van nje. Pomoć sama odredi šta se odnosi na tebe i prikazuje te korake. Red na vrhu teme kaže šta je odabrano, na primjer „Prikazujem korake za Mac, Chrome ili Edge, na mreži“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPromijeni\u003C/span\u003E u tom redu da odabereš drugi računar ili pregledač, na primjer da pomogneš kolegi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži sve\u003C/span\u003E da vidiš svaku verziju svakog koraka, svaku označenu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrečice na tastaturi napisane su onako kako ih tvoja tastatura označava: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E se čita kao ⌘S na Macu i Ctrl+S na Windowsu i Linuxu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ista-pomo-na-sajtu\"\u003EIsta pomoć na sajtu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESajt prikazuje iste teme na getcadcraft.com/tutorials, sa koracima za svaku platformu. U aplikaciji, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori na sajtu\u003C/span\u003E na dnu teme otvara tu stranicu kad si na mreži.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Svaka aplikacija ima svoju pomoć. Ona je dio aplikacije, pa se otvara bez veze i uvijek opisuje verziju koju pokrećeš. Otvori pomoć Pritisni F1, ili izaberi Pomoć u traci na vrhu aplikacije. Pritisni Esc ili izaberi Zatvori da je sklonite. Tvoj crtež ostaje kakav je bio. Na većini Mac tastatura gornji red kontroliše svjetlinu i zvuk. Pritisni F1 zajedno s tipkom fn (ili tipkom globus), ili koristi dugme Pomoć. Vidi Tipke na Macu. Pronađi temu Ukucaj u polje za pretragu na vrhu pomoći. Rezultati se mijenjaju dok kucaš i uključuju i komande drugih programa, pa ukucavanje onoga što bi inače ukucao drugdje obično nađe pravu stranicu. Teme su grupisane isto u svakoj aplikaciji: početak rada, vodiči korak po korak, dolazak iz drugog softvera, referenca i rješavanje problema. Linkovi unutar teme otvaraju sljedeću temu u istom panelu. Nazad te vraća na mjesto gdje si bio. Koraci za tvoj računar Neki koraci se razlikuju između Maca, Windowsa i Linuxa, između pregledača i između rada na mreži i van nje. Pomoć sama odredi šta se odnosi na tebe i prikazuje te korake. Red na vrhu teme kaže šta je odabrano, na primjer „Prikazujem korake za Mac, Chrome ili Edge, na mreži“. Izaberi Promijeni u tom redu da odabereš drugi računar ili pregledač, na primjer da pomogneš kolegi. Izaberi Prikaži sve da vidiš svaku verziju svakog koraka, svaku označenu. Prečice na tastaturi napisane su onako kako ih tvoja tastatura označava: Ctrl+S se čita kao ⌘S na Macu i Ctrl+S na Windowsu i Linuxu. Ista pomoć na sajtu Sajt prikazuje iste teme na getcadcraft.com/tutorials, sa koracima za svaku platformu. U aplikaciji, Otvori na sajtu na dnu teme otvara tu stranicu kad si na mreži.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Pregledači i računari","summary":"U kojim pregledačima aplikacije rade, šta se razlikuje među njima i šta tvoj računar treba.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","pregledač","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","zahtjevi","memorija"],"headings":[{"id":"koji-pregleda","text":"Koji pregledač","level":2},{"id":"ta-se-razlikuje-me-u-pregleda-ima","text":"Šta se razlikuje među pregledačima","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-i-linux","text":"Mac, Windows i Linux","level":2},{"id":"tableti-i-ekrani-osjetljivi-na-dodir","text":"Tableti i ekrani osjetljivi na dodir","level":2},{"id":"najstariji-pregleda-i-sistem","text":"Najstariji pregledač i sistem","level":2},{"id":"ta-treba-tvom-ra-unaru","text":"Šta treba tvom računaru","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije rade unutar web pregledača. Posao obavljaju na tvom vlastitom računaru: tvoje datoteke se tamo otvaraju i nikad se ne šalju nama (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EGdje idu tvoje datoteke\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koji-pregleda\"\u003EKoji pregledač\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristi ažurnu verziju jednog od ovih:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPregledač\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMotor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajpotpuniji: biranje foldera, spašavanje za rad van mreže, rukovanje datotekama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadi. Otvaranje cijelog foldera koristi jednostavniji birač. Spašavanje za rad van mreže možda neće raditi u privatnim prozorima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadi na Macu i iPadu. Otvaranje cijelog foldera koristi jednostavniji birač. Safari može obrisati kopiju za rad van mreže koju nisi koristio nekoliko sedmica.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESva tri motora su dobra za svakodnevni rad. Gdje aplikacija nešto radi drugačije u nekom od njih, njena pomoć pokazuje korake za tvoj pregledač.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-se-razlikuje-me-u-pregleda-ima\"\u003EŠta se razlikuje među pregledačima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOtvaranje foldera.\u003C/strong\u003E Pregledači na Chromiumu prikazuju pravi birač foldera i mogu direktno čitati folder. Firefox i Safari traže da izabereš folder, pa čitaju svaku datoteku u njemu, što traje duže za velike projektne foldere; prevlačenje foldera u aplikaciju radi u sva tri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpašavanje.\u003C/strong\u003E Aplikacije spašavaju preuzimanjem datoteke. Tvoj pregledač odlučuje gdje idu preuzimanja i da li prvo pita.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Chromeu ili Edgeu uključi „Pitaj gdje da spasim svaku datoteku prije preuzimanja“ (u Postavkama, pod Preuzimanja) da svaki put izabereš folder.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Firefoxu otvori Postavke, pa Opšte, pa Preuzimanja, i izaberi „Uvijek pitaj gdje da spasim datoteke“ da svaki put izabereš folder.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Safariju otvori Postavke, pa Opšte, i postavi „Lokacija za preuzimanje datoteka“ na „Pitaj za svako preuzimanje“ da svaki put izabereš folder.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-i-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows i Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije su iste na svakom računaru. Mijenja se tastatura: prečice su automatski napisane za tvoj računar. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003ETipke, miševi i trackpadovi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tableti-i-ekrani-osjetljivi-na-dodir\"\u003ETableti i ekrani osjetljivi na dodir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeke aplikacije prihvataju dodir (jedan prst crta ili bira, dva prsta razmiču ili približavaju za zumiranje, a pomjeraju za pomjeranje pogleda). Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže da li to radi. Na iPadu koristi Safari ili Chrome. Tastatura pomaže kod aplikacija koje koriste ukucane komande.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"najstariji-pregleda-i-sistem\"\u003ENajstariji pregledač i sistem\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOve verzije čitamo iz koda aplikacija verzije 0.7, a ne iz pretpostavke: svaka datoteka je raščlanjena, a svaka jezička mogućnost koju koristi provjerena je u objavljenim podacima o kompatibilnosti pregledača. Ispod ovih verzija aplikacije ne mogu ni da se pokrenu, jer pregledač ne razumije njihov kod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENajstarija verzija koja može pokrenuti aplikacije\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS i iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio na Windowsu ima svoj web motor, pa mu treba Windows 10 ili 11; na Macu koristi sistemski, pa mu treba macOS 13.3 ili noviji. Postavke › Ažuriranja u Studiju pokazuju na čemu tvoja kopija radi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo je najstarija verzija koja \u003Cem\u003Epočinje\u003C/em\u003E raditi, pročitana iz koda. Nije spisak starih pregledača u kojima smo pokretali aplikacije, pa stariji koji se pokrene može i dalje propustiti neku mogućnost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-treba-tvom-ra-unaru\"\u003EŠta treba tvom računaru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo su planirani minimumi za aplikacije, a ne izmjereni zahtjevi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB memorije (preporučeno je 16 GB za velike federirane modele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGrafički čip sa WebGL 2 za 3D aplikacije. Ako 3D prikaz ostane prazan, provjeri da je hardversko ubrzanje uključeno u postavkama pregledača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEkran širine najmanje 1280 piksela za pune alatne trake; manji ekrani ih prelamaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVrlo velike datoteke (veliki setovi planova, veliki modeli) troše puno memorije u kartici pregledača. Zatvori ostale teške kartice ako se aplikacija uspori.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aplikacije rade unutar web pregledača. Posao obavljaju na tvom vlastitom računaru: tvoje datoteke se tamo otvaraju i nikad se ne šalju nama (vidi Gdje idu tvoje datoteke). Koji pregledač Koristi ažurnu verziju jednog od ovih: Pregledač Motor Napomene Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Najpotpuniji: biranje foldera, spašavanje za rad van mreže, rukovanje datotekama. Firefox Gecko Radi. Otvaranje cijelog foldera koristi jednostavniji birač. Spašavanje za rad van mreže možda neće raditi u privatnim prozorima. Safari WebKit Radi na Macu i iPadu. Otvaranje cijelog foldera koristi jednostavniji birač. Safari može obrisati kopiju za rad van mreže koju nisi koristio nekoliko sedmica. Sva tri motora su dobra za svakodnevni rad. Gdje aplikacija nešto radi drugačije u nekom od njih, njena pomoć pokazuje korake za tvoj pregledač. Šta se razlikuje među pregledačima Otvaranje foldera. Pregledači na Chromiumu prikazuju pravi birač foldera i mogu direktno čitati folder. Firefox i Safari traže da izabereš folder, pa čitaju svaku datoteku u njemu, što traje duže za velike projektne foldere; prevlačenje foldera u aplikaciju radi u sva tri. Spašavanje. Aplikacije spašavaju preuzimanjem datoteke. Tvoj pregledač odlučuje gdje idu preuzimanja i da li prvo pita. U Chromeu ili Edgeu uključi „Pitaj gdje da spasim svaku datoteku prije preuzimanja“ (u Postavkama, pod Preuzimanja) da svaki put izabereš folder. U Firefoxu otvori Postavke, pa Opšte, pa Preuzimanja, i izaberi „Uvijek pitaj gdje da spasim datoteke“ da svaki put izabereš folder. U Safariju otvori Postavke, pa Opšte, i postavi „Lokacija za preuzimanje datoteka“ na „Pitaj za svako preuzimanje“ da svaki put izabereš folder. Mac, Windows i Linux Aplikacije su iste na svakom računaru. Mijenja se tastatura: prečice su automatski napisane za tvoj računar. Vidi Tipke, miševi i trackpadovi. Tableti i ekrani osjetljivi na dodir Neke aplikacije prihvataju dodir (jedan prst crta ili bira, dva prsta razmiču ili približavaju za zumiranje, a pomjeraju za pomjeranje pogleda). Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže da li to radi. Na iPadu koristi Safari ili Chrome. Tastatura pomaže kod aplikacija koje koriste ukucane komande. Najstariji pregledač i sistem Ove verzije čitamo iz koda aplikacija verzije 0.7, a ne iz pretpostavke: svaka datoteka je raščlanjena, a svaka jezička mogućnost koju koristi provjerena je u objavljenim podacima o kompatibilnosti pregledača. Ispod ovih verzija aplikacije ne mogu ni da se pokrenu, jer pregledač ne razumije njihov kod. Najstarija verzija koja može pokrenuti aplikacije Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS i iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio na Windowsu ima svoj web motor, pa mu treba Windows 10 ili 11; na Macu koristi sistemski, pa mu treba macOS 13.3 ili noviji. Postavke › Ažuriranja u Studiju pokazuju na čemu tvoja kopija radi. Ovo je najstarija verzija koja počinje raditi, pročitana iz koda. Nije spisak starih pregledača u kojima smo pokretali aplikacije, pa stariji koji se pokrene može i dalje propustiti neku mogućnost. Šta treba tvom računaru Ovo su planirani minimumi za aplikacije, a ne izmjereni zahtjevi: 8 GB memorije (preporučeno je 16 GB za velike federirane modele). Grafički čip sa WebGL 2 za 3D aplikacije. Ako 3D prikaz ostane prazan, provjeri da je hardversko ubrzanje uključeno u postavkama pregledača. Ekran širine najmanje 1280 piksela za pune alatne trake; manji ekrani ih prelamaju. Vrlo velike datoteke (veliki setovi planova, veliki modeli) troše puno memorije u kartici pregledača. Zatvori ostale teške kartice ako se aplikacija uspori.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Tipke, miševi i trackpadovi","summary":"Kako su napisane prečice, funkcijske tipke na Macu, desni klik i pomjeranje pogleda bez miša.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["tastatura","prečica","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","funkcijske tipke","trackpad","desni klik","srednje dugme","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"kako-su-napisane-pre-ice","text":"Kako su napisane prečice","level":2},{"id":"funkcijske-tipke-na-macu","text":"Funkcijske tipke na Macu","level":2},{"id":"pre-ice-koje-pregleda-zadr-ava","text":"Prečice koje pregledač zadržava","level":2},{"id":"dugmad-mi-a-na-trackpadu","text":"Dugmad miša na trackpadu","level":2},{"id":"kucanje-u-tekstualnom-polju","text":"Kucanje u tekstualnom polju","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-su-napisane-pre-ice\"\u003EKako su napisane prečice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPomoć piše svaku prečicu onako kako je tvoja tastatura označava.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENapisano\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENa Macu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENa Windowsu i Linuxu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) i S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl i S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) i F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift i F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) i ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt i ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etipka Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn i Delete (brisanje unaprijed)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZnak plus znači da tipke pritisneš zajedno. „Zatim“ znači da ih pritisneš jednu za drugom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVećina prečica aplikacija prihvata i Command i Control na Macu, pa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E radi na oba načina. Nekoliko, poput cijelog ekrana (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), koristi tipku Control na svakom računaru; pomoć to kaže tamo gdje se odnosi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funkcijske-tipke-na-macu\"\u003EFunkcijske tipke na Macu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa većini Mac tastatura gornji red mijenja svjetlinu, jačinu zvuka i medij. Da pošalješ F1 do F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edrži \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ili tipku globus) dok pritiskaš tipku, ili\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eotvori \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavke sistema\u003C/strong\u003E, pa \u003Cstrong\u003ETastatura\u003C/strong\u003E, pa \u003Cstrong\u003EPrečice na tastaturi\u003C/strong\u003E, pa \u003Cstrong\u003EFunkcijske tipke\u003C/strong\u003E, i uključi „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EmacOS sam koristi neke F-tipke (na primjer Mission Control). Ako tipka ne radi u aplikaciji, probaj je s fn ili koristi dugme na alatnoj traci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pre-ice-koje-pregleda-zadr-ava\"\u003EPrečice koje pregledač zadržava\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeb stranica ne može preuzeti neke prečice od pregledača, šta god radila. U svakoj aplikaciji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uvijek otvaraju ili zatvaraju prozore i kartice pregledača. Aplikacije za novo i zatvaranje koriste dugmad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na Macu i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na Windowsu zatvaraju pregledač. Ako imaš nesačuvan rad, pregledač prvo pita („Napusti stranicu?“); izaberi da ostaneš, pa spasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPregledačev vlastiti cijeli ekran (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ili zeleno dugme na prozoru\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) i dalje radi. Aplikacije imaju i vlastite režime ekrana na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, koji mogu sakriti i njihove trake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dugmad-mi-a-na-trackpadu\"\u003EDugmad miša na trackpadu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije koriste desno i srednje dugme. Bez miša s tri dugmeta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDesni klik:\u003C/strong\u003E klikni s dva prsta. Uključi „Sekundarni klik“ u \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavke sistema\u003C/strong\u003E, pa \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, ako klik s dva prsta ne radi. Držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok klikneš otvara meni pregledača, ali unutar crteža neke aplikacije to čitaju kao običan klik (uz držan Control), pa radije koristi klik s dva prsta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrevlačenje srednjim dugmetom (pomjeranje):\u003C/strong\u003E svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način pomjeranja, na primjer držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok prevlačiš ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom. Stranica s tastaturom aplikacije kaže koji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZumiranje točkićem:\u003C/strong\u003E skrolovanje dvama prstima na trackpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Štipanje takođe zumira tamo gdje aplikacija to podržava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDesni klik:\u003C/strong\u003E klikni s dva prsta ili klikni donji desni ugao touchpada. Ovo zavisi od postavki touchpada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrevlačenje srednjim dugmetom (pomjeranje):\u003C/strong\u003E svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način pomjeranja, na primjer držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok prevlačiš ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom. Stranica s tastaturom aplikacije kaže koji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZumiranje točkićem:\u003C/strong\u003E skrolovanje dvama prstima na touchpadu zumira u većini aplikacija.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kucanje-u-tekstualnom-polju\"\u003EKucanje u tekstualnom polju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok kucaš u polje (ime, bilješku, pretragu), jednoslovne prečice aplikacije su isključene, pa kucanje „L“ kuca slovo L. Pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili klikni na crtež da vratiš tipke aplikaciji.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kako su napisane prečice Pomoć piše svaku prečicu onako kako je tvoja tastatura označava. Napisano Na Macu Na Windowsu i Linuxu Ctrl+S Command (⌘) i S Ctrl i S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) i F Ctrl, Shift i F Alt+← Option (⌥) i ← Alt i ← Backspace tipka Delete Backspace Delete fn i Delete (brisanje unaprijed) Delete Enter Return Enter Znak plus znači da tipke pritisneš zajedno. „Zatim“ znači da ih pritisneš jednu za drugom. Većina prečica aplikacija prihvata i Command i Control na Macu, pa Ctrl+Z radi na oba načina. Nekoliko, poput cijelog ekrana (Ctrl+Shift+F), koristi tipku Control na svakom računaru; pomoć to kaže tamo gdje se odnosi. Funkcijske tipke na Macu Na većini Mac tastatura gornji red mijenja svjetlinu, jačinu zvuka i medij. Da pošalješ F1 do F12: drži fn (ili tipku globus) dok pritiskaš tipku, ili otvori Postavke sistema, pa Tastatura, pa Prečice na tastaturi, pa Funkcijske tipke, i uključi „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“. macOS sam koristi neke F-tipke (na primjer Mission Control). Ako tipka ne radi u aplikaciji, probaj je s fn ili koristi dugme na alatnoj traci. Prečice koje pregledač zadržava Web stranica ne može preuzeti neke prečice od pregledača, šta god radila. U svakoj aplikaciji: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T i Ctrl+W uvijek otvaraju ili zatvaraju prozore i kartice pregledača. Aplikacije za novo i zatvaranje koriste dugmad. Ctrl+Q na Macu i Alt+F4 na Windowsu zatvaraju pregledač. Ako imaš nesačuvan rad, pregledač prvo pita („Napusti stranicu?“); izaberi da ostaneš, pa spasi. Pregledačev vlastiti cijeli ekran (Control-Command-F, ili zeleno dugme na prozoru / F11) i dalje radi. Aplikacije imaju i vlastite režime ekrana na Ctrl+Shift+F, koji mogu sakriti i njihove trake. Dugmad miša na trackpadu Aplikacije koriste desno i srednje dugme. Bez miša s tri dugmeta: Desni klik: klikni s dva prsta. Uključi „Sekundarni klik“ u Postavke sistema, pa Trackpad, ako klik s dva prsta ne radi. Držanje Ctrl dok klikneš otvara meni pregledača, ali unutar crteža neke aplikacije to čitaju kao običan klik (uz držan Control), pa radije koristi klik s dva prsta. Prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom (pomjeranje): svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način pomjeranja, na primjer držanje Space dok prevlačiš ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom. Stranica s tastaturom aplikacije kaže koji. Zumiranje točkićem: skrolovanje dvama prstima na trackpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Štipanje takođe zumira tamo gdje aplikacija to podržava. Desni klik: klikni s dva prsta ili klikni donji desni ugao touchpada. Ovo zavisi od postavki touchpada. Prevlačenje srednjim dugmetom (pomjeranje): svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način pomjeranja, na primjer držanje Space dok prevlačiš ili prevlačenje desnim dugmetom. Stranica s tastaturom aplikacije kaže koji. Zumiranje točkićem: skrolovanje dvama prstima na touchpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Kucanje u tekstualnom polju Dok kucaš u polje (ime, bilješku, pretragu), jednoslovne prečice aplikacije su isključene, pa kucanje „L“ kuca slovo L. Pritisni Esc ili klikni na crtež da vratiš tipke aplikaciji.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Nađi alat ili postavku","summary":"Pritisni Ctrl+K i ukucaj nekoliko slova da pokreneš bilo koji alat, promijeniš postavku ili otvoriš temu pomoći.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["nađi","traži","paleta komandi","brzo otvaranje","pokreni komandu","ctrl k","cmd k","alat","postavka","prečica"],"headings":[{"id":"na-i-i-pokreni","text":"Nađi i pokreni","level":2},{"id":"na-ta-treba-paziti","text":"Na šta treba paziti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaka aplikacija ima polje za pretragu svojih alata, postavki i ove pomoći. Ne moraš znati gdje se alat nalazi na alatnoj traci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"na-i-i-pokreni\"\u003ENađi i pokreni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ili izaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENađi\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucaj nekoliko slova onoga što želiš, na primjer „fillet“, „tekst panela“ ili „jedinice“. Svaka riječ koju ukucaš mora se podudarati, pa dodaj drugu riječ da suziš spisak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da pokreneš prvi pogodak, ili se prvo pomjeri tipkama sa strelicama. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara polje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat se pokreće kao da si ga kliknuo na alatnoj traci. Postavka otvara \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E na toj postavci. Tema pomoći otvara se ovdje, u panelu pomoći.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"na-ta-treba-paziti\"\u003ENa šta treba paziti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOno što si zadnje koristio dolazi prvo sljedeći put, pa je alat koji često koristiš jedan pritisak tipke udaljen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlati koji ne mogu trenutno da se pokrenu, na primjer prije nego što je datoteka otvorena, navedeni su ali su zasivljeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlati dodataka su takođe na spisku, čim je dodatak uključen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Svaka aplikacija ima polje za pretragu svojih alata, postavki i ove pomoći. Ne moraš znati gdje se alat nalazi na alatnoj traci. Nađi i pokreni Pritisni Ctrl+K, ili izaberi Nađi u traci na vrhu. Ukucaj nekoliko slova onoga što želiš, na primjer „fillet“, „tekst panela“ ili „jedinice“. Svaka riječ koju ukucaš mora se podudarati, pa dodaj drugu riječ da suziš spisak. Pritisni Enter da pokreneš prvi pogodak, ili se prvo pomjeri tipkama sa strelicama. Esc zatvara polje. Alat se pokreće kao da si ga kliknuo na alatnoj traci. Postavka otvara Postavke na toj postavci. Tema pomoći otvara se ovdje, u panelu pomoći. Na šta treba paziti Ono što si zadnje koristio dolazi prvo sljedeći put, pa je alat koji često koristiš jedan pritisak tipke udaljen. Alati koji ne mogu trenutno da se pokrenu, na primjer prije nego što je datoteka otvorena, navedeni su ali su zasivljeni. Alati dodataka su takođe na spisku, čim je dodatak uključen.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Složi panele i koristi drugi monitor","summary":"Prikači bočne panele lijevo, desno ili na dno, slaži ih, grupiši kao kartice, učvrsti ili sakrij, pusti da lebde preko crteža, učini raspored gušćim, odaberi koliko redova koristi alatna traka ili ih premjesti u vlastiti prozor na drugom ekranu.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["paneli","prikači","lebdi","premjesti panel","prevuci","raspored","kartice","grupa kartica","slaži","učvrsti","automatsko skrivanje","sakrij panel","zatvori panel","zbijeno","gustina rasporeda","gusto","redovi alatne trake","prelomi","1 red","2 reda","redovi trake","drugi monitor","dva ekrana","dvostruki monitor","više monitora","prozor","iskačući prozor","vrati raspored"],"headings":[{"id":"pomjeri-panel-u-prozoru","text":"Pomjeri panel u prozoru","level":2},{"id":"grupi-i-panele-kao-kartice","text":"Grupiši panele kao kartice","level":2},{"id":"u-vrsti-sakrij-i-vrati","text":"Učvrsti, sakrij i vrati","level":2},{"id":"u-ini-raspored-gu-im","text":"Učini raspored gušćim","level":2},{"id":"odaberi-koliko-redova-koristi-alatna-traka","text":"Odaberi koliko redova koristi alatna traka","level":2},{"id":"koristi-tastaturu","text":"Koristi tastaturu","level":2},{"id":"stavi-panele-na-drugi-monitor","text":"Stavi panele na drugi monitor","level":2},{"id":"vi-e-od-jednog-prozora-s-panelima","text":"Više od jednog prozora s panelima","level":2},{"id":"isto-za-svaki-dio-rasporeda","text":"Isto za svaki dio rasporeda","level":2},{"id":"premjesti-dijalog","text":"Premjesti dijalog","level":2},{"id":"vrati-panele","text":"Vrati panele","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPaneli pored crteža mogu se pomjerati. Postavi ih gdje ti odgovara ili im daj vlastiti prozor na drugom monitoru, da crtež dobije cijeli prvi monitor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki panel ima naslovnu traku: tanku traku s nazivom panela, meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, dugme za učvršćivanje i dugme za zatvaranje na vrhu panela. Verzije prije 0.7 imaju samo naziv i meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pomjeri-panel-u-prozoru\"\u003EPomjeri panel u prozoru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevuci panel za njegov naziv na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDok prevlačiš, na lijevoj, desnoj i donjoj strani crteža pojave se ocrtane površine. Spusti panel na jednu od njih da se prikači tu. Površina iznad koje si potamni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpusti ga bilo gdje drugdje preko crteža da lebdi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli mogu dijeliti jednu stranu: slažu se, a svaka linija između dva dijeli prostor (kad je linija u fokusu, strelice je pomjeraju, a dvostruki klik je dijeli ravnomjerno). Prevuci unutrašnju ivicu prikačene strane da je učiniš širom ili užom; dvostruki klik na ivicu vraća je.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELebdeći panel ostaje preko crteža. Pomjeri ga za naziv, a veličinu mijenjaš prevlačenjem donjeg desnog ugla (ili dođi do ugla tabulatorom i koristi strelice). Dvostruki klik na naziv ga ponovo prikači tamo gdje je bio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrevuci jednim prstom za naziv panela. Prevuci donji desni ugao lebdećeg panela jednim prstom da mu promijeniš veličinu, a isto tako i ivice između prikačenih panela. Da bi lebdio ili se prikačio bez prevlačenja, koristi meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"grupi-i-panele-kao-kartice\"\u003EGrupiši panele kao kartice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDva panela mogu dijeliti jedan okvir i prikazivati se jedan po jedan. Prevuci panel za naziv na naslovnu traku drugog panela (traka je ocrtana dok si iznad nje) i pusti: okvir sada ima karticu za svaki panel, u naslovnoj traci. Klikni karticu da prikažeš taj panel. Kad je kartica u fokusu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mijenjaju kartice, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idu na prvu i posljednju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa izvučeš panel iz grupe, odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvuci iz grupe kartica\u003C/span\u003E u njegovom meniju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, ili ga prevuci negdje drugdje. Odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKartica s\u003C/span\u003E i naziv panela da ih grupišeš bez prevlačenja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-vrsti-sakrij-i-vrati\"\u003EUčvrsti, sakrij i vrati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDugme za učvršćivanje na naslovnoj traci panela čini ga \u003Cstrong\u003Eautomatski skrivenim\u003C/strong\u003E: panel napušta svoje mjesto i postaje mala kartica na toj ivici. Pokaži na karticu, fokusiraj je ili klikni na nju, i panel izađe preko crteža; kad se odmakneš (ili pritisneš \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), vraća se. Ponovo pritisni dugme ili odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkači\u003C/span\u003E da ga trajno prikačiš.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDugme za zatvaranje, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESakrij ovaj panel\u003C/span\u003E u meniju, sakriva panel i zatvara njegovu stranu. Isprekidana kartica na ivici ga vraća: klikni je ili je fokusiraj i pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-ini-raspored-gu-im\"\u003EUčini raspored gušćim\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpšte\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGustina rasporeda\u003C/span\u003E ima dva izbora. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUdobno\u003C/span\u003E je zadano. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZbijeno\u003C/span\u003E zateže visinu redova, unutrašnje razmake panela, dugmad alatne trake i tekst panela te aplikacije, da stane više na ekran. Pamti se za svaku aplikaciju. Ekran osjetljiv na dodir zadržava svoja velika dugmad u oba slučaja, a telefon zadržava svoj raspored. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored\u003C/span\u003E ostavlja gustinu onakvom kakvu si postavio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberi-koliko-redova-koristi-alatna-traka\"\u003EOdaberi koliko redova koristi alatna traka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpšte\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedovi alatne trake\u003C/span\u003E ima tri izbora. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrelomi\u003C/span\u003E je zadano: svaka grupa alata se prikazuje, u onoliko redova koliko treba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 reda\u003C/span\u003E drži alatnu traku na dva reda, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 red\u003C/span\u003E na jednom, pa crtež dobija visinu; grupe koje ne stanu klize vodoravno unutar alatne trake (koristi točkić miša, dvoprstni prevlak ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E do alata). Alatna traka koja već stane u dva reda ostaje kakva jeste pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 reda\u003C/span\u003E, jer bi mreža samo učinila traku višom. Izbor se pamti za svaku aplikaciju. Ekran osjetljiv na dodir i telefon zadržavaju svoj raspored. CadCraft ima vlastitu postavku za svoju alatnu traku, pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristi-tastaturu\"\u003EKoristi tastaturu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E svakog panela otvara meni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikači lijevo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikači desno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikači na dno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELebdi preko crteža\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikači uz ivicu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESakrij ovaj panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKartica s\u003C/span\u003E drugim panelom, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati ga\u003C/span\u003E. Dođi do dugmeta tabulatorom, pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, pomjeraj strelicama i ponovo pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara meni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stavi-panele-na-drugi-monitor\"\u003EStavi panele na drugi monitor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E na panelu, pa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti sve panele u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E. Možeš odabrati i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti panele u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvara se mali prozor s panelima. Prevuci ga na drugi monitor i učini ga koliko god želiš velikim.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENastavi raditi: paneli djeluju na crtež kao i prije, a crtež ispunjava glavni prozor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrečice i dalje rade dok je prozor panela ispred: tasteri koje pritisneš tu, osim kad kucaš u polje, idu crtežu. Pitanja i dijalozi koje aplikacija postavlja i dalje se otvaraju u glavnom prozoru, pa tamo pogledaj kad se pojavi jedan. Tema i veličina teksta panela prate glavni prozor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome i Edge mogu sami postaviti prozor na drugi ekran. Kad je drugi ekran priključen, odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti ga na moj drugi ekran\u003C/span\u003E u prozoru panela (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrebaci panele na moj drugi ekran\u003C/span\u003E u meniju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panela). Preglednik jednom pita smije li ovaj sajt vidjeti tvoje ekrane; kad to dopustiš, prozor s panelima se svaki put otvara na tom ekranu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrevuci prozor s panelima na drugi monitor sam. Sljedeći put se otvara na istom mjestu i u istoj veličini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vi-e-od-jednog-prozora-s-panelima\"\u003EViše od jednog prozora s panelima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki panel može imati vlastiti prozor: do četiri prozora s panelima, na primjer jedan po monitoru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU meniju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E otvara još jedan prozor za taj panel, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u prozor panela 2\u003C/span\u003E (i tako dalje) premješta ga u onaj koji je već otvoren. Drugi prozor se zove „prozor panela 2“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrevuci panel za naziv iz jednog prozora u drugi: pusti ga iznad glavnog prozora da se prikači tamo (ocrtane površine se vide dok si iznad njega) ili da lebdi, a iznad drugog prozora s panelima da se premjesti u njega. Pusti bilo gdje drugdje i ostaje gdje je bio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProzor s panelima koji nema više panela zatvara se sam.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon ponovnog učitavanja aplikacija ponudi tvoje prozore s panelima ponovo. Preglednici otvaraju jedan prozor po kliku, pa odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori sljedeći\u003C/span\u003E jednom za svaki prozor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isto-za-svaki-dio-rasporeda\"\u003EIsto za svaki dio rasporeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETraka, alatnica, redovi alata i statusna traka odlaze u vlastiti prozor na isti način kao panel: otvori meni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E na tom dijelu i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati ga\u003C/span\u003E (ili zatvaranje prozora) ga vraća kući. Tipke koje pritisneš u tom prozoru stižu do aplikacije, kao i iz prozora s panelima. Svaki dio ima jedan takav meni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premjesti-dijalog\"\u003EPremjesti dijalog\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki dijalog se može pomjeriti s puta crtežu: pritisni i prevuci njegovu naslovnu traku. Dijalog pamti gdje si ga ostavio, svaki zasebno, i vraća se na to mjesto kad se sljedeći put otvori. Dvostruki klik na naslovnu traku ga ponovo centrira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ES tastature, pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+strelicu dok je fokus unutar dijaloga da ga pomjeraš po 16 piksela; dodaj \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za 64. Dijalog koji završi van ekrana (nakon manjeg prozora ili ekrana) vraća se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu dijalozi ostaju listovi punе širine i ne pomjeraju se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU CadCraft Studiu dijalog \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIspiši u PDF\u003C/span\u003E, koji možeš držati otvoren dok radiš, ima dugme u naslovnoj traci, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori u vlastitom prozoru\u003C/span\u003E. Dijalog se premješta u vlastiti prozor koji možeš staviti na drugi monitor. Zatvaranje dijaloga zatvara prozor, a zatvaranje prozora zatvara dijalog.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vrati-panele\"\u003EVrati panele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati panele\u003C/span\u003E u prozoru s panelima ili jednostavno zatvori taj prozor. Paneli se vraćaju tamo gdje su bili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvaranje ili ponovno učitavanje glavnog prozora zatvara i prozor s panelima. Kad se aplikacija ponovo otvori, kaže da su tvoji paneli bili u vlastitom prozoru; odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori ga\u003C/span\u003E da vratiš prozor, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZadrži ih ovdje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpšte\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored\u003C/span\u003E vraća svaki panel tamo gdje je počeo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko ništa ne otvori kad premjestiš panele u novi prozor, preglednik je blokirao iskačući prozor. Aplikacija to kaže i ostavlja panele gdje su bili. Dozvoli iskačuće prozore za getcadcraft.com, pa pokušaj ponovo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se pamti za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku, zajedno s ostalim postavkama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Paneli pored crteža mogu se pomjerati. Postavi ih gdje ti odgovara ili im daj vlastiti prozor na drugom monitoru, da crtež dobije cijeli prvi monitor. Svaki panel ima naslovnu traku: tanku traku s nazivom panela, meni ⋯, dugme za učvršćivanje i dugme za zatvaranje na vrhu panela. Verzije prije 0.7 imaju samo naziv i meni ⋯. Pomjeri panel u prozoru Prevuci panel za njegov naziv na vrhu. Dok prevlačiš, na lijevoj, desnoj i donjoj strani crteža pojave se ocrtane površine. Spusti panel na jednu od njih da se prikači tu. Površina iznad koje si potamni. Spusti ga bilo gdje drugdje preko crteža da lebdi. Paneli mogu dijeliti jednu stranu: slažu se, a svaka linija između dva dijeli prostor (kad je linija u fokusu, strelice je pomjeraju, a dvostruki klik je dijeli ravnomjerno). Prevuci unutrašnju ivicu prikačene strane da je učiniš širom ili užom; dvostruki klik na ivicu vraća je. Lebdeći panel ostaje preko crteža. Pomjeri ga za naziv, a veličinu mijenjaš prevlačenjem donjeg desnog ugla (ili dođi do ugla tabulatorom i koristi strelice). Dvostruki klik na naziv ga ponovo prikači tamo gdje je bio. Prevuci jednim prstom za naziv panela. Prevuci donji desni ugao lebdećeg panela jednim prstom da mu promijeniš veličinu, a isto tako i ivice između prikačenih panela. Da bi lebdio ili se prikačio bez prevlačenja, koristi meni ⋯. Grupiši panele kao kartice Dva panela mogu dijeliti jedan okvir i prikazivati se jedan po jedan. Prevuci panel za naziv na naslovnu traku drugog panela (traka je ocrtana dok si iznad nje) i pusti: okvir sada ima karticu za svaki panel, u naslovnoj traci. Klikni karticu da prikažeš taj panel. Kad je kartica u fokusu, ← i → mijenjaju kartice, a Home i End idu na prvu i posljednju. Da izvučeš panel iz grupe, odaberi Izvuci iz grupe kartica u njegovom meniju ⋯, ili ga prevuci negdje drugdje. Odaberi Kartica s i naziv panela da ih grupišeš bez prevlačenja. Učvrsti, sakrij i vrati Dugme za učvršćivanje na naslovnoj traci panela čini ga automatski skrivenim: panel napušta svoje mjesto i postaje mala kartica na toj ivici. Pokaži na karticu, fokusiraj je ili klikni na nju, i panel izađe preko crteža; kad se odmakneš (ili pritisneš Esc), vraća se. Ponovo pritisni dugme ili odaberi Otkači da ga trajno prikačiš. Dugme za zatvaranje, ili Sakrij ovaj panel u meniju, sakriva panel i zatvara njegovu stranu. Isprekidana kartica na ivici ga vraća: klikni je ili je fokusiraj i pritisni Enter. Učini raspored gušćim Postavke › Opšte › Gustina rasporeda ima dva izbora. Udobno je zadano. Zbijeno zateže visinu redova, unutrašnje razmake panela, dugmad alatne trake i tekst panela te aplikacije, da stane više na ekran. Pamti se za svaku aplikaciju. Ekran osjetljiv na dodir zadržava svoja velika dugmad u oba slučaja, a telefon zadržava svoj raspored. Vrati raspored ostavlja gustinu onakvom kakvu si postavio. Odaberi koliko redova koristi alatna traka Postavke › Opšte › Redovi alatne trake ima tri izbora. Prelomi je zadano: svaka grupa alata se prikazuje, u onoliko redova koliko treba. 2 reda drži alatnu traku na dva reda, a 1 red na jednom, pa crtež dobija visinu; grupe koje ne stanu klize vodoravno unutar alatne trake (koristi točkić miša, dvoprstni prevlak ili Tab do alata). Alatna traka koja već stane u dva reda ostaje kakva jeste pod 2 reda, jer bi mreža samo učinila traku višom. Izbor se pamti za svaku aplikaciju. Ekran osjetljiv na dodir i telefon zadržavaju svoj raspored. CadCraft ima vlastitu postavku za svoju alatnu traku, pod Postavke › CadCraft. Koristi tastaturu Dugme ⋯ svakog panela otvara meni: Prikači lijevo, Prikači desno, Prikači na dno, Lebdi preko crteža, Prikači uz ivicu, Sakrij ovaj panel, Kartica s drugim panelom, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati ga. Dođi do dugmeta tabulatorom, pritisni Enter, pomjeraj strelicama i ponovo pritisni Enter. Esc zatvara meni. Stavi panele na drugi monitor Odaberi ⋯ na panelu, pa Premjesti sve panele u novi prozor. Možeš odabrati i Premjesti panele u novi prozor u Postavke. Otvara se mali prozor s panelima. Prevuci ga na drugi monitor i učini ga koliko god želiš velikim. Nastavi raditi: paneli djeluju na crtež kao i prije, a crtež ispunjava glavni prozor. Prečice i dalje rade dok je prozor panela ispred: tasteri koje pritisneš tu, osim kad kucaš u polje, idu crtežu. Pitanja i dijalozi koje aplikacija postavlja i dalje se otvaraju u glavnom prozoru, pa tamo pogledaj kad se pojavi jedan. Tema i veličina teksta panela prate glavni prozor. Chrome i Edge mogu sami postaviti prozor na drugi ekran. Kad je drugi ekran priključen, odaberi Premjesti ga na moj drugi ekran u prozoru panela (ili Prebaci panele na moj drugi ekran u meniju ⋯ panela). Preglednik jednom pita smije li ovaj sajt vidjeti tvoje ekrane; kad to dopustiš, prozor s panelima se svaki put otvara na tom ekranu. Prevuci prozor s panelima na drugi monitor sam. Sljedeći put se otvara na istom mjestu i u istoj veličini. Više od jednog prozora s panelima Svaki panel može imati vlastiti prozor: do četiri prozora s panelima, na primjer jedan po monitoru. U meniju ⋯ panela, Premjesti u novi prozor otvara još jedan prozor za taj panel, a Premjesti u prozor panela 2 (i tako dalje) premješta ga u onaj koji je već otvoren. Drugi prozor se zove „prozor panela 2“. Prevuci panel za naziv iz jednog prozora u drugi: pusti ga iznad glavnog prozora da se prikači tamo (ocrtane površine se vide dok si iznad njega) ili da lebdi, a iznad drugog prozora s panelima da se premjesti u njega. Pusti bilo gdje drugdje i ostaje gdje je bio. Prozor s panelima koji nema više panela zatvara se sam. Nakon ponovnog učitavanja aplikacija ponudi tvoje prozore s panelima ponovo. Preglednici otvaraju jedan prozor po kliku, pa odaberi Otvori sljedeći jednom za svaki prozor. Isto za svaki dio rasporeda Traka, alatnica, redovi alata i statusna traka odlaze u vlastiti prozor na isti način kao panel: otvori meni ⋯ na tom dijelu i odaberi Premjesti u novi prozor; Vrati ga (ili zatvaranje prozora) ga vraća kući. Tipke koje pritisneš u tom prozoru stižu do aplikacije, kao i iz prozora s panelima. Svaki dio ima jedan takav meni. Premjesti dijalog Svaki dijalog se može pomjeriti s puta crtežu: pritisni i prevuci njegovu naslovnu traku. Dijalog pamti gdje si ga ostavio, svaki zasebno, i vraća se na to mjesto kad se sljedeći put otvori. Dvostruki klik na naslovnu traku ga ponovo centrira. S tastature, pritisni Alt+Shift+strelicu dok je fokus unutar dijaloga da ga pomjeraš po 16 piksela; dodaj Ctrl za 64. Dijalog koji završi van ekrana (nakon manjeg prozora ili ekrana) vraća se. Na telefonu dijalozi ostaju listovi punе širine i ne pomjeraju se. U CadCraft Studiu dijalog Ispiši u PDF, koji možeš držati otvoren dok radiš, ima dugme u naslovnoj traci, Otvori u vlastitom prozoru. Dijalog se premješta u vlastiti prozor koji možeš staviti na drugi monitor. Zatvaranje dijaloga zatvara prozor, a zatvaranje prozora zatvara dijalog. Vrati panele Odaberi Vrati panele u prozoru s panelima ili jednostavno zatvori taj prozor. Paneli se vraćaju tamo gdje su bili. Zatvaranje ili ponovno učitavanje glavnog prozora zatvara i prozor s panelima. Kad se aplikacija ponovo otvori, kaže da su tvoji paneli bili u vlastitom prozoru; odaberi Otvori ga da vratiš prozor, ili Zadrži ih ovdje. Postavke › Opšte › Vrati raspored vraća svaki panel tamo gdje je počeo. Ako ništa ne otvori kad premjestiš panele u novi prozor, preglednik je blokirao iskačući prozor. Aplikacija to kaže i ostavlja panele gdje su bili. Dozvoli iskačuće prozore za getcadcraft.com, pa pokušaj ponovo. Raspored se pamti za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku, zajedno s ostalim postavkama.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Radi u rasporedu trake i pregleda projekta","summary":"Prebaci aplikaciju na traku kartica preko crteža, s Svojstvima i pregledom projekta lijevo i karticom za svaki otvoreni pogled, i vrati se na klasični raspored kad god želiš.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","traka","kartice trake","pregled projekta","pregledavač","palete","paleta svojstava","kartice pogleda","statusna traka","brzi pristup","sklopi traku","minimiziraj traku","prozor trake","klasični raspored","promijeni raspored","prebaci raspored","prikačeno"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberi-ga","text":"Odaberi ga","level":2},{"id":"ta-je-gdje","text":"Šta je gdje","level":2},{"id":"koristi-traku-s-tastature","text":"Koristi traku s tastature","level":2},{"id":"sklopi-traku-ili-joj-daj-vlastiti-prozor","text":"Sklopi traku ili joj daj vlastiti prozor","level":2},{"id":"tvoji-paneli-ostaju-tvoji","text":"Tvoji paneli ostaju tvoji","level":2},{"id":"vrati-klasi-ni-raspored","text":"Vrati klasični raspored","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka i pregled projekta\u003C/strong\u003E je jedan od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Traka kartica ide preko vrha, Svojstva i pregled projekta dijele lijevi panel, svaki pogled koji otvoriš dobija karticu preko crteža, a statusna traka je na dnu. Alati su aplikacijini: sve što možeš raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a tvoj crtež, stil menija i tasteri ostaju kakvi jesu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberi-ga\"\u003EOdaberi ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi karticu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E, pa idi na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka i pregled projekta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se odmah mijenja. Izbor vrijedi za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, i on je na mjestu prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidiš klasični raspored prvi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-je-gdje\"\u003EŠta je gdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaslovna traka:\u003C/strong\u003E naziv aplikacije, dugmad brzog pristupa (otvori, sačuvaj, poništi, ponovi), naziv otvorene datoteke, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠta ovdje radi svaki alat\u003C/span\u003E (spisak svakog alata s poljem za pretragu, koji su spremni sada i zašto ostali nisu), puni ekran, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E. U ovom rasporedu naslovna traka zauzima mjesto trake aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka:\u003C/strong\u003E alati aplikacije u karticama, svaka kartica u grupama. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E na lijevom kraju otvara, čuva i ostalo. Neke aplikacije dodaju svoju karticu dok radiš u određenom režimu ili radnom prostoru; ona svijetli dok važi i nestaje poslije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka opcija:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod trake, ono što aktivni alat traži od tebe, ili šta je odabrano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELijevi panel:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E iznad, a ispod njega palete (pregled projekta i sadržaj samog panela) kao kartice. Prevuci liniju između njih da podijeliš prostor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKartice pogleda:\u003C/strong\u003E jedna kartica po pogledu koji si otvorio (list, plan, scena…). Zatvori jednu njenim dugmetom za zatvaranje; datoteka ostaje otvorena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka pogleda i statusna traka:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod crteža, kontrole samog pogleda (razmjera, zum); na dnu, poruke aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat koji sada ne može raditi je zasivljen, a njegov opis kaže zašto (na primjer „Prvo otvori datoteku“, ili da aplikacija još nema taj alat). Klikni ga, ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na njemu, da pročitaš razlog u okviru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristi-traku-s-tastature\"\u003EKoristi traku s tastature\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad je kartica trake u fokusu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prelaze između kartica, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idu na prvu i posljednju. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo prekida aktivni alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaka prečica i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (režimi ekrana) rade kao prije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sklopi-traku-ili-joj-daj-vlastiti-prozor\"\u003ESklopi traku ili joj daj vlastiti prozor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDvostruki klik na karticu trake sklapa traku na njene kartice; klik na karticu tada prikazuje njene alate dok ne pređeš dalje. Ponovo dvostruki klik je drži otvorenom. Dugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti traku\u003C/span\u003E na desnom kraju trake ima i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklopi traku\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrži traku otvorenom\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka aplikacija to pamti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti traku\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E stavlja traku u vlastiti prozor, na primjer na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati traku\u003C/span\u003E, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, je vraća kući.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPostavke alatne trake važe za traku: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka s alatima\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkone i oznake\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo ikone\u003C/span\u003E (traka tada prikazuje dva reda sitnih ikona po grupi) ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo oznake\u003C/span\u003E, i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži nazive grupa (Datoteka, Crtanje, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tvoji-paneli-ostaju-tvoji\"\u003ETvoji paneli ostaju tvoji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELijevi i desni paneli zadržavaju sve što je opisano u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ESloži panele i koristi drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E: prikačivanje, lebdenje, učvršćivanje, sakrivanje, kartice, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vrati-klasi-ni-raspored\"\u003EVrati klasični raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klasični\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka traka, kartica i panel vraćaju se gdje su bili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon, šta god da si odabrao. Širi prozor vraća tvoj raspored.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa isprobaš drugi raspored, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003ERadi u rasporedu alatnice i info okvira\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa promijeniš šta ovaj raspored prikazuje, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromijeni raspored na ekranu\u003C/a\u003E; za tamni raspored s trakom menija i trakom kartica vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Traka i pregled projekta je jedan od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Traka kartica ide preko vrha, Svojstva i pregled projekta dijele lijevi panel, svaki pogled koji otvoriš dobija karticu preko crteža, a statusna traka je na dnu. Alati su aplikacijini: sve što možeš raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a tvoj crtež, stil menija i tasteri ostaju kakvi jesu. Odaberi ga Otvori Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,). Odaberi karticu Globalno, pa idi na Raspored › Radni prostor. Odaberi Traka i pregled projekta. Raspored se odmah mijenja. Izbor vrijedi za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, i on je na mjestu prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidiš klasični raspored prvi. Šta je gdje Naslovna traka: naziv aplikacije, dugmad brzog pristupa (otvori, sačuvaj, poništi, ponovi), naziv otvorene datoteke, Šta ovdje radi svaki alat (spisak svakog alata s poljem za pretragu, koji su spremni sada i zašto ostali nisu), puni ekran, Pomoć i Postavke. U ovom rasporedu naslovna traka zauzima mjesto trake aplikacije. Traka: alati aplikacije u karticama, svaka kartica u grupama. Datoteka na lijevom kraju otvara, čuva i ostalo. Neke aplikacije dodaju svoju karticu dok radiš u određenom režimu ili radnom prostoru; ona svijetli dok važi i nestaje poslije. Traka opcija: ispod trake, ono što aktivni alat traži od tebe, ili šta je odabrano. Lijevi panel: Svojstva iznad, a ispod njega palete (pregled projekta i sadržaj samog panela) kao kartice. Prevuci liniju između njih da podijeliš prostor. Kartice pogleda: jedna kartica po pogledu koji si otvorio (list, plan, scena…). Zatvori jednu njenim dugmetom za zatvaranje; datoteka ostaje otvorena. Traka pogleda i statusna traka: ispod crteža, kontrole samog pogleda (razmjera, zum); na dnu, poruke aplikacije. Alat koji sada ne može raditi je zasivljen, a njegov opis kaže zašto (na primjer „Prvo otvori datoteku“, ili da aplikacija još nema taj alat). Klikni ga, ili pritisni Enter na njemu, da pročitaš razlog u okviru. Koristi traku s tastature Kad je kartica trake u fokusu, ← i → prelaze između kartica, a Home i End idu na prvu i posljednju. Esc prvo prekida aktivni alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaka prečica i Ctrl+Shift+F (režimi ekrana) rade kao prije. Sklopi traku ili joj daj vlastiti prozor Dvostruki klik na karticu trake sklapa traku na njene kartice; klik na karticu tada prikazuje njene alate dok ne pređeš dalje. Ponovo dvostruki klik je drži otvorenom. Dugme Premjesti traku na desnom kraju trake ima i Sklopi traku i Drži traku otvorenom. Svaka aplikacija to pamti. Premjesti traku › Premjesti u novi prozor stavlja traku u vlastiti prozor, na primjer na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. Vrati traku, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, je vraća kući. Postavke alatne trake važe za traku: Postavke › Globalno › Traka s alatima › Ikone i oznake, Samo ikone (traka tada prikazuje dva reda sitnih ikona po grupi) ili Samo oznake, i Prikaži nazive grupa (Datoteka, Crtanje, …). Tvoji paneli ostaju tvoji Lijevi i desni paneli zadržavaju sve što je opisano u Složi panele i koristi drugi monitor: prikačivanje, lebdenje, učvršćivanje, sakrivanje, kartice, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati raspored. Vrati klasični raspored Otvori Postavke › Globalno › Raspored › Radni prostor i odaberi CadCraft klasični. Svaka traka, kartica i panel vraćaju se gdje su bili. Na telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon, šta god da si odabrao. Širi prozor vraća tvoj raspored. Da isprobaš drugi raspored, vidi Radi u rasporedu alatnice i info okvira. Da promijeniš šta ovaj raspored prikazuje, vidi Promijeni raspored na ekranu; za tamni raspored s trakom menija i trakom kartica vidi raspored Drafting.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Radi u rasporedu alatnice i info okvira","summary":"Prebaci aplikaciju na stupac alata lijevo s mjestima za tvoje, info okvir preko vrha koji prati aktivni alat ili ono što si odabrao, navigator desno, karticu za svaki pogled, brze opcije i paletu za uređivanje, i vrati se na klasični raspored kad god želiš.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","alatnica","stupac alata","info okvir","info traka","navigator","mapa projekta","brza traka","brze opcije","paleta za uređivanje","palete uređivanja","moji alati","omiljeni alati","kartice pogleda","prozor alatnice","klasični raspored","promijeni raspored","prebaci raspored"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberi-ga","text":"Odaberi ga","level":2},{"id":"ta-je-gdje","text":"Šta je gdje","level":2},{"id":"daj-alatnici-vlastiti-prozor","text":"Daj alatnici vlastiti prozor","level":2},{"id":"tvoji-paneli-ostaju-tvoji","text":"Tvoji paneli ostaju tvoji","level":2},{"id":"vrati-klasi-ni-raspored","text":"Vrati klasični raspored","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkvir s alatima i info okvir\u003C/strong\u003E je jedan od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Alati za crtanje stoje u stupcu lijevo, info okvir preko vrha pokazuje šta aktivni alat traži ili šta si odabrao, svaki pogled ima karticu, a brza traka ispod crteža drži nekoliko svakodnevnih opcija. Alati su aplikacijini: sve što možeš raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a tvoj crtež, stil menija i tasteri ostaju kakvi jesu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberi-ga\"\u003EOdaberi ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi karticu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E, pa idi na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkvir s alatima i info okvir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se odmah mijenja. Izbor vrijedi za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, i on je na mjestu prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidiš klasični raspored prvi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-je-gdje\"\u003EŠta je gdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka s alatima:\u003C/strong\u003E traka aplikacije ostaje na vrhu područja crteža, sa svojim menijima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInfo okvir:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod trake s alatima. Dok alat radi, pokazuje alat i šta traži. Kad nešto odabereš, pokazuje glavne postavke (za zid: tip, debljinu, dužinu, liniju lokacije i visinu), i možeš ih mijenjati odmah tu: promjena je ista kao u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je poništava. Kad ništa nije odabrano, piše „Ništa nije odabrano“. Svaka aplikacija dodaje svoje okvire ovdje, kao što su trenutni sloj ili nivo, ili otvoreni dokument.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlatnica:\u003C/strong\u003E stupac lijevo, alati aplikacije u grupama. Klikni na naziv grupe da je sklopiš ili ponovo otvoriš. Alat koji radi je osvijetljen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoji alati:\u003C/strong\u003E prva grupa alatnice, osam praznih mjesta za alate koje najviše koristiš. Klikni prazno mjesto da odabereš bilo koji alat ili naredbu aplikacije; ili desnim klikom na alat u alatnici odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u Moje alate\u003C/span\u003E; ili prevuci alat na mjesto. Desni klik na mjesto ga mijenja ili ga isprazni. Tvoja mjesta se pamte za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENavigator:\u003C/strong\u003E desni panel. Pregled projekta aplikacije je na vrhu (planovi, presjeci, izgledi, 3D pogledi, specifikacije, listovi, kako aplikacija ima): klikni jedan da ga otvoriš. Ispod njega su \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E i kartica s ostalim sadržajem desnog panela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKartice pogleda:\u003C/strong\u003E kartica za svaki pogled otvorene datoteke (list, plan, scena…), preko crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrza traka:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod crteža, postavke pogleda i svakodnevne opcije koje aplikacija ima, kao što su razmjera, nivo detalja, opseg pogleda, prilagodi, plan, podijeli ili 3D, hvatanja i jedinice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaleta za uređivanje:\u003C/strong\u003E klikni nešto u crtežu i pored pokazivača se pojavi mala paleta s naredbama za uređivanje te aplikacije, kao što su pomjeri, kopiraj, rotiraj, ogledaj, dupliraj ili izbriši, i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, točkić miša, novi klik ili njeno dugme za zatvaranje je sklanjaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat koji sada ne može raditi je zasivljen, a njegov opis kaže zašto. Klikni ga, ili pritisni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na njemu, da pročitaš razlog u okviru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo prekida aktivni alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaka prečica i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (režimi ekrana) rade kao prije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daj-alatnici-vlastiti-prozor\"\u003EDaj alatnici vlastiti prozor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDugme \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti alatnicu\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu alatnice ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E: alatnica se otvara u uskom vlastitom prozoru koji možeš staviti pored aplikacije ili na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati alatnicu\u003C/span\u003E, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, je vraća kući.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPostavke alatne trake važe i za alatnicu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETraka s alatima\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkone i oznake\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo ikone\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo oznake\u003C/span\u003E, i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži nazive grupa (Datoteka, Crtanje, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tvoji-paneli-ostaju-tvoji\"\u003ETvoji paneli ostaju tvoji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELijevi i desni paneli zadržavaju sve što je opisano u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ESloži panele i koristi drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E: prikačivanje, lebdenje, učvršćivanje, sakrivanje, kartice, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vrati-klasi-ni-raspored\"\u003EVrati klasični raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klasični\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka traka, kartica i panel vraćaju se gdje su bili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon, šta god da si odabrao. Širi prozor vraća tvoj raspored.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa isprobaš drugi raspored, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003ERadi u rasporedu trake i pregleda projekta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa promijeniš šta ovaj raspored prikazuje, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromijeni raspored na ekranu\u003C/a\u003E; za tamni raspored s trakom menija i trakom kartica vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okvir s alatima i info okvir je jedan od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Alati za crtanje stoje u stupcu lijevo, info okvir preko vrha pokazuje šta aktivni alat traži ili šta si odabrao, svaki pogled ima karticu, a brza traka ispod crteža drži nekoliko svakodnevnih opcija. Alati su aplikacijini: sve što možeš raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a tvoj crtež, stil menija i tasteri ostaju kakvi jesu. Odaberi ga Otvori Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,). Odaberi karticu Globalno, pa idi na Raspored › Radni prostor. Odaberi Okvir s alatima i info okvir. Raspored se odmah mijenja. Izbor vrijedi za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, i on je na mjestu prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidiš klasični raspored prvi. Šta je gdje Traka s alatima: traka aplikacije ostaje na vrhu područja crteža, sa svojim menijima. Info okvir: ispod trake s alatima. Dok alat radi, pokazuje alat i šta traži. Kad nešto odabereš, pokazuje glavne postavke (za zid: tip, debljinu, dužinu, liniju lokacije i visinu), i možeš ih mijenjati odmah tu: promjena je ista kao u Svojstva, a Ctrl+Z je poništava. Kad ništa nije odabrano, piše „Ništa nije odabrano“. Svaka aplikacija dodaje svoje okvire ovdje, kao što su trenutni sloj ili nivo, ili otvoreni dokument. Alatnica: stupac lijevo, alati aplikacije u grupama. Klikni na naziv grupe da je sklopiš ili ponovo otvoriš. Alat koji radi je osvijetljen. Moji alati: prva grupa alatnice, osam praznih mjesta za alate koje najviše koristiš. Klikni prazno mjesto da odabereš bilo koji alat ili naredbu aplikacije; ili desnim klikom na alat u alatnici odaberi Dodaj u Moje alate; ili prevuci alat na mjesto. Desni klik na mjesto ga mijenja ili ga isprazni. Tvoja mjesta se pamte za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku. Navigator: desni panel. Pregled projekta aplikacije je na vrhu (planovi, presjeci, izgledi, 3D pogledi, specifikacije, listovi, kako aplikacija ima): klikni jedan da ga otvoriš. Ispod njega su Svojstva i kartica s ostalim sadržajem desnog panela. Kartice pogleda: kartica za svaki pogled otvorene datoteke (list, plan, scena…), preko crteža. Brza traka: ispod crteža, postavke pogleda i svakodnevne opcije koje aplikacija ima, kao što su razmjera, nivo detalja, opseg pogleda, prilagodi, plan, podijeli ili 3D, hvatanja i jedinice. Paleta za uređivanje: klikni nešto u crtežu i pored pokazivača se pojavi mala paleta s naredbama za uređivanje te aplikacije, kao što su pomjeri, kopiraj, rotiraj, ogledaj, dupliraj ili izbriši, i Svojstva. Esc, točkić miša, novi klik ili njeno dugme za zatvaranje je sklanjaju. Alat koji sada ne može raditi je zasivljen, a njegov opis kaže zašto. Klikni ga, ili pritisni Enter na njemu, da pročitaš razlog u okviru. Esc prvo prekida aktivni alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaka prečica i Ctrl+Shift+F (režimi ekrana) rade kao prije. Daj alatnici vlastiti prozor Dugme Premjesti alatnicu na vrhu alatnice ima Premjesti u novi prozor: alatnica se otvara u uskom vlastitom prozoru koji možeš staviti pored aplikacije ili na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. Vrati alatnicu, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, je vraća kući. Postavke alatne trake važe i za alatnicu: Postavke › Globalno › Traka s alatima › Ikone i oznake, Samo ikone ili Samo oznake, i Prikaži nazive grupa (Datoteka, Crtanje, …). Tvoji paneli ostaju tvoji Lijevi i desni paneli zadržavaju sve što je opisano u Složi panele i koristi drugi monitor: prikačivanje, lebdenje, učvršćivanje, sakrivanje, kartice, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati raspored. Vrati klasični raspored Otvori Postavke › Globalno › Raspored › Radni prostor i odaberi CadCraft klasični. Svaka traka, kartica i panel vraćaju se gdje su bili. Na telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon, šta god da si odabrao. Širi prozor vraća tvoj raspored. Da isprobaš drugi raspored, vidi Radi u rasporedu trake i pregleda projekta. Da promijeniš šta ovaj raspored prikazuje, vidi Promijeni raspored na ekranu; za tamni raspored s trakom menija i trakom kartica vidi raspored Drafting.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Složi vlastiti raspored i sačuvaj postavke","summary":"Odaberi koji panel prikazuje pregled projekta, Svojstva ili vlastiti sadržaj panela, gdje ide alatnica i šta sadrže trake, sačuvaj to kao vlastiti raspored i čuvaj cijele postavke pod imenom između kojih možeš prebacivati.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","slaganje","prilagodi","moj raspored","vlastiti raspored","paneli","uređivači","pregled projekta","svojstva","alatnica","brza traka","info okvir","radno okruženje","postavka","profil","sačuvaj postavku","uvezi postavku","izvezi postavku","prebaci postavku","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"slo-i-vlastiti-raspored","text":"Složi vlastiti raspored","level":2},{"id":"sa-uvaj-postavku-kao-radno-okru-enje","text":"Sačuvaj postavku kao radno okruženje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOsim tri ugrađena rasporeda, možeš složiti jedan vlastiti i sačuvati cijelu postavku pod imenom, da se u jednom koraku vratiš na nju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slo-i-vlastiti-raspored\"\u003ESloži vlastiti raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalno\u003C/span\u003E, pa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESloži vlastiti raspored…\u003C/span\u003E. Dijalog polazi od rasporeda koji sada koristiš.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaj mu ime, pa odaberi:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPreko crteža:\u003C/strong\u003E alatnu traku aplikacije, traku ili ništa; naslovnu traku; info okvir i kontrole koje sadrži.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPored crteža:\u003C/strong\u003E alatnicu lijevo, desno ili nikako, s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoji alati\u003C/span\u003E ili bez; koji panel drži palete, koji je na vrhu (pregled projekta ili Svojstva, na primjer) i koji su kartice ispod njega.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPodručje crteža:\u003C/strong\u003E kartice pogleda, brzu traku i traku pogleda s kontrolama koje označiš, paletu za uređivanje, statusnu traku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzgled:\u003C/strong\u003E veličinu, ocrtane površine dugmadi i stil kartica.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoristi ovaj raspored\u003C/span\u003E. Aplikacija se odmah prebaci na njega, a svaka aplikacija koja ima rasporede koristi ga također.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENudi se samo ono što ova aplikacija ima. Tvoj raspored se nalazi pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIz dodataka i datoteka\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi ovaj raspored\u003C/span\u003E ga čuva kao datoteku koju možeš dati kolegi, a dugme za uklanjanje ga briše. Paneli koje raspored ispunjava i dalje se prikače, lebde i premještaju u vlastite prozore, kao u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ESloži panele i koristi drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sa-uvaj-postavku-kao-radno-okru-enje\"\u003ESačuvaj postavku kao radno okruženje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadno okruženje je cijela tvoja postavka za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: raspored, stil menija i tvoje tastere, stil alatne trake, paneli i njihove veličine, i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoji alati\u003C/span\u003E. Tema i jezik nisu u njemu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESačuvaj:\u003C/strong\u003E upiši ime pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadna okruženja\u003C/span\u003E i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESačuvaj moju postavku\u003C/span\u003E. Čuvanje pod imenom koje već postoji zamjenjuje tu postavku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrebaci se:\u003C/strong\u003E odaberi postavku u listi i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrebaci se na nju\u003C/span\u003E. Aplikacija se ponovo učitava u toj postavci; ako imaš nesačuvan rad, aplikacija prvo pita, kao i pri svakom ponovnom učitavanju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPodijeli:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi\u003C/span\u003E sprema odabranu postavku kao datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi postavku…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje postavku iz datoteke. Datoteka postavlja samo ove izbore, ništa drugo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkloni:\u003C/strong\u003E odaberi postavku i odaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMožeš sačuvati do dvanaest postavki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa promijeniš raspored bez otvaranja dijaloga (prevuci blok, desni klik na alat), vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromijeni raspored na ekranu\u003C/a\u003E. Da prvo isprobaš ugrađene rasporede, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003ERadi u rasporedu alatnice i info okvira\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003ERadi u rasporedu trake i pregleda projekta\u003C/a\u003E i \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Osim tri ugrađena rasporeda, možeš složiti jedan vlastiti i sačuvati cijelu postavku pod imenom, da se u jednom koraku vratiš na nju. Složi vlastiti raspored Otvori Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,), odaberi Globalno, pa Raspored. Odaberi Složi vlastiti raspored…. Dijalog polazi od rasporeda koji sada koristiš. Daj mu ime, pa odaberi: Preko crteža: alatnu traku aplikacije, traku ili ništa; naslovnu traku; info okvir i kontrole koje sadrži. Pored crteža: alatnicu lijevo, desno ili nikako, s Moji alati ili bez; koji panel drži palete, koji je na vrhu (pregled projekta ili Svojstva, na primjer) i koji su kartice ispod njega. Područje crteža: kartice pogleda, brzu traku i traku pogleda s kontrolama koje označiš, paletu za uređivanje, statusnu traku. Izgled: veličinu, ocrtane površine dugmadi i stil kartica. Odaberi Koristi ovaj raspored. Aplikacija se odmah prebaci na njega, a svaka aplikacija koja ima rasporede koristi ga također. Nudi se samo ono što ova aplikacija ima. Tvoj raspored se nalazi pod Iz dodataka i datoteka; Izvezi ovaj raspored ga čuva kao datoteku koju možeš dati kolegi, a dugme za uklanjanje ga briše. Paneli koje raspored ispunjava i dalje se prikače, lebde i premještaju u vlastite prozore, kao u Složi panele i koristi drugi monitor. Sačuvaj postavku kao radno okruženje Radno okruženje je cijela tvoja postavka za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: raspored, stil menija i tvoje tastere, stil alatne trake, paneli i njihove veličine, i Moji alati. Tema i jezik nisu u njemu. Sačuvaj: upiši ime pod Radna okruženja i odaberi Sačuvaj moju postavku. Čuvanje pod imenom koje već postoji zamjenjuje tu postavku. Prebaci se: odaberi postavku u listi i odaberi Prebaci se na nju. Aplikacija se ponovo učitava u toj postavci; ako imaš nesačuvan rad, aplikacija prvo pita, kao i pri svakom ponovnom učitavanju. Podijeli: Izvezi sprema odabranu postavku kao datoteku .ccenv.json; Uvezi postavku… dodaje postavku iz datoteke. Datoteka postavlja samo ove izbore, ništa drugo. Ukloni: odaberi postavku i odaberi Ukloni. Možeš sačuvati do dvanaest postavki. Da promijeniš raspored bez otvaranja dijaloga (prevuci blok, desni klik na alat), vidi Promijeni raspored na ekranu. Da prvo isprobaš ugrađene rasporede, vidi Radi u rasporedu alatnice i info okvira, Radi u rasporedu trake i pregleda projekta i raspored Drafting.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Rad van mreže","summary":"Spasi aplikaciju za rad van mreže, šta radi bez veze, a šta treba vezu.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["van mreže","bez interneta","avion","posjeta lokaciji","keš","service worker","instaliraj","preuzmi","veza"],"headings":[{"id":"spasi-aplikaciju-za-rad-van-mre-e","text":"Spasi aplikaciju za rad van mreže","level":2},{"id":"ta-radi-van-mre-e","text":"Šta radi van mreže","level":2},{"id":"ta-treba-vezu","text":"Šta treba vezu","level":2},{"id":"na-ta-treba-paziti","text":"Na šta treba paziti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije svoj posao obavljaju na tvom računaru, pa većina radi bez veze. Pregledač samo treba prvo imati spašene datoteke aplikacije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spasi-aplikaciju-za-rad-van-mre-e\"\u003ESpasi aplikaciju za rad van mreže\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvori aplikaciju dok si na mreži.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzaberi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESačekaj „Spremno za rad van mreže“. Datoteke aplikacije, njeni čitači datoteka i ova pomoć sada su spašeni u tvom pregledaču. Aplikacije koje čitaju DWG ili PDF datoteke spašavaju i svoje čitače, pa ovo prvi put može potrajati minut.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUradi ovo jednom po aplikaciji, u svakom pregledaču koji koristiš. Da se kasnije vratiš u aplikaciju bez veze, otvori istu adresu koju si koristio ranije, ili njenu zabilješku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESada si van mreže. Ako je ova aplikacija spašena za rad van mreže, sve ispod radi. Ako nije, i dalje možeš koristiti ono što je već učitano u ovoj kartici, ali je nemoj ponovo učitavati dok opet ne budeš na mreži.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-radi-van-mre-e\"\u003EŠta radi van mreže\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvaranje datoteka s računara, crtanje, uređivanje, mjerenje i provjera.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpašavanje i izvoz: svako spašavanje je preuzimanje na računar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOva pomoć, uključujući pretragu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-treba-vezu\"\u003EŠta treba vezu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrvo otvaranje aplikacije i spašavanje za rad van mreže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDobijanje novije verzije aplikacije. Kad si na mreži, aplikacija preuzme najnoviju verziju sljedeći put kad se otvori, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpasi za rad van mreže\u003C/span\u003E osvježava spašenu kopiju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinkovi na sajt, kao \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori na sajtu\u003C/span\u003E, i linkovi na druge stranice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpašavanje u oblaku i sinhronizacija među računarima, koji još nisu dostupni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"na-ta-treba-paziti\"\u003ENa šta treba paziti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpašena kopija pripada jednom pregledaču na jednom računaru. Brisanje podataka sajta u pregledaču je uklanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivatni prozori nekih pregledača i neki zaključani poslovni računari ne dozvoljavaju spašavanje za rad van mreže. Dugme ti kaže kad ne može da spasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari uklanja spašene podatke sajtova koje nisi posjetio nekoliko sedmica. Otvori aplikaciju s vremena na vrijeme dok si na mreži, ili je ponovo spasi prije putovanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, desktop aplikacija sa svih osam aplikacija u jednoj instalaciji, dostupna je na getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Aplikacije svoj posao obavljaju na tvom računaru, pa većina radi bez veze. Pregledač samo treba prvo imati spašene datoteke aplikacije. Spasi aplikaciju za rad van mreže Otvori aplikaciju dok si na mreži. Izaberi Spasi za rad van mreže u traci na vrhu. Sačekaj „Spremno za rad van mreže“. Datoteke aplikacije, njeni čitači datoteka i ova pomoć sada su spašeni u tvom pregledaču. Aplikacije koje čitaju DWG ili PDF datoteke spašavaju i svoje čitače, pa ovo prvi put može potrajati minut. Uradi ovo jednom po aplikaciji, u svakom pregledaču koji koristiš. Da se kasnije vratiš u aplikaciju bez veze, otvori istu adresu koju si koristio ranije, ili njenu zabilješku. Sada si van mreže. Ako je ova aplikacija spašena za rad van mreže, sve ispod radi. Ako nije, i dalje možeš koristiti ono što je već učitano u ovoj kartici, ali je nemoj ponovo učitavati dok opet ne budeš na mreži. Šta radi van mreže Otvaranje datoteka s računara, crtanje, uređivanje, mjerenje i provjera. Spašavanje i izvoz: svako spašavanje je preuzimanje na računar. Ova pomoć, uključujući pretragu. Šta treba vezu Prvo otvaranje aplikacije i spašavanje za rad van mreže. Dobijanje novije verzije aplikacije. Kad si na mreži, aplikacija preuzme najnoviju verziju sljedeći put kad se otvori, a Spasi za rad van mreže osvježava spašenu kopiju. Linkovi na sajt, kao Otvori na sajtu, i linkovi na druge stranice. Spašavanje u oblaku i sinhronizacija među računarima, koji još nisu dostupni. Na šta treba paziti Spašena kopija pripada jednom pregledaču na jednom računaru. Brisanje podataka sajta u pregledaču je uklanja. Privatni prozori nekih pregledača i neki zaključani poslovni računari ne dozvoljavaju spašavanje za rad van mreže. Dugme ti kaže kad ne može da spasi. Safari uklanja spašene podatke sajtova koje nisi posjetio nekoliko sedmica. Otvori aplikaciju s vremena na vrijeme dok si na mreži, ili je ponovo spasi prije putovanja. CadCraft Studio, desktop aplikacija sa svih osam aplikacija u jednoj instalaciji, dostupna je na getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Gdje idu tvoje datoteke","summary":"Datoteke ostaju na tvom računaru, kako funkcioniše spašavanje i šta pregledač pamti.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["privatnost","otpremanje","oblak","spašavanje","preuzimanje","skladište","lokalno","sigurnost","povjerljivo"],"headings":[{"id":"tvoje-datoteke-ostaju-na-tvom-ra-unaru","text":"Tvoje datoteke ostaju na tvom računaru","level":2},{"id":"kako-funkcioni-e-spa-avanje","text":"Kako funkcioniše spašavanje","level":2},{"id":"ta-pregleda-pamti","text":"Šta pregledač pamti","level":2},{"id":"spa-avanje-u-oblaku","text":"Spašavanje u oblaku","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"tvoje-datoteke-ostaju-na-tvom-ra-unaru\"\u003ETvoje datoteke ostaju na tvom računaru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad otvoriš crtež, model ili PDF, aplikacija ga čita unutar tvog pregledača. \u003Cstrong\u003EDatoteka se ne otprema.\u003C/strong\u003E Mi je nikad ne vidimo, i radi jednako bez veze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-funkcioni-e-spa-avanje\"\u003EKako funkcioniše spašavanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeb stranica ne može sama prepisati datoteke na tvom računaru, pa aplikacije spašavaju \u003Cstrong\u003Epreuzimanjem\u003C/strong\u003E nove datoteke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreuzimanje ide tamo gdje pregledač stavlja preuzimanja, obično u tvoj folder Downloads, osim ako si pregledač podesio da pita svaki put (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EPregledači i računari\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAplikacije koje mijenjaju datoteku spašavaju kopiju s novim imenom, kao „(edited)“ ili „(marked up)“, pa tvoj original ostaje netaknut.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko zatvoriš karticu s nesačuvanim radom, pregledač prvo pita („Napusti stranicu?“).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ta-pregleda-pamti\"\u003EŠta pregledač pamti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeke aplikacije pamte male postavke u tvom pregledaču, kao što su tvoje ime autora ili stilovi alata. One ostaju u tom pregledaču na tom računaru, a brisanje podataka sajta ih uklanja. Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže šta čuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spa-avanje-u-oblaku\"\u003ESpašavanje u oblaku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpašavanje u oblaku i sinhronizacija među računarima dio su komercijalne licence. Još nisu dostupni. Dok to ne bude, drži datoteke tamo gdje držiš ostale projektne datoteke i pravi im rezervne kopije na uobičajen način.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tvoje datoteke ostaju na tvom računaru Kad otvoriš crtež, model ili PDF, aplikacija ga čita unutar tvog pregledača. Datoteka se ne otprema. Mi je nikad ne vidimo, i radi jednako bez veze. Kako funkcioniše spašavanje Web stranica ne može sama prepisati datoteke na tvom računaru, pa aplikacije spašavaju preuzimanjem nove datoteke: Preuzimanje ide tamo gdje pregledač stavlja preuzimanja, obično u tvoj folder Downloads, osim ako si pregledač podesio da pita svaki put (vidi Pregledači i računari). Aplikacije koje mijenjaju datoteku spašavaju kopiju s novim imenom, kao „(edited)“ ili „(marked up)“, pa tvoj original ostaje netaknut. Ako zatvoriš karticu s nesačuvanim radom, pregledač prvo pita („Napusti stranicu?“). Šta pregledač pamti Neke aplikacije pamte male postavke u tvom pregledaču, kao što su tvoje ime autora ili stilovi alata. One ostaju u tom pregledaču na tom računaru, a brisanje podataka sajta ih uklanja. Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže šta čuva. Spašavanje u oblaku Spašavanje u oblaku i sinhronizacija među računarima dio su komercijalne licence. Još nisu dostupni. Dok to ne bude, drži datoteke tamo gdje držiš ostale projektne datoteke i pravi im rezervne kopije na uobičajen način.","lang":"bs"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffDesk The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"bs","chain":["bs","en"]};
